INSERT INTO `custom_text_old` VALUES (1,'<img src=\"https://www.opendrive.com/thumbnails?64707882_rVQeG\" alt=\"Bunker Sessions 2012\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px;\" title=\"\"></font><font size=\"2\">If you love Y-Not Radio, please consider making a donation to help with our operating costs. Every month it costs over $500 to stream music to your ears.  To ensure that we can continue to to do that each and every day (and keep feeding the Bunker Cats), we\'re asking for your help.  But we don\'t want you walking away empty-handed. For any donation of $20 or more, you\'ll get a CD, or $15 for a digital download, as our thanks. One of your choices is <b>Y-Not\'s Bunker Sessions 2012</b> compilation, featuring 25 live recordings from some of the best Y-Not Sessions from this past year. Thank you for your support!</font><br>\r\n</p><center>\r\n<form action=\"https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr\" method=\"post\">\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"cmd\" value=\"_s-xclick\">\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"hosted_button_id\" value=\"ZQ6NUYG6YWKW6\">\r\n<table>\r\n<tr><td><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"on0\" value=\"Donation Options\">Donation Options</td></tr><tr><td><select name=\"os0\">\r\n	<option value=\"Download Only\">Download Only $15.00 USD</option>\r\n	<option value=\"CD Only\">CD Only $20.00 USD</option>\r\n	<option value=\"Download + CD\">Download + CD $30.00 USD</option>\r\n	<option value=\"Download + 2 CDs\">Download + 2 CDs $50.00 USD</option>\r\n	<option value=\"Download + 3 CDs\">Download + 3 CDs $75.00 USD</option>\r\n	<option value=\"Be Our Best Friend\">Be Our Best Friend $100.00 USD</option>\r\n</select> </td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"currency_code\" value=\"USD\">\r\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/btn/btn_donateCC_LG.gif\" border=\"0\" name=\"submit\" alt=\"PayPal - The safer, easier way to pay online!\">\r\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/scr/pixel.gif\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\">\r\n</form>\r\n</center>\r\n<p><center>Choose from the following (subject to available supply):</center></p>\r\n<p><center>\r\n\r\n  <b><i>Y-Not Bunker Sessions 2012 Compilation</i></b> (Digital Download)\r\n  <br> \r\n  <b>Atlas Genius</b> - <em>When It Was Now</em>\r\n  <br> \r\n  <b>Foals</b> - <em>Holy Fire</em>\r\n  <br> \r\n  <b>Jim James</b> - <em>Regions of Light and Sound of God</em>\r\n  <br> \r\n  <b>The Joy Formidable</b> - <em>Wolf\'s Law</em> (Digital Download)\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Toro y Moi</b> - <em>Anything In Return</em>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>The NowhereNauts</b> - <em>Warned You</em>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Jason Lytle</b> - <em>Dept. Of Disappearance</em>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Animal Collective</b> - <em>Centipede Hz</em>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Jens Lekman</b> - <em>I Know What Love Isn\'t</em>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Minus The Bear</b> - <em>Infinity Overhead</em>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Wintersleep</b> - <em>Hello Hum</em>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>The Cribs</b> - <em>In The Belly of The Brazen Bull</em>\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>POP ETC</b> - <em>POP ETC</em>\r\n  </center>\r\n<p>\r\nPlease make sure to include your correct shipping address on the Paypal form and specify which CD you\'d like in the comments section.'),(2,'<p><img id=\"donate_img\" border=\"0\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://c438342.r42.cf2.rackcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/03/rsd-2012.jpg\">\r\n  Thank you for supporting our friends at Main Street Music on Record Store Day and welcome to Y-Not Radio. If this is your first time visiting us, we hope you\'ll <a href=\"http://www.live365.com/cgi-bin/mini.cgi?station_name=ynotradio&site=pro&tm=5300\" target=\"_new\">tune in</a> and enjoy what you hear. </p>\r\n<p>One of our featured programs is <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, where each week we put the spotlight on a specific local artist, who is interviewed, performs live, and chooses a playlist of their favorite local artists. This exclusive Record Store Day downloadable compilation features some of the best performances from the show over the course of the last year. We hope you\'ll enjoy and check out new episodes every Wednesday at 11am and 10pm (or replays on Saturdays at 8pm). <a href=\"/ymail.php\">Sign up for our weekly newsletter</a> to find out who our guests are each week, plus info on upcoming sessions with national artists, concert tickets giveaways, and more.</p>\r\n<p><b><center>\r\n  <a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7586331/Y-Not%20Philly%20Record%20Store%20Day%202012%20Compilation.zip\">FREE DOWNLOAD HERE</a>\r\n</center></b></p>\r\n</p>\r\nTracklist for Y-Not Philly Record Store Day 2012 Compilation:\r\n<p>\r\n  <b>City Rain</b> - I\'m Gone<br>\r\n  <b>Creepoid</b> - Stranger\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Norwegian Arms</b> - Run! Ran! Run! Rah!\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Turning violet Violet</b> - Pink Sky\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Nicos Gun</b> - New Explosion\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>East Hundred</b> - This Year\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Nothing</b> - Suns and Lovers<br>\r\n  <b>Arrah and The Ferns</b> - Wake Up<br>\r\n  <b>Lion Versus</b> - I Am (The Springtime)\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Man Man</b> - Haute Tropique\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Conversations With Enemies</b> - Hey\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>The Quelle Source</b> - The French Rapture\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Illinois</b> - Metropolis\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Geology</b> - Living Things<br>\r\n  <b>The New Connection</b> - Pickle Matrix\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Catnaps</b> - Kiss Like A Statue\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Algernon Cadwallader</b> - Pitfall\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Steve Goldberg & The Arch Enemies</b> - July\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>White Birds</b> - Floating Hands\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>She Came Crashing</b> - Gasoline<br>\r\n  <b>Little Big League</b> - My Very Own You<br>\r\n  <b>The Timid Roosevelts</b> - Dennis Kufinich\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>Auctioneer</b> - The Loser\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>The Danger O\'s</b> - Some Time Away\r\n  <br>\r\n  <b>The Really Cooks</b> - Mr. Carlisle\r\n  <br>\r\n<b>Tutlie</b> - We Film Clouds\r\n'),(3,'<a href=\"#blayer\">Enter Blayer Point Dujour Contest</a> | <a href=\"#lucius\">Enter Lucius Contest</a><p></p>\r\n<a name=\"lucius\"></a> \r\n<iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheet/viewform?formkey=dFhHVkpaZDd5azl4NGd3WTFrTGhhYkE6MQ\" width=\"650\" height=\"752\" frameborder=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\">Loading...</iframe>\r\n<a name=\"blayer\"></a>\r\n<iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheet/viewform?formkey=dFRkUUdrRlZVZG03X0ZVYWhFbnUtUWc6MA\" width=\"650\" height=\"752\" frameborder=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\">Loading...</iframe>');
