kers (3) $5.00 USD</option>\r\n</select> </td></tr>\r\n<tr><td><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"on1\" value=\"Choose T-Shirt Color\">Choose T-Shirt Color</td></tr><tr><td><select name=\"os1\">\r\n	<option value=\"Black\">Black </option>\r\n	<option value=\"Gray\">Gray </option>\r\n</select> </td></tr>\r\n<tr><td><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"on2\" value=\"Choose T-Shirt Size\">Choose T-Shirt Size</td></tr><tr><td><select name=\"os2\">\r\n	<option value=\"Small\">Small </option>\r\n	<option value=\"Medium\">Medium </option>\r\n	<option value=\"Large\">Large (SOLD OUT)</option>\r\n	<option value=\"XL\">XL (SOLD OUT)</option>\r\n</select> </td></tr>\r\n<tr><td><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"on3\" value=\"Choose Your CD(s)\">Choose Your CD(s)</td></tr><tr><td><input type=\"text\" name=\"os3\" maxlength=\"200\"></td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"currency_code\" value=\"USD\">\r\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/btn/btn_donateCC_LG.gif\" border=\"0\" name=\"submit\" alt=\"PayPal - The safer, easier way to pay online!\">\r\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/scr/pixel.gif\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\">\r\n</form>-->\r\n<br>\r\n<center><b>Or become a sustaining supporter by making a monthly donation.</b></center>\r\n<form action=\"https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr\" method=\"post\" target=\"_top\">\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"cmd\" value=\"_s-xclick\">\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"hosted_button_id\" value=\"RGKSNY4XEDE3N\">\r\n<table>\r\n<tr><td><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"on0\" value=\"\"></td></tr><tr><td><select name=\"os0\">\r\n	<option value=\"1)\">1) : $5.00 USD - monthly</option>\r\n	<option value=\"2)\">2) : $10.00 USD - monthly</option>\r\n	<option value=\"3)\">3) : $20.00 USD - monthly</option>\r\n	<option value=\"4)\">4) : $25.00 USD - monthly</option>\r\n</select> </td></tr>\r\n<tr><td><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"on1\" value=\"Select Thank You Gift(s)\">Select Thank You Gift(s)</td></tr><tr><td><input type=\"text\" name=\"os1\" maxlength=\"200\"></td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"currency_code\" value=\"USD\">\r\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/btn/btn_subscribe_LG.gif\" border=\"0\" name=\"submit\" alt=\"PayPal - The safer, easier way to pay online!\">\r\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/scr/pixel.gif\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\">\r\n</form></center>\r\n\r\n<center> <p><b>VENMO: @ynotradio</b><br>\r\n<b>CASHAPP: $ynotradio</b><br><br>\r\nChoose from the following (subject to available supply). <br>    \r\n<em>Please make sure to include your correct shipping address on the Paypal form and specify which Download you\'d like. </em>\r\n</center></p> <p>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2025 Compilation</i></b> \r\n<LI><b>Snocaps</b> - <em>Snocaps</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Tame Impala</b> - <em>Deadbeat</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Dave Hause</b> - <em>...And The Mermaid</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Nation of Language</b> - <em>Dance Called Memory</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>The Beths</b> - <em>Straight Line Was A Lie</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Wolf Alice</b> - <em>The Clearing</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>HAIM</b> - <em>I quit</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Matt Berninger</b> - <em>Get Sunk</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Tunde Adebimpe</b> - <em>Thee Black Boltz</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>OK Go</b> - <em>And The Adjacent Possible</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Squid</b> - <em>Cowards</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Franz Ferdinand</b> - <em>The Human Fear</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2024 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Bright Eyes</b> - <em>Five Dice, All Threes</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Brigitte Calls Me Baby</b> - <em>The Future Is Our Way Out</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2023 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Cherry Glazerr</b> - <em>I Don’t Want You Anymore\r\n</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Ratboys</b> - <em>The Window</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Beach House</b> - <em>Once Twice Melody</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2022 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2021 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2020 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2019 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2018 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2017 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2016 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2015 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br> \r\n<LI><b><i>Y100Rocks.com 10th Anniversary Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2014 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b><i>Y-Not Sessions 2013 Compilation</i></b> (Download)<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n  <br><u><b>BARGAIN BIN</b></u>\r\n<LI><b>Beach House</b> - <em>Once Twice Melody</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Hippo Campus</b> - <em>LP3</em> (Download)<br>\r\n<LI><b>Bob Mould</b> - <em>Blue Hearts</em> (Download)<br>','active'),(2,'Y-Not Radio Contests','contests','<center><a href=\"https://www.amylandthesniffers.com/\" target=_blank><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5A4dooa.png\" height=\"100\"></a></center>\r\n\r\n<iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd0uG2NKhNA83yDioWMGwY46_1QfoWlKJJF4KNRRV7Ao2a4tQ/viewform?embedded=true\" width=\"700\" height=\"1500\" frameborder=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\">Loading...</iframe>\r\n\r\n<!--<iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1HFZV9wI_FWEacZEr0unpRQiYGjpQ0gGc_6FClUP1rI0/viewform\" width=\"700\" height=\"950\" frameborder=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\">Loading...</iframe>-->\r\n\r\n<!--<iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/19NQoJJmN4nBIiNu6ZKqhFrGizYlLcYJcuEANLc_Nv08/viewform\" width=\"700\" height=\"950\" frameborder=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\">Loading...</iframe>-->','active'),(4,'<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QfqMVsE.png\" width=\"685\">','modern-rock-madness','<!--<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QfqMVsE.png\" width=\"685\">-->\r\n<font size=3><i>64 Bands.  2 Weeks  of Fierce Competition.<br>There can be only 1 champion and it\'s up to you to decide!<br>Y-Not Radio presents Modern Rock Madness 2025, March 24th - April 4th.</i>\r\n<br><br> \r\n<!--Thanks to everyone who sponsored Modern Rock Madness!  Sponsorships are now sold out.  The Modern Rock Madness 2025 brackets will be posted soon.--></font>\r\n<center><a href=\"https://od.lk/d/219145587_ruE6q/MRM2025Bracket.pdf\"><font size=5>CLICK HERE TO DOWNLOAD THE 2025 BRACKETS</font><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kagQIGI.jpeg\"></a></center>\r\n\r\n<!--<u><font size=4><b>Sponsor Modern Rock Madness</b></font></u><br>\r\n<font size=2>This year you can be a <i>Modern Rock Madness</i> sponsor and enter our \"office pool.\" For a $20 donation you\'ll be randomly assigned a band.  The sponsor of the winning band will get $100 cash (or choose from available concert tickets of equivalent value) and bragging rights!  The sponsor of the runner-up band will get $50 cash (or equivalent value in album downloads). Sponsors also get to vote in the <i>Modern Rock Madness 2025 Draft</i> to help choose the 64 bands who will participate in this year\'s tournament. <em>*Maximum of 2 sponsorship spots per person.</em></font><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<center><form action=\"https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr\" method=\"post\" target=\"_top\">\r\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"cmd\" value=\"_s-xclick\" />\r\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"hosted_button_id\" value=\"KSVSB6QJ73UH8\" />\r\n  <table>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>\r\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"on0\" value=\"Sponsorship Options\"/>\r\n        Sponsorship Options\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>\r\n        <select name=\"os0\">\r\n          <option value=\"Sponsor 1 Band\">\r\n            Sponsor 1 Band $20.00 USD\r\n          </option>\r\n        <option value=\"Sponsor 2 Bands\">\r\n            Sponsor 2 Bands $40.00 USD\r\n          </option>\r\n        </select>\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"currency_code\" value=\"USD\" />\r\n  <input type=\"image\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/btn/btn_paynowCC_LG.gif\" border=\"0\" name=\"submit\" title=\"PayPal - The safer, easier way to pay online!\" alt=\"Buy Now\" />\r\n</form>\r\n</center>-->','active'),(8,'Win Firefly Festival Tickets','win-firefly-festival-tickets','<img style=\"margin:5px 10px 0px 0px\" title=\"\" src=\"/sponsors/fireflycontest.jpg\" alt=\"Firefly Contest\" height=\"100\" align=\"left\" border=\"0\">\r\n\r\nY-Not and iRadioPhilly have another chance for you to win a pair of 3-day passes for the <i>Firefly Music Festival</i>! It\'s the East Coast\'s Premier Music Experience, happening June 21st through 23rd in Dover Delaware, featuring <b>Vampire Weekend, Yeah Yeah Yeahs , Red Hot Chili Peppers, Foster The People, Passion Pit, MGMT, Grizzly Bear, Jim James, Matt and Kim, Dr. Dog, The Joy Formidable, Amanda Palmer,</b> and many more!\r\n<br><br>\r\nIf you want to go for free, now\'s your chance to TEXT FOR TICKETS.<br><br>\r\n<b>Text the word iradiophilly to 313131 by Friday, June 7th to enter. Only from Y-Not and iRadioPhilly.</b>\r\n<img style=\"margin:0px 10px 0px 0px\" title=\"\" src=\"http://brewingsomefun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/dock-street-ales-logo-575.jpg\" alt=\"Dock Street\" height=\"125\" align=\"right\" border=\"0\"><br><br>\r\nOr come register in person at the free <a href=\"http://dockstreetbeer.com\" target=\"_blank\">Dock Street Brewery Music</a> Festival this Sunday from 2-6pm with live music from <b>Norwegian Arms</b>, <b>On The Water, Post Sun Times</b>,  <b>Bomple, </b>and Y-Not\'s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> DJing between bands.\r\n<br><br>For more information on the Firefly Festival and to purchase single day tickets, visit <a href=\"http://FireflyFestival.com\" target=_blank>FireflyFestival.com</a>. ','deleted'),(9,'','tweet-4-tix:-the-postal-service','','deleted'),(10,'Y-Not Radio Presents: Pretty and Nice','y-not-radio-presents:-pretty-&-nice','<center><img src=\"http://www.ghsstrings.com/artist_medias/624_3.jpg\" height=100></center>\r\n<iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheet/viewform?formkey=dFRkUUdrRlZVZG03X0ZVYWhFbnUtUWc6MA\" width=\"650\" height=\"1000\" frameborder=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\">Loading...</iframe>','deleted'),(11,'Y-Not Radio Presents: Break It Up','y-not-radio-presents:-pretty-and-nice','<center><img src=\"http://sphotos-b.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-frc3/401173_333792123311775_1931406544_n.jpg\" height=100><img src=\"http://fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-frc1/295331_195459900581231_881259384_n.jpg\" height=100><img src=\"http://fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/226507_168834703266585_2041344609_n.jpg\" height=100></center>\r\n<iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheet/viewform?formkey=dFRkUUdrRlZVZG03X0ZVYWhFbnUtUWc6MA\" width=\"650\" height=\"1000\" frameborder=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\">Loading...</iframe>','deleted'),(15,'','year-end-poll-results','<div id=\"survey\">\r\n<center>\r\n<img src=\"images\\yrendlong2012.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800px\"></center>\r\n<p><div id=\"survey_text\" style=\"padding: 0 25px\">\r\nThanks to everyone who voted in the 2012 Year End Poll! If you missed any of results during our Top 212 Songs of 2012 Countdown here they are. And congratulations to Tessa Powell, our grand prize winner of a $100 iTunes gift card and the chance to host her own Top 20 of 2012 on Y-Not Radio! Check out the Y-Not DJs\' Best of Lists <a href=\"yearendstaff.php\">here</a>.\r\n</div>\r\n<center>\r\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/share\" class=\"twitter-share-button\" data-text=\"Check out @YNotRadio\'s Year End Poll and you could win a $100 iTunes gift card\" data-co