\"true\"></iframe>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>Zack (Imaging Composite)</b><br>\r\n<iframe src=\"https://www.opendrive.com/player/216917677_0zLdc\" height=\"25\" width=\"297\" style=\"border:0\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowtransparency=\"true\"></iframe>\r\n<br>\r\nFind much more of Zack\'s Y100 imaging production <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/y100archives\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a>. </td>\r\n    <td valign=\"top\">\r\n	  <iframe width=\"325\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CmKDj9AZ7ZA?si=TCEa_CuQQhGAVDwa\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n		<br><br>\r\n<iframe width=\"325\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VmseA33lCzA?si=xT26XFtiedmyF9S1\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n		<br><br>\r\n<iframe width=\"325\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gsl0rgPlW5w?si=p2-aT7r3rsNzLsJw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>		\r\n		<br><br>\r\n<iframe width=\"325\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pdm9r5GF1dk?si=yGmHAFonHpwRZmgz\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>		\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>','active'),(70,'Remembering Starla','remembering-starla','<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U0cmkxx.png\" alt=\"Starla\" height=\"125\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px;\" title=\"\" />Oh my <strong>Starla</strong>, my sweet, silly, smart, mischievous, weird, and beautiful Starla.  There will never be another one like you – cat, human, or otherwise.  Such a little girl, with such a huge personality.\r\n\r\nAfter the onset of complications from pancreatic cancer last week, Starla passed on Thursday, July 3rd, 2025 at age 15.  Fortunately her bad days were few and her good ones were plentiful, including a 24 hour rally to spend lots of quality time together on her daddy\'s birthday (July 2nd).  Losing any pet is an inevitability, but fate was cruel to take Starla from us so soon after her beloved brother <strong>Hugo</strong> last year.  Obviously, we hoped for much more time with her.<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ERj5Ez8.jpeg\" alt=\"MADM + Starla\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 10px;\" title=\"\" />Starla was also a beloved member of the Y-Not Radio family, counting all the DJs over the years amongst her friends. Her exploits became legendary amongst the listening audience.  Starla got to meet lots of bands that would come by The Bunker.  One of the most memorable instances of a musician just falling head over heels with the magic of Starla was former <strong>Hole</strong> and <strong>Smashing Pumpkins</strong> bassist <strong>Melissa Auf Der Maur</strong>.  Another favorite  rock star encounter was with the UK band <strong>Two Door Cinema Club</strong>.  Their singer <strong>Alex</strong> was wearing a very stylish, very British grey peacoat, and while the band was performing, Starla decided to grab onto his coat and climb it!  To Alex’s credit, he kept going while this hyperactive kitty was ascending his body.  Everyone in the room was fighting back hysterical laughter so as not to ruin the performance.	<br><br>\r\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Zy3trjB.jpeg\" alt=\"Starla + JTL\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px;\" title=\"\" />To quote the Smashing Pumpkins song that she was named after, “Starla dear, You\'re on my mind”, and you always will be, my sweetest little girl.  I love you so much! <br><br>\r\nDonations in Starla\'s memory can made to <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/donate/1040404718295794/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PAWS (Philadelphia Animal Welfare Society)</strong></a>, to help other rescue kitties find the lives that they deserve as Starla did with us.<br><br>\r\n~Josh T. Landow (a.k.a. Starla\'s Daddy)','active'),(71,'<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U7gvgiH.gif\" width=\"685\">','top225of2025','<!--<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U7gvgiH.gif\" width=\"685\">-->\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"5\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#666666\"><div align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"pages.php?page=top225of2025\">TOP 225 SONGS OF 2025</a></strong></div></td>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#CCCCCC\"><div align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"pages.php?page=yearendpoll2025\">YEAR END POLL RESULTS</a></strong></div></td>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#CCCCCC\"><div align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"yearendstaffpicks.php\">Y-NOT STAFF FAVORITES</a></strong></div></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table><br>\r\n<!--<font size=2>Check this page after each day\'s part of <i>The Top 225 of 2025</i> airs for a list of the songs played.</font><br><br>-->\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">\r\nbody table {\r\n	font-size: small;\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://player-widget.mixcloud.com/widget/iframe/?hide_cover=1&mini=1&hide_artwork=1&feed=%2Fynotradio%2Fy-nots-top-225-of-2025-part-1%2F\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"encrypted-media; fullscreen; autoplay; idle-detection; speaker-selection; web-share;\" ></iframe>\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td width=\"65\"><em><strong>PART 1</strong></em></td>\r\n    <td width=\"310\"> </td>\r\n    <td width=\"310\"> </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n\r\n    <tr bgcolor=\"#CCCCCC\">\r\n      <t