INSERT INTO `stories` VALUES (1,'2011-03-01','2011-04-11','Modern Rock Madness','64 Bands. 5 Days of Fierce Competition. There can be only 1 champion! Y-Not Radio presents Modern Rock Madness 2011, where you vote for your favorite bands in our rip off of the college basketball tournament. The action starts Monday morning! You can get ready now by downloading your Modern Rock Madness brackets','','',1,'y'),(2,'2011-03-01','2011-04-11','Get Up Kids Y-Not Radio Takeover',' Last week The Get Up Kids played 2 shows at The T.L.A. and while they were in town Noise Complaint host Jeff St. Pierre caught up with founding member Rob Pope for a special Y-Not Radio Takeover.  Tune in for the replay this Saturday at 9pm for an hour with Rob playing guest DJ, plus an interview and tracks from their new album There Are Rules.','','',2,'n'),(3,'2011-03-01','2011-04-01','Top 11 @ 11 - Vote & Win Cold War Kids Tickets',' Every Thursday morning at 11, Y-Not Radio counts down the Top 11 alternative & indie rock songs of the week. Vote this week and you\'ll be registered to win a pair of tickets for the sold out <b>Cold War Kids</b> show on Friday, March 25th at The Trocadero.\r\n<em>This week\'s Top 11 will be at a special time due to Modern Rock Madness.  Tune in early on Thursday at 9am.</em>','','',3,'n'),(4,'2011-03-01','2011-04-02','Y-Not On Demand',' Check out the On Demand page for interviews and sessions with <b>Gold Motel, Diamond Rings, Tapes \'N Tapes, Young The Giant, Ghostland Observatory, Kate Nash, The Black Angels, Earl Greyhound, Guster, Two Door Cinema Club, Amusement Parks On Fire, Someone Still Loves You Boris Yeltsin, Hot Hot Heat, </b>and more.','','',4,'n'),(5,'2010-12-31','2011-04-11','Y-Not\'s Year End Poll & Top 210 Songs of 2010',' Thanks for voting in the Year End Poll. If you missed any of our week-long Top 210 Songs of 2010 countdown, then click here to see the entire list, all the Year End Poll results, Y-Not staff picks, and the winner of our contest.  Brought to you by Philadelphia Weekly.','','',5,'n'),(6,'2010-06-12','2011-12-31','We\'re Still Alive!',' Hello friends!  Thank you for your outpouring of support over the last few weeks, especially during my show last Thursday.  You all told me how much you\'d miss me and the other DJs who were leaving; you said that you knew it was the people who made that station what it was, and that you\'d love to hear us start up again somewhere else soon.  Well, soon is now and somewhere else is here - the all new Y-Not Radio!\r\n\r\nThe name has changed but our mission remains the same as it always has, whether we\'ve been in a professional radio station or a DIY Bunker studio, to bring you the best alternative, modern, and indie rock!  We\'ve had our share of obstacles recently, but they have only made us a stronger, more unified team who will do whatever it takes to share in the joy of music with you.\r\n\r\nThank you for finding us here, thank you for sticking with the people rather than the name, and thank you for listening!  We hope that you enjoy Y-Not Radio, and please please please tell your friends!','','',6,'y'),(7,'2011-03-20','2011-03-29','Y-Not Thursdays @ Dobbs',' Every Thursday night Y-Not Radio DJs will be spinning your favorite modern/alternative/indie mix upstairs at <a href=\'http://www.dobbsphilly.com\' target=_new>The Legendary Dobbs</a> on South Street from 9pm-1am.  This Thursday join <b>Joey O. </b>with no cover, drink specials all night, and $3 validated parking in the lot at 3rd & South.  <b><em>Plus enter to win tickets for upcoming shows at The TLA - Omar Rodriguez Lopez Group on Monday, March 28th and The Raveonettes on Wednesday, March 30th!</b></em>','','',7,'n'),(8,'2011-03-21','2011-03-26','Modern Rock Madness','<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\r\n<a href=\"http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/p/modern-rock-madness.html\" style=\"clear: right; float: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-TQjsk_6noB4/TWwZW18iMHI/AAAAAAAAALk/nJEiBMmqs54/s200/MRM2011.jpg\" /></a></div>\r\n64 Bands.  5 Days of Fierce Competition.  There can be only 1 champion!  Y-Not Radio presents Modern Rock Madness 2011, where you vote for your favorite bands in our rip off of the college basketball tournament.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<a href=\"http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/p/modern-rock-madness.html\"><i><b>CLICK HERE TO VOTE </b></i></a></div>\r\n','','',1,'n'),(9,'2011-04-18','2011-05-01','Cake Interview','<b>Cake</b> were just in town for 2 sold out shows at The Keswick Theatre and before the first show, Y-Notâ??s <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Josh T. Landow</b> caught up with founding members <b>John McCrea</b> and <b>Vince DiFiore</b> for an in-depth interview about their new album <em>Showroom of Compassion</em>, their latest tour, solar power, trees, and more! Tune in for the interview this Wednesday at 3pm and 9pm. ','http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-QGfPVsrXEBY/Tawz-tOuHlI/AAAAAAAAAMA/Ge4-0IjCK1o/s200/120_6266.JPG','http://www.cakemusic.com/',3,'y'),(10,'2011-04-18','2011-04-22','The Go! Team Y-Not Radio Takeover','Hopefully you caught <b>The Go! Team</b> the other night at The T.L.A. for their frenetic dance party rock show!  Before the show, Y-Not Radio\'s <b>Andre</b> caught up with the band\'s mastermind <b>Ian Parton</b> to tape our next radio takeover.  Hear Ian\'s diverse musical taste in action and find out what makes The Go! Team tick on Thursday at 3pm and Friday night at 9pm.','http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_smnDcduibfQ/RvWVzCdtrTI/AAAAAAAAA30/Q6hdaVUdgmM/s200/go+team.jpg','http://www.thegoteam.co.uk',2,'n'),(11,'2011-04-18','2099-04-28','Y-Not Philly: <br>Clark Park Festival Preview','Tune in on Saturday at 8pm for this week\'s <i>Y-Not Philly</i> replay with guest host <b>Joshua Craft</b>, organizer of West Philly\'s Clark Park Summer Festival coming up this Saturday, June 30th. Joshua will feature all the bands performing at the Festival including <b>Power Animal, The Horrible Department, Erode And Disappear, Break It Up, The Really Cooks, Best Westerns,</b> and more, plus a live performance from <b>The Downtown Club</b>. Get more info <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/events/323475277721476/\" target=_blank>here</a>.\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--featuring guests <b>Seamus Browning</b>, made up of frontman <b>Matt Duke</b> with members of <b>The Quelle Source</b> and <b>Sun Airway</b>.  They\'ll be performing live on air and picking out a playlist of their Philly favorites. Check them out live on July 7th at <a href=\"http://tickets.worldcafelive.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=4496\" target=_blank>World Cafe Live</a> with <b>June Divided</b>. Download music from Seamus Browning <a href=\"http://soundcloud.com/seamus-browning\" target=_blank>here</a>.-->','http://fbcdn-profile-a.akamaihd.net/hprofile-ak-snc4/157898_323475277721476_231542573_n.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/events/323475277721476/',11,'y'),(12,'2011-04-18','2011-04-22','Top 11 @ 11 - Vote & Win Kills Tickets','Every Thursday morning at 11, Y-Not Radio counts down the Top 11 alternative & indie rock songs of the week. Vote this week and you\'ll be registered to win a 4-pack of tickets for <b>The Kills</b> with <b>Cold Cave</b> on Wednesday, April 27th at The T.L.A.\r\n','http://a1.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/115/0e6d771b48ce489d9dccf29055dff4f6/l.jpg','top11.php',4,'n'),(13,'2011-04-18','2011-04-23','The Dig Bunker Session','New York band <b>The Dig</b> come to Philadelphia this Friday night on tour with <b>Local H</b> at The North Star Bar. Friday afternoon at 4pm, theyâ??ll be stopping by to play some songs from their album Electric Toys live in the Bunker. <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/31383\" target=_new>Tickets are available</a> for the show and find out more at <a href=\"http://myspace.com/TheDigIsUp\" target=_new>MySpace.com/TheDigIsUp</a>.','http://a2.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/84/780ec642c7d2448f8a7a27dd64c0f527/l.jpg','http://www.myspace.com/thedigisup',4,'n'),(14,'2011-04-18','2011-04-20','test',' test','test 2 img','test',9,'y'),(15,'2011-04-22','2011-04-28','Top 11 @ 11<br>Win Peter Bjorn and John Tickets','Every Thursday morning at 11, Y-Not Radio counts down the Top 11 alternative & indie rock songs of the week. Vote this week and you\'ll be registered to win a 4-pack of tickets for <b>Peter Bjorn and John</b> on Sunday, May 1st at The T.L.A.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<center><a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/top11.php\"><i><b>CLICK HERE TO VOTE!</b></i></a></center>\r\n','http://soundsxp.com/artman2/uploads/1/20070313_peter_bjorn_john_2_1_.jpg','http://ynotradio.net/top11.php',1,'n'),(16,'2011-04-22','2011-04-27','The Submarines Bunker Session','This Wednesday night husband and wife duo <b>The Submarines</b> return to Philadelphia to play <a href=\"http://www.johnnybrendas.com/event/28257/\" target=_blank>Johnny Brenda\'s</a>.  That afternoon <b>John</b> and <b>Blake</b> will be stopping by to play acoustic versions of some songs from their new album <i>Love Notes / Letterbombs</i>.  In the meantime get a free download of \"Birds\" <a href=\"http://www.thesubmarines.com/news/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://a3.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/149/49e875f1436147cfb2adf1958388acbd/l.jpg','http://www.thesubmarines.com/',2,'n'),(17,'2018-12-31','2020-12-31','Y-Not On Demand','If you missed our recent interview with <b>Laura Jane Grace</b> of <b>Against Me!</b> or <em>Y-Not Sessions</em> with <b>Kestrels</b>, <b>Cults</b>, and <b>Tommy Siegel</b> of <b>Jukebox The Ghost</b>, you can hear them any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>, along with many other sessions, videos, interviews, <em>Radio Takeovers</em>, and more! \r\n\r\n<br><br>You can also catch up with Y-Not specialty shows like <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <em>Transmission</em>, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, and <em>Future Friday</em> <a href=\"shows.php\">here</a>.\r\n','https://i.imgur.com/D8NAE1M.jpg','ondemand.php',6,'n'),(18,'2026-01-12','2027-01-01','CD of The Week','<font size=2><b>The Cribs</b></font><br>\r\n<font size=2><i>Selling a Vibe</i></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a href=\"cdoftheweek.php\">Click here to read the review.</a>\r\n<!--<br><br>\r\n<a href=\"donate.php\">Donate to get a download.</a>\r\n<BR><hr />\r\n<a href=\"cdoftheweek.php?id=836\" style=\"clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 0em;\" ><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a2436756804_2.jpg\" /></a> \r\n<font size=2><b>SPRINTS</b><br>\r\n<i>All That Is Over</i></font>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<a href=\"/cdoftheweek.php?id=836\">Click here to read the review.</a>\r\n<br><br><a href=\"donate.php\">Donate to get a download.</a>-->','https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a2428139929_2.jpg','cdoftheweek.php?id=837',4,'n'),(19,'2014-04-23','2020-12-31','New Y-Not T-Shirts and Stickers','Help support Y-Not Radio by picking up one of our new t-shirts and stickers! These shirts are made for us by <a href=\"http://PhillyBandMerch.com\" target=\"_blank\">PhillyBandMerch.com</a> and unlike our old Cafe Press merch, your purchases will go directly to support the station. Shirts are in and your order will be shipped within the week. <strong><a href=\"donate.php\">Click here for more info.</a></strong> ','images/josh-y-not-shirts.jpg','donate.php',100,'y'),(20,'2011-04-25','2011-04-29','Inside Beastie Boys:<br>Hot Sauce Committee Part 2','Next week <b>Beastie Boys</b> finally release <i>Hot Sauce Committee Part Two</i>. Get the inside scoop and hear tracks from the new album as <b>Mike D.</b> and <b>Ad-Rock</b> are interviewed by host <b>Matt Pinfield</b>. Catch it on Y-Not Radio this Friday at 1pm and 9pm.','http://uncrate.com/p/2011/04/hot-sauce-committee.jpg','http://hotsaucecommittee.com/',1,'n'),(21,'2011-04-27','2011-04-28','The Submarines Bunker Session','Unfortunately due to and unforseen illness and doctors orders for Blake not sing, <b>The Submarines</b> have been forced to cancel today\'s Bunker Session :(  They hope to return and make it up very soon.  In the meantime get a free download of \"Birds\" from their new album <i>Love Notes / Letterbombs</i> <a href=\"http://www.thesubmarines.com/news/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.\r\n','http://a3.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/149/49e875f1436147cfb2adf1958388acbd/l.jpg','http://www.thesubmarines.com',3,'n'),(22,'2011-07-28','2020-12-31','Top 11 @ 11<br>Vote & Win Death Cab Tickets','Every Thursday morning at 11, Y-Not Radio counts down the Top 11 alternative & indie rock songs of the week. Vote this week and you\'ll be registered to win a pair of tickets for <b>Death Cab For Cutie</b> on Friday, August 5th at The Mann Center!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<center><b><i><a href=\"/top11.php\">CLICK HERE TO VOTE</a></i></b></center>','http://a1.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/127/1fdf699fd6df45e18295e5d2d0c86224/l.jpg','/top11.php',1,'y'),(23,'2011-04-28','2011-04-30','Matt Pond PA Bunker Session','Tune in Friday at 2:30pm for another Y-Not Bunker Session with former Philly residents <b>Matt Pond PA</b> who return to town for the premiere of the film they scored, <i>Lebanon, PA</i> that night at The Ritz Bourse.  They\'ll chat about that and play songs from their new EP <i>Spring Fools</i>.','http://a1.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/127/1a3b944c5f3e41aca7195b5df6c05727/l.jpg','http://www.mattpondpa.com/',2,'n'),(24,'2011-04-29','2011-04-30','Inside Beastie Boys:<br>Hot Sauce Committee Part 2','On Tuesday <strong>Beastie Boys</strong> finally release <em>Hot Sauce Committee Part Two</em>. Get the inside scoop and hear tracks from the new album as <strong>Mike D.</strong> and <strong>Ad-Rock</strong> are interviewed by host <strong>Matt Pinfield</strong>. Catch it on Y-Not Radio this Friday at 4pm and 9pm.','http://uncrate.com/p/2011/04/hot-sauce-committee.jpg','http://hotsaucecommittee.com/',1,'n'),(25,'2011-05-02','2011-05-06','Wintersleep Bunker Session','Tonight, Canadian indie rock band <b>Wintersleep</b> comes to Philly to play <a href=\"http://www.r5productions.com/event/33945/\" target=_blank>Johnny Brenda\'s</a>, but first they\'ll be stopping by the Y-Not Bunker at around 4pm to perform songs from their latest album <i>New Inheritors</i>. In the meantime download the title track free <a href=\"http://www.wintersleep.com/\" target=_blank>here</a>. ','http://a4.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/131/19c07c20d7dd467ea81245eb653e6e18/l.jpg','http://www.wintersleep.com',1,'n'),(26,'2011-05-02','2011-05-08','Transmission Interview<br>with Zola Jesus','Tune in for this weekâ??s edition of <i>Transmission</i> - 2 hours of alternative electronic and dance music with <b>Rob Huff</b>, featuring an interview with darkwave siren <b>Zola Jesus</b> and hear songs from her recent EPs.  Hear the replay on Saturday from 6-8pm. ','http://c438342.r42.cf2.rackcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/01/zola-jesus-2011-tour.jpg','http://zolajesus.com/',3,'n'),(27,'2011-05-06','2011-05-11','Margot & The Nuclear So and So\'s Bunker Session','On Tuesday, Indianapolis indie band <b>Margot & The Nuclear So and So\'s</b> will be in Philly to play with <b>Twilight Singers</b> at the <a href=\"http://www.ticketmaster.com/event/0200464EA4A66590\" target=_blank>Trocadero</a>.  That afternoon at about 2:30, they\'ll be stopping by the Y-Not Bunker where singer <b>Richard Edwards</b> will perform a couple solo acoustic songs.','http://thenjunderground.com/storage/Margot%20%20The%20Nuclear%20So%20and%20So%27s.jpg','http://margotandthenuclearsoandsos.net/',2,'n'),(28,'2011-05-09','2011-05-13','Surfer Blood Bunker Session','How many indie rock bands come from Florida?  Count <b>Surfer Blood</b> among the few!  They play the <a href=\"http://www.r5productions.com/event/21331/\" target=_blank>First Unitarian Church</a> this Thursday night with <b>...And You Will Know Us By The Trail of Dead</b>, but before the show will be stopping by for an acoustic Bunker Session.  <i>If you missed it, catch the replay on Friday at 8pm.</i>','http://a2.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/126/c86e7356e4224185ba0b222a8399864c/l.jpg','http://surferblood.com/',2,'n'),(29,'2011-05-09','2011-05-13','Surfer Blood Bunker Session','How many indie rock bands come from Florida?  Count <b>Surfer Blood</b> among the few!  They play the First Unitarian Church this Thursday night with <b>...And You Will Know Us By The Trail of Dead</b>, but before the show will be stopping by around 2pm for an acoustic Bunker Session.','http://a2.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/126/c86e7356e4224185ba0b222a8399864c/l.jpg','http://surferblood.com/',4,'y'),(30,'2011-05-09','2011-05-14','Sleigh Bells Interview','Over the weekend <b>Sleigh Bells</b> rocked out (and gave seizures to) a sold out crowd at The Trocadero!  Before the show, Y-Not\'s <b>Rob Huff</b> caught up with the duo of <b>Alexis Krauss</b> and <b>Derek Miller</b>.  Hear their conversation this Friday at 2pm.','http://a4.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/148/667f1a05e7a0463f9fab3728645b8d27/l.jpg','http://www.myspace.com/sleighbellsmusic',1,'n'),(31,'2011-05-16','2011-05-24','The Vaccines Interview','<b>The Vaccines</b> are one of the U.K.\'s biggest buzz bands of the moment and Y-Not\'s <b>Matt McGrath</b> caught up with them backstage before their sold out show with <b>Arctic Monkeys</b> at The Factory. Hear the exclusive interview and tracks from their debut <i>What Did You Expect From The Vaccines?</i> tonight around 8:45 during <i>Britspotting</i>.','http://blahblahblahscience.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/03/the-vaccines.jpg','http://www.thevaccines.co.uk/',2,'n'),(32,'2011-05-23','2011-05-27','Transmission Interview w/ Grimes','Tune in for this week\'s edition of <i>Transmission</i> - 2 hours of alternative electronic and dance music with <strong>Rob Huff</strong>, featuring an interview with cosmic pop deity <strong>Grimes</strong>, who recently opened for <strong>Lykke Li</strong>, and hear songs from her recent albums <em>Geidi Primes</em> and <em>Halfaxa</em>.  Hear it Thursday from 9-11pm or catch the replay on Saturday from 6-8pm.','http://a4.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/129/f631eacc8e044c97898e6fe60c7ad612/l.png','http://www.myspace.com/boucherville',3,'n'),(33,'2011-05-23','2011-05-28','Inside Death Cab For Cutie\'s<br>Codes And Keys','<strong>Death Cab For Cutie</strong> return next week with their 7th studio album <em><a href=\"http://www.deathcabforcutie.com/codesandkeys/\" target=_blank>Codes And Keys</a></em>.  Tune in this Friday at 1pm or 9pm for an hour long special featuring <strong>Ben Gibbard</strong>, <strong>Chris Walla</strong>, <strong>Nick Harmer</strong> and <strong>Jason McGerr</strong> playing tracks from the new album and chatting with host <strong>Matt Pinfield</strong> about making it.','http://cdn.pastemagazine.com/www/articles/2011/03/14/death-cab-for-cutie-codes-and-keys.jpg?1300117463','http://www.deathcabforcutie.com/',1,'n'),(34,'2011-05-28','2011-06-10','Donate for Death Cab','Want to support Y-Not Radio and get the new <b>Death Cab For Cutie</b> album at the same time?  Well, if you make a donation of $20 or more towards station operating costs, we\'ll send you a download of <i>Codes And Keys</i> courtesy of Atlantic Records as a thank you gift.\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<center><form action=\"https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr\" method=\"post\">\r\n<input name=\"cmd\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"_s-xclick\" />\r\n<input name=\"hosted_button_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"HPD3J7U8MSM8J\" />\r\n<input alt=\"PayPal - The safer, easier way to pay online!\" border=\"0\" name=\"submit\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/btn/btn_donateCC_LG.gif\" type=\"image\" />\r\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/scr/pixel.gif\" width=\"1\" />\r\n</form>\r\n</center>','http://cdn.pastemagazine.com/www/articles/2011/03/14/death-cab-for-cutie-codes-and-keys.jpg?1300117463','',2,'n'),(35,'2011-06-02','2011-06-07','Go Inside <i>Codes and Keys</i>','If you missed the <b>Inside Codes And Keys</b> special that aired last week  featuring the guys from <b>Death Cab For Cutie</b> playing tracks from the new record and chatting with host <b>Matt Pinfield</b> about making it, you can now hear it <a href=\"http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/p/on-demand.html\" target=\"_blank\">on demand for a limited time</a>.<br><br>\r\n<i>And read our CD of The Week review of the album <a href=\"/cdoftheweek.php?id=16\">here</a>.</i>','http://www.deathcabforcutie.com/wp-content/gallery/Press%20Photos/5510875268_3f0a07e836_b.jpeg','http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/p/on-demand.html',4,'n'),(36,'2011-06-02','2011-06-04','Tweet For Tickets: Roots Picnic','This just in: Y-Not has another pair of tickets for <a href=\"http://www.okayplayer.com/rootspicnic\" target=_blank><b><i>The Roots Picnic</b></i></a> on Saturday at Festival Pier! If you want to win them, you have to follow us on <a href=\"http://twitter.com/ynotradio\" target=_blank>Twitter</a> and then tweet <i>\"I hope @YNotRadio picks me to see @questlove @EdwardSharpe @manmanbandband at #rootspicnic http://ynotradio.net\"</i>','http://www.billboard.com/photos/stylus/102819-The_Roots_617_409.jpg','http://twitter.com/ynotradio',1,'n'),(37,'2011-06-02','2020-12-31','Lollapalooza Chile Report','Back in April, our own <b>Zeke</b>, who has been studying abroad in Chile, had the opportunity to attend <b><i>Lollapalooza Chile</i></b> and he sent us back a report. It took a long time to get here (or we forgot to post it right away). <a href=\"http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/2011/06/lollapalooza-chile-report.html\">Read it here.</a>','http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-keMt1lF3nbg/Tef0BRRX3TI/AAAAAAAAAM8/QlHwSzuym1Q/s1600/Untitled1.jpg','http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/2011/06/lollapalooza-chile-report.html',9,'y'),(38,'2011-06-07','2011-06-11','The Postelles Bunker Session','This Friday afternoon New York garage pop band <strong>The Postelles</strong> will be coming by the Bunker to perform a live acoustic session before their show that night at <a href=\"http://www.r5productions.com/event/37809/\" target=\"_blank\">Kungfu Necktie</a>. Check them out and get a free download of the song â??Hold Onâ? from their self titled debut out this week at <a href=\"http://www.thepostelles.com/\" target=\"_blank\">ThePostelles.com</a>.','http://lh5.ggpht.com/_pVXrYi8s2rM/TIaOvb5RtSI/AAAAAAAAEJU/ypovYvmw0Lw/ThePostelles_thumb2.jpg','http://www.thepostelles.com/',9,'y'),(39,'2011-06-09','2011-06-15','Those Darlins Bunker Session','Next Tuesday, June 14th, we welcome <strong>Those Darlins</strong> to the Bunker where they will not be \"sticking anything in\" because they\'ll be playing acoustic versions of songs from their new album <em>Screws Get Loose</em>. You can catch them that evening at <a href=\"http://www.johnnybrendas.com/event/36341/\" target=\"_blank\">Johnny Brenda\'s</a>. <em>Enter to win tickets by e-mailing your name, phone #, and date of birth to <a href=\"mailto:contest@ynotradio.net\" target=\"_blank\">contest@ynotradio.net</a> by Tuesday at Noon.</em>','http://a3.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/133/68671d764178423ab95af51e43310b7f/l.jpg','http://thosedarlins.com/',1,'n'),(40,'2011-06-10','2011-07-01','Donate For Death Cab','If you love listening to Y-Not Radio, please consider making a donation to help with our operating costs. And to say thanks, we\'re offering a download of <b>Death Cab For Cutie</b>\'s new album <i>Codes and Keys</i> to anyone who donates $20 or more, courtesy of Atlantic Records.<br><br>\r\n<center>\r\n<form action=\"https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr\" method=\"post\">\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"cmd\" value=\"_s-xclick\">\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"hosted_button_id\" value=\"HPD3J7U8MSM8J\">\r\n<input type=\"image\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/btn/btn_donateCC_LG.gif\" border=\"0\" name=\"submit\" alt=\"PayPal - The safer, easier way to pay online!\">\r\n<img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.paypalobjects.com/en_US/i/scr/pixel.gif\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\">\r\n</form></center>','http://cdn.pastemagazine.com/www/articles/2011/03/14/death-cab-for-cutie-codes-and-keys.jpg?1300117463','',3,'n'),(41,'2011-06-16','2011-06-18','Ambassadors Bunker Session','You may not have heard of <b>Ambassadors</b> yet, but you probably will.  Last week they opened for <b>The Postelles</b> and stopped by The Bunker to play a couple acoustic songs for us. Hear the session this Friday at 1pm.','http://a3.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ak-snc6/252860_220411371311099_137798016239102_804403_7422079_n.jpg','http://www.myspace.com/ambassadorsband',2,'n'),(42,'2011-06-16','2011-06-22','Eastern Conference Champions Kawari Session','Last summer <b>Eastern Conference Champions</b> were our very first visitors to the Y-Not Bunker.  Now they make their triumphant return, this time for a full on rock session at <a href=\"http://kawarisound.com\" target=_blank>Kawari Sound</a>. Hear the session on Thursday at 3pm and check out their new album <i>Speak-Ahhh</i> <a href=\"http://eccmusic.com/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://a1.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/96/6fd4ea6a7a2741b2b7721f240ec83006/l.jpg','http://eccmusic.com/',4,'n'),(43,'2011-06-19','2011-06-23','White Denim Bunker Session','This Wednesday, Austin, TX psychadelic rock band <b>White Denim</b> will be in Philly for a show at <a href=\"http://www.r5productions.com/event/39013/\" target=_blank>Johnny Brenda\'s</a>.  Before the show, they\'ll stop by Y-Not Radio for a Bunker Session at around 4pm and play some acoustic versions of songs from their new album <i>D</i>.','http://a4.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/85/c630182e0a174742a887ff82198866e4/l.jpg','http://whitedenimmusic.com/',1,'n'),(44,'2011-06-22','2011-06-24','Eastern Conference Champions Kawari Session','This Thursday at 3pm we welcome back our friends and very first Y-Not Bunker visitors<strong> Eastern Conference Champions</strong>. Josh, Greg, and Melissa were in town to play Johnny Brenda\'s on Monday and before the show they recorded this  brand new, full-on rock session at <a href=\"http://kawarisound.com\" target=\"_blank\">Kawari Sound</a> featuring songs from their new album <a href=\"http://eccmusic.com/store/\" target=\"_blank\">Speak-Ahh</a>.','http://a1.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/96/6fd4ea6a7a2741b2b7721f240ec83006/l.jpg','http://eccmusic.com',1,'n'),(45,'2011-06-23','2011-06-25','White Denim Bunker Session','On Wednesday afternoon, Austin, TX psychadelic rock band <b>White Denim</b> stopped by for a very cool Bunker Session, playing acoustic versions of songs from their new album <i>D</i>.  But they were kinda late so we\'re going to play it back this Friday at 2pm.  Download a free track and watch the video for \"Drug\" <a href=\"http://whitedenimmusic.com/\" target=_blank\">here</a>.','http://www.clashmusic.com/files/imagecache/big_node_view/files/whitedenim_1.jpg','http://whitedenimmusic.com/',1,'n'),(46,'2011-06-28','2011-07-05','Britspotting July 4th Marathon','This 4th of July, Y-Not Radio celebrates our independence from tyranny with a 12 hour marathon of our Brit-rock show, <em><strong>Britspotting</strong></em> with Y-Not\'s resident anglophile <strong>Matt McGrath</strong>.  Tune in from 10am-10pm and catch 6 episodes in a row featuring all the best alt &amp; indie rock from across the pond.  And then hear <em>Britspotting</em> every Monday night from 8-10 with replays on Saturdays from 4-6pm.','http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Ajx-wzbYp2E/TeUoLN3bfQI/AAAAAAAAAM4/SFpqYzsZEzc/s1600/britspotting.jpg','http://facebook.com/britspottingradio',1,'n'),(47,'2018-09-30','2020-12-31','Support Y-Not Radio','This week Y-Not Radio celebrates its 7th Anniversary!  Help keep the station running for many more years by <b><a href=\"https://www.paypal.me/ynotradio/7\" target=\"_blank\">donating $7</a></b> today.  <!--If you love Y-Not Radio, please help support the station streaming and music royalty fees.  Please help keep Y-Not on the air by making a donation and-->Or donate more and, weâ€™ll say thanks by sending you a Y-Not t-shirt or a new album from <b>Portugal. The Man</b>, <b>Phoenix</b>, <b>Dan Auerbach</b>,\r\n <b>Blondie</b>, <b>Gorillaz</b>, <b>Future Islands</b>, or others to choose from.  Thank you!\r\n<br><center><b><a href=\"donate.php\">DONATE HERE</a></b></center>','http://indiareconnect.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/07/7th4.png','/donate.php',7,'y'),(48,'2011-07-05','2011-08-01','Kawari Sound Throwdown','Our friends at <strong>Kawari Sound</strong> are searching for the best local talent to record at their amazing studio FOR FREE and get played on Y-Not Radio!  Catch the finals on Friday, July 29th at World Cafe Live with performances from the winners of each Throwdown.  <strong>Joey O.</strong> will be judging to see who has the stuff to get played on Y-Not.  Get more info at <a href=\"http://KawariSound.com\" target=\"_blank\">KawariSound.com</a>.','http://fbcdn-profile-a.akamaihd.net/hprofile-ak-snc4/195805_214514551918408_4798609_n.jpg','http://kawarisound.com/',4,'y'),(49,'2011-07-11','2011-07-13','Darwin Deez Interview','This Tuesday night, indie quirkster <b>Darwin Deez</b> comes to Philly to play at <a href=\"http://www.r5productions.com/event/40879/\" target=_blank>Johnny Brenda\'s</a>.  Before the show, Darwin will be calling in from the road to chat with <b>Josh T.</b> and feature some songs from his self titled debut album.  Sure hope he has a <i>radar detector</i> cause we wouldn\'t want him getting pulled over during the interview.','http://www.live4ever.uk.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/06/darwin-deez.jpg','http://darwindeez.com/',3,'n'),(50,'2011-07-13','2011-07-22','EMA Bunker Session','On Monday, Y-Not Radio was paid a visit by up and coming indie artist <strong>EMA</strong> (<strong>Erika M. Anderson</strong> formerly of<strong> The Gowns</strong>) who performed  songs from her solo debut album <em>Past Life Martyred Saints</em> and had a chat with <strong>Rob Huff</strong>.  If you missed it, catch the playback on during the first hour of <em>Transmission</em> either Thursday from 9-11pm or Saturday from 6-8pm. <em>Get EMA\'s  new single â??Milkmanâ? for free at <a href=\"/Music\">here</a>.</em>','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-yNdc3J_wBew/TdVSGqtq5PI/AAAAAAAAAu4/KPBOjVLQmh0/s1600/ema-past-life-martyred-saints.jpg','http://cameouttanowhere.com/',1,'n'),(51,'2011-07-14','2011-07-16','Gomez Show Cancelled','Press release: <i>With great regret we must cancel the remaining 8 dates of our North American tour. After a couple of days battling vocal loss, Ben met with a specialist who determined that he must take the next two weeks to recover with absolute voice rest.</i> <a href=\"http://www.gomeztheband.com/news/announcement-n-american-summer-tour-cancelled/\" target=_blank>See More...</a>','http://www.gomeztheband.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/04/BG48c30-R01-007-e1302204131416.jpg','http://www.gomeztheband.com/news/announcement-n-american-summer-tour-cancelled/',3,'n'),(52,'2011-07-18','2011-07-24','La Vida Boheme Bunker Session','<i>Y-Not Internacional</i> favorites <b>La Vida Boheme</b> from Venezuela come to Philadelphia tonight to play at <a href=\"http://www.dobbsphilly.com/event/53719/\" target=_blank>The Legendary Dobbs</a>. Tune in for their Bunker Session this afternoon in the 5pm hour or catch the replay during <i>Y-Not Internacional</i> on Saturday from 2-4pm.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/09/75/53-atlg.jpg','http://www.myspace.com/vidaboheme',2,'y'),(53,'2011-07-18','2011-07-27','Y-Not Internacional Interview w/ La Vida Boheme','Venezuelan rock band <b>La Vida Boheme</b> were in Philadelphia on Monday night and <em>Y-Not Internacional</em> co-host <strong>Gil</strong> caught up with the guys before their show. Hear the interview and tracks from their album <i>Nuestra</i> on this week\'s episode - Tuesday night from 10pm-midnight.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/09/75/53-atlg.jpg','http://www.myspace.com/vidaboheme',5,'n'),(54,'2011-07-20','2011-08-01','Y-Not in The Daily News','Thanks to the <b>Philadelphia Daily News</b> for running a big article about Y-Not Radio on Wednesday.  If you missed it in the paper, you can can still read it online <a href=\"http://www.philly.com/philly/entertainment/20110720_Y100_lives_on.html\" target=_blank>here</a>. <br><br><br>\r\n<i>Check out writer <b>Molly Eichel</b>\'s Y-Not Philly playlist <a href=\"http://www.philly.com/philly/entertainment/20110720_Let_a_reporter_pick_the_tunes__Why_not_.html\" target=_blank>here</a> and <b>Josh T.</b>\'s \"10 Bands You Should Know About\" list <a href=\"http://www.philly.com/philly/entertainment/20110720_Expand_your_playlist_with_these_10_bands.html\" target=_blank>here</a>.</i>','http://ismashphone.typepad.com/.a/6a00e55225079e8834014e89c3b638970d-320wi','http://www.philly.com/philly/entertainment/20110720_Y100_lives_on.html',6,'n'),(55,'2011-07-21','2011-07-31','Viva Brother Bunker Session','The latest darlings of the UK, <b>Viva Brother</b> made their Philly debut this week and came in for an acoustic Y-Not Bunker Session and interview.  If you missed it live, hear the replay this Monday night at 8:30 during <i>Britspotting</i> - 2 hours of UK indie rock.','http://acidlove.net/vivabrother/splashpic2.jpg','http://acidlove.net',3,'n'),(56,'2011-07-26','2011-07-31','Y-Not @ ART/GAGE Festival','This Saturday <strong>Philadelphia\'s Magic Gardens</strong> hosts the <strong>Art/Gage Festival</strong> on South Street between 10th & 11th featuring over 30 art and food vendors,and live music from <b>Toy Soldiers, Lion Versus, TJ Kong and The Atomic Bomb, Bells Bells Bells,</b> and more. Come visit the Y-Not tent and sign up to win tickets for <strong>Big Audio Dynamite</strong> at The Electric Factory or <strong>Man Man</strong> at The Trocadero. <a href=\"http://www.philadelphiasmagicgardens.org/pages.php?ContentID=3&SubContentID=27#555\" target=\"_blank\">Get more info here.</a>','http://www.philadelphiasmagicgardens.org/Editor/assets/gallery2/ART_GAGE_Postcard_Vendors-FINAL.jpg','http://www.philadelphiasmagicgardens.org/pages.php?ContentID=3&SubContentID=27#555',1,'n'),(57,'2011-07-27','2011-08-01','Y-Not @ 2nd Street Festival','This Sunday, 2nd Street in Northern Liberties gets turned into a giant music festival featuring <b>tUnE-yArDs</b> along with local favorites <b>East Hundred, Cheers Elephant, Black Landlord, Toy Soldiers,</b> and many more!  Y-Not will be out DJing between bands on the Poplar stage and signing people up at our tent to win tickets for <b>Big Audio Dynamite</b> at The Electric Factory or <b>Man Man</b> at The Trocadero. <a href=\"http://2ndstreetfestival.org/\" target=_blank>Get more info here.</a>','http://www.uwishunu.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/07/2nd-street-festival-260uw.jpg','http://2ndstreetfestival.org/',1,'n'),(58,'2011-07-29','2099-04-28','Top 11 @ 11:<br>Vote & Win Sun Airway Tickets','Every Thursday morning at 11, Y-Not Radio counts down the Top 11 alternative & indie rock songs of the week.  Vote this week and you\'ll be registered to win a pair of tickets for <b>Sun Airway</b> on Saturday, January 5th at Johnny Brenda\'s!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<center><b><i><a href=\"/top11.php\">CLICK HERE TO VOTE</a></i></b></center>','http://rcrdlbl.com/files/rblog_images/sunairway%281%29.jpg','top11.php',2,'y'),(59,'2011-08-01','2011-08-07','Viva Brother Bunker Session','The latest darlings of the UK, <strong>Viva Brother</strong> are made their way to our shores for Philly debut last week at Kungfu Necktie. Before the show, they stopped by for an interview and acoustic Bunker Session.  If you missed it live, hear the replay on the next <em>Britspotting</em> â?? Saturday afternoon at 4. Pick up their debut album <em><a href=\"http://www.acidlove.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Famous First Words</a></em>, out this week.','http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-7wbfGIRRXS8/Tjb4HkjB5EI/AAAAAAAAAOs/mb4g9pK-TIc/s1600/Viva+Brother+2.JPG','http://www.acidlove.net/',4,'n'),(60,'2011-08-01','2011-08-10','Tweet For Tix: Band of Horses','<strong>Band of Horses</strong> just announced a show this Tuesday at The TLA and Y-Not Radio has a chance for you to win your way in.  Just follow us on <a href=\"http://twitter.com/ynotradio\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a> and then tweet this message: <em>\"I want to win <b>@bandofhorses</b> tickets so I listen to <b>@YNotRadio</b>. You should too at http://ynotradio.net\" </em><strong>Tweet by Tuesday at noon to register.Â  </strong>Good luck! Tickets are available now to purchase <a href=\"http://www.livenation.com/event/020047039DE46A19\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.\r\n','http://www.bandofhorses.com/sites/bohorses6/files/1809-17.jpg','http://twitter.com/ynotradio',1,'y'),(61,'2011-08-07','2011-08-12','The Ettes Bunker Session','Over the weekend, 60\'s girl group inspired Nashville rock band <b>The Ettes</b> were in town supporting their recently released 5th album <i>Wicked Will</i>.  While they were here  <strong>Coco</strong>, <strong>Jem</strong>, and <strong>Poni</strong> stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to chat with <b>Joey O.</b> (mainly about cheese whiz) and play live for us.  Hear their session this Thursday at 2pm.','http://www.theettes.com/guns3.jpg','http://www.theettes.com',1,'n'),(62,'2011-08-10','2011-08-19','Fountains of Wayne Interview','Last week <b>Fountains of Wayne</b> were in Philadelphia and before their show, frontmen <b>Adam Schlesinger</b> and <b>Chris Collingwood</b> sat down with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to chat about their just released 5th album <i><a href=\"http://www.fountainsofwayne.com\" target=_blank>Sky Full of Holes</a></i>.  Hear the interview and songs off the record on Thursday afternoon at 2. <br><br>\r\n<b><i><a href=\"http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/p/donate.html\" target=_blank>Make a $25 donation to Y-Not Radio</a> this week and get a copy of Sky Full of Holes.</i></b>  ','http://img2.timeinc.net/ew/i/2011/07/26/Fountains-Of-Wayne_320.jpg','http://www.fountainsofwayne.com',1,'n'),(63,'2011-08-13','2011-08-22','Guster Radio Takeover','Our friends <b>Guster</b> were back in town last week to play Festival Pier and before the show <b>Ryan Miller</b> took the time to guest DJ for Y-Not Radio.  If you missed his Takeover on Friday, catch the playback this Sunday at 8pm.  Hear his playlist including <b>The Drums, Washed Out, Love and Rockets, Jukebox The Ghost,</b> and lots more.  Plus catch up with the latest Guster goings on including their self released <i>On The Ocean</i> EP, available now at <a href=\"http://guster.com\" target=_blank>Guster.com</a>.','http://wearyourmusic.org/catalog/images/Ryan%20Miller%20197%20x%20178.jpg','http://guster.com',1,'n'),(64,'2011-08-16','2011-08-21','Austra Interview on Transmission','Tune in Thursday nights from 9-11 for <em>Transmission</em> â?? 2 hours of alternative electronic and dance music with <strong>Rob Huff</strong>!  This week Rob has an interview with Torontoâ??s <strong>Austra</strong>, who return to Philly on October 26th at <a href=\"http://www.r5productions.com/event/52099/\" target=\"_blank\">The First Unitarian Church</a>.  Or catch the replay on Saturday from 6-8pm.','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-PTpFR81N41M/TiYPZ1ojUQI/AAAAAAAAGy4/8ZD_iuzyAOI/s640/austra.jpg','http://www.austramusic.com/',4,'n'),(65,'2011-08-19','2011-08-24','Tweet For Tix: My Morning Jacket','On Tuesday night <strong>My Morning Jacket</strong> returns to play The Mann Center with <b>Neko Case</b>! Y-Not Radio has one more chance for you to win your way in by following us on <a href=\"http://twitter.com/ynotradio\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a> and then tweet this message: <em>\"For the most <strong>@mymorningjacket</strong> I listen to <strong>@YNotRadio</strong>. You should too at http://ynotradio.net\" </em><strong>Tweet by Tuesday at noon to register.  </strong>Good luck! </font>            \r\n            </p><p><font size=\"2\">Tickets are still available to purchase <a href=\"http://www.ticketmaster.com/event/020046D0CCED8200\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.\r\n              </font>','http://truthaboutmusic.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/My_Morning_Jacket_Lo_Res_Press_Photo-220x170.jpg','http://twitter.com/ynotradio',1,'y'),(66,'2011-08-22','2011-09-25','Y-Not F/M Fest Showcase','Tonight is Y-Not Radio\'s F/M Fest Showcase at The North Star Bar featuring <strong>Turning violet Violet</strong>, <strong>Steve Goldberg & The Arch Enemies</strong>, <strong>The Kickdrums</strong>, <strong>High Kick</strong>, and <strong>New Motels</strong>!  Before you see them all live, check out <b><a href=\"http://dl.dropbox.com/u/7586331/YNot_Fest_Sampler.zip\">this free sampler</a></b> of tracks from all of the bands live Y-Not Session performances. Tickets are only $8 and are <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/56393\" target=\"_blank\">available here</a> or at the door. <br><br>Then on Saturday we co-present <strong>The Swimmers</strong> with <strong>Adam and Dave\'s Bloodline</strong> and <strong>Creeping Weeds</strong> at <a href=\"http://www.ticketweb.com/t3/sale/SaleEventDetail?dispatch=loadSelectionData&eventId=3880565\" target=_blank>KungFu Necktie</a>. <i>Find out about more Philly Film & Music Festival shows <a href=\"http://www.phillyfmfest.com\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. </i>','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/10/25/37-atsm.jpg','http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/56393',1,'n'),(67,'2011-08-27','2011-08-29','Your Soundtrack for Irene','With Hurricane Irene bearing down on Philadelphia and the surrounding areas, we want to encourage people to stay safely indoors where you can listen to Y-Not Radio all weekend...unless the power goes out (ours or yours).<br><br>\r\n<u>Show Cancellations:</u> <br>Black Landlord BBQ (Sat.)<br>Faux Slang @ Kungfu Necktie (Sat.)<br>\r\nCrills Wilson @ North Star Bar Star (Sat.)<br>\r\nMale Bonding @ Kungfu Necktie (Sun.)','http://i.usatoday.net/news/gallery/2011/n110824_IRENE/03n110824_IRENE-pg-horizontal.jpg','http://www.accuweather.com/',1,'n'),(68,'2011-08-27','2011-09-03','Inside Tom Morello\'s <br>World Wide Rebel Songs','For his third album as <b>The Nightwatchman</b>, guitar superhero <b>Tom Morello</b> switched up his style from folk balladeer and picked up his electric guitar to convey his messages of resistance. Hear Tom\'s interview with <b>Jane\'s Addiction</b> frontman <b>Perry Farrell</b> as they talk about and play tracks from the new album <i>World Wide Rebel Songs</i>.  If you missed it on the air, check it out <a href=\"http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/2011/09/inside-tom-morello-nightwatchmans-world.html\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>.','http://nightwatchmanmusic.com/spash-page/wwrs.jpg','http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/2011/09/inside-tom-morello-nightwatchmans-world.html',1,'n'),(69,'2011-09-01','2011-09-08','Tweet For Tickets: The National','This week <B>The National</b> returns to Philadelphia for 2 shows at The Academy of Music, along with <b>Yo La Tengo</b>, and we have a chance for you to win your way in on Wednesday night! To enter, follow us on <a href=\"http://twitter.com/ynotradio\" target=_blank>Twitter</a> and then tweet this message: <i>\"Hey @YNotRadio, help me go see @The_National at Academy of Music. http://ynotradio.net\"</i> Tweet by Wednesday at noon to enter. Good luck! <a href=\"http://www.kimmelcenter.org/events/index.php?id=4153\" target=_blank>Tickets for both nights are still available here.</a>','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-p-Rpv5ichPI/Tl_Im9p7dHI/AAAAAAAAAPA/TOx-EcbdCBM/s1600/National_300x250ONSALE.jpg','http://www.kimmelcenter.org/events/index.php?id=4153',1,'y'),(70,'2011-09-03','2011-09-17','Inside Tom Morello\'s <br>World Wide Rebel Songs','For his third album as <strong>The Nightwatchman</strong>, guitar superhero <strong>Tom Morello</strong> switched up his style from folk balladeer and picked up his electric guitar to convey his messages of resistance. Hear Tom\'s interview with <strong>Jane\'s Addiction</strong> frontman <strong>Perry Farrell</strong> as they talk about and play tracks from the new album <em>World Wide Rebel Songs</em>. If you missed it on air, listen now <a href=\"\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>.','http://nightwatchmanmusic.com/spash-page/wwrs.jpg','http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/2011/09/inside-tom-morello-nightwatchmans-world.html',8,'n'),(71,'2011-09-05','2011-09-09','Baseball Project Interview','No, Y-Not Radio isn\'t turning into a Sports Talk station too, but over the weekend, <b>Joey O.</b> sat down with <b>Scott McCaughey</b> and <b>Steve Wynn</b> of <b>The Baseball Project</b> to chat about the National Pastime, the home town <b>Phillies</b> and some rock \'n roll too. Hear the interview and a few of the band\'s songs, this Thursday afternoon at 2pm.','http://static.sched.org/c/austin2011/df6bd9eca32d74a39e4e5d3b86317f69.jpg','http://thebaseballproject.net/',2,'n'),(72,'2011-09-05','2011-09-10','Tweet For Tix: TV On The Radio','Win tickets to see <strong>TV On The Radio</strong> with <strong>Broken Social Scene</strong> on Friday night at The Mann Center. The more you listen, the better your chance of winning because every time we play TV On The Radio, you can enter the contest by tweeting<em> \"I\'m listening to [song title] by <strong>@TVonTheRadio</strong> on <strong>@YNotRadio</strong>. Tune in at http://ynotradio.net\"</em> Tweet as much as you can until Friday at noon. <a href=\"http://www.ticketmaster.com/event/020046B3F7DA9842\" target=\"_blank\">Tickets for TVOTR are  still available here</a>.','http://a3.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/137/a7fa79bd77fc4dbd934f3c296a72f1c8/l.jpg','http://twitter.com/ynotradio',1,'y'),(73,'2011-09-09','2011-09-15','The Smiths Social','Join Y-Not Radio this Wednesday night for the first ever <b><i>Smiths Social</i></b>, a monthly gathering of like-minded <b>Smiths</b> and <b>Morrissey</b> fans, at 7:30pm at The Grape Room in Manayunk. The evening will be hosted by Philadelphiaâ??s own <b>18th Pale Descendents</b>, who will play two live acoustic sets of Smiths tunes, plus Y-Not Radio DJâ??s Ramon and Matt McGrath will be spinning music from The Smiths, Morrissey, Johnny Marr, and other related acts before and after each live set.  More information can be found <a href=\"http://graperoommusic.com/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','images/smiths_social.jpg','http://graperoommusic.com/',3,'n'),(74,'2011-09-13','2011-09-17','The Kickdrums Live Session','<strong>The Kickdrums</strong> from Brooklyn will be one of the bands playing Y-Not\'s <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/56393\" target=\"_blank\">F/M Fest Showcase</a>, and later this week they\'ll be giving you a preview of what you\'ll hear from them at The North Star Bar on September 23rd. Tune in this Friday at 2pm to check them out playing songs from their debut album <em><a href=\"http://thekickdrums.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Meet Your Ghosts</a></em> live on the air. <br><br>\r\n<i>Check out their video for \"Animal\" shot in \"the bad part\" of Philadelphia <a href=\"http://www.prefixmag.com/media/prefix-the-kickdrums/animal-video-prefix-premiere/47096/\" target=_blank>here</a>.</i>','http://a1.l3-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/140/23276211b60c4226a37f61d6e719458c/l.jpg','http://thekickdrums.com/',1,'n'),(75,'2011-09-15','2011-09-25','The Dead Milkmen Y-Not Session','Jumpin\' Jesus on a pogo stick... one of Philadelphia\'s most iconic bands, <strong>The Dead Milkmen</strong>, joined us at <a href=\"http://kawarisound.com\" target=\"_blank\">Kawari Sound</a> for a very rare acoustic session and interview. Tune in to hear <strong>Joey O.</strong> and <strong> Bob Grant </strong>chat with <strong>Rodney Anonymous, Joe, Dean, </strong>and<strong> Dan </strong>on on Friday night at 9. <em>Then catch the Milkmen with <strong>The Descendents, X, Plow United, The Menzingers, </strong> and many more at <strong><a href=\"http://www.ticketmaster.com/event/020046D1BB009092\" target=\"_blank\">Riot Fest</a></strong> on Saturday, Sept. 24th at Festival Pier. </em>','http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-A3q7_QAgmq8/Tm9RWko6xdI/AAAAAAAAAPM/cALA-7WlmVg/s1600/120_6788.JPG','http://www.deadmilkmen.com/',2,'n'),(76,'2011-09-30','2011-10-07','They Might Be Giants Interview','<b>They Might Be Giants</b> were just in town for a show at The TLA supporting their new album <i>Join Us</i>.  Before the show <b>John Flansburgh</b> and <b>John Linnell</b> joined Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> for a chat about the record and all things TMBG.  Tune in to hear the interview on Wednesday night at 8pm and Thursday afternoon at 2pm.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/photos-ak-snc1/v4673/241/7/1018280801/n1018280801_30360179_6956256.jpg','http://www.theymightbegiants.com/',2,'n'),(77,'2011-10-07','2011-10-15','The Best Imitation of Ben Folds','This week <b>Ben Folds</b> releases <i>The Best Imitation of Myself: A Retrospective</i>, a 3 disc set featuring songs spanning Ben\'s entire career so far, including 3 brand new songs with <b>The Five</b>. Tune in all this week at 10am and 4pm to hear exclusive inside recollections about some of the songs from Ben himself. ','http://www.nbc.com/sing-off/about/benfolds_music_450.png','http://www.benfolds.com/',2,'y'),(78,'2011-10-10','2011-10-15','Ladytron Radio Takeover','Over the weekend <b>Ladytron</b> played The TLA in Philly and before the show <b>Josh T. Landow</b> sat down with co-frontwoman <b>Mira Aroyo</b> to chat about their new album <i>Gravity The Seducer</i>.  Plus Mira picked out a playlist of some songs that she\'s been listening to lately from the likes of <b>Panda Bear, The Beach Boys, Bonnie Prince Billy</b> and more... Tune in to hear it on Friday at 9pm.','http://www.clashmusic.com/files/imagecache/big_node_view/files/ladytron-miraaroyo.jpg','http://ladytron.com',1,'n'),(79,'2011-10-15','2011-10-22','Jane\'s Addiction: Inside The Great Escape Artist','This week brings the long-awaited release of <b>Jane\'s Addiction</b>\'s fourth album <i>The Great Escape Artist</i>.  Hear songs from the album and eccentric frontman <b>Perry Farrell</b> being interviewed by <b>Tom Morello</b> of <b>Rage Against The Machine</b> in this one hour radio special.  Tune in for it this Friday at 1pm and 10pm.','http://images.artistdirect.com/Images/a3/news/240/8973810_janesaddiction2011_240.jpg','http://janesaddiction.com',1,'n'),(80,'2011-10-15','2011-10-22','An Horse Bunker Session','This Friday afternoon around 4pm we\'ll welcome the grammatically challenged Aussie duo <b>An Horse</b> to The Bunker where they\'ll perform acoustic versions of songs from their new album <i>Walls</i>. Then you can check them out live that night at the North Star Bar with <b>Kevin Devine</b>.  <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/57961/tfly\" target=_blank>Tickets are available here.</a>','http://www.anhorse.com/wp-content/gallery/promtional-shots/promo5.jpg','http://www.anhorse.com',2,'n'),(81,'2011-10-23','2011-10-29','CSS Radio Takeover','Last week <b>CSS</b> hit Philly (like a rock) in support of their new album <i>La Liberacion</i>.  Before their show, Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and <b>Ramon</b> caught up with <b>Lovefoxxx, Luiza, Ana,</b> and <b>Carolina</b> for another Radio Takeover where they got to play some of their favorite music from <b>Grinderman, Donita Sparks, Metronomy,</b> and more!  Tune in to hear it this Friday at 1pm and 9pm.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc7/298318_287746644577571_137798016239102_1040306_1916887273_n.jpg','http://www.csssuxxx.com/',1,'n'),(82,'2011-10-23','2011-11-01','The Wombats Interview','Last weekend, Y-Not Radio\'s <i>Britspotting</i> host <b>Matt McGrath</b> had the chance to sit down with <b>Matthew Murphy</b> and <b>Dan Haggis</b> of <b>The Wombats</b> after their show at Johnny Brenda\'s.  Hear them chat about their new album <i>This Modern Glitch</i>, videos, touring, and more today at 1pm and 8:30pm. Watch their video for \"1996\" <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8grF93Qe9Lk\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-dBAbi96kIp8/TduFIA4mG8I/AAAAAAAAAHM/LFqs0tFnde0/s1600/The+Wombats.jpg','http://www.thewombats.co.uk/',1,'n'),(83,'2011-10-29','2011-11-05','Asobi Seksu Bunker Session','This Friday New Yorkâ??s <b>Asobi Seksu</b> will be in Philadelphia to play a show with <b>Boris</b> at Union Transfer.  Before the show, the main duo of <b>Yuki Chikudate</b> and <b>James Hanna</b> will stop by the Bunker to play acoustic versions of songs from their recent album <i>Fluorescence</i>.  Tune in to hear it around 4pm on Friday afternoon. <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/51575\" target=_blank>Tickets are available here.</a>','http://a3.ec-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/113/859561f81aef4c58a9d923752ddf492d/l.jpg','http://www.asobiseksu.com/',3,'y'),(84,'2011-10-31','2011-11-08','Metronomy Live Session','U.K. indie band <b>Metronomy</b> recently made a tour stop in Philadelphia, and took some time out to record a live session for us at <a href=\"http://KawariSound.com\" target=_blank>Kawari Sound</a>. Tune in this Monday at 9pm during <i>Britspotting</i> to hear their set plus a chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> about their new album <i>English Riviera</i> and what it\'s like to to be nominated for the Mercury Prize.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc1/5769_139324856083_17298911083_3700108_6418656_n.jpg','http://www.metronomy.co.uk/',2,'n'),(85,'2011-10-31','2011-11-05','Library Voices Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm for another Bunker Session, this time with a new indie band from Saskatchewan, Canada - <b>Library Voices</b>!  They\'ll play acoustic versions of some of the songs from their new album <i>Summer of Lust</i> before their show that night at <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/68573/tfly\" target=_blank>The North Star Bar</a> with local bands <b>Fang Fang</b> and <b>Geology</b>.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc3/19163_298118826432_25889251432_3973785_2415108_n.jpg','http://libraryvoices.ca/',1,'n'),(86,'2011-11-04','2011-11-13','The Rapture Radio Takeover','<b>The Rapture</b> recently came through Philly and while they were here Y-Not\'s <b>Rob Huff</b> caught up with <b>Vito</b> and <b>Gabriel</b> from the band.  Hear the guys chat about their new album <i>In The Grace of Your Love</i> and pick out a playlist of music that they\'re listening to. The Rapture takes over this Friday at 1pm with a replay during <i>Transmission</i> on Saturday at 5pm.','https://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash4/230055_10150199775974725_133896639724_6909736_2597548_n.jpg','http://therapturemusic.com',1,'n'),(87,'2011-11-04','2011-11-11','Two Lights Bunker Session','You may not have heard of <b>Two Lights</b> yet, but hopefully you will soon. These New Yorkers by way of Maine will be playing their first ever show in Philly this Thursday night at Dobbs on South Street. Before the show, they\'ll be stopping by Y-Not Radio in the 1pm hour to play some acoustic songs.  Before that you can download their debut single by liking them on <a href=\"http://facebook.com/twolightsband\" target=_blank>Facebook</a>.','http://twolightsband.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/09/TWO-LIGHTS-FLOOR-300x200.jpg','http://twolightsband.com',3,'n'),(88,'2011-11-07','2011-11-11','Tweet 4 Tix: Noel Gallagher','This Friday night <b>Noel Gallagherâ??s High Flying Birds</b> kick off their U.S. tour in Philadelphia at <a href=\"http://kimmelcenter.org/events/?id=4232\" target=\"_blank\">The Academy of Music</a> and Y-Not Radio has another chance for you to win your way in by tweeting for tickets. To enter, you have to follow us on <a href=\"http://twitter.com/ynotradio\" target=_blank>Twitter</a> and then tweet this message: <i>\"I listen to @YNotRadio for the most @NoelGallagher and deep cuts from @Oasis. You should too at http://ynotradio.net\"</i> Tweet by Thursday at 4pm to register.  Good luck! ','http://thetroc.com/images/events/Noel.gif','http://twitter.com/ynotradio',2,'y'),(89,'2011-11-07','2011-11-14','Y-Not Presents The Smiths Social','Join Y-Not Radio this Sunday night at 9 for the next <em><strong>Smiths Social</strong></em> at The Tritone. The evening will be hosted by Philadelphia\'s own 18th Pale Descendents, who will play two live acoustic sets of The Smiths tunes, plus  DJ\'s  spinning music from The Smiths, <strong>Morrissey</strong>, <strong>Johnny Marr</strong>, and other related acts. More information can be found <a href=\"http://www.tritonebar.com/mod/news/5991/9pm-the-smiths-social\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://ynotradio.net/images/smiths_social.jpg','http://www.tritonebar.com/mod/news/5991/9pm-the-smiths-social',10,'n'),(90,'2011-11-07','2011-11-16','Girl In A Coma Bunker Session','This Tuesday, November 15th, San Antonio\'s <strong>Girl In A Coma </strong>will be stopping by in the 1pm hour to play acoustic versions of songs from their new album <em>Exits & All The Rest</em>. Check them out later that night at <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/64805/tfly\" target=\"_blank\">The North Star Bar</a> and get a free download of their single \"Smart\" <a href=\"http://www.spinner.com/2011/09/09/girl-in-a-coma-smart-download/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. ','http://girlinacoma.com/media/images/photos/20110830/IMG_0540_EDITED_medium_1a6f459e16a8fc623f27de5ee452af45_600.jpg','http://girlinacoma.com/',1,'y'),(91,'2011-11-14','2011-11-17','Soup & Bread Happy Hour','This Wednesday from 5-7pm, <b>Soup & Bread</b>, \"Chicago\'s most laid-back, nutritious party,\" comes to Philadelphia for one night only at <a href=\"http://kungfunecktie.com\" target=_blank>Kungfu Necktie</a>!  Join Y-Not Radioâ??s <b>John Burke</b> DJing as they dish up soups from Philly\'s most generous chefs.  Admission is free but donations are suggested with all proceeds benefit the Greater Philadelphia Coalition Against Hunger.','http://cannonfallsucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2010/03/soup_and_bread.jpg','http://kungfunecktie.com',6,'n'),(92,'2011-11-14','2011-11-19','The Kooks Radio Takeover','<b>The Kooks</b> were in town this week for a sold out show and recorded a Y-Not Radio Takeover!  Hear <b>Luke Pritchard</b> and <b>Hugh Harris</b> chat about their brand new third album <i>Junk of The Heart</i> and pick out a playlist of their favorite songs. The Kooks Radio Takeover airs this Friday at 1pm and 10pm.','http://thetroc.com/images/events/kooks.jpg','http://www.thekooks.com/',1,'n'),(93,'2011-11-14','2011-11-18','Theophilus London Live Session','A couple weeks ago indie-rapper <b>Theophilus London</b> paid us a visit at <a href=\"http://headroomphiladelphia.blogspot.com/\" Target=_blank>The Headroom Studios</a> in Northern Liberties to record a live Y-Not Session featuring songs from his debut album <i>Timez Are Weird These Days</i>!  We will play that session back for you along with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>â??s interview with Theophilus this Thursday afternoon at 2pm.  ','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash4/302439_288674927818076_137798016239102_1044519_1283868355_n.jpg','http://theophiluslondon.net/',3,'n'),(94,'2011-11-18','2011-11-25','Y-Not\'s Turkey Day Takeovers','This Thanksgiving,  Y-Not continues the tradition of Turkey Day Takeovers!  Starting at 10am  until around dinnertime, hear Y-Not Radio Takeovers from <strong>The Kooks, CSS, Guster, The Rapture, Man, Man, Ben Kweller, Ladytron,</strong> and <strong>The Go! Team</strong>. Check out the full schedule <a href=\"/schedule.php\">here</a>. And you can hear all of these Takeovers and much more <a href=\"/ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','/schedule.php',1,'n'),(95,'2011-11-21','2011-11-26','Alberta Cross Bunker Session','We were recently paid a visit by New York band (by way of Sweden and England) <b>Alberta Cross</b>.  Hear their live Bunker Session and Josh\'s chat with frontman <b>Petter Ericson Stakee</b> this Friday at 4pm.  Find out more about Alberta cross and get their new EP <i>Rolling Thunder</i> <a href=\"http://albertacross.net/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://a1.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ak-snc7/308524_10150311048288501_27427023500_7916748_1956791222_n.jpg','http://albertacross.net/',2,'n'),(96,'2011-11-21','2011-12-06','Smashing Pumpkins:<br>Inside Siamese Dream ','With this week\'s re-releases of the first two <b>Smashing Pumpkins</b> albums, <b>Billy Corgan</b> sat down with host <b>Matt Pinfield</b> to chat about the making of those classic records.  Hear part 2 featuring a look back at <i>Siamese Dream</i> on the next <i>Case of The 90\'s Nooner</i>, Monday, December 5th at 12pm.','http://www.themortonreport.com/SmashingPumpkinsSiameseDream.jpg','http://www.smashingpumpkins.com/reissues',5,'n'),(97,'2011-11-26','2011-12-02','Mike Doughty Interview','Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> recently caught up with his old pal <b>Mike Doughty</b> before his show at The TLA a couple weeks ago.  Hear their chat about Mike\'s new album <i>Yes and Also Yes</i> and his upcoming memoir <i>The Book of Drugs</i> this Wednesday night at 8 or Thursday afternoon at 2.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/photos-ak-snc1/v4673/241/7/1018280801/n1018280801_30360178_8220561.jpg','http://www.mikedoughty.com/',3,'y'),(98,'2011-11-26','2011-12-10','The Drums Bunker Session','Several weeks ago <b>The Drums</b> stopped by The Bunker before their show in Philly to record acoustic versions of songs off their sophomore album <i>Portamento</i>.  Hear their session and interview with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> this Friday at 2pm or 9pm.  And check out their fancy schmancy Time Calculation website (with an exclusive MP3 download) <a href=\"http://timecalc.net/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc7/299926_293840753968160_137798016239102_1066763_2132388315_n.jpg','http://thedrums.com/',2,'n'),(99,'2011-11-26','2011-12-03','Sam Roberts Bunker Session','This Friday night <b>Sam Roberts Band</b> returns to Philly to play The North Star Bar in support of their new album <i>Collider</i>.  Before the show, tune in to Y-Not Radio in the 2pm hour to hear Sam and guitarist <b>Dave Nugent</b> performing an acoustic session and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>. Tickets for the show are available <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/54739\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://wersmusic.files.wordpress.com/2011/06/sam-roberts.jpg','http://www.samrobertsband.com/',2,'n'),(100,'2011-11-28','2012-01-30','Year End Poll Winner Playlist','Tune in this Sunday at 1pm to hear Y-Notâ??s 2011 Year End Poll contest winner,<strong> Ryan Decker</strong>, skype in from Alabama to host his Top 20 songs of 2011.  If you missed any of our countdown of the Top 211 Songs of 2011, the entire list along with all the other poll results are posted <a href=\"/yearendpollresults.php\">here</a> and our staff favorites are <a href=\"/yearendstaff.php\">here</a>.</i>','images/year-end-square.png','yearendpollresults.php',1,'n'),(101,'2011-12-05','2011-12-09','Le Butcherettes Interview','A few weeks ago Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> caught up with <b>Le Butcherettes</b>\' frontwoman <b>Teri Gender Bender</b> before their show at Milkboy Philly.  Tune in to hear their chat about about the new album <i>Sin Sin Sin</i> and Teri\'s energetic performances this Thursday at 3pm.','http://a5.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ak-snc7/320667_292626087422960_137798016239102_1060871_801852233_n.jpg','http://lebutcherettes.net/',3,'n'),(102,'2011-12-06','2011-12-13','U2\'s Achtung Baby 20th Anniversary Special ','<strong>U2</strong>\'s <em>Achtung Baby</em> was recently reissued for  its 20th anniversary.  Tune in during next Monday\'s<em> Case of The 90\'s Nooner</em>\r\n to hear the band telling the story of the album that redefined them, featuring classic album tracks as well as rare and previously unreleased songs compiled for the deluxe edition.','http://ssimg.soundspike.com/artists/u2_achtungbaby_deluxe.jpg','http://u2.com',9,'y'),(103,'2011-12-12','2011-12-17','Asobi Seksu Live Session','New York City shoegazers <b>Asobi Seksu</b> are back with their 4th album <i>Fluorescence</i> and they recently paid a visit to <a href=\"http://theheadroomphiladelphia.blogspot.com\" target=_blank>The Headroom Studios</a> in Philly to play songs from the album live for a Y-Not Session.  Hear the performance and interview with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> this Friday at 3pm or 10pm.','http://newmusicmichael.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/asobi-seksu.jpg','http://www.asobiseksu.com/',2,'n'),(104,'2011-12-19','2011-12-22','Mike Viola Interview','Power-pop singer-songwriter <b>Mike Viola</b> recently chatted with our own <b>Joey O.</b> backstage at World Cafe Live. Hear their chat about Mike\'s new album <i>Electro De Perfecto</i>, his numerous film songwriting credits including <i>Walk Hard</i> and <i>Get Him To The Greek</i>, as well as a live acoustic performance this Wednesday afternoon at 2pm.','http://b.vimeocdn.com/ps/257/485/2574854_300.jpg','http://www.mikeviola.com/',3,'n'),(105,'2011-12-24','2099-12-31','Y-Not Philly: Best of 2011','Tune in on Sunday at Noon for a special Best of 2011 Edition of Y-Not Philly! We\'ll take a look back at some of the best music from the Philadelphia area this year and live songs from Y-Not Philly Sessions.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash4/299507_267978906554345_137798016239102_967204_1676199435_n.jpg','index.php',4,'y'),(106,'2011-12-27','2012-01-03','New Year\'s Weekend Best of 2011 Specials','If noisemakers and Mummers arenâ??t your thing, then tune in all this weekend for Best of 2011 editions of Y-Notâ??s specialty programs. On Saturday starting at 2pm itâ??s <em>Y-Not Internacional, Britspotting,</em> and <em>Transmission</em>. On  New Year\'s Day beginning at 10am, look back at all of 2011\'s <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, followed by <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <em>Noise Complaint </em> and our <em>2012 New Music Prewiew</em>. The long weekend wraps up on Monday with an all day playback of <em>Y-Not\'s Top 211 of 2011 Countdown</em> starting at 8am. Check the <a href=\"/schedule.php\">schedule</a> for the full lineup.','http://z.about.com/d/philadelphia/1/0/u/S/2000mummers37.jpg','/schedule.php',2,'y'),(107,'2011-12-28','2012-01-02','Y-Not Sessions: Best of 2011','Join <b>Josh T. Landow</b> on Sunday morning at 10am for 2 hours of the best Y-Not Session recordings from the past year including music from <b>The Drums, Gold Motel, Against Me!, The Dears, Those Darlins, Theophilus London, The Ettes,</b> and lots more.','http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-lqWuUy6_VPc/Tht2g0ZnhsI/AAAAAAAAAOk/g24B9voIxn0/s1600/White+Denim.jpg','/ondemand.php',3,'n'),(108,'2011-12-29','2011-12-30','George Stanford Bunker Session','Former frontman of late great local band <b>Townhall</b>, <b>George Stanford</b> is home for the holidays and will be stopping by to play live on Y-Not Radio this afternoon in the 4pm hour.  Then catch George\'s show tonight at the <a href=\"http://tinangel.com/schedule.html\" target=_blank>Tin Angel</a>.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc7/380888_10150461179988476_6438783475_8555639_20923526_n.jpg','http://www.georgestanford.com/',2,'n'),(109,'2012-01-03','2012-01-07','Little Dragon Interview','A little while back, Y-Not\'s <b>Amy G.</b> had the chance to interview Swedish electronic group <b>Little Dragon</b>.  Hear their chat and songs from their new album <i>Ritual Union</i> this Friday at 2pm.','http://little-dragon.net/littledragon/wp-content/gallery/by-seek/ld_runninggreen_72dpi0.jpg','http://little-dragon.net/',2,'n'),(110,'2012-01-09','2012-01-14','The Features Y-Not Session','Tennessee rockers <b>The Features</b> released their third album <i>Wilderness</i> this past summer and recently returned to Philadelphia.  While they were here, they paid us a visit at The Headroom Studios in Northern Liberties to play songs from the album live for a Y-Not Session. Hear the performance and interview with Josh T. Landow this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc6/267525_10150255351463113_45860628112_7514159_4418010_n.jpg','http://thefeatures.com/',1,'n'),(111,'2012-01-10','2012-01-18','Yelle Interview','Tune in on Tuesday night at 10 for <em>Y-Not Internacional</em> â?? 2 hours of alternative rock in espanol and from all over the world with your hosts <strong>Ramon â??el Rockâ? Martinez</strong> and <strong>Gil</strong>!  This week hear their interview with French electronic dance band <strong>Yelle</strong> and songs from their new album <em>Safari Disco Club</em>.','http://www.topcreeper.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/04/yelle-at-the-polish-american-club.2626297.36.jpg','http://www.yelle.fr/',3,'n'),(112,'2012-01-14','2012-01-21','The Hours Bunker Session','Former members of <b>Joe Strummer\'s Mescaleros</b>, the U.K.\'s <b>The Hours</b> recently followed up their debut album <i>It\'s Not How You Start, It\'s How You Finish</i> with the EP <i>I Want More</i> and a U.S. tour with <b>Noel Gallagher</b>. Before their Philly show, they stopped by the Bunker for a chat with Josh T. Landow and an energetic acoustic performance!  Hear their session this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://www.thehours.co.uk/_images/photos/press01.jpg','http://www.thehours.co.uk/',1,'n'),(113,'2012-01-17','2012-01-20','Y-Not Presents The Smiths Social','Join Y-Not Radio this Thursday night at 9pm for another<em><strong> Smiths Social</strong></em> at The Level Room, located at 21st & Market Sts. The evening will be hosted by Philadelphia\'s own <strong>18th Pale Descendents</strong>, who will play two live acoustic sets of Smiths tunes, plus Y-Not DJs will be spinning music from The Smiths, Morrissey, Johnny Marr, and other related acts between live sets, and new wave afterwards. More information can be found <a href=\"http://phonographicartssouthphilly.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','/images/smiths_social.jpg','http://phonographicartssouthphilly.tumblr.com/',2,'n'),(114,'2012-01-17','2012-01-25','Housse de Racket Interview','Tune in Saturdays from 2-4pm for <em>Y-Not Internacional</em> â?? 2 hours of alternative rock in espanol and from all over the world with your hosts <strong>Ramon </strong> and <strong>Gil</strong>!  This week hear thier interview with French electronic indie band <strong>Housse de Racket</strong> and songs from their new album <em>Alesias</em>. If you miss it on Saturday, catch the replay next Tuesday night at 10.','http://o.aolcdn.com/os/music/housse-de-racket-438-111511.jpg','http://www.houssederacket.com/',3,'y'),(115,'2012-01-18','2012-01-19','Save The Internet','As an internet based company, Y-Not Radio stands firmly against the SOPA and PIPA bills that could censor the internet and harm smaller site such as ourselves.  We\'re not shutting down the stream today, but if these bills pass, music sites will surely be hit hard.  <a href=\"https://www.google.com/landing/takeaction/\" target=_blank\">Please take a few moments to find out more and lend your support.</a>','http://madmikesamerica.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/01/StopSOPA_NewLogo_SOPA_PIPA.jpg','https://www.google.com/landing/takeaction/',0,'n'),(116,'2012-01-23','2012-01-28','Stephie Coplan & The Pedestrians Bunker Session','Our new favorite band of 2012 here at Y-Not Radio is the piano based indie trio of <b>Stephie Coplan & The Pedestrians</b>, who just released their self-titled debut EP.  Stephie, John, and Shane will be be joining us in the Bunker this Thursday at 2pm to play some of the songs off the EP and a brand new song live on air. Find out more and get the EP <a href=\"http://stephiecoplan.com\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash4/395587_10150438305103779_146249933778_8709832_555543011_n.jpg','http://stephiecoplan.com',2,'n'),(117,'2012-01-30','2012-02-04','Savior Adore Bunker Session','New York\'s <b>Savoir Adore</b> recently paid a visit to The Bunker after playing with <b>Oh Land</b> in Philadelphia.  Tune in this Friday at 1pm or 10pm to hear their live performance and a chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> about their upcoming new album.  Savoir Adore will be back in town on March 7th at <a href=http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/91507 target=_blank>The Blockley</a> and in the meantime, download their new single Dreamers <a href=\"http://www.spinner.com/2011/11/29/savoir-adore-dreamers-free-mp3-download/\" target=_blank>here</a>. ','http://www.blogcdn.com/www.spinner.com/media/2011/11/savoir-adore-456.jpg','http://savoiradore.com',2,'n'),(118,'2012-02-06','2012-02-11','Asteroids Galaxy Tour Live Session','Last week Denmark\'s <b>The Asteroids Galaxy Tour</b> released their new album <i>Out of Frequency</i> and came through Philly on tour. While they were here, half of the band stopped by The Headroom Studios to record an acoustic Y-Not Session. Hear the performance and interview this Friday at 1pm or 10pm and see photos from it <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.350717384947163.85955.137798016239102&type=3&l=d4ec4ce8c8\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://assets.rollingstone.com/assets/images/embedded/1000x595/af1803ecd23a4ee1c5939617a343a0ddaca16495.jpg','http://www.theasteroidsgalaxytour.com',2,'n'),(119,'2012-02-12','2012-02-18','Veronica Falls Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm for our next Bunker Session with UK band <b>Veronica Falls</b>.  They stopped by before their Philly show last week to chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and play acoustic versions of songs from their self-titled debut album, plus a brand new song too.','http://www.timbreproductionsconcerts.dreamhosters.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/11/veronica-falls_bp.jpg','http://veronicafalls.com/',1,'n'),(120,'2012-02-13','2012-02-19','Class Actress Interview','Tune in this and every week for <i>Transmission</i>, 2 hours of indie electronic and dance music, every Thursday night at 9 with <b>Rob Huff</b>. This week Rob will be chatting with <b>Elizabeth Harper</b> aka <b>Class Actress</b> and playing songs from her debut album <i>Rapprocher</i>. If you miss it Thursday, catch the replay on Saturday at 6pm.','http://a2.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ak-snc6/270536_10150224920582525_169089547524_7643302_3148644_n.jpg','http://classactress.com/',3,'n'),(121,'2012-02-14','2012-02-22','Housse de Racket Interview on Y-Not Internacional','Tune in for this week\'s edition of <em>Y-Not Internacional</em> as <strong>Gil</strong> presents an interview with French electronic indie band <strong>Housse de Racket</strong> and songs from their new album <em>Alesias</em>, plus 2 hours of alternative rock in espanol and from all over the world! Hear it on Saturday at 2pm or catch the replay next Tuesday night at 10.','http://o.aolcdn.com/os/music/housse-de-racket-438-111511.jpg','http://www.houssederacket.com/',4,'n'),(122,'2012-02-20','2012-02-25','Slow Club Bunker Session','UK duo <b>Slow Club</b> just paid a visit to Y-Not Radio last week.  Tune in this Friday at 1pm or 10pm to hear <b>Rebecca</b> and <b>Charles</b> chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> about their new album <i>Paradise</i> and play a couple brand new, unreleased acoustic songs. ','http://static.nme.com/images/gallery/SlowClubPR160611.jpg','http://www.slowclubband.com/',1,'n'),(123,'2012-02-25','2012-03-06','Ximena SariÃ±ana Bunker Session','Tune in for our next Bunker Session with Mexican indie artist / media darling <b>Ximena SariÃ±ana</b>, performing songs from her new album and chatting with <b>Ramon</b>.  Hear it during the next <i>Y-Not Internacional</i> on Tuesday night at 10.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash4/428171_366417586710476_137798016239102_1280528_2094674994_n.jpg','http://www.ximenamusic.com/',4,'n'),(124,'2012-03-05','2012-03-10','Saint Motel Bunker Session','L.A. band and film school grads <b>Saint Motel</b> just paid a visit to Y-Not Radio over the weekend. Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm to hear them play live, songs from their forthcoming full length debut album, and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>. Check out more from Saint Motel, including videos for every song theyâ??ve released, <a href=\"http://www.saintmotel.com/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc6/250307_10150201625531523_9122571522_7327188_2639328_n.jpg','http://www.saintmotel.com/',1,'n'),(125,'2012-03-05','2012-03-09','Y-Not Presents The Smiths Social','Join Y-Not Radio this Thursday night at 9pm for another edition of <b>The Smiths Social</b> at <a href=\"http://mroomphilly.com/\" target=_blank>The M-Room</a>. The evening will be hosted by Philadelphia\'s own <b>18th Pale Descendents</b>, who will play two live acoustic sets of Smiths tunes, plus Y-Notâ??s DJ <b>John Burke</b> will be spinning music from The Smiths, <b>Morrissey</b>, <b>Johnny Marr</b>, and other related acts between sets, and a new wave dance party afterwards. ','http://ynotradio.net/images/smiths_social.jpg','http://mroomphilly.com/?e=kivmars-bowling',2,'n'),(126,'2012-03-12','2012-03-17','Guards Bunker Session','Our next Bunker Session features an acoustic performance and interview with <b>Guards</b>, fronted by <b>Richie Follin</b> (brother of <b>Madeline</b> from <b>Cults</b>).  Tune in for the session this Friday at 2pm or 10pm and get free music from Guards <a href=\"http://guards.bandcamp.com/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-mBeP5Oa9-_I/TpdadlQDktI/AAAAAAAAA3A/cls1n1xRAlo/s1600/roeg-cohen_Guards_FOAM-2.121859.jpg','http://guards.bandcamp.com/',2,'n'),(127,'2012-03-13','2012-05-01','Modern Rock Madness','And in the end, there was only one.  After an exhausting final match between <b>The White Stripes</b> and <b>Blur</b>, we\'ve crowned our 2012 Modern Rock Madness Champion!<br><br><center><a href=\"/madness.php\"><b>CLICK HERE TO SEE THE WINNER<br>AND HOW IT ALL WENT DOWN!</b></a></center>','images/mrm12_sq.jpg ','madness.php',8,'n'),(128,'2012-03-19','2012-03-27','Bombay Bicycle Club Live Session','UK band <b>Bombay Bicycle Club</b> recently wrapped up their U.S. tour in Philly, and while they were in town, paid us a visit for an acoustic session.  If you missed it on Friday, hear them chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and play songs from their new album  <i>A Different Kind of Fix</i> during this week\'s <i>Britspotting</i>, Monday at 8pm. In the meantime, check out their new stop motion video <a href=\"http://www.bombaybicycleclubmusic.com/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/14/92/49-atlg.jpg','http://www.bombaybicycleclubmusic.com/',3,'n'),(129,'2012-03-21','2012-03-22','Donate For Dr. Dog Tix','Wanna get into <b>Dr. Dog</b>\'s sold out Factory show on Saturday night AND help out Y-Not Radio at the same time?  Participate in our silent auction through midnight tonight for your shot at tickets! <a href=\"/donate.php\">Click here for details.</a>','http://www.origivation.com/features/september2010/images/dog-02.jpg','/donate.php',1,'n'),(130,'2012-03-26','2012-03-31','Win Wild Flag Tickets','All this week, when you vote for your favorite bands to win in <i>Modern Rock Madness</i>, you can be a winner too.  Today\'s contest is for tickets to see <B>Wild Flag</b> on Tuesday night next week at at The Trocadero.  <a href=\"http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/2012/03/modern-rock-madness-contests.html\" target=_blank><b>ENTER TO WIN HERE.</b></a>','http://thetroc.com/images/events/wildflag.jpg','http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/2012/03/modern-rock-madness-contests.html',2,'y'),(131,'2012-04-02','2012-04-07','Sleeper Agent Bunker Session','A couple weeks ago, in the midst of a tour with our good friend <b>Ben Kweller</b>, Bowling Green, Kentucky\'s <b>Sleeper Agent</b> paid us a visit to play some acoustic songs in the bunker and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> about their new album <i>Celebrasion</i>.  Hear their session this Friday at 2pm (or 10pm).  In the meantime, check out their recent late night tv debut with <b>Jimmy Fallon</b> <a href=\"http://sleeperagentmusic.com/category/uncategorized/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc7/316315_10150520916894348_383537614347_11460922_2032911280_n.jpg','http://sleeperagentmusic.com/',1,'n'),(132,'2012-04-02','2012-04-10','Band Of Skulls Interview','Last week Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Amy G.</b> caught up with classic rock influenced UK group <b>Band Of Skulls</b> to chat about their recently released sophomore album <i>Sweet Sour</i>.  Hear the interview and songs from the record on the next episode of <i>Britspotting</i> - Monday night at 8pm.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/548974_384645711554330_137798016239102_1334211_986268048_n.jpg','http://bandofskulls.com/',3,'n'),(133,'2012-04-09','2012-04-14','Geographer Bunker Session','Tune in this Thursday at 2pm (or Friday night at 10pm) for our next Bunker Session with San Francisco\'s <b>Geographer</b> who recently released their 2nd album <i>Myth</i>.  Hear them play some acoustic versions of their songs and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>. Check out the single for their song \"Kites\" <a href=\"http://youtu.be/gxUVNoiVdts\" target=blank>here</a>.','http://sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash4/409372_10150466922728349_38687383348_8622779_501732036_n.jpg','http://www.geographermusic.com/',2,'n'),(134,'2012-04-09','2012-04-20','Neon Indian Radio Takeover','<b>Neon Indian</b> played last week in Philadelphia at Union Transfer.  Before his set, frontman/composer <b>Alan Palomo</b> took some time to sit down with Y-Not\'s <i>Transmission</i> host <b>Rob Huff</b> to talk about some of the music he\'s been listening to lately.  Hear his guest DJ set including <b>Lone, Kingdom, Ceephax Acid Crew</b>, and more. Catch the replay this Thursday, April 19th at 8pm.','http://cdn.stereogum.com/files/2010/03/NeonIndianGLS3.jpg','http://neonindian.com/',4,'n'),(135,'2012-04-10','2012-04-13','Tweet For Ting Tings Tickets','This Friday night <strong>The Ting Tings</strong> make their long awaited return to Philadelphia at The Trocadero, and we have a chance for you to win your way in! To enter, follow us on <a href=\"http://twitter.com/ynotradio\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a> and then tweet this message: <em>\"Hey @YNotRadio, help me go see @thetings at @thetrocadero and keep rockin\' #soundsfromnowheresville! http://ynotradio.net\" </em>Tweet by Thursday at 2pm to enter. Good luck! Tickets are still available <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/84743\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://images.soundspike.com/artists/thetingtings_press_1_2012.jpg','http://twitter.com/ynotradio',3,'y'),(136,'2012-04-16','2012-04-21','Canon Blue Bunker Session','Tune in this Thursday at 2pm (or Friday at 10pm) for our next Bunker session with \"Folktronica\" band <b>Canon Blue</b>, who stopped by recently to chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and play acoustic versions of songs from their new album <i>Rumspringa</i>. See them live with <b>The Boxer Rebellion</b> on Wednesday, April 25th at <a href=\"http://www.johnnybrendas.com/event/90617/\" target=_blank>Johnny Brenda\'s</a>.','http://www.canonblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/09/CanonBlue-2011-Crop.jpg','http://www.canonblue.com/',3,'n'),(137,'2012-04-16','2012-04-21','Stephie Coplan Radio Takeover','Over the last few months, Y-Not Radio has introduced you to the music of <b>Stephie Coplan & The Pedestrians</b>.  Now Stephie is going to introduce you to some of her favorite music when she guest DJs this Friday at 1pm.  Then next Wednesday, April 25th they\'ll make their live Philly debut at <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/event/109871\" target=_blank>The North Star Bar</a> with <b>The Really Cooks</b> and <b>Glen Landing</b>!  Check out the video for \"JERK!\" <a href=\"http://youtu.be/a-Lo5FLpYGM\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://content.bandzoogle.com/users/stephiecoplan/images/photos/gallery/4681977-thumb.jpg?2','http://stephiecoplan.com',1,'n'),(138,'2012-04-17','2012-04-22','Record Store Day with The Spinto Band','Join Y-Not Radio at <a href=\"http://www.mainstreetmusicpa.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Main Street Music</a> in Manayunk on <em>Record Store Day</em>, this Saturday starting at 3pm for live performances from<strong> The Spinto Band</strong> and more!  Plus everyone who comes by will get a free download code for the Y-Not Philly Record Store Day 2012 Compilation featuring live performances from locals bands <strong>White Birds, The Really Cooks, Auctioneer, Little Big League, Catnaps, Conversations With Enemies,</strong> and more...','http://c438342.r42.cf2.rackcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/03/rsd-2012.jpg','http://www.recordstoreday.com/Home',2,'n'),(139,'2011-04-23','2011-04-28','Cloud Nothings Bunker Session','Tune in for our next Bunker Session featuring <b>Cloud Nothings</b>, the much buzzed about project of 20 year old Ohio native <b>Dylan Baldi</b>, as they turn the volume down and play some acoustic versions of songs from their new album <i>Attack On Memory</i> for us.  Hear it this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://www.brokenmic.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/03/cloud-nothings.jpg','http://cloudnothings.tumblr.com/',2,'n'),(140,'2012-04-23','2012-04-28','Cloud Nothings Bunker Session','Tune in for the our next Bunker Session, featuring <b>Cloud Nothings</b>, the project of 20 year old Ohio native <b>Dylan Baldi</b>, as they turn the volume down and play some acoustic versions of songs from their new album <i>Attack On Memory</i>.  Hear it this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://www.brokenmic.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/03/cloud-nothings.jpg','http://cloudnothings.tumblr.com/',1,'n'),(141,'2012-04-23','2011-04-29','Chairlift Interview','Tune in for this week\'s all new installment of <i>Transmission</i> for 2 hours of indie electronic and dance music, plus hear <b>Rob Huff</b>\'s interview with <b>Caroline</b> and <b>Patrick</b> of <b>Chairlift</b> along with songs from their new album <i>Something</i>.  Hear it Thursday night at 9pm or catch the replay on Saturday at 6pm.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc6/179478_501889375851_102648700851_6435495_1319769_n.jpg','http://www.chairlifted.com/',4,'n'),(142,'2012-04-23','2012-04-29','Chairlift Interview','Tune in for this week\'s all new episode of <i>Transmission</i> for 2 hours of indie electronic and dance music, plus <b>Rob Huff</b>\'s interview with <b>Caroline</b> and <b>Patrick</b> from <b>Chairlift</b> along with songs from their new album <i>Something</i>.  Hear it on Thursday night at 9pm or catch the replay on Saturday at 6pm.','http://www.chairlifted.com/wp-content/gallery/chairlift/thumbs/thumbs_press_photo_5_print.jpg','http://www.chairlifted.com/',2,'n'),(143,'2012-04-26','2012-04-30','The Smiths Social','Join Y-Not Radio this Sunday night at 9pm for another edition of The Smiths Social at The Trocadero Balcony. The evening will be hosted by Philadelphia\'s own 18th Pale Descendents , who will play two live acoustic sets of Smiths tunes, plus Y-Not\'s DJ John Burke will be spinning music from The Smiths, Morrissey, Johnny Marr, and other related acts between sets, and a new wave dance party afterwards.  ','http://ynotradio.net/images/smiths_social.jpg','http://thetroc.com/events.php',5,'n'),(144,'2012-04-30','2012-05-05','Young Hines Session<br>+ Brendan Benson Interview','This Thursday night when <strong>Brendan Benson</strong> plays at <a href=\"http://tickets.worldcafelive.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=4320\" target=\"_blank\">World Cafe Live</a> in Philadelphia, he\'ll be bringing his protege <strong>Young Hines</strong> with him to open the show.  Earlier in the day, we\'ll hear from both fellows. Â Tune in that morning at 10am when BrenBen calls in to talk to <strong>Joey O</strong> about his new albumÂ <em>What Kind Of World</em>. Â Then at 3pm, Young will stop by The Bunker to chat with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> and play a few acoustic versions of songs from his debut album <em>Give Me My Change</em>. Both will be replayed on Friday night at 10pm. Download singles from both artistsÂ <a href=\"/music.php\">here</a>.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/532510_10150744793798142_19215103141_11329287_644955642_n.jpg','http://tickets.worldcafelive.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=4320',3,'n'),(145,'2012-05-04','2012-06-01','RIP MCA','All of us at Y-Not Radio join <b>Beastie Boys</b> fans everywhere in mourning the loss of <b>Adam \"MCA\" Yauch</b>, taken from us far too soon. Our thoughts are with his family and friends. On Friday we aired the Beasties Radio Takeover of Y100 from 2004. It\'s a fun look back at better times. If you didn\'t catch it, we\'ve posted it <a href=\"/ondemand.php?id=120\">On Demand here</a>.','http://www.themusicninja.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/05/mca-adam-yauch.jpg','ondemand.php?id=120',9,'y'),(146,'2012-05-07','2012-05-12','We Are Serenades Bunker Session','Swedish band <b>We Are Sereandes</b> is the collaborative effort of <b>Adam Olenius</b> of <b>The Shout Out Louds</b> and <b>Markus Krunegard</b> of <b>Laakso</b>.  They play a href=\"http://www.johnnybrendas.com/event/110103/\" target=_blank>Johnny Brenda\'s</b> this Tuesday night, but before the show, they\'ll be stopping by The Bunker to play some acoustic versions of songs from their debut album <i>Criminal Heaven</i>. Tune in for the session at around 2pm or catch a replay on Friday night at 10.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc6/250999_149436775130184_137691116304750_324116_5004169_n.jpg','http://www.weareserenades.com/',4,'y'),(147,'2012-05-07','2012-05-12','Ben Kweller Interview & Performance','Back at the end of March our buddy <b>Ben Kweller</b> was in town for a show in support of his new album <i>Go Fly A Kite</i>.  Before the show, he and his band performed an acoustic set at <a href=\"http://www.mainstreetmusicpa.com/\" target=_blank>Main Street Music</a> in Manayunk.  Y-Not Radio was there to record that performance, which we will play back for you, along with <b>Josh</b> and <b>Joey</b>\'s backstage interview, this Friday at 2pm and 10pm.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/531190_384658098219758_137798016239102_1334283_498336459_n.jpg','http://benkweller.com/',1,'n'),(148,'2012-05-14','2012-05-25','Washed Out Radio Takeover','Last month when <b>Washed Out</b> came to Philly, Y-Not\'s <b>Rob Huff</b> caught up with the man behind the chill <b>Ernest Greene</b> chat about his new record <i>Within And Without</i>.  Ernest also took the opportunity to play guest DJ and pick a playlist of music that he wants you to check out from the likes of <b>10cc, DJ Shadow, Boards of Cananda,</b> and more.  Hear it this Thursday night at 8pm before <i>Transmission</i>.','http://assets1.subpop.com/assets/images/column1_wide/9281.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/washed.out',5,'n'),(149,'2012-05-14','2012-05-18','Win Reggie Watts Tickets','Comedian/Musician <b>Reggie Watts</b> brings his unique blend of comedy and music to The Trocadero this Saturday night.  To enter to win a pair of tickets, <a href=\"mailto:contest@ynotradio.net\">e-mail in</a> your info by this Thursday at 5pm.  The winner will be notified on Friday morning.  Tickets are still available to purchase <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/event/107625\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/22/58/31-atlg.jpg','http://www.ticketfly.com/event/107625',2,'n'),(150,'2012-05-21','2012-05-26','Dirty Ghosts Live Session','One of our favorite bands lately has been San Francisco\'s <b>Dirty Ghosts</b>, who recently released their debut album <i>Metal Moon</i>. Last month they stopped by <a href=\"http://kawarisound.com\" target=_blank>Kawari Sound</a> to record a fully plugged in live session. Hear it this Thursday at 2pm with a replay on Friday night at 10.','http://www.theprovince.com/6405735.bin','http://dirtyghosts.com/',3,'n'),(151,'2012-05-21','2012-05-26','Joey Ramone <i>...Ya Know?</i> Special','11 years ago the world lost a legend far too soon. Now <b>Joey Ramone</b>\'s brother has put together a new posthumous release of unreleased songs and demos found after his death and finished by friends.  Tune in to hear the the songs and stories from the new album <i>..Ya Know?</i> this Friday at 1pm.','http://loudwire.com/files/2012/04/joey-ramone-ya-know-album-cover-300x300.jpg','http://www.joeyramone.com/',1,'n'),(152,'2012-05-25','2012-06-01','Win Wizard World Tickets','It\'s that time of the year when nerd/geek culture descends on Philadelphia for the annual <i><b>Wizard World Comic-Con</i></b>, June 1-3 at the Pennsylvania Convention Center, featuring guests <b>Stan Lee, William Shatner, Patrick Stewart, Chris Hemsworth, Bruce Campbell, Melissa Joan Hart, Scott Bakula, CM Punk,</b> and many more... <a href=\"http://www.wizardworld.com/home-pa.html\" target=_blank>Tickets are available now</a> or win a pair for Friday or Sunday (your choice) by <a href=\"mailto:contest@ynotradio.net\">e-mailing your info to us</a> by Thursday at 5pm.','http://ep.yimg.com/ca/I/wizardworld_2211_68578653','http://www.wizardworld.com/home-pa.html',4,'n'),(153,'2012-05-26','2012-06-02','IAMDYNAMITE Bunker Session','Detroit duo <b>IAMDYNAMITE</b> recently paid a visit to the Bunker to play acoustic versions of songs from their upcoming debut release <i>SUPERMEGAFANTASTIC</i>, which comes out on June 5th.  Hear the session this Friday at 2pm or 10pm and catch them here in Philadelphia on Monday, June 4th at <a href=\"http://www.ticketweb.com/t3/sale/SaleEventDetail?dispatch=loadSelectionData&eventId=4597605\" target=_blank>Kung Fu Necktie</a>.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc6/167288_10150116773527069_34988787068_8282761_3028886_n.jpg','http://iamdynamite.com/',1,'n'),(154,'2012-06-04','2012-06-09','Philly Roller Girls Radio Takeover','This Saturday is another roller derby double header with Phillyâ??s all-star <b>Liberty Belles</b> taking on New Yorkâ??s <b>Gotham Girls</b>, plus the <b>Heavy Metal Hookers</b> vs. the <b>Philthy Britches</b>. Before the match, roller girls <b>Eileen U. Scream & Damage Dahl</b> will trade their skates for microphones as they guest DJ for an hour this Friday night at 8pm.  Philly Roller Girls tickets are available <a href=\"http://www.phillyrollerderby.com/events/ticket-info\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://www.derbynewsnetwork.com/files/imagecache/300x225/2010/04/article_images/PhillyRollerGirls.gif','http://phillyrollergirls.com/',2,'n'),(155,'2012-06-04','2012-06-12','Breton Live Session','UK electro-rock band <b>Breton</b> recently came through Philly and stopped by to record a session with us at <a href=\"http://siamesetwinstudios.tumblr.com\" target=_blank>Siamese Twin Studios</a>. Tune in this Friday at 2pm to hear them play songs from their debut album <i>Other People\'s Problems</i> and chat with <i>Britspotting</i> host <b>Matt McGrath</b>.  Or catch the replay on Monday night at 9pm.','http://fat-cat.co.uk/images/made/images/artists_images/BRETON_JF-2-2_480_320_s_c1.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/bretonlabs',2,'n'),(156,'2012-06-11','2012-06-16','POP ETC Bunker Session & Takeover','Remember <b>The Morning Benders</b>?  Well, now they are <b>POP ETC</b> and have a new self-titled album out this week!  Tune in this Thursday at 2pm as they stop by the Bunker to chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>, play acoustic versions of some of their new songs, and guest DJ for a mini-takeover. Or if you miss it catch the replay on Friday night at 10.','http://www.nme.com/images/gallery/2012PopEtcPR260312.jpg','http://popetcetera.com/',2,'n'),(157,'2012-06-11','2012-06-18','Inside Smashing Pumpkins: Oceania','<b>Smashing Pumpkins</b> will release their seventh studio album <i>Oceania</i> on June 19th and to celebrate the release, <b>Billy Corgan</b> will be presenting the 60 minute album in its entirety along with commentary about the songs and the making of the record.  Hear it this Friday at 1pm or catch the replay on Sunday night at 8.','http://www.fmqbproductions.com/broadcasts/2012/smashingpumpkins/images/Smashingpumpkins_band.jpg','http://www.smashingpumpkins.com/',1,'n'),(158,'2012-06-18','2012-06-23','The Royalty Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday for our next Bunker Session with retro soul band <b>The Royalty</b> from El Paso, Texas.  They\'ll be performing songs from their debut album <i>Lovers</i> and chatting with Josh T. Landow. Hear it on Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://www.substreammusicpress.com/home/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/the-royalty-290x193.jpg','http://www.theroyalty.net',1,'n'),(159,'2012-06-18','2012-06-24','Ziggy Stardust 40th Anniversary Special','Tune in on Saturday morning at 9 for a special look back on the making and legacy of <b>David Bowie</b>â??s 1972 album, <i>The Rise and Fall of Ziggy Stardust and the Spiders of Mars</i>. Frank insights from both Bowie and the late guitarist, <b>Mick Ronson</b>, detail how they developed the <b>Ziggy Stardust</b> character and all the music from this landmark album. The remastered 40th Anniversary edition is <a href=\"http://www.emisessions.com/david-bowie/\" target=_blank>available now</a>.','http://www.emisessions.com/wp-content/uploads/davidbowie.jpg','http://www.emisessions.com/david-bowie/',4,'n'),(160,'2012-06-25','2012-06-30','The Hives Radio Takeover','Tune in this Friday at 1pm or 9pm for our next Y-Not Radio Takeover with Swedish rock superstars <b>The Hives</b>! <b>Josh T. Landow</b> caught up with frontman <b>Howlin\' Pelle Almquist</b> and guitarist <b>Nicholaus Arson</b> before their Electric Factory show last week to chat about the new album <i>Lex Hives</i> and turn the station reigns over for them to guest DJ for an hour. Hear them play selections from <b>Alex Chilton, Eagles of Death Metal, Kraftwerk,</b> and more...','http://fbcdn-sphotos-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-snc6/270922_446980921987475_951319311_n.jpg','http://www.thehivesbroadcastingservice.com/',1,'n'),(161,'2012-06-25','2012-06-30','We Are Serenades Bunker Session','Swedish supergroup <b>We Are Serenades</b> made up of <b>Adam Olenius</b> from <b>Shout Out Louds</b> and <b>Markus Krunegard</b> of <b>Laakso</b> recently paid a visit to the Bunker.  Hear them play some acoustic songs and chat about their debut album <i>Criminal Heaven</i> this Thursday at 2pm with a replay on Friday night at 10. ','http://thedroppedbeat.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/04/0.jpg','http://www.weareserenades.com/',2,'n'),(162,'2019-06-20','2099-06-01','<font size=2>Rodney Anonymous Tells You How To Live</font>','On the first Friday of each month <b>Rodney Anonymous</b> takes us on a 2 hour trip into his world of industrial, goth, and dark wave music!  <!--Tune in this Friday, January 2nd from 9-11pm or Sunday the 4th from 7-9pm for Rodney\'s first show of 2026!  -->If you missed Rodney\'s first show of 2026, you can hear it any time <a href=\"rodney.php\">On Demand</a>.','images/rodney.png','rodney.php',8,'n'),(163,'2012-06-26','2012-06-27','Dick Valentine Bunker Session','TONIGHT our buddy <strong>Dick Valentine</strong> of <strong>Electric Six</strong> is in town to play a solo acoustic show at <a href=\"http://tickets.worldcafelive.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=4474\" target=\"_blank\">World Cafe Live</a> in support of his new solo acoustic album <em>Destroy The Children. </em>Some time this afternoon Dick will be stopping by The Bunker to catch up with  <b>Josh T. Landow</b>, play some songs from the record live, and use our wifi.','http://sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn1/544598_154001034727469_514785774_n.jpg','http://tickets.worldcafelive.com/eventperformances.asp?evt=4474',1,'n'),(164,'2012-06-30','2012-07-07','The Cribs Y-Not Session','Earlier this month <b>The Cribs</b> journeyed from the UK to Philadelphia and while they were here, they stopped by <b>Siamese Twin Studios</b> to record an acoustic Y-Not Session and chat about their new album <i>In The Belly Of The Brazen Bull</i>.  Hear the session this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://static.nme.com/images/gallery/2012Cribs02PR240112.jpg','http://www.thecribs.com/official/',2,'n'),(165,'2012-07-02','2012-07-05','4th Of July <i>Britspotting</i> Marathon','Here at Y-Not Radio we celebrate our independence by listening to music from the empire whose tyrannical rule we escaped in 1776.  That\'s right, it\'s an all day marathon of <i>Britspotting</i> with <b>Matt McGrath</b>. Enjoy music exclusively from across the pond all day long starting at 10am.  And catch new episodes of <i>Britspotting</i> Monday nights at 8 with encores on Saturday at 4pm.','http://sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-snc7/301544_239459456092128_2562453_n.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/BritSpottingRadio',1,'n'),(166,'2012-07-02','2012-07-15','Y-Not 2nd Anniversary Free Show','July 12th, 2010 was the day that we defied the odds and took on the world by signing on Y-Not Radio! 2 years later we\'re still rockinâ?? the web, indie style, and to celebrate weâ??re having a party!  Join us this Saturday, July 14th, for a FREE show with <b>The Pains Of Being Pure At Heart</b> at <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/events/440264836006709/\" target=_blank>Morganâ??s Pier</a>! Doors open at 5pm and the show starts at 6:30. <i>If you missed our Radio Takeover with Pains frontman and Philly native <b>Kip Berman</b>, you can hear it <a href=\"/ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.</i>','http://fbcdn-profile-a.akamaihd.net/hprofile-ak-ash2/162080_440264836006709_1411286359_n.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/events/440264836006709/',1,'n'),(167,'2012-07-09','2099-07-01','Y-Not Philly w/ Arc In Round','Tune in on Wednesday at 11am or 10pm for this week\'s <i>Y-Not Philly</i> featuring guests <b>Arc In Round</b>, who will be performing live on air and picking out a playlist of their Philly favorites. Get their brand new self-titled album <a href=\"http://arcinround.bandcamp.com/\" target=_blank>here</a> and catch their next show with <b>Historics</b> on July 28th at <a href=\"http://www.philamoca.org/> target=_blank>PhilaMOCA</a>.','http://sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-snc6/251362_10150195383221659_5845045_n.jpg','http://arcinround.com/',4,'y'),(168,'2016-01-05','2099-07-07','Y-Not Philly: Best of 2015','If you missed <i>The Best of 2015</i> edition of <em>Y-Not Philly </em> in full, tune in for the replay of part 2 this Saturday at 8pm (and part 2 next Saturday), as <strong>Josh T.</strong> and <strong>Shana</strong> take a look back at the best music that Philadelphia had to offer in 2015 including <strong>Hop Along</strong>, <strong>The Districts</strong>, <strong>Kurt Vile</strong>, <strong>Waxhatchee</strong>, <strong>Beach Slang</strong>, <strong>Cold Fronts</strong>, <strong>Cheerleader</strong>, <strong>Teen Men</strong>, <strong>Lithuania</strong>, <strong>Alex G</strong>, <strong>Suburban Living</strong>, and many moreâ?¦ <em>And vote for your favorite Philly bands in <a href=\"http://www.ynotradio.net/yearendpoll.php\" target=\"_blank\">Y-Notâ??s 2015 Year End Poll</a>.</em>\r\n\r\n<!--Tune in on Saturday at 8pm for this week\'s <em>Y-Not Philly</em> featuring <b>Madalean Gauze</b>, who will be performing songs from her debut album <i>Sing</i> and picking a playlist of her Philly favorites!  Madalean\'s album release show is on Thursday, December 17th at <a href=\"http://www.bootandsaddlephilly.com/event/978211-madalean-gauze-record-release-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">Boot & Saddle</a> with <b>Woven In</b> and <b>Rosali</b>.  You can get the album now at <a href=\"https://madaleangauze.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">BandCamp</a>.-->','https://app.box.com/representation/file_version_47640296541/image_2048_jpg/1.jpg?shared_name=glkuu9ji5kjc7ctn1depi9b8lrauh3x7','ondemand.php',3,'y'),(169,'2012-07-09','2012-07-15','Philly Roller Girls Radio Takeover 2','This Saturday is another roller derby double header with Philly\'s all-star <b>Independence Dolls</b> taking on the Texas <b>Honkey Tonk Heartbreakers</b>. The night before the match, roller girls <b>Damage Dahl</b> and <b>Queen of Pain</b> got themselves psyched as they guest DJed for an hour. If you missed their takeover, hear it <a href=\"/ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.  <b>Philly Roller Girls</b> tickets are available <a href=\"http://phillyrollergirls.com/events/ticket-info\" target=_blank>here</a>.<!-- or enter to win a pair by e-mailing your info to contest@ynotradio.net by Thursday at midnight.-->','http://www.derbynewsnetwork.com/files/imagecache/300x225/2010/04/article_images/PhillyRollerGirls.gif','http://phillyrollergirls.com',2,'n'),(170,'2012-07-16','2012-07-23','Gold Motel Bunker Session','This Thursday, Y-Not Radio welcomed our friends <b>Gold Motel</b> back to town for a show at <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/130423/tfly\" target=_blank>The North Star Bar</a> and before the show, they stopped in for another Bunker Session to chat about and play songs from their just-released 2nd album. If you missed it live, catch the replay Friday night at 10 or Sunday at 8pm.','http://userserve-ak.last.fm/serve/500/47372443/Gold+Motel+_group.jpg','http://goldmotel.com/',2,'n'),(171,'2012-07-16','2012-07-20','Baltimore Ave. Dollar Stroll','Every Summer shops and restaurants along Baltimore Ave. between 42nd & 50th Streets in West Philly offer $1 specials out along the sidewalk. The first Dollar Stroll of the season is this Thursday from 5:30-8:30pm.  As a proud West Philly business, Y-Not Radio will be out playing music at 47th & Baltimore in front of Aksum (for free, but we\'ll gladly accept a buck from you). <a href=\"http://universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll\" target=_blank>Click here</a> for a full list of $1 deals. <i>I\'d buy that for a dollar!</i>','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-3vaiEbgZm6k/UARVRUmSFvI/AAAAAAAAAV0/l1QfbieytvQ/s1600/dollarstroll.jpg','http://universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',2,'n'),(172,'2012-07-16','2012-07-21','Hot Chip Radio Takeover','This Saturday night <b>Hot Chip</b> returns to Philly and to get everyone ready for the show, <b>Joe Goddard</b> will be calling in to Y-Notâ??s <b>Rob Huff</b> to chat about their new album <i>In Our Heads</i>, and guest DJ a playlist of some of his favorite songs.  Hear Hot Chipâ??s Radio Takeover this Friday at 1pm. Tickets for their show at The Electric Factory are <a href=\"http://www.ticketmaster.com/event/0200486EB80F6042\" target=_blank>available here</a> or listen all week for more chances to win them.','http://sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash4/421613_10150689283791187_412493806_n.jpg','http://hotchip.co.uk/',1,'n'),(173,'2012-07-23','2012-07-28','Animal Kingdom Bunker Session','On Tuesday, British band <b>Animal Kingdom</b> came to Philly for their first ever U.S. show.  Before the show, they stopped by Y-Not Radio for an acoustic Bunker Session to chat at about and play songs from their new album <i>The Looking Away</i>.  If you missed it live, catch the replay on Friday night at 10.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/24/78/49-atlg.jpg','http://www.weareanimalkingdom.com/',4,'n'),(174,'2012-07-23','2012-07-28','The Pains Of Being Pure At Heart Concert Playback','Y-Not Radio recently celebrated its 2nd anniversary with a free show from <b>The Pains Of Being Pure At Heart</b> at Morgan\'s Pier.  For those of you missed the show or just want to relive it, we hit record on the whole thing and will play it back this Friday at 2pm and Sunday at 7pm. Plus, hear <b>Kip Berman</b> from Pains doing a Radio Takeover <a href=ondemand.php?id=138\">On Demand here</a>.','http://fbcdn-profile-a.akamaihd.net/hprofile-ak-ash2/162080_440264836006709_1411286359_n.jpg','http://www.thepainsofbeingpureatheart.com/',2,'n'),(175,'2012-07-23','2012-08-05','Noise Complaint','Tune in Monday night at 10 or Saturday at 9 for Noise Complaint â?? an hour of the wide world of punk rock, old school to new.  This week, join our brand new purveyor of punk <b>Bayley Brown</b> as she takes the reins and brings us music from <b>The Have Nots, The Holy Mess, Versus The World, Future of The Left</b>, and lots more...','http://sphotos-b.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash4/409727_10150982616408507_1092706765_n.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/noisecomplaintradio',8,'n'),(176,'2012-07-24','2012-07-29','Y-Not @ Art/Gage Festival','This Saturday <strong>Philadelphia\'s Magic Gardens</strong> hosts the <em>Art/Gage Festival</em> on South Street between 10th & 11th. The free street fair is from Noon to 6pm featuring over 35 art and food vendors, paired with performances from local bands like <strong>The Really Cooks</strong>, and more. The music continues inside the Gardens until 10pm with <strong>Catnaps, Cuddle Magic</strong>, and others. Y-Not will be out all day taking part in the festivities. Come see us and sign up to win tickets for <strong>Gogol Bordello</strong> at The House of Blues in Atlantic City. <a href=\"http://www.phillymagicgardens.org/news/news\" target=\"_blank\">Get more info here.</a>','http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-KK4_pznKyMo/UA6vxGJkbzI/AAAAAAAAAWc/-DYWS_2iKTk/s1600/ARTGAGElogo.jpg','http://www.phillymagicgardens.org/news/news',3,'n'),(177,'2012-07-25','2012-07-30','Y-Not Presents The Smiths Social','<i>The Smiths Social<i> has a new permanent monthly home at The Trocadero Balcony Bar starting this Sunday, July 29th at 7pm! <b>The 18th Pale Descendents</b> will be playing your favorite <b>Smiths</b> and <b>Morrissey</b> solo songs in two live acoustic sets.  Plus, thereâ??s a Smiths trivia contest and New Wave Dance Party following the live music. <a href=\"http://www.thetroc.com/events.php\" target=_blank>Get more info here.</a>','images/smiths_social.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/18thPaleDescendents',8,'n'),(178,'2012-08-05','2012-08-11','Tokyo Police Club Bunker Session','While on their recent tour with <b>Foster The People</b>, Canadian indie rock band <b>Tokyo Police Club</b> came through Philadelphia and frontman <b>Dave Monks</b> stopped by the Bunker to chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and play acoustic versions of a couple new songs as well as an old favorite.  Hear the session this Friday at 2pm with a replay at 10pm.','http://sphotos-b.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash3/s720x720/580838_465456276806606_869400927_n.jpg','http://tokyopoliceclub.com/',1,'n'),(179,'2012-07-31','2012-08-06','Y-Not @ 2nd Street Festival','This Sunday, 2nd Street in Northern Liberties gets turned into a giant FREE music festival featuring local favorites <strong>Man Man, Kuf Knotz, Auctioneer, The Spinning Leaves, Purples,</strong> and many more! The festival starts at Noon and runs all day til 10pm. Y-Not Radio\'s Josh T. Landow will be DJing between bands on the Poplar stage and we\'ll have a tent near the stage where you can sign up to win tickets for <strong>Jane\'s Addiction</strong> at The Mann Center (Wed. 8/15).\r\n\r\nGet more info and a full schedule of bands at the <a href=\"http://www.2ndstfestival.org/music\" target=\"_blank\">2nd Street Festival website.</a>','http://theswollenfox.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/2nd-Street-Festival.jpg','http://www.2ndstfestival.org',1,'n'),(180,'2012-08-06','2012-08-12','Mighty Mighty Bosstones Interview','Over the weekend Y-Not\'s new <i>Noise Complaint</i> host <b>Bayley Brown</b> caught up with <b>Dicky Barrett</b> of <b>The Mighty Mighty Bosstones</b>!  Hear their conversation during the encore of on this week\'s episode of <i>Noise Complaint</i> on Saturday at 9pm.','http://multimedia.heraldinteractive.com/images/20101223/414b9c_ltpboss20101224.jpg','http://facebook.com/noisecomplaintradio',3,'n'),(181,'2012-08-06','2012-08-11','Philly Roller Girls Radio Takeover #3','This Saturday is another roller derby double header. On Friday night at 8, to get pumped for their match against the <strong>Philthy Britches</strong>, roller girls <strong>Eileen U. Scream</strong> and <strong>Butterscotch Cripple</strong> from the <strong>\r\nBroad Street Butchers</strong> will take over Y-Not Radio as guest DJs. Philly\'s all-star <strong>Liberty Belles</strong> will also be taking on the <strong>DC Rollergirls\' All-Stars</strong> on Saturday. Tickets are available <a href=\"http://PhillyRollerGirls.com\" target=_blank>here</a> or listen all week for chances to win \'em.','http://www.derbynewsnetwork.com/files/imagecache/300x225/2010/04/article_images/PhillyRollerGirls.gif','http://phillyrollergirls.com',2,'n'),(182,'2012-08-13','2012-08-18','Ume Bunker Session','One of indie rock\'s loudest bands, <b>Ume</b> from Austin, TX just recently passed through Philly and stopped by the Bunker to turn the volume down a bit.  Hear husband and wife <b>Eric & Lauren Larson</b> playing acoustic versions of songs from their new album <i>Phantoms</i> and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> this Friday at 2pm (or catch the replay at 10pm).','http://ampedupmag.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/02/UME.main_.credit_Sandy_Carson2-300x199.jpg','http://www.umemusic.com/',1,'n'),(183,'2012-08-14','2012-08-17','Y-Not @ Baltimore Ave. Dollar Stroll','Once a month throughout the summer, the shops and restaurants along Baltimore Ave.  in West Philly, between 42nd & 50th Streets, offer $1 specials out along the sidewalk. The next Dollar Stroll  is this Thursday from 5:30-8:30pm. As a proud West Philly business, Y-Not Radio will be out playing music at 47th & Baltimore in front of Aksum (for free, but we\'ll gladly accept a buck from you). <a href=\"http://universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll\" target=\"_blank\">Click here</a> for a full list of $1 deals. ','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-3vaiEbgZm6k/UARVRUmSFvI/AAAAAAAAAV0/l1QfbieytvQ/s1600/dollarstroll.jpg','http://universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',2,'n'),(184,'2012-08-20','2012-08-28','Little Barrie Bunker Session','Tune in to this week\'s <i>Britspotting</i> on Monday night from 8-10pm as we present a live session with UK soul rock band <b>Little Barrie</b>.  Theyâ??ll be playing songs from their recently released 3rd album <i>King of The Waves</i> and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.','http://www.bbc.co.uk/nottingham/content/images/2007/01/18/little_barrie_lead_203x152.jpg','http://littlebarrie.com/',2,'n'),(185,'2012-08-20','2012-08-26','Y-Not Internacional Is Moving','Beginning this week, catch <i>Y-Not Internacional</i> at its new time â?? Tuesday nights from 9-11pm, for 2 hours of alternative rock in espanol and from all over the world with your host <b>Gil</b>!  But if you listen on Saturdays, donâ??t worry because weâ??ll still run encores each week at the same time â?? Saturdays from 2-4pm. ','http://fbcdn-profile-a.akamaihd.net/hprofile-ak-ash2/372895_175399545916687_954193322_n.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/YNotInternacional',5,'n'),(186,'2012-08-20','2012-08-23','Y100 & WDRE Reunion @ The Phillies 90\'s Night','This Wednesday night when <b>The Phillies</b> take on <b>The Cincinnati Reds</b> at Citizens Bank Park, itâ??ll be a 90â??s Retro Night with <b>Spacehog</b> playing live on the field before the game, but thatâ??s not all.  Former <b>Y100</b> and <b>WDRE</b> DJs - <b>Preston Elliot, Bret Hamilton, Matt Cord, Leeann Curtis, Steve Morrison, Dan Fein, Josh T. Landow, Joey O, Mel Toxic,</b> and more â?? will reunite at McFadden\'s from 5:30-6:30pm.  Anyone who shows up wearing old Y100 or DRE gear will get a free Y100 Sonic Session CD. For discounted tickets to the game in the Y100/DRE section, please contact <a href=\"mailto:josh@ynotradio.net\">Josh</a>. ','http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-01mdkbLI7Lk/UDOPwzJ2nEI/AAAAAAAAAYA/5i9EiFp3MmU/s1600/PhilliesY100WDRE.jpg','http://phillies.com',4,'n'),(187,'2012-08-28','2012-09-04','Y-Not Session Labor Day Shuffle','Tune in this Labor Day Monday as we mix things up by playing tracks from Y-Not Sessions all day long on shuffle!  Gonna be out and about for the holiday?  Take us with you on your iPhone, Android, or Blackberry with either the <strong>Live 365</strong> or <strong>Tune In Radio</strong> apps available for free <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/mobile.php\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. Or check out our library of full sessions <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/ondemand.php\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.','http://erstarnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/08/labor-day.gif','http://ynotradio.net/ondemand.php',1,'n'),(188,'2012-09-03','2012-09-23','Blood Red Shoes Bunker Session','This week, Y-Not Radio presented <b>Blood Red Shoes</b> at Kung Fu Necktie.  Hear the Brighton duo playing acoustic versions of songs from their third album <i>In Time To Voices</i> and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> on Sunday night at 8. Check out their awesome new video <a href=\"http://www.bloodredshoes.co.uk/home/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://sphotos-b.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash3/s720x720/531152_10150956318216307_1664400233_n.jpg','http://www.bloodredshoes.co.uk',1,'n'),(189,'2012-09-04','2012-09-09','Philly Roller Girls Radio Takeover','This Friday night from 8-9, Philly Roller Girls <b>Kish Ash</b> and <b>Mary That Motha OH GOD!</b> are taking over to get pumped for Saturday\'s double-header at The Liacouras Center, where <strong>The Philthy Britches</strong> take on <strong>The Heavy Metal Hookers</strong>, and Phillyâ??s <strong>Independence Dolls</strong> face off against South Carolina\'s <strong>Columbia Quad Squad</strong>! Tickets are available <a href=\"http://ev9.evenue.net/cgi-bin/ncommerce3/SEGetEventList?groupCode=SPORT&linkID=global-temple&shopper\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> or listen all week for chances to win.</font></p>','http://www.derbynewsnetwork.com/files/imagecache/300x225/2010/04/article_images/PhillyRollerGirls.gif','http://phillyrollergirls.com/',2,'y'),(190,'2012-09-14','2012-09-19','MOFO with John Von','This Saturday from 10am-2pm, Y-Not Radio will feature the long awaited return to the airwaves of former Y100 overnight host <b>John Von</b>! During the 1pm hour, John will present his new monthly show <i>Music On Film...O\'Clock (MOFO)</i> where he plays music that has been created for and used in visual media.','http://sphotos-a.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-snc6/229227_481104141908486_2043296913_n.jpg','http://ynotradio.net',1,'y'),(191,'2012-09-17','2012-09-21','Y-Not @ Baltimore Ave. Dollar Stroll','This Thursday is the final <i>Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll</i> for 2012 from 5:30-8:30pm between 42nd & 50th Streets in West Philly.  Get $1 specials from all the local businesses and stop by the Y-Not Radio table at 47th & Baltimore in front of Aksum for free CDs and a chance to win concert tickets.','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-3vaiEbgZm6k/UARVRUmSFvI/AAAAAAAAAV0/l1QfbieytvQ/s1600/dollarstroll.jpg','http://universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',2,'n'),(192,'2012-09-21','2012-09-24','Win Walkmen VIP Tickets','This month, our friend <b>Jersey Dan</b> begins his second year of <i>The Choice Tasters Lounge</i> here on Y-Not Radio. If you missed the show on Friday, catch the replay on Sunday at 7pm. In honor of that, he\'s offering up a pair of VIP SkyBar tickets to see <b>The Walkmen</b> and <b>The War On Drugs</b> at the Electric Factory on Sat. October 6th. <a href=\"contests.php\">Enter here</a> by Sunday at midnight. ','http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Mh3-wtblnu0/UFx7EUFBG2I/AAAAAAAAAYY/4r1p7qM7MmA/s1600/choice+tasters.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/pages/Choice-Tasters-Selectors/174178675963174',2,'n'),(193,'2012-09-22','2012-10-01','Royal Teeth Live Session','This Wednesday night, Y-Not Radio Presents <b>Royal Teeth</b> at The North Star Bar. They\'ll also be recording a live session at Kawari Sound, which you can hear on Thursday at 3pm or Friday at 10pm. Hear  the New Orleans sextet play songs from their debut EP <i>Act Naturally</i> and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>. Listen all week to win tickets for their show or or purchase them <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/158401\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://www.whereyat.com/neworleans/imgs/media.images/597/a_1343754375501810879014d.widea.jpg','http://www.royalteethmusic.com/',3,'n'),(194,'2012-09-25','2012-10-01','Inside Mumford & Sons <i>Babel</i>','This week <strong>Mumford & Sons</strong> release <em>Babel</em>, the follow-up to their 2009 grammy nominated debut.  Tune in this Sunday at 7pm to hear <strong>Marcus</strong> and the rest of his Mumfords talking to host <strong>Matt Pinfield</strong> and highlighting selections from the album. And if you\'d you like to get the album for yourself, just <a href=\"donate.php\"><strong>make a donation</strong></a> of $25 or more to Y-Not this week and we\'ll send it to you as a thank you gift.','http://www.halamusique.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/07/16/a851c__mumford-album_320.jpg','http://www.mumfordandsons.com/',1,'n'),(195,'2012-10-01','2012-10-09','Bloc Party Radio Takeover','A few weeks ago, <b>Bloc Party</b> was in town and <b>Matt Tong</b> from the band  caught up with Y-Not\'s <i>Britspotting</i> host <b>Matt McGrath</b> to chat about their new album <i>Four</i> and host a Radio Takeover!  You can hear his guest DJ set on Monday at 8pm during the next episode of <i>Britspotting</i>.','http://s2.sscdn.co/cifraclubnews/wp-content/uploads/2012/08/bloc-party.jpg','http://blocparty.com',2,'n'),(196,'2012-10-09','2012-10-13','Tweet 4 Tix: Beach House','<strong>Beach House</strong> are coming to Union Transfer next Tuesday, October 16th in support of their new album <em>Bloom</em>. Tickets have been sold out for months, but we have one last pair  and you\'ve gotta tweet for â??em!  Follow <a href=\"http://twitter.com/ynotradio\" target=\"_blank\">@YNotRadio on Twitter</a> and then Tweet â??I want @YNotRadio to pick me to win tickets for the sold out @BeaccchHoussse show at @UnionTransfer.â? <em>The deadline for tweets is this Friday at midnight and you must follow @YNotRadio to be entered.</em>','http://uinterview.com/images/uinterview/reviews_reviews_image/79c6fb76ce269d439d0e9a79a7ec2fe7-265x265.jpg','http://twitter.com/ynotradio',2,'n'),(197,'2012-10-09','2012-10-13','Metric Radio Takeover','A couple weeks ago, before their show at the Tower Theater, the men of <strong>Metric</strong> â?? <strong>Jimmy</strong>, <strong>Josh</strong>, and <strong>Jules</strong> â?? sat down with Y-Notâ??s <strong>Joey O.</strong> to chat about their new album <em>Synthetica</em>  and play guest DJ for a bit.  Hear their playlist picks on the <em>Metric Radio Takeover</em> this Friday at 1pm or 10pm.','http://sphotos-b.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash3/554229_10150649975059370_1150079459_n.jpg','http://ilovemetric.com/',1,'n'),(198,'2012-10-13','2012-10-20','Silversun Pickups Radio Takeover','On Tuesday <b>Silversun Pickups</b> returned to Philadelphia to play The Tower Theater. Before the show <b>Josh T. Landow</b> met up with his old buddies <b>Christopher Guanlao</b> and <b>Joe Lester</b> from  SSPU for their 3rd Radio Takeover! Tune in Friday at 2pm or 10pm to hear their guest DJ playlist and interview about the new album <i>Neck of The Woods</i>, bandmate <strong>Nikki Moninger</strong>\'s pregnancy, and more.','http://dangerbirdrecords.com/assets/images/silversunpickups_art748347_large.jpg','http://silversunpickups.com',1,'n'),(199,'2012-10-20','2012-10-22','Silversun Pickups Radio Takeover','Earlier this week <b>Silversun Pickups</b> returned to Philadelphia to play The Tower Theater. <b>Josh T. Landow</b> caught up with his old buddies <b>Christopher Guanlao</b> and <b>Joe Lester</b> from SSPU for their 3rd Radio Takeover!  Hear them playing tunes and chatting about their new album <i>Neck of The Woods</i>, bandmate <b>Nikki Moninger</b>\'s pregnancy, and more this Sunday at 8pm.','http://dangerbirdrecords.com/assets/images/silversunpickups_art748347_large.jpg','http://silversunpickups.com',1,'n'),(200,'2012-10-22','2012-11-12','Grouplove Radio Takeover','For a year and a half we\'ve been big fans of <b>Grouplove</b> here at Y-Not Radio, and now we\'re finally having them on the air as guest DJs for an hour!  Hear Christian, Hannah, Ryan, Sean, and Andrew picking tunes from <b>Alexander, Alt-J, Modern Lovers, Frank Black,</b> and more during the <i>Grouplove Radio Takeover</i> this Friday at 1pm or 10pm.','http://sphotos-a.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash3/547027_499893773362856_1491718213_n.jpg','http://www.grouplovemusic.com/',1,'n'),(201,'2012-11-04','2012-11-10','Philly Roller Girls Radio Takeover #5','This Friday night from 8-9, <b>The Philly Roller Girls</b> are taking over again! <b>Antidote</b> from the <b>The Broad Street Butchers</b> and <b>Fully Addomatic</b> from <b>The Heavy Metal Hookers</b> will be here to play music to psych themselves up for their Warrior Cup Championship game versus each other on Saturday at The Liacouras Center!  Tickets are available <a href=\"http://ev9.evenue.net/cgi-bin/ncommerce3/SEGetEventInfo?ticketCode=GS%3AGTL%3ALC12-13%3AROLL1110%3A&linkID=global-temple\" target=_blank>here</a> or listen all week to win them.','http://www.derbynewsnetwork.com/files/imagecache/300x225/2010/04/article_images/PhillyRollerGirls.gif','http://phillyrollergirls.com/',2,'n'),(202,'2012-11-12','2012-11-18','The Hush Sound Bunker Session','Over the last couple years we\'ve gotten to know <b>Greta Morgan</b>\'s band <b>Gold Motel</b>, but she\'s recently gotten her old band <B>The Hush Sound</b> back together.  They played The TLA on Friday, and stopped by for an acoustic session that afternoon. If you missed it, tune in for a replay on Saturday at 1:30pm.','http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_hNAwfVaKVws/Spcjfo-Lo_I/AAAAAAAAAQ0/BXzFF9T08XA/s200/the-hush-sound-instrumentals.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/thehushsound',1,'y'),(203,'2012-11-12','2012-11-19','Inside Soundgarden: <i>King Animal</i>','This week <b>Soundgarden</b> is back with their first album since 1998!  To celebrate the release they sat down for a radio special with host <b>Matt Pinfield</b> to premiere songs from <i>King Animal</i> and talk about making the record.  Hear it this Sunday night at 8. ','http://www.fmqbproductions.com/broadcasts/2012/soundgarden/images/Soundgarden_Album.jpg','http://www.soundgardenworld.com/',4,'n'),(204,'2012-11-19','2012-11-25','Tame Impala Interview','<i>Y-Not Internacional</i> host <b>Gil</b> recently had the chance to chat with <b>Tame Impala</b> frontman and mastermind <b>Kevin Parker</b> before their Philly show.  Hear the interview and songs from their new album <i>Lonerism</i> on this week\'s <i>Y-Not Internacional</i>, replaying Saturday at 2pm.','http://d36jiqg3u1m7g0.cloudfront.net/artistas/338x236/v2_338x236_thumb_701013_tame_impala.jpg','http://www.tameimpala.com/',3,'n'),(205,'2012-11-19','2012-11-23','Y-Not\'s Turkey Day Takeovers','Gobble Gobble! Tune in on Thanksgiving day from 9am-9pm as Y-Not continues the tradition of <em>Turkey Day Takeovers,</em> featuring this year\'s guest DJ sets from <strong>Metric, Silversun Pickups, Grouplove, Bloc Party, The Hives, Hot Chip, Washed Out</strong>, and more...  Check out the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>. You can also hear all of these Takeovers and much more <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',2,'n'),(206,'2012-11-26','2012-12-02','Stephie Coplan Week','One of Y-Not\'s favorite discoveries of 2012 has been <b>Stephie Coplan & The Pedestrians</b>! Surely you\'ve heard their single <a href=\"http://youtu.be/a-Lo5FLpYGM\" target=_blank\">\"JERK!\"</a> a few times. This week Stephie is embarking on her first ever solo tour and playing multiple nights in Philly. While she\'s in town, she\'ll be guest hosting The Nooner on Wednesday, 1-4pm on Thursday, and finally performing a live set on Friday at 2pm. Find out where you can see Stephie Coplan around Philly <a href=\"http://stephiecoplan.com\" target=_blank\">here</a>.','http://content.bandzoogle.com/users/stephiecoplan/images/photos/gallery/4627358-thumb.jpg?2','http://stephiecoplan.com',1,'n'),(207,'2012-11-26','2012-12-03','Music On Film... O\'Clock','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm (or Sunday at 7pm) for the return of <strong>John Von</strong> with a new installment of <em>MOFO</em>, playing music that you\'ve heard in movies, TV, commericials, and video games.','http://sphotos-a.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-snc6/s720x720/229227_481104141908486_2043296913_n.jpg','',2,'n'),(208,'2012-12-02','2012-12-09','The Whigs Acoustic Session','A few weeks back <b>The Whigs</b> rocked our faces off at The North Star, but then they turned things down to play acoustic versions of songs from their new album <i>Enjoy The Company</i> for us at <a href=\"http://webrolik.com\" target=_blank>Brolik Productions</a>.  Hear their session and interview with <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Josh T. Landow</b> this Friday at 2pm or Saturday at 1:30pm.','http://images.clubzone.com/events/images/558589/558589-1.jpg','http://www.thewhigs.com/',1,'n'),(209,'2012-12-04','2013-01-31','Y-Not\'s Top 212 of 2012','If you missed <b><i>Y-Not\'s Top 212 of 2012</i></b> countdown, see the entire list of songs and Year End Poll results <a href=\"yearendpollresults.php\">here</a>.','images/top-212-tape.png','yearendpollresults.php',8,'n'),(210,'2012-12-10','2012-12-15','The Helio Sequence Live Session','Portland duo <b>The Helio Sequence</b> recently released their fifth album <i>Negotiations</i>.  Tune in this Friday at 2pm to hear them playing songs from the album and chatting about it with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> live from the studio at <a href=\"http://www.foundationsinc.org/expanded-learning/projects/philadelphia-center-arts-and-technology\" target=_blank>Philadelphia Center for Arts & Technology</a>. ','http://i.axs.com/7-09272012-5064afedeebdb.jpeg','http://www.heliosequence.com/',2,'n'),(211,'2012-12-15','2012-12-21','TEEN Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm for our final Bunker Session of the year with the band <b>TEEN</b> featuring former <b>Here We Go Magic</b> member <b>Teeny Lieberson</b>.  They\'ll be performing acoustic versions of songs from their debut album <i>In Limbo</i> and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.','http://www.brooklynvegan.com/img/indie/TEENband.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/teentheband',2,'n'),(212,'2012-12-20','2012-12-23','TEEN Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm for our final Bunker Session of the year with the band <strong>TEEN</strong> featuring former <strong>Here We Go Magic</strong> member <strong>Teeny Lieberson</strong>.  They\'ll be performing acoustic versions of songs from their debut album <em>In Limbo</em> and chatting with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>.','http://www.brooklynvegan.com/img/indie/TEENband.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/teentheband',2,'n'),(213,'2012-12-25','2013-01-02','Y-Not Best of 2012 Specials','Tune in all day New Year\'s Day to hear Best of 2012 editions Y-Not Radio\'s specialty shows before we kick off our Top 212 countdown on January 2nd.<br><br>\r\nCheck out our <a href=\"schedule.php\">program schedule</a> for times of <i>Y-Not Philly, Y-Not Sessions, Britspotting, Y-Not Internacional, Transmission, Noise Complaint, Rodney Anonymous Tells You How To Live,</i> and <i>In The Loop</i>.','http://cdn.mhpbooks.com/uploads/2012/12/1212bestofopener.jpg','schedule.php',2,'n'),(214,'2013-03-22','2099-12-31','Top 11 @ 11:<br>Vote & Win They Might Be Giants Tickets','Every Thursday morning at 11, Y-Not Radio counts down the Top 11 alternative & indie rock songs of the week. Vote this week and you\'ll be registered to win a pair of tickets for <b>They Might Be Giants</b> on Friday, April 5th at The TLA! <br><br> <center><b><i><a href=\"/top11.php\">CLICK HERE TO VOTE</a></i></b></center>','http://thenationalva.s3.amazonaws.com/img/they-might-be-giants-thumb.jpg','top11.php',2,'y'),(215,'2013-01-05','2013-01-13','Ash Acoustic Session','Recently Y-Not\'s <i>Britspotting</i> host <b>Matt McGrath</b> had the opportunity to sit down with veteran UK band <b>Ash</b> for an interview and acoustic session. Hear them play songs from throughout their career and chat about their latest release <i>The A-Z Series</i> on Friday at 2pm or on the replay of this week\'s <i>Britspotting</i> on Saturday at 4pm.','https://sphotos-a.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn1/164329_492078316436_5370476_n.jpg','http://www.ash-official.com/',1,'n'),(216,'2013-01-10','2013-01-31','Help Wanted','Do you like listening to Y-Not Radio?  How\'d you like to join us behind the mic? We are now looking to fill a few DJ positions on weekday afternoons. Do you have college radio experience and know how to form sentences? That\'s a plus! Are you extremely knowledgeable and enthusiastic about the music that we play? That\'s a must. Do you want to get paid? That\'s not gonna happen. If you\'re seriously interested, please get in touch with <a href=\"mailto:josh@ynotradio.net\">Josh T. Landow</a>. Send samples if you have \'em.','images%5Cstarla_mic.jpg','',10,'y'),(217,'2013-01-13','2013-01-19','Ra Ra Riot <i>Beta Love</i> Album Preview','Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> recently sat down with <b>Ra Ra Riot</b> members <b>Mathieu Santos</b> and <b>Rebecca Zeller</b> in the <a href=\"http://tristateindie.com\" target=_blank>Tri State Indie</a> Lounge to chat about and listen to songs from their new album. Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm to hear this preview of <i>Beta Love</i> before it\'s released next week. ','http://farm9.staticflickr.com/8517/8357373173_7e084113a8_m.jpg','http://rarariot.com',1,'n'),(218,'2013-01-19','2013-01-26','UltraÃ­sta Live Session + Win Tickets','This Wednesday night, Y-Not Radio Presents <b>UltraÃ­sta</b>, the new project from <b>Radiohead</b> producer </b>Nigel Godrich</b> at <a href=\"http://undergroundarts.org/\" target=_blank>Underground Arts</a> in Philly. Not only do you have a chance to <a href=\"contests.php\">win tickets</a>, but you can also hear them performing live and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://215mag.com/wp-content/blogs.dir/117/files/2013/01/Ultraista_2012AlexPrager_1-300x251.jpeg','http://www.ultraista.co.uk',1,'n'),(219,'2013-01-20','2013-01-28','The National Rifle Album Premiere','Philly band <b>The National Rifle</b> release their debut full length album <i>Almost Endless</i> this week and Y-Not Radio is giving you the chance to hear it first.  <a href=\"http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/2013/01/album-preview-national-rifle-almost.html\" target=_blank>CLICK HERE</a> to listen to an advance stream of the record for this week only, and then buy it on iTunes as of Jan. 22nd. Also check out their Y-Not Philly Session <a href=\"/ondemand.php?id=176\">here</a>.','https://i1.sndcdn.com/artworks-000038761101-gzo52y-t200x200.jpg?0c1a674','http://ynotradio.blogspot.com/2013/01/album-preview-national-rifle-almost.html',2,'n'),(220,'2013-01-26','2013-02-03','Eytan & The Embassy Live Session','NYC piano-rock band <b>Eytan & The Embassy</b> headlined <i>Y-Not\'s Early Xmas Present</i> show last month and while they were in town, recorded a session for us. Tune in this Friday at 2pm (or Saturday at 1pm) to hear them playing live and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> at the <a href=\"http://www.foundationsinc.org/expanded-learning/projects/philadelphia-center-arts-and-technology\" target=\"_blank\">Philadelphia Center for Arts & Technology</a>. And check out their world record setting video for <a href=\"http://youtu.be/iMwyun2KUI8\" target=_blank>\"Everything Changes\"</a>.','http://cdn.melodicamente.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/embasssy_1960s-1_smaller-300x200.jpg','http://eytanandtheembassy.com/',2,'n'),(221,'2013-01-31','2013-02-10','Y-Not Radio Joins iRadioPhilly','We are happy to announce that Y-Not Radio has joined <a href=\"http://www.iradiophilly.com/index.php?idStation=42\" target=_blank>iRadioPhilly</a> as their new indie rock station. Everything you love about Y-Not is staying exactly the same, but now you\'ll stream us through iRadioPhilly\'s website and the iRadioPhilly mobile app! <i>*If you have old Live 365 links bookmarked, please update them as they will soon be gone.</i>','http://sphotos-a.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash4/304845_540978655921034_1837595675_n.jpg','http://www.iradiophilly.com/index.php?idStation=42',1,'n'),(222,'2013-02-04','2013-02-09','The NowhereNauts Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm for our next Y-Not Bunker Session with New Yorkâ??s <b>The NowhereNauts</b>, who just released their second album <i>Warned You</i>. Theyâ??ll chat about it with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and play acoustic versions of some of the songs live on the air. We\'ll also replay the session on Friday night at 10. ','http://www.sonicscoop.com/site/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/the-nowherenauts-portraits-0259-300x200.jpg','http://www.thenowherenauts.com/',3,'n'),(223,'2013-02-04','2013-02-11','Smashing Pumpkins: <i>Mellon Collie To Oceania</i>','<b>Billy Corgan</b> recently sat down with host <b>Matt Pinfield</b> to discuss the reissue of <b>The Smashing Pumpkins</b>â?? career-defining 1995 double album, <i>Mellon Collie & The Infinite Sadness</i>, and the bandâ??s seventh studio release, 2012â??s <i>Oceania</i>. Hear the interview and songs from both albums this Saturday at 1pm or Sunday at 7pm.','http://c438342.r42.cf2.rackcdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/10/melloncollie-260x260.jpeg','http://smashingpumpkins.com',4,'n'),(224,'2013-02-01','2013-02-28','Y-Not Radio Is Now On iRadioPhilly','We are happy to announce that Y-Not Radio has joined <a href=\"http://www.iradiophilly.com/index.php?idStation=42\" target=_blank>iRadioPhilly</a> as their new indie rock station. Everything you love about Y-Not is staying exactly the same, but now you\'ll stream us through iRadioPhilly\'s website and the <a href=\"mobile.php\">iRadioPhilly mobile app</a>!','http://sphotos-a.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash4/304845_540978655921034_1837595675_n.jpg','http://www.iradiophilly.com/index.php?idStation=42',1,'n'),(225,'2013-02-11','2013-02-16','Robert DeLong Live Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm as Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> is joined by one man electro band <b>Robert DeLong</b> for his first ever radio performance! Robert will be chatting about and performing songs from his debut album <i>Just Movement</i> live from the studio at <a href=\"http://www.foundationsinc.org/expanded-learning/projects/philadelphia-center-arts-and-technology\" target=_blank>The Philadelphia Center for Arts and Technology</a>. If you miss it at 2, catch the replay Friday at 10pm.','http://robertdelong.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/xsilverlakejubilee-320x240.jpg.pagespeed.ic.APwZKnfv8V.jpg','http://robertdelong.com/',2,'n'),(226,'2013-02-16','2012-02-23','Atlas Genius Milkboy Session','Tune in this Friday as we welcome Australian indie band Atlas Genius for our first ever acoustic session at Milkboy The Studio!  Atlas Genius will be chatting with Josh T. Landow and playing songs from their debut full length album When It Was Now, being released this week, including the hit â??Trojans.â? Hear it this Friday at 2pm or catch the replay at 10pm.','http://sphotos-b.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash4/423245_476381219070381_1795630536_n.jpg','http://www.atlasgenius.com/',2,'n'),(227,'2013-02-16','2013-02-23','Atlas Genius MilkBoy Session','Tune in this Friday as we welcome Australian indie band <b>Atlas Genius</b> for our first ever acoustic session at <a href=\"http://www.milkboythestudio.com/\" target=_blank>MilkBoy The Studio</a>! Brothers <b>Keith</b> and <b>Michael Jeffrey</b> will be chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and playing songs from their debut full length album <i>When It Was Now</i>, being released this week, including the hit â??Trojans.â? Hear it this Friday at 2pm or catch the replay at 10pm.','http://sphotos-b.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash4/423245_476381219070381_1795630536_n.jpg','http://www.atlasgenius.com/',2,'n'),(228,'2013-02-19','2013-02-25','MOFO with John Von','This Friday night at 9, it\'s time to join <strong>John Von</strong> for a new episode of <em>MOFO: Music On Film... O\'Clock</em>, where he plays indie  tunes that you\'ve heard in movies, tv shows, commericals, video games, and more. If you miss it on Friday, catch the replay on Sunday at 7pm and hear last month\'s episode <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','http://sphotos-a.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-snc6/s720x720/229227_481104141908486_2043296913_n.jpg','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(229,'2013-02-23','2013-03-03','Lucius Milkboy Session','Last week Y-Not Radio presented <b>Tri State Indie</b> \"Best New York City Indie Band\" award winners <b>Lucius</b> at <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank>Milkboy Philly</a>.  Before the show, they took some time out to chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>  and perform an exclusive live session on the Milkboy stage.  Hear it this Friday at 2pm or Saturday at 1pm. ','http://sphotos-b.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash4/398133_10151365122204417_199455902_n.jpg','http://ilovelucius.com/',1,'n'),(230,'2013-03-03','2013-03-09','Willy Moon Milkboy Session','You\'ve heard his song \"Yeah Yeah\" in that iPod commercial a zillion times, now hear <b>Willy Moon</b> performing songs from his upcoming debut album live from the stage at <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank>Milkboy Philly</a>! Tune in for his session and interview with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://cdn.umg3.net/willymoon/uploads/2011/11/gin-oclock-150x150.jpg','http://willymoon.com/',2,'n'),(231,'2013-03-11','2013-03-18','Stars Radio Takeover','Last week before their show at The Trocadero, <b>Stars</b>\' <b>Torquil Campbell</b> sat down with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to share an hour of his favorite tunes and chat about their new album <i>The North</i>.  Hear Torq\'s radio takeover this Friday at 1pm or 10pm.','http://www.blackbookmag.com/polopoly_fs/1.59609.1362752193!/image/image.jpg','http://youarestars.com',3,'y'),(232,'2013-03-11','2013-04-15','Modern Rock Madness','Congratulations to 2013\'s <i>Modern Rock Madness</i> champions <b>Tegan and Sara</b>! And thanks to everyone for voting all week and making this our most exciting tournament ever! If you missed any of the madness, see how it all went down <a href=\"/madness.php\">here</a>.\r\n<br><br>\r\nBrought to you by <a href=\"http://sixpoint.com\" target=_blank>Sixpoint Brewery</a>, where \"Beer is culture.\"','images/square.png','madness.php',11,'n'),(233,'2013-03-18','2013-04-15','Modern Rock Madness','64 bands, 5 days of fierce competition, and only 1 will be crowned the world champion of modern rock! The original rip-off of the college basketball tournament is back for 2013 only at Y-Not Radio! <a href=\"http://ynotradio.opendrive.com/files/68533726_CRA47_00e2/YNot_MRM2013_Brackets.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Click here</a> to download your <em>Modern Rock Madness</em> brackets and then <a href=\"/madness.php>vote all week</a> for your favorite bands to move ahead in the tournament.','images/square.png','madness.php',1,'y'),(234,'2026-01-16','2099-12-31','Top 11 @ 11: Vote & Win<br>The Last Dinner Party Tickets','Every Thursday at 11am and 11pm, Y-Not Radio counts down the Top 11 indie rock songs of the week.  Vote this week and you\'ll be entered to win tickets for <b>The Last Dinner Party</b> on Wednesday, April 15th at The Franklin Music Hall.<br><br>\r\n<center>\r\n<b><a href=\"top11.php\">VOTE HERE</a></b></center>','https://images.discovery-prod.axs.com/2025/10/the-last-dinner-party_10-16-25_19_68f0fa7dc327d.jpg','top11.php',1,'n'),(235,'2013-11-04','2013-11-11','The Fratellis Radio Takeover','<b>The Fratellis</b> are back with a new album <i>We Need Medicine</i> and a sold out show earlier this week in Philly. Before the show <b>Barry Fratelli</b> sat down with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to chat about the the band\'s return and to guest DJ for an hour of his favorite tunes! Hear The Fratellis\' <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i> this Friday at 1pm or 10pm!','http://thefratellis.com/site/wp-content/uploads/2013/09/fratellis_333-1024x682.jpg','http://thefratellis.com/site/',1,'n'),(236,'2013-03-25','2013-03-30','Rah Rah Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm for our next Bunker Session with Saskatchewan\'s <b>Rah Rah</b> (not to be confused with <b>Ra Ra Riot</b>). They\'ll be performing songs from their new album <i>The Poet\'s Dead</i> and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>, which is available now <a href=\"http://www.rahrahband.com/\" target=_blank>here</a>. ','http://www.cmj.com:8080/wp-content/uploads/marcato/RahRah-533x330.jpg','http://www.rahrahband.com/',2,'n'),(237,'2013-03-31','2013-04-07','Garbage Interview + Guest Playlist','<b>Garbage</b> returned to Philadelphia for the first time in 8 years last week and before the show \r\nY-Notâ??s <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Josh T. Landow</b> sat down with members <b>Butch Vig</b> and <b>Duke Erikson</b> to chat about their new album <i>Not Your Kind of People</i>, the future of the band, and much more. Tune in this Friday at 1pm or Saturday at Noon to hear the interview along with a playlist of songs selected by Butch and Duke.\r\n','http://24.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_mb00m324Az1qidbnto1_500.jpg','http://garbage.com',1,'n'),(238,'2013-05-08','2013-04-14','Kate Nash MilkBoy Session Playback','A few weeks ago, before playing a sold out show in town, <b>Kate Nash</b> stopped by MilkBoy Philly to play for just a small audience of Y-Not listeners and chat with <b>Joey O.</b> about her new album <i>Girl Talk</i>, doing the <i>Buffy The Vampire Slayer</i> musical, and much more.  Tune in to hear the session playback this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://static3.plasticosydecibelios.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/03/kate-nash3-460x306.jpg','http://www.myignorantyouth.com/',1,'n'),(239,'2013-04-14','2013-04-20','They Might Be Giants Radio Takeover','Before <b>They Might Be Giants</b>\' show at The TLA last week, Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> sat down with <b>John Linnell</b> and <b>John Flansburgh</b> yet again, to chat about their new album <i>Nanobots</i>. But this time the Johns also brought a playlist of music to share with you for a Y-Not Radio Takeover. Hear it this Friday at 1pm or 10pm.','http://www.newyorker.com/online/blogs/culture/they-might-be-giants-465.jpg','http://www.theymightbegiants.com/',2,'n'),(240,'2013-04-14','2013-04-21','The 1975 Britspotting Interview','Tune in for the replay of this week\'s <i>Britspotting</i>, our weekly UK indie rock show, on Saturday at 4pm for <b>Matt McGrath</b>\'s interview with <b>Matthew Healy</b> of <b>The 1975</b>. Make sure to follow <a href=\"http://twitter.com/britspotting\" target=_blank><i>Britspotting</i> on Twitter</a> for updates and music news from across the pond.','http://www.hotnewsonglyrics.co/wp-content/uploads/2013/03/The-1975-Chocolate-Lyrics.jpg','http://twitter.com/britspotting',4,'n'),(241,'2013-04-14','2013-04-19','Jukebox The Ghost Interview + Performance','When <b>Jukebox The Ghost</b> was back in town a few weeks ago, <b>Josh T. Landow</b> caught up with <b>Ben</b>, <b>Tommy</b>, and <b>Jesse</b> backstage for a chat about their latest album <i>Safe Travels</i> and a live acoustic performance of \"Somebody.\" Hear it this Sunday at 8pm.','http://ww1.prweb.com/prfiles/2012/11/28/10180781/gI_110284_JTG.jpeg','http://jukeboxtheghost.com/site/',3,'n'),(242,'2013-04-14','2013-04-21','Y-Not @ Record Store Day','Join Y-Not Radio for Record Store Day at Main Street Music in Manayunk this Saturday. Everyone who comes out will get a free <i>Y-Not Philly</i> compilation download and there will be live performances and signings all day from <b>Billy Bragg</b>, <b>Generationals</b>, <b>The Joy Formidable</b> and more. <a href=\"pages.php?page=record-store-day\">Click here for more details.</a>','http://recordstoreday.com/templates/Store/recordstoreday2011/logos/RSDvector_2013_thumb.jpg','pages.php?page=record-store-day',1,'n'),(243,'2013-04-14','2013-04-22','Jukebox The Ghost Interview + Performance','When <b>Jukebox The Ghost</b> was back in town a few weeks ago, <b>Josh T. Landow</b> caught up with <b>Ben</b>, <b>Tommy</b>, and <b>Jesse</b> backstage for a chat about their latest album <i>Safe Travels</i> and a live acoustic performance of \"Somebody.\" Hear it this Sunday at 8pm.','http://ww1.prweb.com/prfiles/2012/11/28/10180781/gI_110284_JTG.jpeg','http://jukeboxtheghost.com/site/',3,'n'),(244,'2013-04-22','2013-04-27','The Virgins MilkBoy Session Playback','<b>The Virgins</b> recently returned from a long hiatus with frontman <b>Donald Cumming</b> forming an entirely new version of the band with an updated sound for their new album <i>Strike Gently</i>. Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm to hear them play some songs from the new record and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> live from <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank>MilkBoy Philly</a>.','http://sacksco.com/photo/lo/the_virgins.jpg','http://www.returnfromthevoid.com/_/The_Virgins.html',2,'n'),(245,'2013-04-29','2013-05-07','The View Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm to hear an acoustic performance from Scottish indie rock band <b>The View</b> live at the Y-Not Bunker, plus <b>Josh T. Landow</b>\'s chat with frontman <b>Kyle Falconer</b> about their new album <i>Cheeky For A Reason</i>.  If you miss it on Friday, catch the replay on Monday, May 6th during <i>Britspotting</i> at 8pm.','http://www.themusicmag.com/wp-content/plugins/rss-poster/cache/77c54_the-view-354954360.jpg','http://www.theviewareonfire.com/news/',3,'n'),(246,'2013-05-06','2013-05-11','Here We Go Magic Soundcheck Session','A few weeks ago, Y-Not\'s <b>Kara Zorrell</b> caught up with <b>Luke Temple</b> and <b>Michael Bloch</b> of New York band indie band <b>Here We Go Magic</b> before their show at Underground Arts.  Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm to hear their chat and a live soundcheck performance of songs from their latest album <i>A Different Ship</i>.','http://blahblahblahscience.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/Here-We-Go-Magic-300x300.jpg','http://herewegomagicband.tumblr.com/',1,'n'),(247,'2013-05-14','2013-05-20','Choice Tasters Lounge Turns 21','This week marks  the 21st episode of  <em>Choice Tasters Lounge</em> with <strong>Jersey Dan</strong>! To celebrate we took the show on the road to <a href=\"http://www.dockstreetbeer.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Dock Street Brewing Co.</a> in West Philly! Tune in to hear the special 2 hour episode at an earlier time on Friday from 8-10pm, or catch the replay on Sunday from 7-9pm.','http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Mh3-wtblnu0/UFx7EUFBG2I/AAAAAAAAAYY/4r1p7qM7MmA/s1600/choice+tasters.jpg','http://twitter.com/ChoiceTasters',2,'n'),(248,'2013-05-14','2013-05-18','Free Energy Session Playback','Last week Y-Not teamed up with <a href=\"http://www.thehotboxstudios.com/\">HotBox Studios</a> and <a href=\"http://tristateindie.com\">Tri State Indie</a> to record a live session with our friends <b>Free Energy</b> at Philadelphia\'s legendary Sigma Sound.  Tune in to hear Free Energy playing songs from their new album <i>Love Sign</i> and chatting with Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.  See photos from the session <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.584879604864272.1073741827.137798016239102&type=3&uploaded=4\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-frc1/263156_588634687822097_51049585_n.jpg','http://www.freeenergymusic.com/',1,'n'),(249,'2013-05-20','2013-05-25','Black Rebel Motorcycle Club<br>Y-Not Radio Takeover','A couple weeks ago when <b>Black Rebel Motorcycle Club</b> was in town to play The TLA, Y-Not\'s <b>Amy G.</b> had a chance to sit down with <b>Robert Levon Been</b> and <b>Leah Shapiro</b> from the band and talk about their new album <i>Specter At The Feast</i>.  They also picked out a playlist of some of their favorite songs for a Y-Not Radio Takeover.  Tune in for it this Thursday at 3pm or Friday at 10pm.','http://www.thedumbingofamerica.net/wp-content/uploads/2013/03/BRMC1-e1362514401113.jpg','http://blackrebelmotorcycleclub.com',1,'n'),(250,'2013-05-20','2013-05-28','Sundrop Music Festival','Join iRadioPhilly and Y-Not Radio this Memorial Day weekend for the <i>Sundrop Music Festival</i> at The Fire with over 30 bands including <b>Juston Stens & The Get Real Gang</b>, <b>Adam & Dave\'s Bloodline</b>, <b>Andrew Lipke</b> and many more. It\'s 3 days of live music including a free, outdoor, all-ages stage. Plus, register on-site to win a pair of 3-day passes to the <i>Firefly Festival</i>. For more information, visit the <a href=\"http://www.iradiophilly.com/station.php?idStation=49\" target=_blank>iRadioPhilly event page</a>.','http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-9LStMDc-sew/UZtxoLcKY1I/AAAAAAAAAfY/uZ8_6UoFwbE/s1600/sundropfestival.jpg','http://www.iradiophilly.com/station.php?idStation=49',2,'y'),(251,'2026-01-31','2099-08-22','Words With Nerds','<!--Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for the next installment of Y-Not\'s pop culture talk show, <em>Words With Nerds</em>. <strong>Joey</strong>, <strong>Liz</strong>, and <strong>Josh</strong> will be talking about the latest TV and movies they\'ve been watching, including <strong>Fantastic Four: First Steps</strong>, <b>Alien: Earth</b>, <strong>Task</strong>, <strong>Only Murders In The Building</strong>, and more, plus Joey will recap the recent <i>RetroCon</i> and <i>Animate Philadelphia</i>.  Catch up on previous episodes of the show <a href=\"nerds.php\">On Demand</a>.  Follow the <em>WWN</em> BlueSky account <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/wordswithnerds.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.-->\r\nIf you missed the latest installment of Y-Not\'s pop culture talk show, <i>Words With Nerds</i>, <b>Joey</b>, <b>Liz</b>, and <b>Josh</b> talked about the latest TV and movies they\'ve seen, including <b>Fantastic Four: First Steps</b>, <b>Alien: Earth</b>, <b>Task</b>, <b>Only Murders In The Building</b>, and more, plus Joey recapped the recent <i>RetroCon</i> and <i>Animate Philadelphia</i> and Liz recounted her experience as a VIP for <b>Jimmy Kimmel Live</b> in Brooklyn.  You can hear it any time <a href=\"nerds.php\">On Demand</a>.  Follow the <em>WWN</em> BlueSky account <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/wordswithnerds.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','images/wordswithnerds-small.jpg','nerds.php',8,'n'),(252,'2013-06-07','2013-06-10','Y-Not @ Dock Street Music Fest','Y-Not Radio will be out this Sunday from 2-6pm at <a href=\"http://dockstreetbeer.com\" target=\"_blank\">Dock Street Brewery\'s</a> Music Fest at 50th & Baltimore in West Philly. Come here live music from <b>Norwegian Arms</b>, <b>On The Water, Post Sun Times</b>,  and <b>Bomple,</b> with Y-Not\'s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> DJing between bands. Plus enter on site to win a 3-day passes for the <i>Firefly Music Festival</i>!\r\n','http://brewingsomefun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/dock-street-ales-logo-575.jpg','http://dockstreetbeer.com',1,'n'),(253,'2013-09-06','2013-09-13','Y-Not @ Baltimore Ave. Dollar Stroll','This Thursday, September 12th, is the return of the Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll from 5:30-8:30pm between 43rd & 50th Streets in West Philly. Get $1 specials from all the local businesses and stop by the Y-Not Radio table at 47th & Baltimore in front of Aksum for free CDs and a chance to win tickets for <b>Yeah Yeah Yeahs</b> at <a href=\"http://www.ticketmaster.com/yeah-yeah-yeahs-philadelphia-pennsylvania-09-17-2013/event/02004B09F09012B3\" target=_blank>Penn\'s Landing on Sept. 17th</a>!','https://sphotos-b-iad.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-frc3/1186107_10151878137828203_1183366482_n.jpg','http://universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',1,'y'),(254,'2013-06-12','2013-06-17','Tweet 4 Tix: The Postal Service','<b>The Postal Service</b> are on tour for the first time in years celebrating the 10th anniversary of their album <i>Give Up</i> and will play <a href=\"http://manncenter.org/events/2013-06-17/postal-service\" target=_blank>The Mann Center</a> this Monday night.  We\'ve got a last chance for you to tweet for tickets.  <a href=\"pages.php?page=tweet-4-tix:-the-postal-service\">Click here for details.</a>','http://tomrobinson.co.uk/radio/assets/postal.jpg','pages.php?page=tweet-4-tix:-the-postal-service',1,'n'),(255,'2013-06-24','2013-07-01','Firefly 2013 Recap','This past weekend the <i>Firefly Music Festival</i> returned to Dover, DE for its 2nd year. Y-Notâ??s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> headed out for Day 2 and caught up with <b>CHVRCHES</b>, <b>Japandroids</b>, and <b>Kopecky Family Band</b>, who all played that day. Tune in this Sunday at 7pm to hear interviews and mini-takeovers from all three bands! Check out Joshâ??s <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.606785076007058.1073741828.137798016239102&type=1\" target=_blank>Firefly photo album on Facebook</a>.  <em>Advance tickets for Firefly 2014 go on sale Wed. June 26th at 9am <a href=\"http://fireflyfestival.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</em>','http://cdn.pastemagazine.com/www/articles/Firefly.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.606785076007058.1073741828.137798016239102&type=1',1,'n'),(256,'2013-06-24','2013-06-30','Still Corners on Transmission','Tune in for this week\'s <em>Transmission </em>with <strong>Rob Huff </strong>for 2 hours of indie electronic and dance music, plus an interview with <strong>Still Corners </strong>and tracks from their album <em>Strange Pleasures. Transmission </em>airs Thursday at 9pm or Saturday at 6pm.','http://static.dailycandy.com/resource.jsp?id=217186&name=StillCorners-050713-620.jpg','http://www.subpop.com/artists/still_corners',6,'n'),(257,'2013-06-24','2013-06-28','Y-Not Presents: Electric Six','After the cancellation of their show last year, </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> Y-Not is bringing <strong>Electric Six </strong>back to MilkBoy Philly for the first time! Tickets go <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/304137-electric-six-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">on sale</a> this Friday at noon, but you can win a pair before you can buy \'em <a href=\"http://www.ynotradio.net/contests\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/60/82/73-atlg.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(258,'2013-07-01','2013-07-06','Y-Not Presents: Break It Up','Y-Not Radio Presents Philly bands <b>Break It Up</b> with <b>Idle Idols</b> and <b>Fantastic Imagination</b> as a July 5th celebration at Kung Fu Necktie. Tickets are only $5, but the first 20 Y-Not listeners who <a href=\"pages.php?page=y-not-radio-presents:-pretty-and-nice\">sign up here</a> get in for free! <i>*Sadly <b>Pretty & Nice</b> have had to drop off the bill.</i>','http://sphotos-a.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash3/935074_609701885720796_874724786_n.jpg','pages.php?page=y-not-radio-presents:-pretty-and-nice',2,'n'),(259,'2013-06-29','2013-07-05','Britspotting 4th of July Marathon','Here at Y-Not Radio we celebrate our independence by listening to music from the empire from whose tyrannical rule we escaped in 1776. Itâ??s an all day marathon of <i>Britspotting</i> with <b>Matt McGrath</b>. Enjoy music exclusively from across the pond all day long starting at 10am. And catch new episodes Monday nights at 8 with encores on Saturday at 4pm.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-frc1/301544_239459456092128_2562453_n.jpg','http://www.facebook.com/BritSpottingRadio',1,'n'),(260,'2013-07-15','2013-07-19','Win Passion Pit / Joy Formidable Tickets','<b>Passion Pit</b> and <b>The Joy Formidable</b> are coming to Atlantic City on November 21st at The House of Blues at The Showboat.  Tickets go <a href=\"http://www.ticketmaster.com/passion-pit-atlantic-city-new-jersey-11-01-2013/event/02004AE1728D2F31\" target=_blank>on sale this Friday at 10am</a>, but you can win a pair before you can buy them all week long from Y-Not Radio.  <a href=\"/contests.php><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> and weâ??ll pick a winner each day on Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday.  ','images/passion-formidable.png','/contests.php',4,'y'),(261,'2013-07-15','2013-07-19','Win Passion Pit / Joy Formidable Tickets','<b>Passion Pit</b> and <b>The Joy Formidable</b> are coming to Atlantic City on November 1st at The House of Blues at The Showboat.  Tickets <a href=\"http://www.ticketmaster.com/passion-pit-atlantic-city-new-jersey-11-01-2013/event/02004AE1728D2F31\" target=_blank>go on sale this Friday</a>, but you can win a pair before you can buy them all week long from Y-Not Radio!  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> and weâ??ll pick a winner each day on Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday.  \r\n','images/passion-formidable.png','contests.php',3,'n'),(262,'2013-07-22','2013-07-27','The Wolverine Ticket Giveaway','A lot of us nerds here at Y-Not Radio are excited about the release of <b><i>The Wolverine</i></b> this Friday and thanks to our friends at <a href=\"http://www.regmovies.com/\" target=_blank>Regal Cinemas</a>, we have passes for the movie to give away all week long! Listen throughout the week for Wolverine trivia for your chance to win nationwide run of engagement passes or enter our bonus drawing <a href=\"contests.php\">here</a>. <br><br>\r\n<i>Y-Not\'s Josh T. & Joey O. will host a special screening this Friday night at 7:40pm at The Regal Theater in Oaks, PA. </i>','http://content9.flixster.com/rtmovie/95/56/95567_gal.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(263,'2013-07-29','2013-08-05','Y-Not @ 2nd Street Festival','This Sunday, 2nd Street in Northern Liberties gets turned into a giant FREE music festival featuring <strong>The Low Anthem, Buried Beds, Kuf Knotz, Laser Background, The Shackeltons, Weird Hot,</strong> and many more! The festival starts at Noon and runs all day til 10pm. Y-Notâ??s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> will be DJing between bands on the Fairmount stage and we\'ll have a tent near the stage where you can get free CDs and sign up to win tickets for <b>Arctic Monkey</b> at The Mann Skyline Stage on Sept. 18th. Get more info and a full schedule of bands <a href=\"http://2ndStreetFestival.org\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://theswollenfox.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/2nd-Street-Festival.jpg','http://2ndStreetFestival.org',1,'n'),(264,'2013-08-12','2013-08-16','Y-Not @ South Street Night Market','This Thursday, the <strong>Philadelphia Night Market</strong> teams up with <strong>Philadelphia Magic Gardens</strong>â?? annual <em>Art/Gage Festiva</em>l to take over South Street with 9 blocks of the cityâ??s best food trucks and restaurants, art, music, and moreâ?¦  Join Y-Not Radio at the 9th Street Stage, DJing between live sets from <strong>Circadian Rhythms</strong>, <strong>Night Panther</strong>, <strong>Norwegian Arms</strong>, and <strong>Strand of Oaks</strong>! Plus weâ??ll have free CDs and sign up to win tickets for upcoming concerts at South Streetâ??s own TLA! Get more info and a full schedule of bands <a href=\"http://www.phillymagicgardens.org/news/artgage\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://www.phillymagicgardens.org/gif/ARTGAGE2013_01-s.jpg','http://www.phillymagicgardens.org/news/artgage',1,'n'),(265,'2013-08-19','2013-09-25','Tuesday Tune Out @ PhilaMOCA','Y-Not Radio is guest curating PhilaMOCAâ??s <em>Tuesday Tune Out</em> series in September.  This Tuesday, Sept. 24th we wrap up the month with <strong>Break It Up</strong> and an undersea adventure film! Show starts at 8pm and admission is a donation of $5 or more to PhilaMOCA. <a href=\"http://www.PhilaMOCA.org\" target=\"_blank\">Get more info here.</a>','http://www.cinedelphia.com/mausoleum_web.jpg','http://www.PhilaMOCA.org',2,'n'),(266,'2013-08-27','2013-09-01','Little Comets <i>Britspotting</i> Interview','Y-Not\'s <em>Britspotting </em>host <strong>Matt McGrath </strong> recently sat down with the members of Little Comets before they played The North Star Bar. Hear their conversation and songs from their new album <em>Life Is Elsewhere</em> this Friday at 2pm, or on the <em>Britspotting</em> encore on Saturday at 4pm.','http://media.virbcdn.com/cdn_images/resize_500x500/c9/eb9a3b78f5132df6-SecretGardenParty8477.jpg','http://www.littlecomets.com/',1,'n'),(267,'2013-11-18','2013-12-31','Y-Not Presents Siamese Dream / In Utero 20th Anniversary Tribute','The night after Thanksgiving, Y-Not Radio Presents <i>A 20th Anniversary Tribute to <b>Smashing Pumpkins</b>\' Siamese Dream and <b>Nirvana</b>\'s In Utero</i>, with both albums being performed live in their entirety at MilkBoy Philly. Get tickets <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/386221-20th-anniversary-tribute-show-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> or at the door. ','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-mJvRFe6lMdU/UmaE-xcO6sI/AAAAAAAAApA/gHBUlTb3ftQ/s1600/Siamese_Utero.jpg','http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/386221-20th-anniversary-tribute-show-philadelphia/',2,'y'),(268,'2013-09-23','2013-09-29','<i>Transmission</i> Takeover w/ Haerts','Tune in Thursday night from 9-11 or Saturday from 6-8pm as <i>Transmission</i> gets taken over by the band <b>Haerts</b> for the first hour followed by an hour of indie electronic and dance music with <b>Rob Huff</b>!','http://media.tumblr.com/57afd24ece7740ea631457047cd924e1/tumblr_inline_mnb8uaoKbv1qz4rgp.jpg','http://www.haertsmusic.com/',2,'n'),(269,'2013-09-30','2013-10-10','Y-Not Wednesday at Ortlieb\'s','This Wednesday, October 9th, Y-Not kicks off a monthly local music showcase at <a href=\"http://www.ortliebsphilly.com/\" target=_blank>Ortliebâ??s</a> in Northern Liberties.  Join us for the first edition featuring Doylestown band <b>Commonwealth Choir</b>, with <b>Chris Kolb</b>, and Y-Notâ??s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> DJing between and after the bands. <a href=\"http://ortliebslounge.ticketfly.com/event/386177-ynot-wednesday-commomwealth-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>Click here for more info.</a>','https://i1.sndcdn.com/avatars-000041597555-pmhru6-t200x200.jpg','http://ortliebslounge.ticketfly.com/event/386177-ynot-wednesday-commomwealth-philadelphia/',2,'n'),(270,'2013-10-07','2013-10-15','Y-Not Radio Presents: Gemini Club','Next Tuesday, October 15th, Y-Not Radio is bringing <b>Gemini Club</b>, a new indie-electronic band from Chicago, to <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/361309-gemini-club-philadelphia/\" target=_blank\">MilkBoy Philly</a>, and we want to put you on the guest list.  <a href=\"contests.php\">Click here</a> to sign up and youâ??ll automatically be on the list! Get their album </i>Here We Sit</i> at <a href=\"http://GeminiClub.fm\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-Yn91bDexixs/T31jGYyGKaI/AAAAAAAAAvg/6lIO3yWqW_w/s320/gemini-club-500x317.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(271,'2013-10-07','2013-10-14','Electric Six: Live @ MilkBoy','A couple weeks ago Y-Not favorites <b>Electric Six</b> made their long awaited return to Philadelphia after 2 years!  If you werenâ??t there, tune in this Friday at 4pm or Sunday night at 9 to hear their entire set, recorded on the <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank>MilkBoy Philly stage</a>, featuring E6 classics and songs from their brand new album <i>Mustang</i>.','https://scontent-b.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn2/1045081_10151656247708762_1771516760_n.jpg','http://electricsix.com',1,'n'),(272,'2013-10-14','2013-10-19','Cub Sport Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm for an acoustic Bunker Session with Brisbane, Australia\'s <b>Cub Sport</b>.  Cub Sport recently celebrated their name change from <b>Cub Scouts</b> with a brand new EP called <i>Paradise</i> and are in the states all this week playing shows at CMJ in New York. Find out more <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/CubSport\" target=_blank>here</a>.','https://scontent-b-iad.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn1/58223_672278882786082_1518553509_n.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/CubSport',1,'n'),(273,'2013-10-14','2013-10-23','Pearl Jam Pre-Parties','If you\'re going to see <b>Pearl Jam</b> at the Wells Fargo Center on October 21st or 22nd stop by the <b>Wishlist Foundation</b> pre-party and fundraiser at McFaddens at the Ballpark co-hosted by Y-Notâ??s <b>Matt Summers</b>.  Pearl Jam  memorabilia will be available for raffle and auction with proceeds benefitting the  Philadelphia chapter of the <b>Crohns and Colitis Foundation of America</b>. In addition there is a canned food drive for <b>Philabundance</b>. Hope to see you there.','http://www.dumbgun.com/portfolio_media/logos/wishlist.jpg','http://wishlistfoundation.org/',3,'n'),(274,'2013-10-21','2013-10-27','Happy Hollows MilkBoy Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm for our next live session from <a href=\"http://www.milkboythestudio.com/\" target=_blank>MilkBoy The Studio</a>.  We\'ll have L.A.\'s <b>Happy Hollows</b> performing songs from their new album <i>Amethyst</i> and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>, plus a song from opening act <b>Son Of Stan</b> as well. Find out more about them <a href=\"http://thehappyhollows.blogspot.com/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-K56ZCQVaVWQ/UjaE8rd4LEI/AAAAAAAAAZI/Hfk04gf6YHE/s1600/Happy+Hollows.jpg','http://thehappyhollows.blogspot.com/',2,'n'),(275,'2013-10-21','2013-10-27','Smashing Pumpkins: Live in NYC','Tune in This Friday at 9pm or Saturday at 1pm for a special program featuring music from <strong>The Smashing Pumpkins</strong>â?? new release <i>Oceania: Live in NYC</i>, recorded at The Barclayâ??s Center in Brooklyn in December 2012.  The full concert is <a href=\"http://www.smashingpumpkins.com/\" target=\"_blank\">now available</a> on Blu-Ray and DVD.','http://www.crestfallen.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/08/Oceania_live_NYC-300x300.jpg','http://www.smashingpumpkins.com/',3,'n'),(276,'2013-10-28','2013-11-04','Weekend MilkBoy Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 11pm for our next live session from <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank>MilkBoy Philly</a>. We\'ll have the indie shoegaze band <b>Weekend</b> performing songs from their new album <i>Jinx</i> and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>. Find out more about Weekend <a href=\"http://WeekendTheBand.us\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://scontent-a-iad.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-frc3/1374804_681860441827220_2003818375_n.jpg','http://WeekendTheBand.us',1,'n'),(277,'2013-11-05','2013-11-08','Win Stone Roses Film Passes','Next Tuesday, November 12th is the Philly screening of <strong>The Stone Roses</strong> documentary / concert film, <em>Made of Stone</em> at The Trocadero Balcony. <a href=\"contests.php\">Enter here</a> to win passes and a copy of their new \'Very Best Of\' CD or buy tickets <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/event/396713\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. <em>You can also get a copy of the CD by making a donation to Y-Not Radio <a href=\"donate.php\">here</a>.</em>','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/76/26/85-atmd.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(278,'2013-11-11','2013-11-16','The Dismemberment Plan<br>Live Set + Interview','Last week <b>The Dismemberment Plan</b> returned to Philly in support of their first new album in 12 years <i>Uncanney Valley</i>. Not only did Y-Not send our D-Plan correspondent <b>Shepard</b> backstage to talk to frontman <b>Travis Morrison</b>, but we also recorded the show. Hear the interview with selections from their live set this Friday at 2pm or 10pm and hear the entire concert playback on Sunday night at 8pm.','http://jumpphilly.files.wordpress.com/2013/11/dplan_004.jpg','http://dismembermentplan.com/',1,'n'),(279,'2013-11-18','2013-11-23','Gemini Club MilkBoy Session','Last month Chicago electro-rock band <b>Gemini Club</b> came to Philly and stopped by the Bunker to chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>. Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm to hear the interview and songs recorded live on the <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank>MilkBoy Philly</a> stage. Get more info and buy their album <i>Here We Sit</i> <a href=\"http://geminiclub.fm\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/70/60/09-atmd.jpg','http://geminiclub.fm',1,'n'),(280,'2013-11-25','2013-11-29','Y-Not\'s Turkey Day Takeovers','Tune in on Thanksgiving day from 9am-10pm as Y-Not continues the tradition of <em>Turkey Day Takeovers,</em> featuring this year\'s guest DJ sets from <strong>Garbage, CHVRCHES, Two Door Cinema Club, Stars, Superchunk, They Might Be Giants, The Vaccines, The Fratellis</strong>, and more... Check out the full schedule <a  href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>. You can also hear all of these Takeovers and much more <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',1,'n'),(281,'2013-12-10','2013-12-09','Minor Alps Radio Takeover','<b>Minor Alps</b> is the new collaboration between <b>Matthew Caws</b> of <b>Nada Surf</b> and <b>Juliana Hatfield</b>.  They recently released their debut album <i>Get There</i> and played at World Cafe Live in Philly where Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> caught up with them for another <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>.  Hear Matthew and Juliana pick out some of their favorite songs for you this Friday at 1pm or Saturday at 10am.','http://bostonherald.com/sites/default/files/styles/default/public/media/2013/11/19/111913minoralps.jpg','http://minoralps.tumblr.com/',2,'n'),(282,'2013-12-02','2014-01-31','Top 213 of 2013','Thanks to all of you who voted in our <em>2013 Year End Poll</em>! If you missed any of the <strong><em>Top 213 of 2013</em></strong> countdown, you can see the entire list of songs and Year End Poll results <a href=\"pages.php?page=top-213-of-2013\">here</a>! ','images/top213_square.jpg','pages.php?page=top-213-of-2013',9,'n'),(283,'2013-12-09','2013-12-15','Cults Radio Takeover','Last week <b>Cults</b> returned to Philly at The T.L.A. and before the show Josh T. Landow caught up with <b>Brian Oblivion</b> for another <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>.  Hear Brian pick out some old songs and new favorites of 2013, plus tracks from Cults new album <i>Static</i>.  Tune in for it this Friday at 1pm or Saturday at 10am.','http://cultscultscults.com/media/gallery_images/lightbox/14.jpg','http://cultscultscults.com',2,'y'),(284,'2013-12-09','2013-12-13','Y-Not Presents: Pompeya and City Rain','This Thursday night, December 12th, Y-Not is proud to be bringing Moscow\'s <b>Pompeya</b> to The North Star Bar in support of their new album <i>Tropical</i> with support from Philly\'s own <b>City Rain</b>! Wanna check out the show for free?  Sign up for our guest list <a href=\"contests.php\">here</a> or buy tickets <a href=\"http://www.northstarbar.com/event/411019-pompeya-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://scontent-a-iad.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-ash2/428661_10151613884316967_1774496958_n.jpg','/contests.php',4,'n'),(285,'2013-12-09','2013-12-15','Jagwar Ma <font size=2>Y-Not Internacional Interview</font> ','Tune in this Saturday from 2-4pm for this week\'s episode of <i>Y-Not Internacional</i> â?? featuring Gilâ??s interview with Australian indie dance band <strong>Jagwar Ma</strong> along with tracks from their debut album <em>Howlinâ??</em>.','http://c.ststat.com/content/EntImg/Tour/jagwar-ma-247105559-340x280.jpg','http://jagwarma.com/',2,'n'),(286,'2013-12-14','2013-12-27','Clap Your Hands Say Yeah<br>on New Year\'s Eve Ticket Giveaway','As the clock turns to midnight and 2013 becomes 2014, you could be rocking out with <b>Clap Your Hands Say Yeah</b> along with <b>Juston Stens & The Get Real Gang</b> at The North Star Bar! <a href=\"contests.php\">Enter here</a> to win a pair of tickets or buy them <a href=\"http://www.northstarbar.com/event/446367-clap-your-hands-say-yeah-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://www.thegrovestl.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/08/clapyourhnds.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(287,'2013-12-23','2014-01-02','Y-Not Best of 2013 Programming','On New Yearâ??s Day, Y-Not is taking a break from our <i>Top 213 of 2013</i> Countdown, but you can catch up with replays of our specialty showsâ?? Best of 2013 editions all day long.  Hear <i>Y-Not Sessions</i> at 11am, <i>Britspotting</i> at 1pm, <i>Y-Not Internacional</i> at 3pm, <i>Y-Not Philly</i> at 5pm, <i>Transmission</i> at 7pm, and <i>Noise Complaint</i> at 9pm.','http://soundfusemag.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/best_of_2013_logo_sq-120x120.png','schedule.php',4,'n'),(288,'2014-01-06','2014-01-11','Pompeya MilkBoy Session','For our first MilkBoy Session airing in 2014, weâ??ll hear from Russian band <b>Pompeya</b>, who were recently in the U.S. in support of their debut album <i>Tropical</i>.  Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm for their live session at MilkBoy Philly and interview with Y-Notâ??s <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.  ','http://scontent-b-iad.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-frc3/552513_10150745355341967_533746008_n.jpg','http://pompeya.com/',2,'n'),(289,'2014-01-12','2014-01-21','Against Me! Interview + Album Preview','Next Tuesday, January 21st, <b>Against Me!</b> will finally release their long awaited 6th album <i>Transgender Dysphoria Blues</i>! Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Josh T. Landow</b> got to sit down with <b>Laura Jane Grace</b> to talk in depth about the events, and the process behind these new songs. Hear our interview and an album preview <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> and hear more tracks from the the record all weekend long.','http://scontent-b-lga.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn2/1549339_709132192439012_313570233_n.jpg','http://www.againstme.net/',1,'y'),(290,'2014-01-13','2014-01-17','Win Royal Bangs Tickets','This Saturday night, January 18th, Y-Not brings <b>Royal Bangs</b> to <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/441101-royal-bangs-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>MilkBoy Philly</a> in support of their new album <i>Brass</i>! Wanna check out the show for free? Enter to win a pair of tickets by Thursday at Noon <a href=\"contests.php\">here</a>.','http://s2.evcdn.com/images/block250/I0-001/003/849/541-3.jpeg_/royal-bangs-41.jpeg','contests.php',3,'n'),(291,'2014-01-19','2014-01-25','Sir Sly Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm for our next Bunker Session with L.A. band <b>Sir Sly</b>.  Hear them playing acoustic versions of songs from their debut EP <i>Gold</i> and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.  Get a free download of Sir Sly\'s latest single \"Miracle\" <a href=\"http://www.sir-sly.com\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://www.hellhoundmusic.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/197.jpg','http://www.sir-sly.com',1,'n'),(292,'2014-01-27','2014-02-06','Y-Not Presents Drowners ','Next Friday, February 7th, Y-Not Presents <b>Drowners</b> at <a href=\"http://www.ticketweb.com/fb/4007164\" target=_blank>Kung Fu Necktie</a>. Wanna check out the show for free? Enter to win a pair <a href=\"contests.php\">here</a>.','http://www.ogirassol.com.br/adm/foto/f4372e3b4369934335f608cb6cf3ea93.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(293,'2014-01-27','2014-02-01','Royal Bangs MilkBoy Session','Tune in this Friday for our next <i>MilkBoy Session</i> with Knoxville, Tennesseeâ??s  <b>Royal Bangs</b>.  Hear them playing live from the <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank>MilkBoy Philly</a> stage and chatting with Y-Notâ??s <b>Shana</b> about their latest album <i>Brass</i> this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://www.bubarmusic.com/img/ro/royal-bangs.jpg','http://www.royalbangs.com/',1,'n'),(294,'2014-02-10','2014-02-16','Glasvegas Britspotting Takeover','Scottish indie rock band <b>Glasvegas</b> are back with their third album <i>Later...When The TV Turns To Static</i> and they\'ll be coming to Philly next Monday, February 17th at <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/426249\" target=_blank>The North Star Bar</a>.  In anticipation of the show, the band members took over this week\'s episode of <i>Britspotting</i> with <b>Matt McGrath</b> and played their favorite music from the UK.  If you missed it, tune in for the replay on Saturday at 4pm.','https://s3.amazonaws.com/storyamp_production/artist/5275/medium/10961-GLAS_DAY_2_DN_21-Edit.jpg','http://glasvegas.net/',1,'y'),(295,'2014-02-08','2014-02-20','Win Sam Roberts Band Tickets','<b>Sam Roberts Band</b> returns to Philadelphia this week with a brand new album <i>Lo-Fantasy</i> for a show at <a href=\"http://tickets.worldcafelive.com/event/444435-sam-roberts-band-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>World Cafe Live</a> this Friday, February 21st.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets!  Read our review of the album <a href=\"cdoftheweek.php?id=189\">here</a>.','http://s3.amazonaws.com/btoimageupload/contests/images/20140124_samroberts_jpg_316x316_q95_up_ctf.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(296,'2014-02-15','2014-02-22','Drowners MilkBoy Session','Y-Not recently welcomed <b>Drowners</b> to Philadelphia in support of their newly released debut album.  While they were here, the NYC foursome stopped by to record a session at <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank><b>MilkBoy Philly</b></a>.  Hear their live performance and interview with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> this Friday at 2pm or 10pm!','http://not-dead.up.n.seesaa.net/not-dead/image/Drowners_mem.jpg','http://drownersband.com/',1,'n'),(297,'2014-02-24','2014-03-01','Sam Roberts Band Y-Not Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm for another live session with <b>Sam Roberts Band</b> performing songs from their new album <i>Lo-Fantasy</i> onstage at World Cafe Live and hear <b>Josh T. Landow</b>\'s backstage interview with Sam.  <i>Donate just $15 this week to get a copy of Lo-Fantasy. More info <a href=\"donate.php\">here</a>.</i>','http://exclaim.ca/images/sam12.jpg','http://samrobertsband.com/',1,'n'),(298,'2014-02-24','2014-03-04','<font size=2>We Were Promised Jetpacks Ticket Giveway</font>','On Thursday, March 6th, Y-Not Radio Presents <b>We Were Promised Jetpacks</b> at Arden Concert Gild in celebration of their new release <i>E Rey: Live In Philadelphia</i>.  Buy tickets <a href=\"http://ardenconcerts.com/\" target=_blank>here</a> or win a pair by entering <a href=\"contests.php\">here</a>.','http://www.insidestl.com/Portals/0/Smitty/WWPJ_450.jpg','contests.php',5,'n'),(299,'2014-03-03','2014-03-10','Those Darlins Radio Takeover','Nashville favorites <b>Those Darlins</b> recently returned to Philly for a sold out show at Boot & Saddle, and before the show Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> caught up with <b>Jessi</b> and <b>Linwood</b> from the band for our next <i>Radio Takeover</i>! Tune in to hear them chatting about their new album <i>Blur The Line</i> and playing guest DJ for an hour.  If you missed it on Friday, catch the replay on Sunday at 9pm.','http://scontent-b-iad.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn1/t1/12687_10151605401716059_1909936113_n.jpg','http://thosedarlins.com/',1,'n'),(300,'2014-03-10','2014-03-13','Veronica Mars Y-Not Movie Night','Join us for a Y-Not night at the movies to see an advance screening of <i>Veronica Mars</i>, starring <b>Kristen Bell</b>, this Wednesday, March 12th at 7:30pm at the AMC Cherry Hill theater. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>Enter here</b></a> for a pair of passes.','http://scontent-a-iad.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn2/l/t1/1467326_269084456572165_1240097180_n.png','contests.php',3,'n'),(301,'2014-10-31','2014-12-31','Speak Volumes w/ Kuf Knotz','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of Y-Notâ??s monthly indie hip-hop show, <em>Speak Volumes</em>, hosted by Philly hip-hop artist <strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/KUFKNOTZ\">Kuf Knotz</a></strong> and <b>DJ Babtoue</b>!','images/kufknotz.jpg','http://www.kufknotz.com/',8,'y'),(302,'2014-03-17','2014-03-22','Eternal Summers MilkBoy Session','Tune in this Friday to hear our latest <i>MilkBoy Session</i> with Virginia band <b>Eternal Summers</b>.  <b>Josh T. Landow</b> sat down with them to chat about their brand new 4th album <i>The Drop Beneath</i> and they played songs from that and their previous release <i>Correct Behavior</i>.  Check it out on Friday at 2pm or 10:30pm.','http://mixonline.com/recording/artists_engineers_producers/Eternal_Summers_LRG_DCAP.jpg','http://www.eternalsummersband.com/',1,'n'),(303,'2014-03-17','2014-03-21','Win The Colourist Tickets','This Saturday night, March 22nd, Y-Not brings <b>The Colourist</b> to <a href=\"http://www.northstarbar.com/event/444997-colourist-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>The North Star Bar</a> in support of their debut album coming out next week! Wanna check out the show for free? Enter to win a pair of tickets <a href=\"contests.php\">here</a>','http://cdn.republicrecords.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/08/thecolouristimage002.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(304,'2014-03-18','2014-03-24','Y-Not SXSW Recap','Tune in for a special SXSW recap with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>, <strong>Matt McGrath</strong>, and <strong>Shana</strong>, who were all down in Austin, TX last week.  They\'ll share their SXSW experience and play music from the bands they saw!  You have two chances to catch the show this weekend - Saturday from 10:30am-2pm or Sunday from 12-3:30pm.','http://www.blogotheque.net/wp-content/thumbnails/uploads/2014/03/fbcb1b3a-tt-width-178-height-115-crop-1-bgcolor-FFFFFF.png','index.php',1,'n'),(305,'2014-03-24','2014-03-30','The Colourist Bunker Session','O.C. band <b>The Colourist</b> came through town this weekend for a show at The North Star Bar and stopped by to record an acoustic <i>Bunker Session</i>.  Hear stripped down versions of songs from their debut album (out this week) and their chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> on Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/24/59/91-atlg.jpeg','http://www.thecolouristmusic.com/',2,'n'),(306,'2014-03-24','2014-03-27','Win Upright Citizens Brigade Tickets','This Thursday night, March 27th, <b>The Upright Citizens Brigade Touring Company</b> presents An Evening of Improv Comedy at <a href=\"http://tickets.worldcafelive.com/event/482021\" target=_blank>World CafÃ© Live</a>. If youâ??d like to check it out on us, enter to win a pair of tickets <a href=\"contests.php\">here</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/89/90/51-atlg.jpg','contests.php',5,'n'),(307,'2014-03-24','2014-04-30','Modern Rock Madness','After 5 days of fierce competition, the 2014 <b>Modern Rock Madness 2014</b> Champions are <b>Yeah Yeahs Yeahs</b>!  See how it all went down on the completed bracket <a href=\"madness.php\">here</a> and read <strong>Joey O</strong>\'s recap at <a href=\"http://www.tristateindie.com/yeah-modern-rock-madness-yeah-champ-is-here-yeah/\" target=\"_blank\">Tri State Indie</a>.  <i>Brought to you by <a href=\"http://sixpoint.com\" target=_blank>Sixpoint Brewery</a>.</i> ','images/mrm2014_square.png','madness.php',10,'n'),(308,'2014-03-25','2014-03-28','Win Dead Milkmen Tickets','<em><a href=\"http://thetwistedworld.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The Twisted World</a></em> is a 3 day festival of avante garde performances, bands, writers, artists, costuming, and more, this weekend in Valley Forge, featuring <strong>The Dead Milkmen</strong>. Enter to win a pair of tickets <a href=\"pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2\">here</a>.','http://thetwistedworld.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/05/logo.png','pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2',9,'y'),(309,'2014-03-27','2014-03-31','Win Jukebox The Ghost Tickets','Friends of Y-Not <b>Jukebox The Ghost</b> are kicking off an April Fool\'s mini tour right here in Philly at World Cafe Live on Tuesday, April 1st. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>Enter here</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them <a href=\"http://tickets.worldcafelive.com/event/494333-jukebox-ghost-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://www.jukeboxtheghost.com/site/wp-content/uploads/2012/02/DSC5868.jpeg','contests.php',4,'n'),(310,'2014-03-27','2014-03-31','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of <i>Aussie Unlocked</i> with <b>Shana</b> for a look at the latest music from down under and an interview with <b>Glass Towers</b>!','http://media2.apnonline.com.au/img/media/images/2009/12/16/LNS_17-12-2009_EGN_07_LNS1707A_fct500x308x27_t460.jpg','http://www.glasstowers.com.au/',6,'n'),(311,'2014-10-20','2014-10-31','Dum Dum Girls Halloween Takeover','<strong>Dum Dum Girls</strong> are returning to Philadelphia this Friday, October 31st at Union Transfer and before the show <b>Dee Dee</b> will be stopping by the Y-Not Bunker to share her spooktacular Halloween playlist!  Tune in Friday at 3pm or 9pm for the <i>Dum Dum Girls Halloween Radio Takeover</i>.  Tickets for the show are available to purchase <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/640733\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://images.artistdirect.com/Images/a3/artist/240/4934362_dum_dum_girls_240.jpg','http://wearedumdumgirls.com/',1,'n'),(312,'2014-04-08','2014-04-12','Roman Remains Bunker Session','<strong>Roman Remains</strong> is a new project from <strong>Duke Spirit</strong> members <strong>Liela Moss</strong> and <strong>Toby Butler</strong>. While on tour in support of their debut album <em>Zeal</em>, they stopped by to record an acoustic Bunker Session. Hear stripped down versions of some Roman Remains songs and their interview with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://www.conciergequestionnaire.com/images/q/RomanRemainsQ.jpg','http://www.romanremains.com/',1,'n'),(313,'2014-04-14','2014-04-21','We Are Scientists MilkBoy Session','<b>Keith Murray</b> and <b>Chris Cain</b> aka <b>We Are Scientists</b> have returned with their 5th album <i>TV en Francais</i> and this week will be joining us to perform songs from it at <a href=\"http://milkboythestudio.com\" target=_blank>MilkBoy The Studio</a>.  Tune in to hear their live session and a sure-to-be nonsensical interview with <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Josh T. Landow</b> this Friday at 2pm or 10pm. ','http://www.nme.com/images/gallery/2013WeAreScientists01PR111013.jpg','http://www.wearescientists.com/',1,'n'),(314,'2014-04-17','2014-04-20','Y-Not @ Record Store Day','Join Y-Not Radio in celebrating <i>Record Store Day 2014</i> at <strong><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/MainStreetMusicPA/109854695706800\" target=\"_blank\">Main Street Music</a></strong> in Manayunk (4444 Main Street) this Saturday, April 19th. Everyone who comes out will get a free download card for an exclusive compilation of songs recorded by local artists for the <em>Y-Not Philly</em> show, including <strong>Amanda X</strong>, <strong>Buried Beds</strong>, <strong>Cayetana</strong>, <strong>Cheerleader</strong>, <strong>Commonwealth Choir</strong>, <strong>Cruiser</strong>, <strong>Night Panther</strong>, <strong>Psychic Teens</strong>, <strong>Restorations</strong>, <strong>W.C. Lindsay</strong>, and many more (while supplies last).','images/y-not_record_store_day_2014_logo.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/pages/MainStreetMusicPA/109854695706800',2,'n'),(315,'2014-04-21','2014-04-28','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> for an hour of  the latest music from Down Under including <strong>Courtney Barnett, Asta, Saskwatch, Strange Talk, Wunder Wunder,</strong> and more!','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','schedule.php',1,'n'),(316,'2014-04-28','2014-05-03','Amazing Spider-Man 2 Giveaway','<a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER HERE</a> for a chance to win passes to see <b><i>The Amazing Spider-Man 2</b></i>, opening this Friday, at any Regal Cinemas nationwide! Or listen all week for more chances to win.  <i>And join Y-Notâ??s <b>Joey O.</b> this Saturday at the Regal Marketplace 24 in Oaks, PA for a day of Spider-Man festivities with face-painting, prizes courtesy of <a href=\"http://newwavecomics.net/\" target=_blank>New Wave Comics</a>, and more!</i>\r\n','http://th05.deviantart.net/fs70/150/f/2013/056/4/c/the_amazing_spider_man_2_trailer_poster_by_alienkid12-d5w81sa.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(317,'2014-04-28','2014-05-04','Baths Interview on Transmission','Tune in Thursday nights from 9-11 or Saturdays from 6-8pm for <i>Transmission</i> â?? 2 hours of alternative electronic and dance music with <b>Rob Huff</b>!  This week Rob has an interview with <b>Baths</b> and features music from his latest album <i>Obsidian</i>.','http://media.lessthan3.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/baths-oceandaeth-lessthan3-e1398441632716.jpg','http://www.bathsmusic.com/',2,'n'),(318,'2014-04-28','2014-05-04','Future Islands Radio Takeover','Tune in this Friday at 1pm for our next <i>Radio Takeover</i> with <b>Future Islands</b>, picking out a playlist of their favorite songs, plus a few tracks from their new album <i>Singles</i>.  If you miss it, catch replays on or Saturday at Noon or Sunday at 9pm.','http://www.radicalslang.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/140108-future-islands-new-album-singles-225x150.jpg','http://www.future-islands.com/',1,'n'),(319,'2014-05-05','2014-05-12','Bombay Bicycle Club Radio Takeover','Tune in this Friday at 1pm or 10pm, or Sunday at 8pm to hear members of <b>Bombay Bicycle Club</b> playing some of their favorite songs for another <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>.  Theyâ??ll also be chatting with Y-Notâ??s <b>Matt McGrath</b> about their new album <i>So Long, See You Tomorrow</i>.  Tickets are still available to see Bombay Bicycle Club on Wednesday night at <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/449085\" target=_blank>Union Transfer</a>.','http://spincoaster.com/wp-content/uploads/bombaybicycleclub-560x373.png','http://bombaybicycleclubmusic.com/',1,'n'),(320,'2014-05-12','2014-05-17','Howler Bunker Session','Over the weekend, Minneapolis band <b>Howler</b> came through Philly and singer <b>Jordan Gatesmith</b> paid us a visit in the Bunker to play an acoustic set of songs from their new album <i>World Of Joy</i>.  Tune in to hear the session and Jordan\'s chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/01/82/39-atlg.jpg','http://yeehawboys.com/',2,'n'),(321,'2014-05-19','2014-05-26','Tokyo Police Club Radio Takeover','Tune in this Sunday at 8pm to hear <strong>Dave</strong> and <strong>Graham</strong> of <strong>Tokyo Police Club</strong> playing some of their favorite songs for another <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>.  Theyâ??ll also be chatting with Y-Notâ??s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> about their new album <em>Forcefield</em> and playing some tracks from the record.','http://pbs.twimg.com/media/BjwEUGvCcAAsSmP.jpg','http://tokyopoliceclub.com/',3,'n'),(322,'2014-05-22','2014-05-26','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> for an hour of the latest music from Down Under including <strong>Pigeon</strong>, <strong>Halcyon Drive</strong>, <strong>Rainy Day Women</strong>, <strong>Cash For Gold</strong>,  and more!','http://www.ynotradio.net/images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','index.php',4,'n'),(323,'2014-05-22','2014-05-27','Memorial Day Block Party','This Memorial Day, Y-Not Radio is throwing a block party that you can take with you wherever you\'re going.  Tune in from 12-7pm on Sunday and 10am-10pm on Monday to hear 3 song blocks of your favorite Y-Not artists.  Takes Y-Not Radio on the go with the <a href=\"mobile.php\">iRadioPhilly app</a> for iPhone or Android.','http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-mffg1d3mecw/UwQqeiiyi3I/AAAAAAAAA_s/nuA0GqbRfIM/s1600/blocks.jpg','mobile.php',1,'n'),(324,'2014-06-30','2014-06-10','Nightbox MilkBoy Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 11pm to hear our latest <i>MilkBoy Session</i> with Toronto electronic band <b>Nightbox</b>!  They\'ll be playing songs from their latest EP <i>The Panic Sequence</i>, as well as brand new songs, and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> live from the <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank>MilkBoy Philly</a> stage.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-xpf1/t1.0-9/10305074_10152183257962809_1908346756347224529_n.jpg','http://www.nightbox.ca/',2,'n'),(325,'2014-06-03','2014-07-09','Y-Not Radio\'s 4th Anniversary Soiree with The Crookes','On July 12th, 2010, Y-Not Radio was born (or reborn). On July 8th, 2014, come join us to celebrate our 4th anniversary with UK band <strong>The Crookes</strong> and <strong>Young Buffalo</strong> live at The Barbary in Fishtown! Tickets are only $12 in advance <a href=\"http://www.ticketfly.com/event/588745-crookes-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> or at the door.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/07/52/13-atxl1.jpg','contests.php',1,'n'),(326,'2014-06-12','2014-06-20','Y-Not @ Baltimore Ave. Dollar Stroll','This Thursday is the return of the <i>Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll</i> from 5:30-8:30pm between 43rd & 51st Streets in West Philly. Get $1 specials from all the local businesses and stop by the Y-Not Radio Stage at 46th Street for live sets from <b>Purples</b> at 6pm and <b>City Rain</b> at 7:30pm!','http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-tBimuiZKfLc/U5oEuVzLL8I/AAAAAAAAA_E/XmDRUcVzBEc/s1600/DollarStroll-2014.jpg','http://universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',2,'n'),(327,'2014-06-16','2014-06-21','Connor Barwin Radio Takeover','In anticipation of this Friday\'s benefit show with <b>Kurt Vile</b>, <b>The Districts</b>, and <b>The Tontons</b>, <i>Make The World Better Project</i> president and <b>Philadelphia Eagles</b> linebacker <B>Connor Barwin</b> will join us this week for a <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>!  Tune in on Thursday at 3:30pm or Friday at 11am to hear Connor\'s playlist featuring music from all the bands playing the show and more of his indie rock favorites!  Tickets for the benefit are available <a href=\"http://www.utphilly.com/event/584159-kurt-vile-violators-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://www.tristateindie.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/D9D42C63-CF1D-4AFD-8E42-234950CBCC7A.jpg','http://www.utphilly.com/event/584159-kurt-vile-violators-philadelphia/',1,'n'),(328,'2014-06-24','2014-06-30','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> for an hour of the latest music from Down Under including <strong>The Griswolds</strong>, <strong>Ball Park Music</strong>, <strong>Lupa</strong>, <strong>Rainy Day Women</strong>, <strong>Jakarta Criers</strong>, <strong>The Money Go Round</strong>, and more!','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','schedule.php',2,'n'),(329,'2014-06-30','2014-07-05','4th of July <i>Britspotting</i> Marathon','Here at Y-Not Radio we\'ll celebrate our independence by listening to music from the empire whose tyrannical rule we escaped in 1776. Itâ??s another July 4th marathon of <i>Britspotting</i> with <b>Matt McGrath</b>. Enjoy music exclusively from across the pond all day long from 9am-9pm. And catch new episodes Monday nights at 8 with encores on Saturday at 4pm.','http://fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-xaf1/t1.0-9/301544_239459456092128_2562453_n.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/BritSpottingRadio',1,'n'),(330,'2014-07-14','2014-07-22','Hamilton Leithauser Radio Takeover','Tune in this Friday at 1pm or 10pm for another <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i> with <b>Hamilton Leithauser</b> of <b>The Walkmen</b>!  Hamilton has spent a lot of time in Philly and picked a playlist of some of his favorite artists from around here along with songs from his own solo debut <i>Black Hours</i>.','http://tixbangboom.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/leithauser-top.jpg','http://hamiltonleithauser.com/',2,'n'),(331,'2014-08-29','2014-08-30','Win QOTSA & Brody Dalle Tickets','This Sunday night, <b>Queens of The Stone Age</b> and <b>Brody Dalle</b> play the Skyline Stage at The Mann and we have a chance for you to go to the show for free courtesy of Brody Dalle and Caroline Records!  <b><a href=\"pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2\">ENTER HERE</a></b> for a pair of tickets plus a copy of Brody\'s new album <i>Diploid Love</i> on CD.  Tickets are still available to purchase <a href=\"http://www.ticketmaster.com/event/02004C7A1F937AE5\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-MBde0T25ayc/U8gLPHViDZI/AAAAAAAABBc/BvlpdCtaA6Y/s1600/brody+josh.jpg','pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2',10,'y'),(332,'2014-07-21','2014-07-28','Hamilton Leithauser Radio Takeover','Tune in this Friday for another Y-Not Radio Takeover with <strong>Hamilton Leithauser</strong> of <strong>The Walkmen</strong>! Hamilton has spent a lot of time in Philly and picked a playlist of some of his favorite artists from around here along with songs from his own solo debut <em>Black Hours</em>.  Hear it on Friday at 1pm or 10pm, or Sunday night at 8.','http://tixbangboom.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/07/leithauser-top.jpg','http://hamiltonleithauser.com/',1,'n'),(333,'2014-07-22','2014-07-28','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> for an hour of the latest music from Down Under!','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','schedule.php',2,'n'),(334,'2014-07-28','2014-08-04','Y-Not @ The 2nd Street Festival','This Sunday, August 3rd, the <i>2nd Street Festival</i> returns to Northern Liberties with live music all day on two stages featuring <b>DRGN King, Black Landlord, Mock Suns, Pine Barons, TJ Kong, Weird Hot,</b> and many more! The festival runs from Noon-10pm and itâ??s all free! <i>Y-Not Radio will be out all day DJing between bands, plus giving away free CDs and a chance for you to win tickets for <b>The Gaslight Anthem</b> at The Mann!</i> Tune into this weekâ??s episode of Y-Not Philly on Saturday at 8pm for a festival preview and get more info, plus the full list of bands <a href=\"http://2ndStreetFestival.org\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://theswollenfox.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/2nd-Street-Festival.jpg','http://www.2ndstfestival.org',1,'y'),(335,'2014-08-03','2014-08-09','Ex Hex MilkBoy Session','<b>Mary Timony</b>â??s new band <b>Ex Hex</b> recently played here in Philadelphia and before their shows, they caught up with Y-Notâ??s <b>Rob Huff</b> for another <i><a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank>MilkBoy</a> Session</i>!  Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm to hear their interview and live performance of songs from their upcoming debut album <i>Rips</i>, due out October 7th. Find  more about Ex Hex <a href=\"http://www.exhexband.com/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-qSp-D6r7FPg/UvKxBLtPQ3I/AAAAAAAAASY/IDFhyau6gpg/s1600/exhexthumbs.jpg','http://www.exhexband.com/',1,'n'),(336,'2014-08-11','2014-08-16','Honeyblood MilkBoy Session','One of Y-Notâ??s staff favorites lately has been <strong>Honeyblood</strong>!  When they recently played their first show ever in Philly, our own <strong>Rob Huff</strong> and <strong>Shana</strong> caught up with the Glasgow duo at <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=\"_blank\">MilkBoy Philly</a> for an interview and live session!  Hear Honeyblood playing songs from their self-titled debut live on the MilkBoy stage this Friday at 2pm or 10pm. Find out more about Honeyblood <a href=\"http://www.fat-cat.co.uk/site/artists/honeyblood\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://www.thefader.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/09/ljc_honeyblood_003-S1-0010-copy-164x109.jpg','http://www.fat-cat.co.uk/site/artists/honeyblood',1,'n'),(337,'2014-08-18','2014-08-25','The Griswolds Acoustic Session','Australiaâ??s <b>The Griswolds</b> are getting ready to release their full length debut album <i>Be Impressive</i> next week and Y-Notâ??s <b>Shana</b> just caught up with them last week when they came to Philly on tour with <b>Miniature Tigers</b>.  Hear their interview and acoustic performance, plus a couple songs from the new album this Friday afternoon at 2 or in an extra long edition of <i>Aussie Unlocked</i> on Friday night at 10pm.','http://www.winduprecords.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/image003.jpg','http://wearethegriswolds.com/',1,'n'),(338,'2014-08-18','2014-08-25','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9 or Sunday at 7 for a new episode of <i>Aussie Unlocked</i>.  This month <b>Shana</b> will be joined by <b>Jeremy Neale</b> of the band <b>Velociraptor</b> for an Aussie Takeover, plus hear a replay of her interview and an acoustic session with <b>The Griswolds</b>! ','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','https://www.facebook.com/velociraptorband',2,'n'),(339,'2014-08-29','2014-09-02','Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day Weekend','This Labor Day, the Y-Not DJs may be off, but the music will be live! All weekend long weâ??ll be playing tracks from <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, old <strong>Y100</strong> and <strong>WDRE</strong> <em>Sonic Sessions</em>, and plenty of other live recordings as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"mobile.php\">iRadioPhilly app</a> for iPhone or Android and make <em>Y-Notâ??s Live Labor Day</em> the soundtrack for your end of summer festivities! ','http://nationalharbor.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/11/Labor-day.jpg','schedule.php',1,'n'),(340,'2014-09-02','2014-09-08','Bob Mould Radio Takeover','If you missed the legendary <b>Bob Mould</b> taking over Y-Not Radio before his Philly show at the TLA on Friday, tune in for the replays this weekend.  Hear Bob talk to <b>Josh T. Landow</b> about his new album <i>Beauty & Ruin</i> and guest DJ for an hour on Saturday at 9am or Sunday at 9pm.','http://s3.amazonaws.com/quietus_production/images/articles/15556/Bob_Mould_1403181300_crop_550x367.jpeg','http://bobmould.com',2,'n'),(341,'2014-09-08','2014-09-15','Thumpers MilkBoy Session','Tune in on Sunday at 7pm for the replay of our latest <i>MilkBoy Session</i> with UK band <b>Thumpers</b>!  They\'ll be playing songs from their debut album <i>Galore</i> live at <a href=\"http://milkboythestudio.com\" target=_blank>MilkBoy The Studio</a> and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/13/02/77-atmd.jpg','http://thumpers.co/',2,'n'),(342,'2014-09-15','2014-09-19','Y-Not @ Baltimore Ave. Dollar Stroll','This Thursday is the return of the <i>Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll</i> from 5:30-8:30pm between 43rd & 51st Streets in West Philly. Get $1 specials from all the local businesses with Y-Not Radio DJs spinning all evening!  Stop by the Y-Not Radio Tent at 46th Street for a chance to win tickets for <b>The Dandy Warhols</b> on Tuesday, September 23rd at <a href=\"http://concerts.livenation.com/event/02004CD3BD6D50EB\" target=_blank>The TLA</a>. Get more info on the <em>Dollar Stroll </em><a href=\"http://universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://i57.tinypic.com/s4yyk7.jpg','http://universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',1,'n'),(343,'2014-09-22','2014-09-29','The Rentals Radio Takeover','Tune in this Sunday at 8pm to hear <b>The Rentals</b>â?? frontman <b>Matt Sharp</b> guest DJing on Y-Not Radio after their Union Transfer show this past week.  Matt will chat about the new Rentals album <i>Lost In Alphaville</i> and share some of his favorite music.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/18/29/95-atmd.jpeg','http://therentalsmusic.tumblr.com/',1,'n'),(344,'2014-09-22','2014-09-29','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of <i>Aussie Unlocked</i> with <b>Shana</b> to hear the latest music from Down Under including new songs from <b>Foreign/National</b>, <b>The Good Morrows</b>, <b>The Jensens</b>, <b>The Furrs</b>, and more.','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','schedule.php',3,'n'),(345,'2014-09-29','2014-10-06','Samsaya Bunker Session ','Norwegian artist <b>Samsaya</b> recently played her first show in Philly with <b>Lily Allen</b> and before the show she stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and play acoustic versions of some songs from her upcoming U.S. debut album <i>Bombay Calling</i>.  Hear Samsayaâ??s Bunker Session this Friday at 2pm or 8:30pm.','http://www.samsaya.com/sites/default/files/styles/gallery/public/Pressebildet%20SAMSAYA_HildeHoltaLysell2.jpg','http://www.samsaya.com/',1,'n'),(346,'2014-10-06','2014-10-13','Mike Doughty Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm for our next Bunker Session with Y-Not favorite <b>Mike Doughty</b>!  Hear Mike playing acoustic versions of songs from his latest album <i>Stellar Motel</i> and chatting with <b>Joey O.</b>!  See Mike Doughty back in Philly on Wednesday, November 26th at The <a href=\"https://tin-angel.seatengine.com/venues/tin-angel/events/5159/shows\" target=_blank>Tin Angel</a> for his <i>World Renowned Question Jar Show</i>. ','http://wac.450f.edgecastcdn.net/80450F/diffuser.fm/files/2014/09/mikedoghty.jpg','http://www.mikedoughty.com',1,'n'),(347,'2014-10-14','2014-10-20','The Orwells Radio Takeover','Before their show this week at Underground Arts, Mario, Matt, and Dom from <b>The Orwells</b> sat down with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to chat about their album <i>Disgraceland</i> and pick a playlist of their favorite songs! Hear the replay of their Radio Takeover on Sunday at 8pm. ','http://31.media.tumblr.com/d0688df4e4e8202a89dd6b65b44de084/tumblr_n8h0y4WbUs1ql58e6o2_500.jpg','http://www.theorwells.com/',1,'n'),(348,'2014-10-20','2014-10-27','Courtney Barnett Radio Takeover','Tune in this Sunday at 8pm for the replay of  <b>Courtney Barnett</b>\'s Y-Not Radio Takeover.  Before her show this week at Union Transfer, Courtney sat down with Y-Notâ??s <b>Shana</b> to chat about her current release, <i>The Double EP: A Sea of Split Peas</i>, whatâ??s in store for the future, and of course to pick a playlist of her favorite songs!','http://www.abc.net.au/triplej/artists/courtney_barnett/img/2014/340.jpg','http://courtneybarnett.com.au/',1,'n'),(349,'2014-10-20','2014-10-27','Courtney Barnett Radio Takeover','Tune in this Friday for the next Y-Not Radio Takeover with Australian indie darling <b>Courtney Barnett</b>. Before her show this week at Union Transfer, Courtney sat down with Y-Notâ??s <b>Shana</b> to chat about her current release, <i>The Double EP: A Sea of Split Peas</i>, whatâ??s in the future, and of course to pick a playlist of her favorite songs! Hear Courtney Barnettâ??s takeover on Friday at 1pm and 10pm, or Sunday at 8pm.','http://www.abc.net.au/triplej/artists/courtney_barnett/img/2014/340.jpg','http://courtneybarnett.com.au/',1,'y'),(350,'2014-10-20','2014-10-27','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> to hear the latest music from Down Under and an interview with Perth band <strong>Doctopus</strong>.','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','/schedule.php',2,'n'),(351,'2014-10-31','2014-11-03','Dum Dum Girls Halloween Takeover','<strong>Dum Dum Girls</strong> are returned to Philadelphia on Friday at Union Transfer and before the show <b>Dee Dee</b> joined us to to share her spooktacular Halloween playlist!  If you missed it, tune in on Sunday at 7pm for the replay of <i>Dum Dum Girls\' Halloween Radio Takeover</i>!','http://images.artistdirect.com/Images/a3/artist/240/4934362_dum_dum_girls_240.jpg','http://wearedumdumgirls.com/',1,'n'),(352,'2014-11-03','2014-11-10','Asteroids Galaxy Tour Y-Not Session','Tune in for our next Y-Not Session with <b>The Asteroids Galaxy Tour</b>, recorded live at <a href=\"http://www.kawarisound.com/\" target=_blank>Kawari Sound</a>! Hear them playing stripped down versions of songs from their latest album <i>Bring Us Together</i> and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.  The Asteroids Galaxy Tour\'s Y-Not Session replays on Sunday night at 9.','http://www.d3bris.de/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/AGT_pressphoto_color4-174x131.jpg','http://theasteroidsgalaxytour.com/',2,'n'),(353,'2014-12-30','2014-12-31','Win St. Lucia & Haerts Tickets','<strong>St. Lucia</strong> and <b>Haerts</b> play Philadelphia this Monday, November 24th at The TLA.  <b><a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER HERE</a></b> for a chance to win a pair of tickets to the show or <a href=\"http://concerts.livenation.com/event/02004CC4ECEA5AF6\" target=\"_blank\">buy tickets here</a>.','http://d1ya1fm0bicxg1.cloudfront.net/2014/06/st-lucia-tickets_10-18-14_23_539f17b554d2b.jpg','contests.php',10,'n'),(354,'2014-12-30','2014-12-31','Jukebox The Ghost Radio Takeover','Tune in this Friday for another <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i> with our old friends <b>Jukebox The Ghost</b>!  Y-Not\'s <b>Bek Henson</b> sat down with <b>Ben</b>, <b>Tommy</b>, and <b>Jesse</b> before their recent Union Transfer show to chat about their new self-titled album and the guys each picked a set of their favorite tunes.  Hear the Jukebox The Ghost takeover on Friday at 1pm and 10pm, or Sunday at 8pm.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/28/50/71-atmd1.jpg','http://jukeboxtheghost.com',9,'n'),(355,'2014-11-24','2014-11-28','Y-Not\'s Turkey Day Takeovers 2014','Happy Thanksgiving everybody! Tune in on Thanksgiving Day from 9am-11:30pm as Y-Not continues the tradition of <em>Turkey Day Takeovers</em>, featuring this year\'s guest DJ sets from the likes of <strong>Bob Mould</strong>, <strong>Bombay Bicycle Club</strong>, <strong>Courtney Barnett</strong>, <strong>Future Islands</strong>, <strong>Tokyo Police Club</strong>, <strong>The Rentals</strong>, <strong>Dum Dum Girls</strong>, <strong>Jukebox The Ghost</strong>, and even <strong>Connor Barwin</strong> of the <strong>Philadelphia Eagles</strong>. Check out the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>. You can also hear all of these Takeovers and much more <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',1,'n'),(356,'2014-11-24','2014-11-29','Y-Not\'s Black Friday Shuffle & Sale','Tune in to Y-Not Radio from 9am-9pm on Black Friday for our all black shuffle! And help Y-Not end the year in the black with doorbuster savings of $5 off all CDs available as donation thank you gifts. <b><a href=\"donate.php\">Click here to donate.</a></b>','images/ynotblackfriday.png','donate.php',2,'n'),(357,'2014-11-24','2014-12-01','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> to hear the latest music from Down Under</span> including new tracks from <strong>San Cisco</strong>, <strong>Gang of Youths</strong>, <strong>I Know Leopard</strong>, and more...','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','schedule.php',4,'n'),(358,'2014-12-01','2014-12-08','We Were Promised Jetpacks<br>Bunker Session','Scottish band <b>We Were Promised Jetpacks</b> recently came through Philly in support of their 3rd album <i>Unravelling</i> and while they were here, stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to play live for us.  Tune in this Friday at 2pm or Sunday at 9pm to hear their acoustic performance and interview with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.','http://bighassle.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/we-were1-280x175.jpg','http://wewerepromisedjetpacks.com/',2,'n'),(359,'2014-12-02','2014-12-31','Y-Not\'s Top 214 of 2014 Countdown','<i>Y-Not\'s Year End Poll</i> votes have all been tallied and now it\'s time to finish the year by counting down the <i><b>Top 214 Songs of 2014</b></i>! Tune in for the countdown and all the poll results on Monday, Tuesday, and Wednesday starting at 10am each day (with replays at 5pm & Midnight, and another playback over the weekend).<br><br> Plus, find out if you\'re the winner of a $100 iTunes gift card and the chance to play your personal top 20 songs of the year on Y-Not! This is the biggest year end countdown in town, and it\'s only on Y-Not Radio!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<i>If you missed Parts 1 or 2, check out songs #214-71 <a href=\"pages.php?page=top214of2014\">here</a>.</i>','images/top214_sm.jpg','yearendpoll.php',1,'n'),(360,'2015-01-02','2015-01-12','Generationals Y-Not Session','New Orleans band <b>Generationals</b> were in town last month at Johnny Brendaâ??s in support of their recently released 4th album <i>Alix</i>.  Y-Notâ??s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> caught up with band founders <b>Grant</b> and <b>Ted</b> after the show to chat about the new album.  Tune in on Friday, January 9th at 2pm or 10pm to hear Generationalsâ?? interview and songs recorded live on stage.','http://thesongswelove.files.wordpress.com/2014/08/generationals.jpg?w=625&h=390&crop=1','http://generationals.com/',1,'y'),(361,'2014-12-13','2014-12-22','<font size=2>Robert DeLong\'s Top 10 of 2014 Takeover</font>','One man electro band <b>Robert DeLong</b> was in Philly on Monday and stopped by before his show to make his contribution to Y-Not\'s <a href=\"yearendpoll.php\">2014 Year End Poll</a> by guest DJing his Top 10 songs of the year!  If you missed it, hear Robert\'s Top 10 Takeover playback this Sunday at 8pm or anytime <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','http://www.spin.com/sites/all/files/styles/style220_147/public/130624-Robert-Delong_0.jpg','http://robertdelong.com/',3,'n'),(362,'2014-12-14','2014-12-22','Y-Not Sessions: Best of 2014','Tune in on Friday at 3pm or Sunday at 10am to hear 2 hours of the best <i>Y-Not Session</i> tracks from the past year including <b>Mike Doughty, <b>Honeyblood</b>, <b>Ex Hex</b>, <b>Thumpers</b>, <b>Sam Roberts Band</b>, <b>We Are Scientists</b>, <b>The Crookes</b>, <b>The Griswolds</b>, <b>Drowners</b>, <b>Eternal Summers</b>, <b>Asteroids Galaxy Tour</b>, and more... <i>Hear all the sessions from the past year <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.</i>','http://i60.tinypic.com/33b3eo9.jpg','ondemand.php',6,'y'),(363,'2014-12-14','2014-12-22','Y-Not Sessions: Best of 2014','Tune in on Friday at 3pm or Sunday at 10am to hear 2 hours of the best <i>Y-Not Session</i> tracks from the past year including <b>Mike Doughty</b>, <b>Honeyblood</b>, <b>Ex Hex</b>, <b>Thumpers</b>, <b>Sam Roberts Band</b>, <b>We Are Scientists</b>, <b>The Crookes</b>, <b>The Griswolds</b>, <b>Drowners</b>, <b>Eternal Summers</b>, <b>Asteroids Galaxy Tour</b>, and more... <i>Hear all the sessions from the past year <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.</i>','http://i60.tinypic.com/33b3eo9.jpg','ondemand.php',2,'n'),(364,'2014-12-31','2015-01-31','Y-Not\'s Top 214 of 2014 Countdown','Thanks to all of you who voted in our <em>2014 Year End Poll</em>.  Now it\'s time to finish the year by counting down the <em><strong>Top 214 Songs of 2014</strong></em>!  Tune in for the countdown and all the poll results on Monday, Tuesday, and Wednesday starting at 10am each day (with replays at 5pm & Midnight, and another playback over the weekend).<br><br>Plus, find out if you\'re the winner of a $100 iTunes gift card and the chance to play your personal top 20 songs of the year on Y-Not!<br><br>\r\n<i>And if you missed any of the countdown so far, check out the list of songs #214-71 <a href=\"pages.php?page=top214of2014\">here</a>.</i>','images	op214_sm.jpg','pages.php?page=top214of2014',1,'y'),(365,'2014-12-31','2015-01-31','2014 Year End Poll Results','Tune in this Friday at 1pm to hear <i>Y-Notâ??s 2014 Year End Poll</i> contest winner <b>Kristen Seavey</b> sharing her Top 20 songs of 2014.  You can see the entire list of <i>Y-Notâ??s Top 214 of 2014</i> and all the poll results <a href=\"pages.php?page=top214of2014\">here</a>.','images/top214_sm.jpg','pages.php?page=top214of2014',4,'n'),(366,'2015-01-09','2015-01-15','Win CRUISR Tickets','Y-Not Radio Presents Philly\'s own <b>CRUISR</b>, <b>Cold Fronts</b>, and <b>Needle Points</b> on Thursday, January 15th at The Barbary as part of our <i>Winter of Y-Not</i> concert series!  <a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER TO WIN</a> a pair of tickets from us or buy \'em <a href=\"https://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/730573\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://blog.cheatbook.de/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/Cruisr-Kidnap-Me.jpg','/contests.php',1,'n'),(367,'2015-01-17','2015-01-24','Win Suburban Living Tickets','Y-Not Radio Presents Philly\'s own Suburban LIving for their album release show this Saturday, January 23rd at Bourbon & Branch in Northern Liberties with Purples and Illinois!  It\'s part of the <i>Winter of Y-Not</i> concert series!  Enter to win a pair of tickets <a href=\"contests.php\">here</a>.','http://theholloweyed.com/main/wp-content/uploads/2013/03/prnt2-e1362570530222-290x290.jpg','contests.php',2,'y'),(368,'2015-03-31','2015-04-01','Win Bondage & Discipline Tickets','Celebrate the release of <b>Bondage & Discipline</b>â??s latest single \"First Kiss\" this Saturday, February 28th at Ortlieb\'s along with <b>Resistor</b> and <b>Blood Sound</b>!  It\'s part of the <i>Winter of Y-Not</i> concert series and you can <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them <a href=\"http://ortliebslounge.ticketfly.com/event/773387-bondage-discipline-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>here</a>. <i>Listen to \"First Kiss\" <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/ynotradio/bondage-discipline-first-kiss\" target=_blank\">here</a>.</i>','http://i61.tinypic.com/2s6jx8g.jpg','contests.php',4,'y'),(369,'2015-01-19','2015-01-26','Knox Hamilton Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday for our next <em>Y-Not Bunker Session</em> with Little Rock, Arkansas band <strong>Knox Hamilton</strong>! Hear them playing acoustic versions of their single â??Work It Outâ? and another song from their upcoming debut EP, plus chatting with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>.  Knox Hamiltonâ??s <em>Bunker Session</em> airs Friday at 2pm and 10pm, plus Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','http://www.arktimes.com/binary/2156/1361471566-knox_hamilton.jpg','http://www.knoxhamilton.com/',1,'n'),(370,'2015-02-06','2015-02-16','The Districts Valentine\'s Takeover','As local favorites <b>The Districts</b> get ready to release their new album <i>A Flourish and a Spoil</i> and play a sold out show at Union Transfer, they\'re going to be sharing some of their favorite love songs on a special <i>Valentine\'s Day Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>.  Tune in and be struck by their arrow on Friday at 1pm or 10pm.','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-n50viIg6QNg/VNTd8gsdUEI/AAAAAAAABOo/GVvrQjsN8Rw/s1600/0Districts_Valentines.jpg','http://thedistrictsband.com/',4,'y'),(371,'2015-02-06','2015-02-16','The Districts Valentine\'s Takeover','Local favorites <b>The Districts</b> released their new album <i>A Flourish and a Spoil</i> this week and play a sold out show at Union Transfer on Saturday, but they\'re also took over Y-Not Radio on Friday!  In you missed the special <i>Valentine\'s Day Radio Takeover</i> with The Districts sharing some of their favorite love songs, tune in for the replay on Sunday at 8pm or catch it <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. See them perform \"Peaches\" on <i><a href=\"http://www.nbc.com/late-night-with-seth-meyers/video/the-districts-performance-peaches/2846424?onid=146956#vc146956=2\" target=_blank>Late Night with Seth Meyers</a></i>.','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-2Of9P6iIbT0/VNThteJz49I/AAAAAAAABO0/anDWU4agZbs/s1600/0Districts_Valentines.jpg','http://thedistrictsband.com/',1,'n'),(372,'2015-02-23','2015-03-31','From Y100 Rocks To Y-Not: 10 Years Off The Air','On February 24th, 2005, Philadelphiaâ??s alternative station <b>Y100</b> went off the air and was reborn as <b>Y100Rocks.com</b>!  To celebrate a decade of broadcasting online, <b>Y-Not Radio</b> will welcome back voices from the past over the next few weeks to share music and memories.  Tune in this Wednesday at 2pm for <b>Jeff St. Pierre</b>, Thursday at 3pm for <b>Liam Static</b>, and Friday at 1pm for the man who started it all, </b>Jim McGuinn<b>!  <i>Plus, check out tons of photos from the past 10 years being posted all week long on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.918139514871611.1073741838.137798016239102&type=1\" target=_blank>Facebook</a>.','images/yrocks_logo.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.918139514871611.1073741838.137798016239102&type=1',2,'y'),(373,'2015-02-23','2015-03-31','From Y100 Rocks To Y-Not: 10 Years Off The Air','On February 24th, 2005, Philadelphiaâ??s alternative station <b>Y100</b> went off the air and was reborn as <b>Y100Rocks.com</b>!  To celebrate a decade of broadcasting online, <b>Y-Not Radio</b> will welcome back voices from the past over the next few weeks to share music and memories.  Tune in this Wednesday at 2pm for <b>Jeff St. Pierre</b>, Thursday at 3pm for <b>Liam Static</b>, and Friday at 1pm for the man who started it all, <b>Jim McGuinn</b>!  <i>Plus, check out tons of photos from the past 10 years being posted all week long on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.918139514871611.1073741838.137798016239102&type=1\" target=_blank>Facebook</a>.','images/yrocks_logo.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.918139514871611.1073741838.137798016239102&type=1',2,'y'),(374,'2015-02-23','2015-05-31','From Y100 Rocks To Y-Not:<br>10 Years Later, We\'re Still Alive','<b>Y-Not Radio</b> has been celebrating a decade of broadcasting online.  If you missed any of the voices from the past who returned to guest host shows, you can hear them  all <a href=\"y100rocks\">On Demand</a>.  And be sure to check out tons of photos from the past 10 years on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.918139514871611.1073741838.137798016239102&type=1\" target=_blank>Y-Not\'s Facebook</a>.','images/yrocks_logo.jpg','y100rocks',10,'y'),(375,'2015-03-03','2015-03-15','2:54 Britspotting Bunker Session','Tune in Monday nights from 8-10 for <em>Britspotting</em> - two hours of Brit rock, new and old, with\r\nY-Not Radioâ??s resident anglophile <strong>Matt McGrath</strong>! Tune in for the replay this Saturday, March 14th at 4pm as Matt welcomes London band <strong>2:54</strong> to the Bunker for an acoustic session & interview! ','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/41/29/75-atmd1.jpg','http://www.twofiftyfour.net/',5,'n'),(376,'2015-03-16','2015-03-23','Springtime Carnivore Y-Not Session','Tune in this Sunday at 8pm the replay of Y-Not\'s first ever live session at <a href=\"http://www.spicehousesound.com/\" target=_blank><b>Spice House Sound</b></a> with <b>Springtime Carnivore</b>!  <b>Greta Morgan</b> and her new band joined us to perform songs from their self-titled debut and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.  ','http://d1tv3qoauyxova.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/SrpingtmeCarnivore-Large-360x240.jpg','http://www.springtimecarnivore.com/',1,'n'),(377,'2015-03-23','2015-03-30','Screaming Females Radio Takeover','Tune in this Sunday at 8pm for the replay of our latest <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i> with New Brunswick, NJ\'s (and sorta Philly\'s too) <b>Screaming Females</b>!  <b>Marissa</b>, <b>Mike</b>, and <b>Jarrett</b> chatted with Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> before their album release show a few weeks ago and shared some of their favorite songs, plus tracks from their new record <i>Rose Mountain</i>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/38/74/61-atlg.jpg','http://screamingfemales.com/',2,'n'),(378,'2015-03-24','2015-04-30','Modern Rock Madness 2015','After 5 days of fierce competition, the 2015 <i>Modern Rock Madness</i> champions are <b>Garbage</b>! Congrats to <b>Shirley</b>, <b>Butch</b>, <b>Duke</b>, and <b>Steve</b> on defying the odds to win it all!  See how it all went down <a href=\"madness.php\">here</a> and read <b>Joey O</b>\'s recap at <a href=\"http://www.tristateindie.com/and-your-2015-modern-rock-madness-champion-is/\" target=_blank>Tri State Indie</a>.  <i>Brought to you by <a href=\"http://sixpoint.com\" target=_blank><b>Sixpoint Brewery</b></a>.</i>','images/mrm2015-small.jpg','madness.php',9,'n'),(379,'2015-04-13','2015-04-17','Win Matt and Kim Tickets','<b>Matt and Kim</b> return to Philadelphia this Friday, April 17th for a sold out show at The Electric Factory in support of their new album <i>New Glow</i>.  Enter to win a pair of tickets at <a href=\"contests\">HERE</a> by Thursday at 3pm.','http://dtfjihky7xwic.cloudfront.net/sites/default/files/styles/events_module_thumbnail/public/media/MattandKIMWEB.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(380,'2015-04-20','2015-04-27','The Wombats Radio Takeover','<strong>The Wombats</strong> are returning to Philadelphia this Thursday night at <a href=\"https://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/727605\" target=\"_blank\">Union Transfer</a> in support of their just released third album <em>Glitterbug</em>!  You can hear <b>Dan</b> and <b>Tord</b> playing guest DJ for <em>The Wombats Y-Not Radio Takeover</em> encore on Sunday night at 8. ','http://astra-berlin.de/img/infos/d29a9bca2b56f4281113a59739ee63b0.jpg','http://www.thewombats.co.uk/',1,'n'),(381,'2015-06-01','2015-06-30','Y-Not Radio 5th Anniversary Show','This July Y-Not Radio will celebrate our 5th anniversary and we want you to join us for a show with <b>Dave Monks</b> of <b>Tokyo Police Club</b> and <b>Fort Lean</b> on Thursday, July 9th at MilkBoy!  <i><a href=\"contests.php\"><b>Enter to win tickets</b></a> or buy them <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/855497-david-monks-tokyo-police-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</i>','http://dinealonerecords.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/MONKSCOVER_FINAL_WEB-210x210.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(382,'2015-04-27','2015-05-04','Speedy Ortiz Radio Takeover','<b>Speedy Ortiz</b> just released their sophomore album <i>Foil Deer</i> last week and played to a packed Johnny Brenda\'s crowd on Sunday night.  Tune in this Friday at 1pm (or Sunday at 9pm) as <b>Sadie Dupois</b> and the band guest DJ for another <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>!  And check out our review of <i>Foil Deer</i> <a href=\"cdoftheweek.php?id=272\">here</a>.','http://d107726cnz3kjh.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/speedy_ortiz-296x198.png','http://speedyortiz.com/',1,'n'),(383,'2015-05-04','2015-05-09','Lost Lander Bunker Session','Portland, OR\'s <strong>Lost Lander</strong> are playing Friday night at <a href=\"http://www.northstarbar.com/event/818957-holiday-mountain-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">The North Star Bar</a> in support of their new album <em>Medallion</em>.  Before the show they\'ll be stopping by the The Bunker to perform live and chat with Josh T. Landow at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em>.  Or catch the replay at 10pm.','https://s3.amazonaws.com/img.tagloom.com/sm/2-13/ot94/0df9df42d76790bdc43d590016b403c9d7f0547d.jpg','http://lost-lander.com/',1,'n'),(384,'2015-05-11','2015-05-18','Dreamers Y-Not Session','Tune in this Friday for another <em>Y-Not Session</em> at <a href=\"http://www.cambridgesoundstudios.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Cambridge Sound Studios</a> with New York City band <strong>Dreamers</strong>!  Hear their live performance of songs from their debut EP and an interview with Y-Notâ??s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> this Friday at 2pm or 10pm.  <em>And catch Dreamers when they return to Philly on Sunday, May 31st at <a href=\"http://www.johnnybrendas.com/event/843357-dreamers-gringo-star-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">Johnny Brendaâ??s</a> with <strong>Gringo Starr</strong>.</em>','http://i62.tinypic.com/vg3r40.jpg','http://www.dreamersuniverse.com/',1,'n'),(385,'2015-06-01','2015-05-31','Win Dreamers Tickets','This Sunday, May 31st, Y-Not Radio Presents <b>Dreamers</b> along with <b>Gringo Star</b> at Johnny Brenda\'s and we\'re giving you the chance to win a pair of tickets. <strong><a href=\"pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2\">Enter here</a></strong> or buy them <a href=\"http://www.johnnybrendas.com/event/843357-dreamers-gringo-star-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.   And check out Dreamers\' Y-Not Session from a few weeks ago <a href=\"ondemand.php?id=300\">On Demand</a>.','http://ak-hdl.buzzfed.com/static/2015-05/22/14/enhanced/webdr06/enhanced-22809-1432319074-13.jpg','pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2',3,'n'),(386,'2015-05-18','2015-05-26','<font size=2>Y-Not\'s Memorial Day Block Party Weekend</font>','Kick off the summer with Y-Not Radio as the soundtrack to your Memorial Day weekend as we play blocks of your favorite indie rock artists from Friday thru Monday!','http://www.crnogorski-online.me/lat/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/1231.png','schedule.php',2,'n'),(387,'2015-06-08','2015-06-30','Hippo Campus Session Video','Minnesota buzz band <strong>Hippo Campus</strong> recently performed a live Y-Not Session at <a href=\"http://bourbonandbranchphilly.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Bourbon & Branch</a>!  You can hear them playing songs from their debut EP and chatting with Y-Notâ??s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> and see videos of the session <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCU-3H3z2lUw1Ls8AP7qDjcA\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</i>','https://alkupra.files.wordpress.com/2015/03/hippo-campus.jpg?w=360&h=240&crop=1','http://hippocampusband.com/',6,'y'),(388,'2015-05-31','2015-06-04','Win Gentlemen of The Road Tickets','Y-Not Radio has one last chance for you to win a pair of passes for the <i>Gentlemen of The Road Stopover Festival</i> in Seaside Heights, NJ on June 5th and 6th, featuring <b>The Flaming Lips</b>, <b>Jenny Lewis</b>, <b>The Vaccines</b>,  and many more!  <a href=\"pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2\">ENTER HERE</a> by Wednesday at Noon or buy tickets at <a href=\"http://www.gentlemenoftheroad.com/stopovers/seaside-heights/\" target=_blank>GentlemenOfTheRoad.com</a>.','http://static-label.frontgatetickets.com/common/events/103380_lg.jpg','pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2',2,'y'),(389,'2015-05-31','2015-06-04','Win Gentlemen of The Road Tickets','Y-Not Radio has one last chance for you to win a pair of passes for the <i>Gentlemen of The Road Stopover Festival</i> in Seaside Heights, NJ on June 5th and 6th, featuring <b>The Flaming Lips</b>, <b>Jenny Lewis</b>, <b>The Vaccines</b>,  and many more!  <a href=\"pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> by Wednesday at Noon or buy tickets at <a href=\"http://www.gentlemenoftheroad.com/stopovers/seaside-heights/\" target=_blank>GentlemenOfTheRoad.com</a>.','http://static-label.frontgatetickets.com/common/events/103380_lg.jpg','pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2',1,'y'),(390,'2015-06-02','2015-06-02','test','test','http://www.ynotradio.net/imgs/header_front.png','http://www.ynotradio.net/imgs/header_front.png',1,'n'),(392,'2015-09-01','2015-09-01','San Cisco Radio Takeover','Tune in this Friday at 1pm or 10pm for the latest <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover </i>with Australian band <b>San Cisco</b>! Hear them play some of their favorite songs of the moment from <b>Alabama Shakes</b>, <b>Frank Ocean</b>, <b>Mark Ronson</b>, <b>Ratatat</b>, and more, plus tracks from their new album <i>Gracetown</i>, and talk about the album with <i>Y-Not Internacional</i> host <b>Gil</b>. \r\n\r\n<!--Tune in this Friday for a brand new session with <b>Torres</b>!  Torres aka <b>Mackenzie Scott</b> performed stripped down versions of songs from her latest album <i>Sprinter</i> and chatted with Y-Not\'s <b>Rob Huff</b> live in The Bunker.  Hear the session this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> or at 10pm, with another playback on Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.-->','http://cps-static.rovicorp.com/3/JPG_250/MI0003/840/MI0003840945.jpg','http://www.sancisco.com/',11,'n'),(393,'2015-06-22','2015-06-26','Y-Not @ Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll','This Thursday is the return of the <em>Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll</em> from 5:30-8:30pm between 43rd & 51st Streets in West Philly. Get $1 specials from all the local businesses!   Y-Not Radio will be DJing all evening outside of <strong>Little Babyâ??s Ice Cream</strong> at 49th Street. Stop by our table for free CDs and a chance to win tickets for <strong>Interpol</strong> at Festival Pier or <strong>The Vaccines</strong> at The TLA!','http://i62.tinypic.com/xkqhd4.jpg','http://www.universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',2,'n'),(394,'2015-06-22','2015-06-29','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> for an hour of the latest music from Down Under including tunes from <strong>The Creases</strong>, <strong>The Belligerents</strong>, <strong>King Gizzard &amp; The Lizard Wizard</strong>, <strong>Redspencer</strong>, and more!','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','schedule.php',2,'n'),(395,'2015-06-29','2015-07-04','<font size=2>Independence Day Britspotting Marathon</font>','Here at Y-Not Radio we celebrate our independence by listening to music from the empire whose tyrannical rule we escaped in 1776. Kick off your July 4th weekend with our annual <i>Britspotting</i> marathon!  Enjoy music exclusively from across the pond with our own <b>Matt McGrath</b> all day Friday, July 3rd, from 10am-Midnight. Hear new episodes on Monday nights at 8 with encores on Saturdays at 4pm.','https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1498946500/britspotting.jpg','https://twitter.com/britspotting',2,'n'),(396,'2015-07-01','2015-07-10','Y-Not 5th Anniversary Show','Y-Not Radio is celebrating our 5th anniversary and we want you to join us for a show with <b>Dave Monks</b> of <b>Tokyo Police Club</b> and <b>Fort Lean</b> on Thursday, July 9th at MilkBoy!  <em> <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>Enter to win tickets</b></a> or buy them <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/855497-david-monks-tokyo-police-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://dinealonerecords.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/MONKSCOVER_FINAL_WEB-210x210.jpg','contests.php',2,'y'),(397,'2015-07-01','2015-07-10','Y-Not 5th Anniversary Show','Y-Not Radio is celebrating our 5th anniversary and we want you to join us TONIGHT at MilkBoy for a show with <b>Dave Monks</b> of <b>Tokyo Police Club</b> and <b>Fort Lean</b>!  Buy tickets <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/855497-david-monks-tokyo-police-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> or at the door.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/53/86/29-atxl1.jpg','http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/855497-david-monks-tokyo-police-philadelphia/',1,'n'),(398,'2015-07-20','2015-07-27','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for a new episode of <i>Aussie Unlocked</i> with <b>Shana</b> to hear the latest music from Down Under including <b>Major Leagues</b>, <b>Ella Thompson</b>, \r\n<b>Tame Impala</b>, <b>The Ocean Party</b>, and more! \r\n','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','schedule.php',3,'n'),(399,'2015-07-27','2015-08-03','Y-Not @ 2nd Street Festival','This Sunday, August 2nd, the <i>2nd Street Festival</i> returns to Northern Liberties between Germantown and Brown Streets with live music all day on two stages featuring <strong>Tutlie</strong>, <strong>Field Mouse</strong>, <strong>Louds</strong>, <strong>Palmas</strong>, <strong>The Extraordinaires</strong>, <strong>Dogs On Acid</strong>, <strong>Northern Arms</strong>, <strong>Satellite Hearts</strong>, and many more! The festival runs from Noon-10pm and itâ??s all free! <br /><br />\r\nY-Not Radio will be out all day, DJing between bands at the Brown Street Stage, plus we\'ll have free CDs and a chance for you to  win <strong>Tame Impala</strong> tickets. Tune in to this weekâ??s episode of <em>Y-Not Philly</em> on Wednesday at 11am or 10pm for a festival preview, and get more info plus the full list of bands <a href=\"http://www.2ndstfestival.org/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://static.tumblr.com/d9d7370664ecfa6819642fadfbe39955/kihyt3q/HM7njmoow/tumblr_static_ctu7caxml544gwgkko0sksgw0.gif','http://www.2ndstfestival.org/',1,'n'),(400,'2015-07-27','2015-08-04','Fort Lean Y-Not MilkBoy Session','Last month Brooklyn\'s <b>Fort Lean</b> joined <b>Dave Monks</b> for Y-Not Radio\'s 5th Anniversary Show at <a href=\"http://milkboyphilly.com\" target=_blank>MilkBoy</a>.  Tune in this Friday at 3:30 or 11pm to hear songs from their live set plus their chat with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b>!  (Or catch another replay on Sunday morning at 11 during the <i>Y-Not Session Shuffle</i>.)','http://atypicalbeastsagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/fortlean-cover-640x510-345x299.jpg','http://www.fortlean.com/',2,'n'),(401,'2015-10-30','2015-10-31','CHVRCHÎ?S Radio Takeover','If you missed the <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i> with <b>CHVRCHÎ?S</b>, tune in for the replay this Sunday at 7pm!  Hear <b>Lauren</b>, <b>Iain</b>, and <b>Martin</b> play some of their favorite tunes and chat with Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Rob Huff</b> about their new album <i>Every Open Eye</i>.<br><br>\r\n<i><a href=\"donate.php\">Make a donation</a> to Y-Not this week and get a copy of Every Open Eye as our thank you gift.</i>','http://i58.tinypic.com/1zx8hw4.jpg','http://www.chvrch.es',11,'n'),(402,'2015-08-13','2015-08-25','Silversun Pickups @ Main St. Music','Y-Not Radio is teaming up with <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pages/MainStreetMusicPA/109854695706800\" target=_blank>Main Street Music</a> in Manayunk to give you a chance to attend an intimate and exclusive acoustic performance with <b>Silversun Pickups</b> on Wed. August 26th!  Album pre-order passes are now sold out so we have your last chance to win your way in.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE!</b></a> Silversun Pickups\' new album <i>Better Nature</i> will be in stores on September 25th.','http://www.mixdownmag.com.au/sites/default/files/styles/teaser_307x220/public/images/14369775039V7B0358.%20ONLINEjpg.jpg','contests.php',1,'y'),(403,'2015-08-31','2015-09-08','Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day Weekend','This Labor Day Weekend, the Y-Not DJs may be off, but the music will be live! From Friday through Monday weâ??ll be playing tracks from <i>Y-Not Sessions</i>, old <i>Y100</i> and <i>WDRE Sonic Sessions</i>, and plenty of other live album tracks as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"mobile.php\">iRadioPhilly app</a> for iPhone or Android and make <i>Y-Notâ??s Live Labor Day</i> the soundtrack for your end of summer festivities!','https://dev.opendrive.com/api/v1/download/file.json/106736924_Xh08f?inline=1','schedule.php',1,'n'),(404,'2015-09-05','2015-09-11','Win CRUISR Tickets','Y-Not Philly favorites <b>CRUISR</b>, <b>Cheerleader</b>, and <b>Cold Fronts</b> all play together this Saturday, September 12th at The T.L.A. and weâ??re giving away more tickets this week! <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair!  You can also purchase tickets <a href=\"http://concerts.livenation.com/event/02004EC9CCFE55EB\" target=_blank>here</a>.','https://jumpphilly.files.wordpress.com/2015/01/barbary_3_cruisr_006.jpg?w=600&h=401','contests.php',4,'n'),(405,'2015-09-14','2015-09-18','Y-Not @ Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll','This Thursday is the return of theÂ <em>Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll</em>Â fromÂ <span data-term=\"goog_618342216\" tabindex=\"0\">5:30-8:30pm</span>Â between 43rd &amp; 51st Streets in West Philly. Get $1 specials from all the local businesses! Y-Not Radio will be DJing all evening outside ofÂ <strong>Little Baby&rsquo;s Ice Cream</strong>Â at 49th Street. Stop by our tent for free CDs and a chance to win tickets forÂ <strong>Alt-J</strong>Â at on Septmber 25th at Festival Pier orÂ <strong>The Fratellis</strong>Â on September 22nd at The TLA!','http://i60.tinypic.com/260wqb6.jpg','http://www.universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',2,'n'),(406,'2015-09-14','2015-09-21','Transmission w/ Tamaryn Interview','Tune in Thursday nights from 9-11pm or Saturdays from 6-8pm for <em>Transmission</em> â?? 2 hours of alternative electronic and dance music with <strong>Rob Huff</strong>!    This week Rob chats with <strong>Tamaryn</strong> and features tracks from her new album <em>Cranekiss</em>. ','http://41.media.tumblr.com/0c4111c45c29aacf90e77073e5a0ba90/tumblr_nkm99pb4bj1rbcnqbo2_1280.jpg','http://tamarynmusic.com/',3,'n'),(407,'2015-09-14','2015-09-21','Choice Tasters Lounge w/ Lushlife','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for this monthâ??s <em>Choice Tasters Lounge </em>with <strong>Jersey Dan</strong>, featuring an interview and mini-takeover from Philly hip-hop artist <strong>Lushlife</strong>!','http://images.playgroundmag.net/noticias/lanzamientos-musicales/Lushlife-presenta-Plateau-Vision_PLYIMA20120306_0006_34.jpg','http://www.theyoungandinlove.com/',5,'n'),(408,'2015-09-14','2015-09-19','Win Cribs Tickets','U.K. band <strong>The Cribs</strong> will be in town next week, on Monday, September 21st, at Underground Arts in support of their latest album <em>For All My Sisters</em>.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> to win a pair of tickets to see them  or <a href=\"http://www.ticketweb.com/t3/sale/SaleEventDetail?dispatch=loadSelectionData&amp;eventId=6061565&amp;pl=uarts\" target=\"_blank\">buy tickets here</a>. ','http://static.gigwise.com/artists/cribs_hmv_manc_shirlaine_600.jpg','contests.php',1,'n'),(409,'2015-09-21','2015-09-28','Worriers Bunker Session','Tune in this Friday for a brand new Bunker Session with <b>Worriers</b>! The Brooklyn punk band led by <b>Lauren Denitzio</b> stopped in to play acoustic versions of songs from their new album <i>Imaginary Life</i> and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>. Hear the session this Friday at 3:30pm during Future Friday or at 10pm, with another playback on Sunday at 11am during the Y-Not Session Shuffle.','https://s3.amazonaws.com/img.tagloom.com/sm/9r36/dn92/ecbcef751b8fb548f96092e78e004673d590484c.jpg','http://worriersmusic.tumblr.com/',4,'n'),(410,'2015-09-21','2015-09-28','Win Wolf Alice Tickets','<b>Wolf Alice</b> returns to Philly next week, on Wednesday, September 30th, at The Trocadero in support of their debut album <i>My Love Is Cool</i>.  <a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER HERE</a> to win a pair of tickets to see them with <b>Drenge</b> and <b>Made Violent</b> or buy tickets <a href=\"http://www.thetroc.com/event/921273-wolf-alice-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>here</a>.  And listen to <i>Britspotting</i> host <b>Matt McGrath</b>\'s interview with lead singer <b>Ellie Rowsell</b> <a href=\"ondemand.php?id=294\">On Demand</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/36/85/99-atlg.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(411,'2015-09-24','2015-09-28','Aussie Unlocked','On the 4th Friday of every month, Y-Not\'s </b>Shana</b> takes you on a trip down under for <i>Aussie Unlocked</i>!  Tune in this time for a special 2 hour edition with new music from <b>King Gizzard & The Lizard Wizard</b>, <b>The Jungle Giants</b>, <b>Morning Harvey</b> and lots more!  Hear it on Friday from 8-10pm or Sunday from 7-9pm.','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','schedule.php',5,'n'),(412,'2015-09-24','2015-09-28','New Music POPE-pourri','In celebration of <b>Pope Francis</b>\' visit to Philadelphia and a ton of new indie rock albums being released this week, Y-Not Radio will present a <i>New Music Pope-pourri</i> this weekend!  Tune in while you\'re trapped at home or while escaping the city and hear brand new tracks from <strong>Silversun Pickups</strong>, <strong>CHVRCHES</strong>, <strong>The Dead Weather</strong>, <strong>Kurt Vile</strong>, <strong>Editors</strong>, <strong>Metric</strong>, <strong>The Dears</strong>, <strong>Big Grams</strong>,<strong> New Order</strong>, <strong>Robert DeLong</strong>, and lots more... ','http://i61.tinypic.com/2d8q89l.jpg','http://www.iradiophilly.com/index.php?idStation=42',1,'n'),(413,'2016-01-29','2016-01-30','Y-Not Sessions: Best of 2015','This Friday at 3pm or Sunday at 10am, tune in to hear 2 hours of the best <em>Y-Not Session</em> tracks from the past year including <strong>Hippo Campus</strong>, <strong>Dreamers</strong>, <strong>Springtime Carnivore</strong>, <strong>Worriers</strong>, <strong>Geographer</strong>, <strong>Torres</strong>, <strong>Beach Slang</strong>, <strong>Cold Fronts</strong>, <strong>Dave Monks</strong>, <strong>Teen Men</strong>, <strong>Lithuania</strong>, <strong>PWR BTTM</strong>, <strong>Generationals</strong>, <strong>Potty Mouth</strong>, <strong>Purple</strong>, <strong>Zella Day</strong>, and lots more...','http://i62.tinypic.com/9qwa4x.jpg','ondemand.php',10,'y'),(414,'2015-09-28','2015-09-30','Win Wavves Tickets','<b>Wavves</b> return to Philly this Wed. September 30th at The T.L.A. along with <strong>Twin Peaks</strong>, in support of their new album <i>V</i>.   <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a>  to win a pair of tickets to see them or buy tickets <a href=\"http://concerts.livenation.com/event/02004ED2C035561E\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://cleverock.cleverockcom1.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/Wavves2-Paley_Fairman-400x266.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(415,'2015-10-05','2015-10-08','Y-Not On The Air @ WKDU','Y-Not Radio is happy to announce that weâ??re coming back to the FM dial in Philadelphia as part of <b>WKDU</b>â??s <i>Crewcast</i> series, featuring rotating guest hosts each week.  Y-Notâ??s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> will be on monthly with various members of our crew, first up being <i>Britspotting</i> host <b>Matt McGrath</b>.  Tune in for the first episode this Wednesday from 3-4pm at 91.7fm in Philly and worldwide at <a href=\"http://wkdu.org\" target=_blank>WKDU.org</a>.','http://4.bp.blogspot.com/--SmP6B5v6Cs/VhKKJjmYwaI/AAAAAAAABjo/VsmoQOk4Yfc/s320/wkdu.png','http://wkdu.org/program/crewcast',4,'n'),(416,'2015-10-05','2015-10-10','Win Electric Six Tickets','The legendary <b>Electric Six</b> return to Philly in support of their new album <i>Bitch, Donâ??t Let Me Die</i> on Monday, October 12th at MilkBoy with<strong> Yip Deceiver</strong> and <strong>Travel Lanes</strong>.   <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a>  to win a pair of tickets to see them, or buy tickets <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/891177-electric-six-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/00/11/49/19-atlg.JPG','contests.php',2,'n'),(417,'2015-10-26','2015-10-31','Win JR JR Tickets','The recently re-named <strong>JR JR</strong> are coming to Union Transfer on Tuesday, November 3rd in support of their new self-titled album and we have a chance for you to win a pair of tickets!  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> or buy tickets at <a href=\"http://www.utphilly.com/event/888091-dale-earnhardt-jr-jr-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>UTphilly.com</a>.  <i>And stay tuned for details about next week\'s JR JR Radio Takeover...</i>','http://i66.tinypic.com/hrbzgm.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(418,'2015-10-12','2015-10-15','Win Eternal Summers Tickets','Virginia trio <b>Eternal Summers</b> return to Philly this Thursday night, October 15th, at Bourbon & Branch, in support of their brand new album <i>Gold and Stone</i> with local bands <b>Suburban Living</b> and <b>Mercury Girls</b>. <a href=\"pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2\">ENTER HERE</a> to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"http://bourbonandbranchphilly.com/event/eternal-summers-suburban-living-mercury-girls/\" target=_blank>BourbonAndBranchPhilly.com</a>.','http://cdn2-b.examiner.com/sites/default/files/styles/image_content_width/hash/12/50/1250cb0700e6e1c565ea6ad78f509b74.jpg','pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2',5,'n'),(419,'2015-11-02','2015-11-09','JR JR Radio Takeover','<b>JR JR</b> (formerly <b>Dale Earnhardt Jr. Jr.</b>) are in town this week at Union Transfer on Tuesday, and they\'ll be taking some time to guest DJ for the next <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>! Tune in this Friday at 2pm or Sunday at 9pm to hear JR JR picking out some of their favorite music and chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> about their new album.  <em>Tickets for JR JR\'s show are still available <a href=\"http://www.utphilly.com/event/888091-dale-earnhardt-jr-jr-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</em>','http://i66.tinypic.com/2dkbned.jpg','http://www.jrjrmusic.com/jrjr',1,'n'),(420,'2015-11-02','2015-11-10','Win Public Image Ltd. Tickets','<strong>John Lydon</strong> and <strong>Public Image Ltd.</strong> are coming to The Trocadero this Wednesday, November 11th in support of their new album <em>What The World Needs Now...</em> <a href=\"/contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"http://www.thetroc.com/event/939919-public-image-ltd-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">TheTroc.com</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/68/11/47-atlg.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(421,'2016-01-30','2016-01-31','Y-Not On The Air @ WKDU','Y-Not Radio returns to the FM dial once again this week as part of <strong>WKDU</strong>â??s <i>Crewcast</i> series, on Wednesday from 3-4pm.  Join <strong> Josh T. Landow</strong> to hear the latest Y-Not favorite tunes, and some recent Y-Not Session tracks from <strong>PWR BTTM</strong>, <strong>Car Seat Headrest</strong>, and <strong>Queen of Jeans</strong>.  Tune in this Wednesday from 3-4pm at 91.7fm in Philly and worldwide at <a href=\"http://wkdu.org/\" target=\"_blank\">WKDU.org</a>. ','https://4.bp.blogspot.com/--SmP6B5v6Cs/VhKKJjmYwaI/AAAAAAAABjo/VsmoQOk4Yfc/s320/wkdu.png','http://wkdu.org/program/crewcast',10,'n'),(422,'2015-12-31','2015-12-31','Win Vacationer Tickets','Philly\'s own <strong>Vacationer</strong> will be celebrating the Thanksgiving weekend on Saturday night at Union Transfer and you can enter to win a pair of tickets <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong> HERE</strong></a>! Tickets are available to buy at <a href=\"http://www.utphilly.com/event/899393-vacationer-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>UTPhilly.com</a>.','http://i68.tinypic.com/1t7aiw.jpg','contests.php',11,'n'),(423,'2015-11-23','2015-11-27','Y-Not\'s Turkey Day Takeovers','Happy Thanksgiving everybody! Tune in on Thanksgiving Day starting at 9am as Y-Not Radio continues the tradition of <i>Turkey Day Takeovers</i>, featuring this year\'s guest DJ sets from the likes of <strong>CHVRCHÎ?S</strong>, <strong>The Wombats</strong>, <strong>JR JR</strong>, <strong>The Districts</strong>, <strong>The Vaccines</strong>, <strong>Speedy Ortiz</strong>, <strong>Screaming Females</strong>, <strong>San Cisco</strong>, and <strong>Robert DeLong</strong>. Check out the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>. ','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',1,'n'),(424,'2015-11-23','2015-11-30','Y-Not\'s Small Business Saturday Sale','Help Y-Not end the year in the black with doorbuster savings of $5 off Y-Not T-Shirts and CDs available as donation thank you gifts. Albums to choose from include <strong>Beach Slang</strong>, <strong>Foals</strong>, <strong>Beach House</strong>, <strong>Albert Hammond Jr.</strong>, <strong>Muse</strong>, and more. <a href=\"http://www.ynotradio.net/donate.php\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Click here to donate.</strong></a>','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-hmQeTG5sae0/Vln6fGIFpSI/AAAAAAAABqU/9A9OkB-iqpk/s1600/SmallBusinessSaturday.jpg','donate.php',1,'n'),(425,'2015-11-30','2015-12-07','Surfer Blood Radio Takeover','<b>Surfer Blood</b> was just in town last week and <b>Josh T. Landow</b> caught up with frontman <b>John Paul Pitts</b> for another <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>! Hear John\'s guest DJ set including music from <b>Courtney Barnett</b>, <b>Stephen Malkmus</b>, <b>Deerhunter</b>, <b>T. Rex</b> and more, plus tracks from Surfer Blood\'s new album <i>1000 Palms</b> this Friday at 2pm or Sunday at 9pm. <i>Donate to Surfer Blood guitarist <b>Thomas Fekete</b>\'s medical fund <a href=\"http://www.surferblood.com/thomas-auction\" target=_blank>here</a>.</i>','https://aestheticmag.files.wordpress.com/2015/02/mg_3797-copy-copy.jpg','http://www.surferblood.com/',2,'y'),(426,'2015-11-30','2015-12-07','Surfer Blood Radio Takeover','<b>Surfer Blood</b> was just in town last week and <b>Josh T. Landow</b> caught up with frontman <b>John Paul Pitts</b> for another <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>! Hear JP\'s guest DJ set including music from <b>Courtney Barnett</b>, <b>Stephen Malkmus</b>, <b>Deerhunter</b>, <b>T. Rex</b> and more, plus tracks from Surfer Blood\'s new album <i>1000 Palms</i> this Friday at 2pm or Sunday at 9pm. <i>Donate to Surfer Blood guitarist <b>Thomas Fekete</b>\'s medical fund <a href=\"http://www.surferblood.com/thomas-auction\" target=_blank>here</a>.</i>','https://aestheticmag.files.wordpress.com/2015/02/mg_3797-copy-copy.jpg','http://www.surferblood.com/',2,'n'),(427,'2015-11-30','2016-01-30','Y-Not\'s Top 215 of 2015','If you missed any of <em>Y-Not\'s Top 215 of 2015</em> countdown, you can see the full list of song and all the Year End Poll results <a href=\"yearendpoll.php\">here</a>.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<em>The Top 215 of 2015 was brought to you by <strong>The Fillmore Philadelphia</strong>. Tickets for all Fillmore shows are available <a href=\"http://bit.ly/227HBkT\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</em>','images/Top215-square-300.png','yearendpoll.php',6,'n'),(428,'2015-12-07','2015-12-14','Car Seat Headrest Bunker Session','<b>Will Toledo </b> aka <b>Car Seat Headrest </b>was just in Philly over the weekend in support of his new album <i>Teens of Style </i>and he stopped by the Y-Not Bunker for an acoustic performance and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>. Tune in for Car Seat Headrest\'s <i>Bunker Session </i>this Friday at 3:30pm during <i>Future Friday </i>or at 10pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the <i>Y-Not Session Shuffle</i>.','http://236izu11yygk2uo6po3yerii7d6.wpengine.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/Car-Seat-300x300.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/Car-Seat-Headrest-143033959103037/',2,'n'),(429,'2015-12-07','2015-12-14','Aussie Unlocked: Best of 2015','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm  as Y-Not\'s <strong>Shana</strong> reveals the Best of 2015 from down under including <strong>Courtney Barnett</strong>, <strong>King Gizzard &amp; The Lizard Wizard</strong>,<strong> Tiny Little Houses</strong>, and lots more on the year end episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>! ','http://www.ynotradio.net/images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','yearendpoll.php',4,'n'),(430,'2015-12-07','2015-12-14','Aussie Unlocked: Best of 2015','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm  as Y-Not\'s <strong>Shana</strong> reveals the Best of 2015 from down under including <strong>Courtney Barnett</strong>, <strong>King Gizzard &amp; The Lizard Wizard</strong>,<strong> Tiny Little Houses</strong>, and lots more on the year end episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>! ','http://www.ynotradio.net/images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','yearendpoll.php',7,'y'),(431,'2015-12-21','2015-12-26','Y-Not Philly Holiday Special','Tune in on Wednesday at 11am or 10pm, or Christmas Day at 3pm for the annual <i>Y-Not Philly Holiday Special</i> featuring new Christmas music from Philadelphia area artists including <b>Free Energy</b>, <b>Spelling Reform</b>, <b>Maxx</b> from <b>Black Landlord</b>, <b>Abi Reimold</b>, <b>By Surprise</b>, and <b>It\'s A King Thing</b>, plus old favorites from <b>The Dead Milkmen</b>, <b>Dr. Dog</b>, <b>The Spinto Band</b>, <b>Buried Beds</b>, <b>GANG</b>, and moreâ?¦','http://www.dialaflight.com/blog/content/articles/article_101325/large/PhiladelphiaChristmas.jpg','/schedule.php',2,'n'),(432,'2015-12-28','2016-02-29','Support Y-Not Radio<br>+ Get Y-Not Sessions 2015','With only a week left in February, Y-Not Radio still needs to raise another $300 to pay our music royalty and streaming fees for the month.  Please help keep Y-Not on the air by making a donation today.  Weâ??ll say thanks by sending you a download of the new <em>Y-Not Sessions 2015 compilation</em>, a Y-Not T-Shirt, or your choice of new CDs from <strong>Animal Collective</strong>, <strong>Ra Ra Riot<strong>,</strong> Dr. Dog</strong>, <strong>Savages</strong>, <strong>Beach House</strong>, and more to pick from.  Thanks for your support!\r\n<!--Thanks to everyone who donated to Y-Notâ??s emergency new computer fund! With your help we raised enough to get a new Mac to keep broadcasting to you! But, if you didnâ??t get to help us with that, Y-Not Radio always needs your support, now more than ever with new music royalty rates in effect, which have more than doubled our monthly expenses!   Donate now and weâ??ll send you a download of the new <i>Y-Not Sessions 2015</i> compilation or your choice of a Y-Not T-Shirt or new CDs. -->\r\n<br><br>\r\n<center><a href=\"donate.php\"><em><strong>CLICK HERE TO MAKE YOUR DONATION TODAY</strong></em></a></center>','https://app.box.com/representation/file_version_48884393681/image_2048_jpg/1.jpg?shared_name=ypeag7o4lvasqucyb0flv215suj9s9t6','donate.php',5,'n'),(433,'2016-01-04','2016-01-11','Narc Twain Interview','<b>Jukebox The Ghost</b> singer / guitarist <b>Tommy Siegel</b> recently released an EP from his side project <b>Narc Twain</b> and Y-Notâ??s <b>Bek Henson</b> caught up with him at his Brooklyn EP release show to chat about it.  Hear the interview and songs from <i>Narc Twain</i> this Friday at 3:30pm during <i>Future Friday</i>.','https://f1.bcbits.com/img/a4127572991_7.jpg','https://narctwain.bandcamp.com/releases',4,'n'),(434,'2017-07-31','2018-12-31','Y-Not Philly w/ Beril','Tune in on <!--Wednesday at 11am or 10pm Saturday at 8pm or--><a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a> to hear the latest episode of <em>Y-Not Philly</em> featuring <b>Beril</b> (formerly of <strong>East Hundred</strong>) chatting with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> and sharing songs from her new EP, <em>Songs of Neptune</em>. Get the EP on <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/album/songs-of-neptune-single/id1184288136\" target=\"_blank\">iTunes</a> and find out more at <a href=\"https://www.berilmusic.com/\" target=\"_blank\">BerilMusic.com</a>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/03/06/9NaAv.jpg','https://www.berilmusic.com/',10,'y'),(435,'2016-01-11','2016-01-18','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for a this months\'s episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> to hear the latest music from Down Under including songs <strong>Step-Panther</strong>, <strong>BRVS</strong>, and more!','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','schedule.php',1,'n'),(436,'2016-01-11','2016-02-29','Y-Not & Internet Radio Need Your Help','Internet Radio as you know it is  in danger due to new royalty rates imposed by The Copyright Royalty Board, which eliminated longstanding provisions for smaller webcasters such as Y-Not Radio and iRadioPhilly. These higher rates threaten to cripple stations like ours, operating on small budgets, and make online broadcasting affordable only to large corporations. You can read more about this <a href=\"http://www.radiosurvivor.com/2016/01/05/why-american-independent-internet-radio-may-go-extinct-in-2016/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and voice your concerns via <a href=\"http://www.gopetition.com/petitions/opposition-to-copyright-royalty-boards-decision-on-hr-1733.html\" target=\"_blank\">this petition</a>. Don\'t let independent voices for independent music go silent. Thanks as always for your support. ','http://thumbnail.mixcloud.com/w/300/h/300/q/85/upload/images/extaudio/99a56ebd-c63c-42ab-848b-13f19a088f15.jpg','http://www.gopetition.com/petitions/opposition-to-copyright-royalty-boards-decision-on-hr-1733.html',9,'n'),(437,'2016-01-18','2016-01-31','Circa Waves Y-Not Session','Up and coming UK band <b>Circa Waves</b> recently opened for <b>Foals</b> in Philly at Union Transfer.  Before the show, their frontman <b>Kieran Shudall</b> stopped by <a href=\"http://sleeplesssound.com/\" target=_blank>Sleepless Sound Studio</a> to play a couple acoustic versions of songs from their debut album <i>Young Chasers</i> and to chat with Y-Not\'s <b>Matt McGrath</b>.  Tune in to hear Circa Wavesâ?? session during this week\'s episode of <i>Britspotting</i>, replaying on Saturday at 4pm, or listen <a href=\"ondemand.php>On Demand</a>.  Check out photos from their concert <a href=\"http://on.fb.me/1JVC4b8\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://amadwickeddangerousfolly.files.wordpress.com/2015/04/circa.jpg','http://circawaves.com/',3,'n'),(438,'2016-01-25','2016-02-06','R.I.P. Y-Not iMac, 2010-2016','Saturday\'s blizzard caused a power outage/surge that seems to have fried our trusty broadcast iMac that plays all the music for you. It served us well, running 24/7 for the last five and half years. We have things back up and running with some old and rented equipment for now, but will  have to purchase a new Mac this week in order to keep Y-Not alive for the long term. It\'s tough times and your support is needed and appreciated more than ever. If you want to help, you can do so <a href=\"donate.php\">here</a>. <em>Everyone who contributes to the new computer fund will be entered into a raffle to win the dead useless husk of the iMac, signed by all the Y-Not DJs (but the winner has to pick it up).</em> Thank you!','https://app.box.com/representation/file_version_52411708189/image_2048/1.png?shared_name=svpj9rsxidh74uhioq9oky0whlkjy5u9','donate.php',2,'y'),(439,'2016-01-28','2016-02-15','R.I.P. Y-Not iMac, 2010-2016','This past weekend\'s blizzard caused a power outage/surge at the Bunker that fried our trusty broadcast iMac that plays all the music for you. It served us well, running 24/7 with very few breaks for the last five and half years. We have things back up and running with some old and rented equipment for now, but will be purchasing a new Mac this week in order to keep Y-Not alive for the long term. It\'s tough times and your support is needed and appreciated more than ever. If you want to help, you can do so <a href=\"donate.php\">by making a donation</a>. <em>Everyone who contributes to the new computer fund will be entered into a raffle to win the dead useless husk of the iMac, signed by all the Y-Not DJs (but the winner has to pick it up). </em>Thank you!','https://app.box.com/representation/file_version_52411708189/image_2048/1.png?shared_name=svpj9rsxidh74uhioq9oky0whlkjy5u9','donate.php',2,'y'),(440,'2016-01-28','2016-02-15','R.I.P. Y-Not iMac, 2010-2016','This past weekend\'s blizzard caused a power outage/surge at the Bunker that fried our trusty broadcast iMac that plays all the music for you. It served us well, running 24/7 with very few breaks for the last five and half years. We have things back up and running with some old and rented equipment for now, but will be purchasing a new Mac this week in order to keep Y-Not alive for the long term. It\'s tough times and your support is needed and appreciated more than ever. If you want to help, you can do so <a href=\"donate.php\">by making a donation</a>. <em>Everyone who contributes to the new computer fund will be entered into a raffle to win the dead useless husk of the iMac, signed by all the Y-Not DJs (but the winner has to pick it up). </em>Thank you!','https://app.box.com/representation/file_version_52411708189/image_2048/1.png?shared_name=svpj9rsxidh74uhioq9oky0whlkjy5u9','donate.php',2,'y'),(441,'2016-02-08','2016-02-14','Oh Wonder Britspotting Interview','Tune in for this week\'s episode of <i>Britspotting</i> on Saturday from 4-6pm to hear <b>Matt McGrath</b>\'s interview with UK duo <b>Oh Wonder</b> and hear songs from their self-titled debut album. Or catch the interview on Friday at 4pm during <i>Future Friday</i>.','http://www.theaudiodb.com/images/media/artist/thumb/uwyysw1442506567.jpg/preview','http://ohwondermusic.com',2,'n'),(442,'2016-02-08','2016-02-15','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for new episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> to hear the latest music from Down Under including new songs from <strong>Good Morning</strong>, <strong>Gunns</strong>, <strong>Violent Soho</strong>, <strong>Cub Sport</strong>, <strong>The Good Sports</strong>, and more! ','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','shows.php',5,'n'),(443,'2016-02-15','2016-02-22','Baio Radio Takeover','<strong>Vampire Weekend</strong> bassist <strong>Chris Baio</strong> was in town last week in support of his solo album <em>The Names</em> and <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> caught up with him before his show for another <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>.  Tune in to hear Baioâ??s guest DJ set including music from <strong>David Bowie</strong>, <strong>Peter Gabriel</strong>, <strong>The Chemical Brothers</strong>, <strong>Depeche Mode</strong>, and more, plus tracks from <em>The Names</em>, this Sunday at 8pm.','http://40.media.tumblr.com/d4eda928bbd3e9e5d38864a7d7f51de9/tumblr_inline_nqrph4WCW91s0xcfm_500.jpg','http://baiobaio.com/',2,'n'),(444,'2016-02-22','2016-02-29','TEEN Y-Not Session','Brooklyn band <strong>TEEN</strong> were in Philly last week in advance of releasing their third album <em>Love Yes</em>, and while they were here, they recorded a <em>Y-Not Session</em> at <a href=\"http://www.spicehousesound.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Spice House Sound</strong></a>.  Hear their live performance and an interview with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em>, with replays on Friday at 9:30pm and Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','https://app.box.com/representation/file_version_56237862081/image_2048_jpg/1.jpg?shared_name=093oxa77dywr82aok9jidmx79tt5xh59','http://www.teentheband.net/',2,'n'),(445,'2016-02-22','2016-02-29','TEEN Y-Not Session','Brooklyn band <strong>TEEN</strong> were in Philly last week in advance of releasing their third album <em>Love Yes</em>, and while they were here, they recorded a <em>Y-Not Session</em> at <a href=\"http://www.spicehousesound.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Spice House Sound</strong></a>.  Hear their live performance and an interview with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em>, with replays on Friday at 9:30pm and Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','https://app.box.com/representation/file_version_56237862081/image_2048_jpg/1.jpg?shared_name=093oxa77dywr82aok9jidmx79tt5xh59','http://www.teentheband.net/',2,'y'),(446,'2016-02-29','2016-03-09','Win DMA\'S Tickets','Australian band <strong>DMA\'S</strong> are releasing their full length debut <em>Hills End</em> this week and coming to Philadelphia for a show at MilkBoy next Thursday, March 10th, presented by Y-Not Radio. Enter to win a pair of tickets <strong><a href=\"contests.php\">here</a></strong> or buy tickets at <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/1065379-dmas-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">MilkBoyPhilly.com</a>. ','http://www.stereoboard.com/images/artistimages/dmas.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(447,'2016-03-07','2016-03-14','Sunflower Bean Session','NYC up-and-comers <strong>Sunflower Bean</strong> played a sold out Philly show over the weekend and also took some time to record a <em>Y-Not Session</em> at <a href=\"http://www.kawarisound.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Kawari Sound</a>.  Hear the live performance of songs from their debut album <em>Human Ceremony</em> and their interview with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em>, with replays on Friday at 10pm and Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','http://41.media.tumblr.com/6da2cd6fae495fd3676e66fc2cd12802/tumblr_nxloh17g7M1ujoxlso1_500.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/SunflowerBean/',1,'n'),(448,'2016-03-08','2016-03-11','Win Le Butcherettes Tickets','Y-Not favorites  <strong>Le Butcherettes </strong>return to Philadelphia this Friday night, March 11th for a show at at Underground Arts, in support of their latest album <em>A Raw Youth.</em> Enter to win a pair of tickets <strong><a href=\"pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2\">here</a></strong> or buy tickets at <a href=\"http://undergroundarts.org/?event_id=6444535\" target=\"_blank\">UndergroundArts.org</a>. ','http://41.media.tumblr.com/3d0e2ba358c1d9d94fe4fd6b4d8f865d/tumblr_npn9mnZqoG1qc4qs2o1_500.jpg','http://www.ynotradio.net/pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2',2,'n'),(449,'2016-03-08','2016-03-14','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for new episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> to hear the latest music from Down Under including new songs from <strong>Cub Sport</strong>, <strong>Tourist Dollars</strong>, <strong>Summer Flake</strong>, and more!','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','shows.php',2,'n'),(450,'2016-03-08','2016-03-13','Daughter Interview on Britspotting','Listen on Monday nights from 8-10 or Saturdays from 4-6pm for <em>Britspotting</em> - two hours of Brit rock, new and old, with Y-Not Radioâ??s resident anglophile <strong>Matt McGrath</strong>!   This week, hear Mattâ??s interview with <strong>Daughter</strong> and songs from their new album <em>Not To Disappear</em>. ','https://image-ticketfly.imgix.net/00/01/93/53/03-og.jpg?w=167&h=333','shows.php',3,'n'),(451,'2016-03-14','2016-03-21','Sun Club Y-Not Session','Baltimore band <strong>Sun Club</strong> recently played Philly, opening for <strong>Ra Ra Riot</strong>, and before the show they recorded a <em>Y-Not Session</em> at <strong><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/DarlaHoodProductions/\" target=\"_blank\">Andyâ??s Room Studios</a></strong>.  Hear their live performance, including songs from their debut album <em>The Dongo Durango</em>, and their interview with Y-Notâ??s <strong>Shana</strong> this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em>, with replays on Friday at 10pm and Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>. ','http://www.co-sign.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/08/sunclub-tropicollerleasevid.jpg','http://www.sunclubband.com/',1,'n'),(452,'2016-03-14','2016-03-20','Win Gaz Coombes Tickets','Former <strong>Supergrass </strong>frontman <strong>Gaz Coombes </strong>is coming to Philly next week for a show at Underground Arts in support of his latest album  <em>Matador</em>. Enter to win a pair of tickets <strong><a href=\"contests.php\">here</a></strong> or buy tickets at <a href=\"http://undergroundarts.org/?event_id=6448715\" target=\"_blank\">UndergroundArts.org</a>.','http://www.blackboxbelfast.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/Gaz_Coombes__2___640x479__medium.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(453,'2016-03-21','2016-04-30','Modern Rock Madness 2016','After 5 Days of fierce competition, the one and only <b>David Bowie</b> has been crowned as the <b><i>Modern Rock Madness 2016</i></b> champion!  Congratulations to <em>The Thin White Duke </em>and thanks to all of you for voting and sponsoring matches to make this another great tournament! If you missed any of the madness, see how it all went down  <a href=\"madness.php\">on the completed bracket</a> and read  <strong>Joey O.</strong>\'s recaps at  <a href=\"http://www.tristateindie.com/category/y-not-radio/\" target=\"_blank\">TriStateIndie.com</a>.','https://app.box.com/representation/file_version_62175082017/image_2048_jpg/1.jpg?shared_name=q31073sn4lqcoco5dbiqjeqvlx1qfd21','madness.php',8,'n'),(454,'2016-03-28','2016-04-01','Win Lucius Tickets','<strong>Lucius</strong> returns to Philly this Saturday, April 2nd at Union Transfer for a SOLD OUT show with <strong>Pure Bathing Culture</strong>, in support of their new album <em>Good Grief</em>!  <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/contests\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> for your last chance to win a pair of tickets.','http://www.ilovelucius.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/Lucius_yellow300.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(455,'2016-04-30','2016-04-30','Win Thao & The Get Down Stay Down Tickets','<b>Thao & The Get Down Stay Down</b> return to Philly this Saturday, April 16th at Underground Arts in support of their latest album <i>A Man Alive</i>. <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them now <a href=\"http://www.ticketweb.com/t3/sale/SaleEventDetail?dispatch=loadSelectionData&eventId=6335185&pl=uarts\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://i.ticketweb.com/i/00/06/05/26/49_Edp.jpg','contests.php',9,'n'),(456,'2016-04-04','2016-04-11','Aussie Unlocked','Tune in this Friday night at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for new episode of <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> with <strong>Shana</strong> to hear the latest music from Down Under including new songs from <strong>The Belligerents</strong>, <strong>Gypsy & The Cat</strong>, <strong>Julia Jacklin</strong>, and more!','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','shows.php',3,'n'),(457,'2016-04-11','2016-04-18','Death By Unga Bunga Bunker Session','Norwegian band <b>Death By Unga Bunga</b> recently paid a visit to the Y-Not Bunker to chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and perform songs from their new album <i>Pineapple Pizza</i>!  Tune in to hear their <i>Bunker Session</i> this Friday at 3:30pm during <i>Future Friday</i>, with replays on Friday at 10pm and Sunday at 11am during the <i>Y-Not Session Shuffle</i>. ','http://oyafestivalen.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/1/2016/02/death-by-unga-bunga-oyafestivalen-2016-ingrid-pop-crop.jpg','http://www.deathbyungabunga.no/',1,'n'),(458,'2016-04-25','2016-05-01','Tokyo Police Club Interview','<b>Tokyo Police Club</b> are back with a new EP called <i>Melon Collie & The Infinite Radness, Part 1</i> and Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> caught up with <b>Dave</b> and <b>Josh</b> from the band after their Union Transfer show last week.  Hear their interview and songs from the EP this Sunday at 9pm.','http://storage.ottawasun.com/v1/dynamic_resize/sws_path/suns-prod-images/1297542214573_ORIGINAL.jpg?quality=80&size=200x','http://www.tokyopoliceclub.com/',1,'n'),(459,'2016-05-09','2016-05-13','Win King Gizzard and The Lizard Wizard Tickets','<i>Aussie Unlocked</i> favorites <b>King Gizzard and The Lizard Wizard</b>  are back in Philly this Sunday night at <a href=\"http://www.ticketweb.com/t3/sale/SaleEventDetail?dispatch=loadSelectionData&eventId=6336005&pl=uarts\" target=_blank>Underground Arts</a> with a new album <i>Nonagon Infinity</i>. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets. And tune in for an all new episode of <i>Aussie Unlocked</i> with Shana this Friday at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm.','http://labohemie.pt/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/0001809130_10-250x188.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(460,'2016-05-16','2016-05-23','Yeasayer Radio Takeover','<strong>Yeasayer</strong> returned to Philly this week in support of their new album <em>Amen & Goodbye</em>.  While they were in town, <strong>Chris Keating</strong> from the band sat down with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> for the next <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>.  Tune in this Friday at 2pm or 10pm to hear Chris sharing some of his favorite songs and chatting about the new record.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/94/20/27-atlg.png','http://www.yeasayer.net/',1,'n'),(461,'2016-05-16','2016-05-20','Win Queen of Jeans Tickets','<em>Y-Not Philly </em>favorites <strong>Queen of Jeans</strong> are continuing their May residency at Bourbon & Branch in Northern Liberties this Friday night, May 20th. This weekâ??s installment is presented by Y-Not Radio.<strong> <a href=\"contests.php\">Enter here</a></strong> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or <a href=\"https://www.ticketfly.com/purchase/event/1146957\" target=\"_blank\">buy them</a>.','http://nichemusic.info/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/Queen-of-Jeans-150x150.jpg','contests.php',6,'n'),(462,'2016-05-23','2016-06-13','Win Firefly Festival Passes','Y-Not Radio has a final chance for you to win your way in to the <strong>Firefly Music Festival</strong>, returning to Dover, DE June 16th thru 19th. This week we\'re giving away a pair of one day passes for you to attend on the day of your choice.  <strong><a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER TO WIN HERE!</a></strong> ','http://g3presents.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/08/firefly-music-festival-2014-180x180.png','contests.php',1,'n'),(463,'2016-05-23','2016-05-31','<font size=2>Y-Not\'s Memorial Day Block Party Weekend</font>','Kick off the summer with Y-Not Radio as the soundtrack to your Memorial Day weekend as we play blocks of your favorite indie rock artists from Friday thru Monday! <a href=\"http://www.ynotradio.net/contact.php\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Click here</em></a><em> to request a block.</em>','http://www.crnogorski-online.me/lat/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/1231.png','schedule.php',1,'y'),(464,'2016-06-06','2016-06-13','Caveman Bunker Session','New York natives <b>Caveman</b> are releasing their third album <i>Otero War</i> next week on June 17th.  They recently stopped by the Y-Not Bunker chat about it with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and to play acoustic versions of some of the songs from the record.  Tune in for the session this Friday at 3:30pm during <i>Future Friday</i> or at 10pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the <i>Y-Not Session Shuffle</i>.','https://augurymusic.files.wordpress.com/2013/12/caveman.jpg','http://cavemantheband.com/',4,'n'),(465,'2016-06-20','2016-07-09','Cub Sport Y-Not Session + Video','Australiaâ??s <strong>Cub Sport</strong> just released a new album called<em> This Is Our Vice</em> and paid us a visit \r\nat <a href=\"http://www.spicehousesound.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Spice House Sound</a>.  If you missed the session, you can hear it now <a href=\"http://www.ynotradio.net/ondemand.php\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a> and see video of their performance at <a href=\"http://swelltonemusic.com/2016/06/videos-cub-sport-ynot-radio-session/\" target=\"_blank\">Swell Tone Music</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/02/07/44/69-atmd1.jpg','http://swelltonemusic.com/2016/06/videos-cub-sport-ynot-radio-session/',2,'n'),(466,'2016-06-27','2016-07-04','<font size=2>Deerhoof Women Crush Wednesday Takeover</font>','Tune in as Courtney Blue teams up with Satomi Matsuzaki from Deerhoof for a special edition of Women Crush Wednesdays where youâ??ll hear tracks from the new Deerhoof album The Magic and some of Satomiâ??s favorite female musicians. If you missed it on Wednesday, catch the replay on Sunday night at 9pm or listen <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a>.','http://bit.ly/295273F','http://deerhoof.net/',1,'n'),(467,'2016-06-27','2016-07-07','Win Zella Day Tickets','<strong>Zella Day</strong> is returning to Philly in support of her album <em>Kicker</em> on Friday, July 8th at\r\nThe Foundry, upstairs at The Fillmore. <a href=\"contests.php\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"http://www.thefillmorephilly.com/EventDetail?tmeventid=020050AA976B382B&offerid=0\" target=\"_blank\">TheFillmorePhilly.com</a>. <em>Listen to Zella Dayâ??s Y-Not Bunker Session <a href=\"ondemand.php?id=301\">On Demand</a>.</em>','http://www.hollywoodrecords.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/12/ZellaDay_kicker_digital-300x300.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(468,'2016-07-11','2016-07-25','Ladyhawke Y-Not Session','New Zealandâ??s <strong>Ladyhawke</strong> just released a new album called <em>Wild Things</em> and paid us a visit \r\nat <a href=\"http://www.cambridgesoundstudios.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Cambridge Sound Studios</strong></a>.  Tune in to hear her perform songs from the new album and chat with Y-Notâ??s <strong>Joey O.</strong> this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> or at 10pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>. ','https://66.media.tumblr.com/fadeda066b3fa444d68fd2f842a0cc15/tumblr_inline_o83vtimvZM1tq5zao_540.jpg','http://www.ladyhawkemusic.com/',2,'y'),(469,'2016-07-18','2016-08-01','Win Hunny + The Frights Tickets','On Thursday, August 4th, Y-Not Radio Presents <strong>Hunny</strong> and <strong>The Frights</strong> at The Foundry, upstairs at The Fillmore. Itâ??s a great opportunity to check out two new Y-Not approved bands for free by entering to win a pair of tickets <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>HERE</strong></a><strong>.</strong> Or you can buy tickets at TheFillmorePhilly.com <a href=\"http://www.thefillmorephilly.com/EventDetail?tmeventid=020050A29EE63161&offerid=27355\" target=\"_blank\">TheFillmorePhilly.com</a>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/07/18/EmK01.jpg','contests.php',1,'n'),(470,'2016-08-01','2016-08-08','Y-Not @ 2nd Street Festival','This Sunday, August 7th, the <strong>2nd Street Festival</strong> returns to Northern Liberties with over 150 craft vendors, 20 food trucks, and live music all day on three stages, featuring <strong>Purples</strong>, <strong>Kuf Knotz</strong>, <strong>Hound</strong>, <strong>Sweet Eureka</strong>, <strong>Song Dogs</strong>, <strong>Cold Roses</strong>, and many more! The festival runs from Noon-10pm and itâ??s all free! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nY-Not Radio will be out all day, DJing between bands, plus we\'ll have free CDs and a chance for you to win  tickets for upcoming concerts at The Fillmore. Tune in to this weekâ??s <i>Y-Not Philly</i> on Saturday at 8pm or <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a> for a festival preview, and get more info plus the full list of bands <a href=\"http://www.2ndstfestival.org/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://www.2ndstfestival.org/uploads/3/9/3/1/39316155/2ndstlogo3small_orig.png','http://www.2ndstfestival.org/',2,'n'),(471,'2016-08-01','2016-08-04','Win Hunny + The Frights Tickets','This Thursday, August 4th, Y-Not Radio Presents <strong>Hunny</strong> and <strong>The Frights</strong> at The Foundry, upstairs at The Fillmore. Itâ??s a great opportunity to check out two new Y-Not approved bands for free by entering to win a pair of tickets <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>HERE</strong></a><strong>.</strong> Or you can buy tickets at <a href=\"http://www.thefillmorephilly.com/EventDetail?tmeventid=020050A29EE63161&offerid=27355\" target=\"_blank\">TheFillmorePhilly.com</a>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/07/18/EmK01.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(472,'2016-08-01','2016-08-15','Shirley Manson of Garbage Interview','Last week, Y-Notâ??s<strong> Josh T. Landow</strong> and<strong> Joey O.</strong> had the opportunity to chat with the one and only <strong>Shirley Manson</strong> of <strong>Garbage</strong> before their show at The Fillmore!  You can hear the interview now <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/08/01/jJneu.jpg','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(473,'2016-08-09','2016-08-11','Win Rainer Maria Tickets','This Thursday night <strong>Rainer Maria </strong>plays a sold out show at Johnny Brenda\'s and Y-Not Radio has a chance for you to win your way in.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE.</strong></a> Tickets are still available for their Wednesday show at <a href=\"http://www.r5productions.com/event/1195213-rainer-maria-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">PhilaMOCA</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/02/00/07/51-atlg.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(474,'2016-08-15','2016-08-22','<font size=2>Aussie Unlocked / Win Violent Soho Tickets</font>','Tune in this Tuesday from 9-10pm or Saturday at 5pm for an all new episode of Y-Not\'s Australian music show <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>.  This week <strong>Shana</strong> shares the latest tunes from down under including <strong>Ball Park Music</strong>, <strong>Waax</strong>, <strong>Violent Soho</strong>, and lots more. <em>Plus <strong><a href=\"Contests.php\">enter to win</a></strong> tickets for Violent Sohoâ??s show at Underground Arts on September 10th.</em>','images/aussie_unlocked_logo.png','contests.php',4,'n'),(475,'2017-05-01','2017-12-31','Methyl Ethel Interview','Every other Tuesday night, Y-Not\'s <strong>Shana</strong> takes you down under to hear the latest indie music from Australia on <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>. On this week\'s episode hear Shana\'s interview with <strong>Methyl Ethel</strong>, chatting about and playing songs off their new album <em>Everything Is Forgotten</em>. Tune in for it this Tuesday at 9pm or Saturday at 5pm. \r\n<!--Tune in this Tuesday from 9-10pm or Saturday at 5pm for an all new episode of Y-Not\'s Australian music show <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>. This week <strong>Shana</strong> shares the latest tunes from down under including <b>Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever</b>, <b>Full Flower Moon Band</b>, and lots more.-->','http://faroutmagazine.co.uk/wp/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/Methyl-ethel-2017-360x240.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/methylethel/',2,'y'),(476,'2016-08-29','2016-09-06','Live Labor Day Weekend','This Labor Day Weekend, the Y-Not DJs may be off, but the music will be live! From Friday through Monday weâ??ll be playing tracks from <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, old <em>Y100</em> and <em>WDRE Sonic Sessions</em>, and plenty of other live album tracks as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/mobile.php\" target=\"_blank\">iRadioPhilly app</a> for iPhone or Android and make <em>Y-Notâ??s Live Labor Day</em> the soundtrack for your end of summer festivities!','https://dev.opendrive.com/api/v1/download/file.json/106736924_Xh08f?inline=1','schedule.php',1,'y'),(477,'2016-09-05','2016-09-09','Y-Not @ Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll','This Thursday is the return of the <strong>Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll</strong> from 5:30-8:30pm between 43rd & 52nd Streets in West Philly. Get $1 specials from all the local businesses! Y-Not Radio will be DJing all evening at the corner of 47th &amp; Baltimore. Stop by our tent for free CDs and a chance to win tickets for upcoming concerts!','http://i60.tinypic.com/260wqb6.jpg','http://www.universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',3,'n'),(478,'2016-09-12','2016-09-19','Weaves Y-Not Session','One of our favorite new bands of the year, Torontoâ??s <strong>Weaves</strong>, were in Philly last month and recorded a <em>Y-Not Session</em> for us at <a href=\"http://sleeplesssound.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sleepless Sound Studios</a>.  Tune in to hear their live performance and interview with Y-Notâ??s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> or at 10pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','http://indiespace.com.mx/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/Weaves-2016-218x150.jpg','http://weavesband.com/',1,'n'),(479,'2016-09-19','2016-09-23','Win Jake Bugg Tickets','This Sunday, September 25th UK artist <strong>Jake Bugg</strong> returns to Philadelphia for a show at \r\nThe T.L.A. in support of his new album <em>On My One</em>.  <strong><a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER TO WIN</a></strong> a pair of tickets or buy them <a href=\"http://concerts.livenation.com/event/0200509AAD702EBD\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://cps-static.rovicorp.com/3/JPG_250/MI0004/021/MI0004021897.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(480,'2016-10-08','2016-10-31','Peter Bjorn and John Radio Takeover','<strong>Peter Bjorn and John</strong> were in town on Friday night and Y-Not\'s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> caught up with <strong>Bjorn</strong> before their show for the next <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>.  Tune in to hear Bjornâ??s guest DJ set including music from <strong>Kurt Vile</strong>, <strong>Chrissie Hynde</strong>, <strong>The Soft Boys</strong>, and more, plus some tracks from PB&Jâ??s latest album <em>Breakinâ?? Point</em>.  Bjornâ??s Takeover airs this Friday at 2pm or 10pm, with another replay on Sunday at 7pm.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/09/26/Cuyv5.jpg','https://www.peterbjornandjohn.com/',1,'y'),(481,'2016-09-26','2016-09-30','Win Tacocat Tickets','Seattle band  <strong>Tacocat </strong> are coming to  Underground Arts in support of their new album <em>Lost Time </em>with Philly\'s own <strong>Queen of Jeans</strong> next Monday, October 3rd. <strong><a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER TO WIN</a></strong> a pair of tickets for their show or buy them <a href=\"http://www.ticketweb.com/t3/sale/SaleEventDetail?dispatch=loadSelectionData&eventId=6787075&pl=uarts\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. ','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/93/50/17-atlg.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(482,'2016-09-26','2016-10-01','Win Electric Six Tickets','The legendary <strong>Electric Six </strong> return for their annual  Philly appearance at MilkBoy next Tuesday, October 4th in support of their  new album <em>Fresh Blood For Tired Vampyres</em>.  <strong><a href=\"pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2\">ENTER TO WIN</a></strong> a pair of tickets or buy them <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/1248761-electric-six-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. ','http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_rpQFyDRRjYo/TEyicSnCKqI/AAAAAAAAAIw/cr00DTfQNB8/s320/ElectricSixbeer.jpg','pages.php?page=y-not-contests-2',4,'n'),(483,'2016-09-30','2016-10-01','Win Tacocat Tickets','Seattle band  <strong>Tacocat </strong> are coming to  Underground Arts in support of their new album <em>Lost Time </em>with Philly\'s own <strong>Queen of Jeans</strong> next Monday, October 3rd. <strong><a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER TO WIN</a></strong> a pair of tickets for their show or buy them <a href=\"http://www.ticketweb.com/t3/sale/SaleEventDetail?dispatch=loadSelectionData&eventId=6787075&pl=uarts\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/01/93/50/17-atlg.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(484,'2016-10-03','2016-10-10','Beach Baby Y-Not Bunker Session','UK band <strong>Beach Baby</strong> were just in town and stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to perform acoustic versions of songs from their debut album <em>No Mind No Money</em>. Hear their session and interview this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em>, or at 11pm, with another replay on Sunday morning at 11 during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.</span> Find out more at <a href=\"http://www.beachbabymusic.com/\" target=\"_blank\">BeachBabyMusic.com</a>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/10/03/JjRF4.jpg','http://www.beachbabymusic.com/',2,'n'),(485,'2016-10-07','2016-10-04','Win The Faint + Gang of Four Tickets','<b>The Faint</b> is teaming up with <strong>Gang of Four</strong> and coming to  The Trocadero this Friday, October 7th.  <strong><a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/contests\" target=\"_blank\">ENTER TO WIN</a></strong> a pair of tickets for their show or buy them <a href=\"http://www.thetroc.com/event/1186433-faint-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://scontent.cdninstagram.com/t51.2885-15/s480x480/e35/13269448_1746979425517050_1941478066_n.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(486,'2016-10-03','2016-10-07','Win The Faint + Gang of Four Tickets','<strong>The Faint </strong>is teaming up with <strong>Gang of Four</strong> and coming to  The Trocadero this Friday, October 7th.  <strong><a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER TO WIN</a></strong> a pair of tickets for their show or buy them <a href=\"http://www.thetroc.com/event/1186433-faint-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. ','https://scontent.cdninstagram.com/t51.2885-15/s480x480/e35/13269448_1746979425517050_1941478066_n.jpg','contests.php',5,'n'),(487,'2016-10-10','2016-10-13','Win M83 Tickets','This Thursday, October 13th <b>M83</b> returns to Philadelphia for a show at The Fillmore in support of their latest album <i>Junk</i>.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them <a href=\"http://TheFillmorePhilly.com\" target=_blank>here</a>.\r\n','http://indiespot.es/wp-content/uploads/2013/11/m83-283x188.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(488,'2016-10-10','2016-10-18','Against Me! Interview','Last week, Y-Notâ??s<strong> Joey O.</strong> had the opportunity to chat with <strong>Laura Jane Grace</strong> and the members of <strong>Against Me!</strong> before their show with <strong>Bad Religion</strong> at The Fillmore!  Hear the interview and songs from the new album <em>Shape Shift With Me </em>this Friday at 3:30 during <em>Future Friday</em>, or at 10pm.','http://cdn.clubzone.com/content/uploads/artists/2276037/1-313x187.jpg','http://www.againstme.net/',10,'y'),(489,'2016-10-13','2016-10-19','Win Failure Tickets','On Wedesday, October 19th <b>Failure</b> returns to Philadelphia for a show at The Trocadero in celebration of the 20th Anniversary of their classic album <i>Fantastic Planet</i>.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER TO WIN</b></a> a pair of tickets or buy them <a href=\"http://www.thetroc.com/event/1215463-failure-20th-anniversary-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/10/13/NKmAO.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(490,'2016-10-17','2016-10-24','Tacocat Y-Not Session','Seattle feminist punk band <strong>Tacocat</strong> were in Philly a couple weeks ago and before their show, they stopped by to record a <em>Y-Not Session</em> at <a href=\"http://www.spicehousesound.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Spice House Sound</a>.  Tune in to hear their live performance of songs from their new album <em>Lost Time</em> and interview with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> or at 10pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>. ','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/10/17/BsFAP.jpg','http://tacocatdotcom.com/',1,'n'),(491,'2016-10-24','2016-11-01','The Joy Formidable Y-Not Session','<strong>The Joy Formidable</strong> were back in Philly the other week in support of their third album <em>Hitch</em> and before their show, they joined us to record an acoustic <em>Y-Not Session</em>, recorded by <a href=\"http://brolik.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Brolik Productions</a> with <a href=\"http://www.cambridgesoundstudios.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Cambridge Sound Studios</a>.    Tune in to hear their live performance and interview with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> or at 10pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/10/24/TXMUJ.jpg','https://www.thejoyformidable.com/',1,'y'),(492,'2016-10-31','2016-11-04','Win Orwells Tickets','<b>The Orwells</b> just announced the release of their second album <em>Terrible Human Beings</em>, coming in February, but they\'re coming to Philly to preview new material this Friday, November 4th at Underground Arts. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them <a href=\"http://www.undergroundarts.org/event/1309189-orwells-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://static.stereoboard.com/images/artistimages/140x140xthe-orwells.jpg.pagespeed.ic.3S6YvFctPD.jpg','contests.php',1,'n'),(493,'2016-11-07','2016-11-14','Royal Teeth Bunker Session','<b>Royal Teeth</b> were recently in town and stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to perform acoustic versions of songs from their upcoming EP <i>Amateurs</i>. Hear their session and interview this Friday at 3:30pm during <i>Future Friday</i>, or at 11pm, with another replay on Sunday morning at 11 during the <i>Y-Not Session Shuffle</i>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/11/07/zbn4a.jpg','http://royalteethmusic.com/',1,'y'),(494,'2016-11-21','2016-12-03','Win Jezabels Tickets','Y-Not Radio Presents Australia\'s <b>The Jezabels</b> with <b>Surf Rock Is Dead</b> on Saturday, December 3rd at World CafÃ© Live, in support of their latest album <i>Synthia</i>. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> to win a pair of tickets or buy them <a href=\"http://www.worldcafelive.com/event/1260485-jezabels-philadelphia/\" target=_blank>here</a>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/02/19/25/99-atxxl.jpg','contests.php',3,'y'),(495,'2016-11-21','2016-11-25','Y-Not\'s Turkey Day Takeovers','Happy Thanksgiving everybody! Tune in on Thanksgiving Day starting at 9am as Y-Not Radio continues the tradition of <i>Turkey Day Takeovers</i>, featuring this year\'s guest DJ sets from the likes of <strong>Yeasayer</strong>, <strong>Bjorn</strong> of <strong>Peter Bjorn and John</strong>, <strong>Surfer Blood</strong>, <strong>Baio</strong>, <strong>Deerhoof</strong>, <strong>Julia Jacklin</strong>, <strong>Violent Soho</strong>, and <strong>Carol Cleveland Sings</strong>. Check out the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a> and stay tuned next week for a brand new Takeover with <strong>CRX</strong>, featuring <strong>Nick Valensi</strong> of <strong>The Strokes</strong>. ','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',1,'n'),(496,'2016-11-21','2016-11-26','Y-Not\'s Black Friday Shuffle and Sale','Tune in to Y-Not Radio from 6am-8pm on Black Friday for our shuffle of all black songs! And help Y-Not end the year in the black by  <a href=\"donate.php\">making a donation</a>! Well say thanks by sending you a new album from <strong>The Growlers</strong>, <strong>Kaiser Chiefs</strong>, <strong>Pixies</strong>, <strong>Beach Slang</strong>, <b>Against Me!</b>, <b>Grouplove</b>, <b>Bastille</b>, <b>Kristin Kontrol</b>, or others to choose from, plus this week we\'ll throw in a  doorbuster bonus album from the bargain bin items!  <em>Thank you!</em><br /><br>\r\n<center><b><a href=\"donate.php\">DONATE HERE</a></b></center>','http://www.ynotradio.net/images/ynotblackfriday.png','donate.php',1,'n'),(497,'2016-11-28','2017-01-31','Y-Not\'s Top 216 of 2016 + Year End Poll Poll Results','If you missed any of <i>Y-Not\'s Top 216 of 2016</i>, see the complete list of songs and all the <i>Year End Poll</i> results <a href=\"pages.php?page=top216of2016\">here</a> and you can listen to the entire countdown <a href=\"pages.php?page=top216of2016\">on demand</a>.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<i>Y-Not\'s Top 216 of 2016 was brought to you by the <b>Theatre of Living Arts</b>.  Tickets for all TLA shows are available at  <a href=\"http://LNphilly.com/\" target=_blank>TLAPhilly.com</a>.</i>','https://app.box.com/representation/file_version_123318015929/image_2048_jpg/1.jpg?shared_name=iglprd5g7knoz5e66pua2tva0ebnwn3o','pages.php?page=top216of2016',5,'n'),(498,'2016-11-28','2016-12-06','Sam Roberts Band Radio Takeover','Montreal favorites <strong>Sam Roberts Band</strong> were in town over Thanksgiving weekend and <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> caught up with Sam and guitarist <strong>Dave Nugent</strong> to host the next <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>.  Tune in to hear their guest DJ set including music from <strong>The Clean</strong>, <strong>Caveman</strong>, <strong>The Tragically Hip</strong>, and more, plus tracks from their own new album <em>TerraForm</em>.  The <em>Sam Roberts Band Takeover</em> airs this Friday at 2pm or 11pm, with another replay on Sunday at Noon.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/11/28/yGajM.jpg','http://www.samrobertsband.com/',2,'n'),(499,'2016-12-05','2016-12-12','SlÃ¸tface Bunker Session','Norwegian punk band <strong>SlÃ¸tface</strong> made their Philly debut over the weekend and before their show, they stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to play acoustic versions of songs from their <em>Sponge State </em>and <em>Empire Records </em>EPs. Tune in to hear their session on Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> or at 10pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the Y-Not Session Shuffle.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/12/05/4zt5r.jpg','http://www.slotface.no/',3,'n'),(500,'2016-12-12','2016-12-19','Y-Not Sessions: Best of 2016','This Friday at 3pm or Sunday at 10am, tune in to hear 2 hours of the best <em>Y-Not Session</em> tracks from the past year including <strong>The Joy Formidable</strong>, <strong>Tacocat</strong>, <strong>Cub Sport</strong>, <strong>Sunflower Bean</strong>, <strong>Royal Teeth</strong>, <strong>Weaves</strong>, <strong>Death By Unga Bunga</strong>, <strong>Ladyhawke</strong>, <strong>TEEN</strong>, <strong>Caveman</strong>, <strong>Sun Club</strong>, <strong>Beach Baby</strong>, <strong>Eliza Hardy Jones</strong>, <strong>Carol Cleveland Sings</strong>, and lots more... <i>Hear all of those sessions in their entirety <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.</i>','http://i.picresize.com/images/2016/12/12/mKevb.jpg','ondemand.php',4,'n'),(501,'2016-12-19','2016-12-27','Y-Not Best of 2016 Specials','Tune in this week for Best of 2016 editions of Y-Not Radioâ€™s specialty shows including <em>Britspotting</em> on Monday at 8pm, <em>Noise Complaint</em> on Monday at 10pm, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> on Tuesday at 8pm, <em>Y-Not Philly</em> on Wednesday at 11am and 10pm, and <em>Transmission</em> on Thursday at 9pm.  Then hear them all replaying on the day after Christmas starting at noon. ','http://www.guiderecensioni.it/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/the-best-2016-300x300.png','schedule.php',4,'n'),(502,'2017-01-02','2017-01-09','The Jezabels Y-Not Session','Australian band <strong>The Jezabels</strong> finally made it to Philly last month in support of their recent album <em>Synthia</em> and we recorded an exclusive performance from the stage at World CafÃ© Live. Tune in to hear their session and interview this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> or at 11pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/02/19/25/99-atxxl.jpg','http://thejezabels.com/',1,'n'),(503,'2017-01-02','2017-01-08','Y-Not  Internacional Returns','Tune in this week for the return of <em>Y-Not Internacional</em> with <strong>Gil</strong> â€“ an hour of alternative rock in espanol and from all over the world! Catch the show on Tuesday at 8pm with a replay on Saturday at 4pm.','https://thumbnailer.mixcloud.com/unsafe/300x300/extaudio/4/1/b/0/8625-5eef-4e6f-a00f-6fa9a8c9f874','schedule.php',6,'n'),(504,'2017-01-09','2017-01-16','American Wrestlers Y-Not Bunker Session','<strong>American Wrestlers</strong> recently came to Philly in support of their new album <em>Goodbye Terrible Youth</em>.  While they were here, frontman <strong>Gary McClure</strong> stopped by the <em>Y-Not Bunker</em> to perform acoustic versions of some of the songs and chat with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>. Tune in to hear their session and interview this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> or at 10pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','https://67.media.tumblr.com/e202e9d312128b9fd730722ba2313789/tumblr_inline_obyfdc7jOy1tgewna_540.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/americanwrestlers/',1,'n'),(505,'2017-02-24','2017-03-01','Win Springtime Carnivore Tickets','Y-Not Radio Presents <b>Springtime Carnivore</b>, returning to Philly in support of the new album <i>Midnight Room</i> on Thursday, March 9th at MilkBoy. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/1400159-springtime-carnivore-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">MilkBoyPhilly.com</a>.  <i>Listen to Springtime Carnivore\'s Y-Not Session <a href=\"ondemand.php?id=289\">here</a>.</i>','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/02/20/fHYLP.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(506,'2017-01-30','2017-02-06','Cloud Nothings Radio Takeover','Clevelandâ€™s <strong>Cloud Nothings</strong> are back with their fourth album <em>Life Without Sound</em>.  Hear them talk about and play songs from the new album, along with some of their favorite music on the next <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>, this Friday at 2pm, with replays on Saturday at 10pm and Sunday at Noon.','http://www.indiehearts.com/sites/default/files/styles/news_143x107/public/cloud_nothings.png','http://www.cloudnothings.com/',1,'n'),(507,'2017-01-31','2017-02-05','Austra Interview on Transmission','Tune in Thursday nights from 9-11 or Saturdays from 6-8pm for <em>Transmission</em> â€“ 2 hours of alternative electronic and dance music with <strong>Rob Huff</strong>!  This week, hear Robâ€™s interview with <strong>Katie Stelmanis</strong> of <strong>Austra</strong>, along with tracks from their new album <em>Future Politics</em>.','http://www.indiewave.it/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/Austra-Photo-Credit-Renata-Raksha-Launch-001-300dpi-300x300.jpg','http://austramusic.com/',3,'n'),(508,'2017-02-06','2017-02-13','Rubblebucket Y-Not Session','Brooklyn band <strong>Rubblebucket</strong> recently came to Philly in support of their new EP<em> If U C My Enemies</em> and before their show members of the band stopped by the Y-Not Bunker for an exclusive stripped down performance. Hear Rubblebucketâ€™s<em> Y-Not Bunker Session</em> this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday </em>or at 9:30pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/02/06/RfDs8.jpg','http://rubblebucket.com/',1,'n'),(509,'2017-03-01','2017-03-31','Win Springtime Carnivore Tickets','Y-Not Radio Presents <b>Springtime Carnivore</b>, returning to Philly in support of the new album <i>Midnight Room</i> on Thursday, March 9th at MilkBoy. <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"http://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/1400159-springtime-carnivore-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">MilkBoyPhilly.com</a>. <i>Listen to  Springtime Carnivore\'s Y-Not  Session <a href=\"ondemand.php?id=289\">here</a>.</i>','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/02/20/fHYLP.jpg','contests.php',1,'y'),(510,'2017-03-06','2017-03-13','Los Campesinos! Bunker Session','<strong>Los Campesinos!</strong> came back to Philly this week in support of their brand new album <em>Sick Scenes</em>.  While here, they stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to chat with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> and play acoustic versions of songs from the album.  Tune in to hear the session this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> or at 9:30pm, with another replay on Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','http://cdn2.pitchfork.com/artists/5337/m.806ee0f7.jpg','http://www.loscampesinos.com/',1,'n'),(511,'2017-03-06','2017-04-30','Modern Rock Madness 2017','After 5 Days of fierce competition, your 2017 <i>Modern Rock Madness</i> champions are <b>Garbage</b>!  Congratulations to <b>Shirley</b>, <b>Butch</b>, <b>Duke</b>, and <b>Steve</b> on their 2nd tournament victory!  And congrats as well to our runner up <b>Beck</b> on great run!  If you missed any of the madness, see how it all went down on the completed bracket <a href=\"madness.php\">here</a>.','https://app.box.com/representation/file_version_153350206997/image_2048/1.png?shared_name=6zys0eyj8dw64xnu2cfz4cacf1fda2hp','madness.php',7,'n'),(512,'2017-03-20','2017-03-27','Mike Doughty Concert Playback','Earlier this month, <b>Mike Doughty</b> returned to Philly for a career-spanning show at World Cafe Live, including reworkings of songs from his <b>Soul Coughing</b> days and his many solo albums.  Mike let Y-Not Radio tap into the board to record the set.  Hear selections from it on Friday at 2:30pm with the entire show airing that night at 9pm and Sunday at 11am.','http://cdn.ticketfly.com/i/00/02/36/43/65-atmd1.JPG','http://www.mikedoughty.com/',3,'n'),(513,'2017-04-03','2017-04-06','Win Diet Cig Tickets','New York indie due <strong>Diet Cig</strong> play Boot & Saddle this Thursday night on the eve of the release of their debut full length album <em>Swear I\'m Good At This</em>.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> by Wednesday at 5pm for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them <a href=\"http://www.bootandsaddlephilly.com/event/1410641-diet-cig-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','http://nysmusic.com/wp-content/uploads/ngg_featured/Diet-Cig-P.-Cummings-1-300x300.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(514,'2017-04-04','2017-04-10','Alex Lahey Aussie Unlocked Session','Up-and-coming Australian artist <b>Alex Lahey</b> recently played in Philadelphia and stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to chat with <b>Shana</b> and perform songs from her debut EP <i>B-Grade University</i>.  Hear the session on this weekâ€™s episode of <i>Aussie Unlocked</i> on Tuesday at 9pm or Saturday at 5pm, with additional airings during <i>Future Friday</i> and Sunday at 11am during the <i>Y-Not Session Shuffle</i>.\r\n','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/04/04/cEOuf.jpg','http://alexlahey.com.au/',1,'n'),(515,'2017-05-31','2017-05-02','Dude York Y-Not Session','Last month, Seattle trio <strong>Dude York</strong> were in Philly and stopped by <a href=\"http://www.spicehousesound.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Spice House Sound</a> to record a Y-Not Session featuring live performances of songs from their new album <em>Sincerely</em>. Tune in to hear their session this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> with replays that night at 9:30pm and Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/04/24/NmEMB.jpg','http://dude-york.com/',11,'n'),(516,'2017-05-29','2017-05-31','Win Circa Waves Tickets','U.K. band <b>Circa Waves</b> return to Philly on Saturday, June 10th at The Foundry, in support of their new album <i>Different Creatures</i>.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or <a href=\"https://concerts1.livenation.com/event/02005293C21EC8ED\" target=_blank>buy them here</a> for only $4!','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/05/30/QzIUp.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(517,'2017-05-15','2017-05-22','Mondo Cozmo Bunker Session','Bucks County, PA native <strong>Josh Ostrander</strong>, formerly of <strong>Eastern Conference Champions</strong> and <strong>Laguardia</strong>, has re-emerged as of late under the alias of <strong>Mondo Cozmo</strong>.  Now based in L.A., Josh will pay us a visit in The Bunker this Friday to catch up with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> about his new project and perform acoustic versions of songs from his upcoming album <em>Plastic Soul</em>.  Hear the session on Friday at 3:30pm during Future Friday with replays that night at 10pm and Sunday at 11am during the Y-Not Session Shuffle.','http://img.over-blog-kiwi.com/400x260-ct/1/40/85/05/20170403/ob_6567a0_aaaaaaaaaabbmm.jpg','http://mondocozmo.com/',2,'n'),(518,'2017-05-23','2017-05-30','<font size=2>Y-Not\'s Memorial Day Block Party Weekend</font>','Kick off the summer with Y-Not Radio as the soundtrack to your Memorial Day weekend as we play blocks of your favorite indie rock artists from Friday thru Monday! <a href=\"contact.php\"><i>Click here to request a block.</i></a>','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/05/22/7TRvz.jpg','contests.php',1,'n'),(519,'2017-06-19','2017-07-08','Y-Not Radio 7th Anniversary Show w/ The Pains of Being Pure at Heart ','Thanks to everyone who came out to Y-Not\'s 7th Anniversary Show with <strong>The Pains of Being Pure At Heart</strong> and <strong>Beverly</strong>!  Check out some pics from the show on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/ynotradio/photos/?tab=album&album_id=1553482591337297\" target=\"_blank\">Y-Not\'s Facebook</a>.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/07/03/Setfk.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/pg/ynotradio/photos/?tab=album&album_id=1553482591337297',3,'n'),(520,'2017-06-05','2017-06-12','Sylvan Esso Radio Takeover','<strong>Sylvan Esso</strong> were in town a few weeks ago for two sold out shows, and while they were here they sat down with Y-Not\'s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> and <strong>Shana</strong> for the next <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>!  Tune in to hear <strong>Amelia</strong> and <strong>Nick</strong> guest DJ a playlist of some of their favorite artists like <strong>Feist</strong>, <strong>Yo La Tengo</strong>, <strong>Frankie Cosmos</strong>, and more, plus tracks from their new record <em>What Now</em>.  The <em>Sylvan Esso Radio Takeover</em> airs this Friday at 2pm or 9pm with a replay on Sunday at 7pm.','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/06/05/BLuVD.jpg','http://www.sylvanesso.com/',1,'n'),(521,'2017-06-10','2017-06-16','Y-Not @ Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll','This Thursday is the return of the <i>Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll</i> from 5:30-8:30pm between 43rd & 52nd Streets in West Philly. Get $1 specials from all the local businesses! Stop by the Y-Not Radio tent at the corner of 47th & Baltimore for free CDs and a chance to win tickets for upcoming concerts including <b>Evan Dando</b> on June 23rd at The Foundry, <b>The Pains of Being Pure At Heart</b> on July 2nd at World Cafe Live, and <b>Echo & The Bunnymen</b> and <b>Violent Femmes</b> on July 11th at The Mann.','http://i60.tinypic.com/260wqb6.jpg','http://universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',2,'n'),(522,'2017-06-19','2017-06-26','Day Wave Bunker Session','Last week, Y-Not Radio presented <strong>Day Wave</strong> at The Foundry, but before the show <strong>Jackson Phillips</strong> and his band stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to perform stripped down versions of songs from their album <em>The Days We Had</em> and chat with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>.  Hear the Day Wave Bunker Session this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em> with replays that night at 10pm and Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','https://image-ticketfly.imgix.net/00/02/43/72/34-og.jpg?w=200&h=133&fit=crop&crop=top','http://www.daywavemusic.com/',2,'n'),(523,'2017-07-01','2017-07-05','Britspotting July 4th Marathon','Here at Y-Not Radio we celebrate our Independence Day by listening to music from the empire whose tyrannical rule we escaped in 1776. Tune in July 4th starting at 10am for our annual <i>Britspotting Marathon</i> and enjoy music exclusively from across the pond with our own <b>Matt McGrath</b> all day. Catch new episodes of <i>Britspotting</i> on Monday nights at 8 with encores on Saturdays at 2pm and <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://thumbnailer.mixcloud.com/unsafe/300x300/extaudio/5/a/c/5/22d6-0db2-41dc-bd3c-52fc7e8ab55b','https://www.facebook.com/BritSpottingRadio/',2,'n'),(524,'2017-07-08','2017-07-16','Clark Park Festival','<em>The Clark Park Festival </em>returns to West Philly this Saturday, July 15th with <strong>The Dead Milkmen</strong>, <strong>West Philadelphia Orchestra</strong>, <strong>Conversations</strong>, <strong>Rockers Galore</strong>, <strong>I Think Like Midnight</strong>, <strong>The Deadeyes</strong>, <strong>American Dinosaur</strong>, <strong>The Momentum</strong>, <strong>BriaMarie</strong>, <strong>Hannah Taylor</strong>, and more, from 11am-7pm.Â  There will be local craft vendors, food trucks, pop up art displays, and face-painting.Â  Y-Not Radio will be out all day with a chance for you to win tickets for <strong>RIDE</strong> on July 22nd at The T.L.A.Â  <a href=\"http://clarkparkfest.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Find out more  here.</a>','http://i.picresize.com/images/2017/06/10/rRb1t.jpg','http://clarkparkfest.com/',2,'n'),(525,'2018-09-01','2018-09-04','Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day Weekend','This Labor Day Weekend, the Y-Not DJs are off, but the music will be live! From Friday through Monday we\'ll be playing tracks from <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, old <em>Y100</em> and <em>WDRE Sonic Sessions</em>, and plenty of other live album tracks as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/mobile.php\" target=\"_blank\">iRadioPhilly app</a> for iPhone or Android and make <em>Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day</em> the soundtrack for your end of summer festivities!','https://dev.opendrive.com/api/v1/download/file.json/106736924_Xh08f?inline=1','http://www.iradiophilly.com/index.php?idStation=42',1,'n'),(526,'2018-09-01','2018-09-30','The Vaccines Radio Takeover','<b>The Vaccines</b> recently kicked off their U.S. tour here in Philadelphia, and Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> got to sit down with frontman <b>Justin Hayward-Young</b> for another <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>!  Tune in <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/ondemand.php\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>On Demand</strong></a> to hear Justin share his guest DJ playlist along with stories and  songs from the new Vaccines album, <i>Combat Sports</i>!','https://i.imgur.com/8rvSnAN.jpg?2','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/the-vaccines-y-not-radio-takeover/',5,'y'),(527,'2018-11-26','2021-12-31','Support Y-Not Radio','<!--If you love Y-Not Radio, please (It\'s almost the end of October and Y-Not Radio still needs to raise about <b>$100</b> to pay for  streaming, music royalty fees, and other expenses.  You can) help support the station by making a donation today.  When you do, we\'ll say thanks by sending you a new album download-->\r\nThanks to everyone who supported  Y-Not Radio in 2021, we will be ending the year in the black! You can help the station get a head start on 2022 expenses like streems fees and music royalties  by <a href=\"donate.php\"><b>making a donation</b></a>.  When you donate, we’ll say thanks with a new album download from <b>Courtney Barnett</b>, <b>Snail Mail</b>, <b>The War On Drugs</b>, <b>Parquet Courts</b>, <b>The Vaccines</b>, <b>Jungle</b>, <b>Torres</b>, the <em>Y-Not Sessions 2020</em> compilation, or others to choose from.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<center>\r\n  <b><a href=\"donate.php\">DONATE HERE</a></b></center>\r\n<!--https://linkstorage.linkfire.com/medialinks/images/ad86b2ec-2050-423c-ad3a-9f4fbece6245/artwork-440x440.jpg-->','https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a4251643785_2.jpg','donate.php',4,'n'),(528,'2018-09-04','2018-09-14','Win Ted Leo Tickets','Indie veteran <b>Ted Leo</b> returns to the Philly area for a solo show on Saturday, September 15th at The Ardmore Music Hall. <a href=\"contests.php\" target=\"_blank\">ENTER HERE</a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"https://www.ardmoremusic.com/event/1716798-ted-leo-solo-ardmore/\" target=_blank>ArdmoreMusic.com</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/Qy3qVma.jpg?1','contests.php',3,'n'),(529,'2018-09-10','2018-09-14','Y-Not @ Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll','This Thursday, September 13th is the next <em>Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll</em> from 5:30-8:30pm between 43rd & 52nd Streets in West Philly.  Stop by the Y-Not Radio tent at the corner of 47th & Baltimore for free CDs and a chance to win tickets for <a href=\"https://manncenter.org/events/2018-09-20/david-byrne\" target=\"_blank\"><b>David Byrne</b> with <b>Tune-Yards</b></a> on Sept. 20th at The Mann Center.','https://i.imgur.com/fhvnY7g.jpg','https://www.universitycity.org/baltimore-ave-dollar-stroll',2,'n'),(530,'2018-09-15','2018-09-30','Dan Fein On Y-Not Radio','<b>Dan Fein</b> has returned to Y-Not Radio! If you missed his September show, tune in <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a> for his latest music discoveries, as well as some rockin\' rhymes and a few old school <em>Scooby Snacks</em> too.  <!--If you missed Dan\'s May show, you can listen  <a href=\"http://www.ynotradio.net/shows\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.</i>-->','https://thumbnailer.mixcloud.com/unsafe/160x160/extaudio/c/a/f/b/ab8f-5361-46a8-a8c0-b70dd1ed3e33','shows.php',8,'n'),(531,'2018-12-30','2018-12-31','Win They Might Be Giants Tickets','Everyone\'s favorite <b>Johns</b> of <b>They Might Be Giants</b> are returning to Philly to spend New Year\'s Eve at The TLA with <b>Jonathan Coulton</b>!  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets  or buy them at <a href=\"http://venue.tlaphilly.com/EventDetail?tmeventid=020054F1CF2BA1C8&offerid=0\" target=\"_blank\">TLAphilly.com</a>.','http://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/6ba/632386f4-dfb9-49a9-856a-60cccbd746ba_810011_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_3_2.jpg','contests.php',20,'n'),(532,'2018-12-21','2018-12-31','Miya Folick Y-Not Session','<b>Miya Folick</b> recently came through Philly and stopped by the <i>Y-Not Bunker</i> to perform acoustic versions of songs from her debut album <i>Premonitions</i> and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.  Hear Miya\'s session <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> and see her back in Philly on March 3rd at <a href=\"https://bootandsaddlephilly.com/event/miya-folick/\" target=\"_blank\">Boot & Saddle</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/Bc6rG34.jpg?1','ondemand.php',6,'n'),(533,'2018-10-22','2018-11-30','CHVRCHES Photo Album','<b>CHVRCHES</b> recently returned to Philly to christen the newly re-named <b>Franklin Music Hall</b> and Y-Not was on the scene with a photographer to capture the sights!  Check out our gallery <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/137798016239102/photos/?tab=album&album_id=2092449110773973\" target=_blank>HERE</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/wp1RQZx.jpg?1','https://www.facebook.com/137798016239102/photos/?tab=album&album_id=2092449110773973',9,'n'),(534,'2018-11-12','2018-11-19','Muse: Simulation Theory Radio Special','<strong>Muse</strong> has just released their 8th album, <em>Simulation Theory</em>, which sees the band examining the future of virtual reality, simulated reality and the idea of fantasy becoming real.  Tune in this Friday at 5pm or Sunday at 8pm to hear Muse\'s <strong>Matt Bellamy</strong> and <strong>Dominic Howard</strong> talking about their creative process and inspirations, plus sharing tracks from the record.','https://www.allaccess.com/assets/img/artists/M/muse/200xH/muse---simulation-theory-lp-1536277605.png','https://simulationtheory.muse.mu/',4,'n'),(535,'2018-11-12','2018-11-18','Celebrate Jersey Dan\'s 40th Birthday!','Tune in this Friday at 9pm or Sunday at 7pm for an all-new episode of <em>The Choice Tasters Lounge</em>, as host <strong>Jersey Dan</strong> celebrates his 40th birthday!  And celebrate with him in person on <a href=\"https://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/1770526-live-band-karaoke-taggart-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">Saturday night at MilkBoy</a> with live band karaoke.  Tickets are only $5 in advance or $10 at the door with proceeds benefitting <strong>Musicians On Call</strong>.','https://i.imgur.com/AmNKeMu.jpg?1','https://www.milkboyphilly.com/event/1770526-live-band-karaoke-taggart-philadelphia/',6,'n'),(536,'2018-11-19','2018-11-23','Y-Not\'s Turkey Day Takeovers','Happy Thanksgiving everybody! Tune in on Thanksgiving Day starting at 10am as Y-Not Radio continues the tradition of <em>Turkey Day Takeovers</em>, featuring this year\'s guest DJ sets from the likes of <strong>Tune-Yards</strong>, <strong>Jukebox The Ghost</strong>, <strong>Kate Nash</strong>, <strong>The Vaccines</strong>, <strong>We Are Scientists</strong>, and a special Holiday Takeover with <strong>Dude York</strong>! Check out the full schedule <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/schedule\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and listen to any of our Y-Not Takeovers <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/ondemand\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a> anytime.','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',1,'n'),(537,'2018-11-19','2018-11-26','Y-Not\'s Black Friday Weekend Sale','Help Y-Not Radio end the year in the black by <b><a href=\"donate.php\">making a donation</a></b> during our Black Friday Weekend sale. We still need to raise <strong>$700</strong> to pay for this month\'s streaming and music royalty fees. Show your support and we\'ll say thanks with a Y-Not t-shirt or a new album from <b>Muse</b>, <b>Laura Jane Grace</b>, <b>J. Mascis</b>, <b>St. Vincent</b>, <b>Kurt Vile</b>, <b>Rubblebucket</b>,  or others to choose from.','http://www.ynotradio.net/images/ynotblackfriday.png','donate.php',1,'n'),(538,'2018-11-26','2018-11-24','Win Cloud Nothings Tickets','<b>Cloud Nothings</b> return to Philly next Thursday, December 4th at Union Transfer with <b>The Courtneys</b>, in support of their new record <i>Last Building Burning</i>. <b><a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER HERE</a></b> for a chance to win a pair of tickets  or buy them at <a href=\"https://utphilly.com/events/cloud-nothings/\" target=\"_blank\">UTphilly.com</a>.','http://discoveredmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/Cloud-Nothings-2018-265x198.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(539,'2018-11-27','2019-01-31','Y-Not\'s Top 218 of 2018','Thanks to all of you who voted in <i>Y-Not\'s 2018 Year End Poll</i> and tuned in for the <i>Top 218 of 2018</i>. If you missed any of the countdown, you can listen on demand and see the entire list of songs and poll results <a href=\"yearendpoll.php\"><b>HERE</b></a>. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<!--Congratulations to our Year End Poll contest winner <b>Joe Barney</b>, who will receive a $100 iTunes gift card and will count down his Top 20 of 2018 on Y-Not Radio soon!\r\n<br><br>-->\r\n<i>Y-Not\'s Top 218 of 2018 was brought to you by <a href=\"https://gopuff.onelink.me/QbZT/YNotRadio\" target=_blank>GoPuff</a>! </i>\r\n','https://i.imgur.com/6ZS2u0d.jpg?1','yearendpoll.php',5,'n'),(540,'2018-11-26','2018-12-01','Win Cloud Nothings Tickets','<b>Cloud Nothings</b> return to Philly next Thursday, December 4th at Union Transfer with <b>The Courtneys</b>, in support of their new record <i>Last Building Burning</i> <b><a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER HERE</a></b> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"https://utphilly.com/events/cloud-nothings/\" target=\"_blank\">UTphilly.com</a>.','http://discoveredmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/Cloud-Nothings-2018-265x198.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(541,'2018-12-18','2018-12-24','Choice Tasters Lounge w/ Carl Broemel','Tune in for a special 2 hour edition of <em>The Choice Tasters Lounge</em> with <strong>Jersey Dan</strong> this Friday night from 9-11pm or Sunday from 7-9pm.  Dan will be joined for an interview by <strong>Carl Broemel</strong> of <strong>My Morning Jacket</strong>, chatting about his new album <em>Wished Out</em>.','https://d2xt1dfa91srgk.cloudfront.net/media/214893/300c.jpg','schedule.php',4,'n'),(542,'2018-12-18','2018-12-31','Y-Not Best Of 2018 Specials','If you missed the Best of 2018 editions of Y-Not Radio\'s specialty shows like <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <i>Aussie Unlocked</i>, <i>Sounds Canadian</i>, <em>Women Crush Wednesday</em>, or <em>Transmission</em>, you can listen to any of them <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a> or catch replays all day on Saturday, December 29th. ','https://i.imgur.com/feln4Jj.jpg?2','shows.php',4,'n'),(543,'2018-12-18','2018-12-31','Y-Not Sessions: Best of 2018','If you missed our recap of this year\'s <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, including <strong>Screaming Females</strong>, <strong>The Wombats</strong>, <strong>Speedy Ortiz</strong>, <strong>The Beths</strong>, <strong>The Regrettes</strong>, <strong>Petal</strong>, <strong>Dream Wife</strong>, <strong>Hurry</strong>, <strong>Castlecomer</strong>, <strong>The Sherlocks</strong>, <strong>GGOOLLDD</strong>, <strong>Miya Folick</strong>, and more, you can hear it replay on New Year\'s Eve from 10am-Noon.  And listen to any of those sessions in their entirety <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/oLUKJl5.png?1','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/y-not-sessions-best-of-2018/',2,'n'),(544,'2019-01-01','2019-01-31','Y-Not Best Of 2018 Specials','If you missed any of the Best of 2018 editions of Y-Not Radio\'s specialty shows including <i>Britspotting</i>, <i>Noise Complaint</i>, <i>Y-Not Philly</i>, <i>Transmission</i>, <i>Aussie Unlocked</i>, <i>Sounds Canadian</i>, <i>Women Crush Wednesday</i>, or <i>Choice Tasters Lounge</i>, they\'re all available On Demand <a href=\"shows.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/feln4Jj.jpg?2','shows.php',6,'y'),(545,'2019-03-01','2019-03-07','Win Psychedelic Porn Crumpets Tickets','Y-Not\'s <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> Presents Australian band <b>Psychedelic Porn Crumpets</b> with <b>Frankie & The Witch Fingers</b> on Thursday, March 7th at Kung Fu Necktie.   <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> to win a pair \r\nof tickets  or buy them at <a href=\"https://www.kungfunecktie.com/event/1795608-psychedelic-porn-crumpets-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">KungFuNecktie.com</a> \r\n <em>Tune in for a new episode of Aussie Unlocked with <strong>Shana</strong> this Tuesday at 8pm or Saturday at 4pm to hear all the latest sounds from down under.</em>','https://www.ticketweb.uk//i/00/08/31/97/79_Listings.jpg?v=5','contests.php',3,'n'),(546,'2019-03-30','2019-03-31','Dentist Y-Not Session','Asbury Park, NJ trio <strong>Dentist</strong> played in Philly recently and stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to perform acoustic versions of songs from their latest album <em>Night Swimming</em> and chat with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>.  Hear their session, now <a href=\"OnDemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/tufpq6D.jpg?1','ondemand.php',10,'n'),(547,'2019-02-25','2019-03-01','Win Le Butcherettes Tickets','Mexican band <b>Le Butcherettes</b> return to Philadelphia this Friday night, March 1st at The Hard Rock Cafe (moved from MilkBoy) in support of their latest album <em>bi/MENTAL</em>.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> to win a pair \r\nof tickets  or buy them <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/le-butcherettes-previously-at-milkboy-tickets-57436559295\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://www.cantstopthemusic.com.mx/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/le-butcherettes-300x200.jpg','contests.php',3,'y'),(548,'2019-02-25','2019-03-09','Noise Complaint','Last week longtime host <b>Bryne Yancey</b> had his final episode of Y-Not\'s punk show <em>Noise Complaint</em>!  If you missed it, be sure to check it out <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a>.  And tune in this week for the Noise Complaint relaunch with new host <b>Keith Obaza</b> at its new times – Tuesday at 9pm with a replay on Saturday at 8pm. <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/shows\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/0VqVJBe.jpg','shows.php',9,'n'),(549,'2019-03-18','2019-04-20','Modern Rock Madness 2019','Congratulations to our 2019 <i>Modern Rock Madness</i> champions, <b>Metric</b>!  See how they got there and how the whole tournament went down <a href=\"madness.php\">HERE</a>. ','https://i.imgur.com/Td4B2A2.jpg','madness.php',9,'n'),(550,'2019-03-11','2019-03-16','Win Pixies Tickets','The legendary <b>Pixies </b>return to Philly next Monday, March 18th at The Fillmore. <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> to win a pair \r\nof tickets  or buy them at <a href=\"http://www.thefillmorephilly.com/EventDetail?tmeventid=02005552B41B52F6&offerid=92526\" target=\"_blank\">TheFillmorePhlly.com</a>.','https://consequenceofsound.files.wordpress.com/2017/02/pixies.jpeg?quality=80&w=150&h=150&crop=1','contests.php',1,'n'),(551,'2019-03-18','2019-03-31','Y-Not Internacional','Last week <em>Y-Not Internacional </em> returned in an all-new monthly format with longtime host <strong>Gil </strong>back to bring you indie rock en Espanol and from all over the world! If you missed it, listen anytime <a href=\"shows.php\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.','https://thumbnailer.mixcloud.com/unsafe/300x300/extaudio/6/2/8/a/7410-d161-4666-9b17-0bc6ac089d7e','shows.php',10,'n'),(552,'2019-03-18','2019-03-31','Win Ex Hex Tickets','Punk trio <b>Ex Hex</b> return to  Philly next  Wednesday, April 3rd  at Union Transfer in support of their 2nd album <em>It\'s Real</em>.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> to win a pair \r\nof tickets  or buy them at <a href=\"https://utphilly.com/events/ex-hex/\" target=\"_blank\">UTphilly.com</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/vRAOxlq.jpg?2','contests.php',3,'n'),(553,'2019-03-18','2019-03-31','Tokyo Police Club Radio Takeover','Before <b>Tokyo Police Club</b>\'s recent sold out Boot & Saddle show, keyboardist/guitarist <b>Graham Wright</b> sat down with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to chat about their new album <i>TPC</i> and to guest DJ for a <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>! Hear it anytime <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a>.','http://www.scwist.ca/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/Graham_Wright_Tokyo-Police-Club-3-e1424562870934-300x280.png','shows.php',3,'n'),(554,'2019-04-30','2019-05-01','<font size=2>TEEN Women CRUSH Wednesday Takeover</font>','Every Wednesday from 5-6pm, <b>Courtney Blue</b> spins an hour of music exclusively from female artists and bands!  Tune in this week to hear <strong>TEEN</strong> take over the show, including songs from their new album <em>Good Fruit</em>!  If you missed it on Wednesday, catch a replay on Sunday at noon.','http://carparkrecords.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/TEEN_GoodFruit_HannahWhitaker_Lead1-copy-460x326.jpg','http://www.teentheband.net/',3,'y'),(555,'2019-04-29','2019-04-30','Win Santigold Tickets','<b>Santigold</b> comes home to Philadelphia this Sunday night, May 5th at The Fillmore on her <i>10 Years Golder Tour</i>!  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a last chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"https://concerts1.livenation.com/event/0200564FE882A045\" target=_blank>TheFillmorePhilly.com</a>.  ','https://i.imgur.com/RZEWunL.jpg?1','contests.php',3,'n'),(556,'2019-04-08','2019-04-30','Madalean Gauze Band Y-Not Session','Philly\'s <b>Madalean Gauze Band</b> just released their new album <em><a href=\"https://madaleangauze.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Nothing Feels Beautiful Anymore</a></em> and will celebrate on Saturday April 20th at <a href=\"https://bootandsaddlephilly.com/event/the-madalean-gauze-band/\" target=\"_blank\">Boot & Saddle</a>!  Get a preview of the show and the album with a live session and interview available now <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/GAuiQpGs.jpg?1','https://madaleangauze.bandcamp.com/',3,'y'),(557,'2019-04-15','2019-05-04','Amanda Palmer Y-Not Session','A few weeks ago Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> met up with <b>Amanda Palmer</b> before her solo show at The Temple Performing Arts Center.  Hear Amanda perform ukulele songs from her latest album, <em>There Will Be No Intermission</em>, along with an in-depth interview this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em>, with replays that night at 11pm after <em>Rodney Anonymous Tells You How To Live</em>, and Sunday at 11am during <em>The Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','https://i.imgur.com/16VsJc3.jpg?1','https://amandapalmer.net/',1,'n'),(558,'2019-04-30','2019-05-04','Ex Hex Radio Takeover','When <b>Ex Hex</b> played in Philly a few weeks ago, Y-Not’s <b>Joey O.</b> sat down with band members <b>Mary Timony</b>, <b>Betsy Wright</b>, and <b>Laura Harris</b> to chat about their new record <i>It’s Real</i> and they picked out a playlist for a <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>!  Hear it anytime <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/XYTIR2Q.jpg?1','https://exhexband.com',4,'n'),(559,'2019-04-25','2019-07-31','Y-Not\'s 9th Anniversary Celebration','Thanks to everyone who came out to <em>Y-Not\'s 9th Anniversary Celebration</em> with <strong>Potty Mouth</strong>, <strong>Colleen Green</strong>, and  <strong>Tact</strong>! It was a fantastic afternoon filled with awesome tunes at Kung Fu Necktie! Check our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/ynotradio/photos/?tab=album&album_id=2511054015580145\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page</a> for a full photo gallery from the show.','http://i.imgur.com/vSZ9j1c.jpg?1','https://www.facebook.com/pg/ynotradio/photos/?tab=album&album_id=2511054015580145',6,'n'),(560,'2019-08-31','2019-09-01','Win Smashing Pumpkins<br>+ Noel Gallagher Tickets','<b>Smashing Pumpkins</b> and <b>Noel Gallagher\'s High Flying Birds</b> are teaming up for a tour this summer that\'ll bring them to the BB&T Pavilion in Camden on Thursday, August 8th!  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"https://www.livenation.com/events/1036716-aug-8-2019-the-smashing-pumpkins-noel-gallagher-s-high-flying-birds\" target=_blank>LiveNation.com</a>. ','https://vmcdn.ca/f/files/shared/feeds/global/2019/03/noel-billy.jpg;w=630','contests.php',19,'n'),(561,'2019-05-06','2019-05-13','Amanda Palmer Y-Not Session','A few weeks ago Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> met up with <b>Amanda Palmer</b> before her solo show at The Temple Performing Arts Center for an interview and performance of ukulele songs from her latest album, <em>There Will Be No Intermission</em>.  You can now hear the session anytime <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>!','https://i.imgur.com/16VsJc3.jpg?1','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(562,'2019-05-13','2019-05-31','Tacocat Radio Takeover','Y-Not favorites <b>Tacocat</b> just released their 4th album <i>This Mess Is A Place</i> and before their Philly show last week, <b>Emily</b>, <b>Bree</b>, <b>Lelah</b>, and <b>Eric</b> joined us to share some of their favorite tunes, plus songs from the new record!  If you missed the <i>Tacocat Radio Takeover</i>, hear it anytime <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/Jtte0Mb.jpg?1','ondemand.php',6,'y'),(563,'2019-05-20','2019-05-28','<font size=2>Y-Not\'s Memorial Day Block Party Weekend</font>','Kick off the summer with Y-Not Radio as the soundtrack to your Memorial Day weekend as we play blocks of your favorite indie rock artists from Friday thru Monday, starting at 10am each day. <a href=\"http://www.ynotradio.net/contact.php\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to request a block. </a>','https://i.imgur.com/EIqxtAl.jpg','schedule.php',1,'y'),(564,'2019-05-20','2019-05-26','Great Time Y-Not Philly Session ','Tune in for this week\'s episode of <em>Y-Not Philly</em> on Saturday at 5pm to hear an interview and live session from <b>Great Time</b>, performing songs from their recent release, <em>Great Album</em>.  <em>Catch Great Time at <a href=\"http://www.johnnybrendas.com/e/son-step-60767667730/\" target=\"_blank\">Johnny Brenda\'s</a> on June 6th or at the <a href=\"http://molestice.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Molestice Music Festival</a> on June 22nd.  Find out more about Great Time <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/GREATTIMEBAND/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</em>','https://i.imgur.com/UX1kQlf.jpg?1','https://www.facebook.com/GREATTIMEBAND/',4,'n'),(565,'2019-05-28','2019-06-03','WAX WAV Y-Not Philly Session ','Tune in for this week\'s episode of <em>Y-Not Philly</em> on Saturday at Saturday at 5pm or <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a> to hear an interview and live session from <strong>WAX WAV</strong>.  <em>See them this Saturday night at <a href=\"https://www.ortliebsphilly.com/event/1839078-wax-wav-wallace-above-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">Ortlieb\'s</a> with <strong>Wallace</strong> and <strong>Above The Moon</strong> or at <a href=\"https://www.davekisspresents.com/event/1824072-waax-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">Y-Not\'s 9th Anniversary Celebration - Part 2</a> with <b>WAAX</b> on July 8th at Kung Fu Necktie.  Get WAX WAV\'s EPs <a href=\"https://waxwav.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</em>','https://i.imgur.com/Z00DKNw.png?1','https://waxwav.bandcamp.com/',2,'n'),(566,'2019-06-03','2019-06-15','Priests Radio Takeover','When <strong>Priests </strong> were in Philly recently, they sat down with Y-Not\'s <strong>Joey O.</strong> to share some favorite songs and influences for their new album <em>The Seduction of Kansas</em>!  If you missed their <i>Radio Takeover</i> last week, you can hear it anytime <a href=\"OnDemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/OWKj5ka.jpg?1','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(567,'2019-09-09','2019-09-13','Y-Not @ Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll','This Thursday, September 12th is the return of <i>The Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll</i>, from 5:30-8:30pm between 43rd & 52nd Streets in West Philly! Stop by the Y-Not Radio tent at the corner of 47th & Baltimore for $1 CDs and a chance to win tickets for upcoming concerts.  Find out more about the <em>Dollar Stroll</em> at <a href=\"https://www.universitycity.org/events/dollarstroll\" target=\"_blank\">UniversityCity.org</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/fhvnY7g.jpg','https://www.universitycity.org/events/dollarstroll',4,'y'),(568,'2019-06-03','2019-06-09','TR/ST Transmission Takeover ','Tune in Thursday nights from 9-11 or Saturdays from 6-8pm for <em>Transmission</em> – 2 hours of indie electronic and dance music with <strong>Rob Huff</strong>! This week Canadian electronic artist <strong>TR/ST </strong>joins Rob for a guest DJ set! TR/ST\'s latest album <em><a href=\"http://smarturl.it/TheDestroyerP1?fbclid=IwAR1CAqEqjhx6xHxcw1cpWTQeqH_a5zYpjgDocYcdi0stpOOOXutnOJAggrc\" target=\"_blank\">The Destroyer -- 1</a></em> is available now.','https://image-ticketfly.imgix.net/00/03/13/55/30-og.jpg?w=167&h=333','http://smarturl.it/TheDestroyerP1?fbclid=IwAR1CAqEqjhx6xHxcw1cpWTQeqH_a5zYpjgDocYcdi0stpOOOXutnOJAggrc',2,'n'),(569,'2019-06-10','2019-06-30','Filthy Friends Interview','Y-Not Radio\'s <strong>Joey O.</strong> and <strong>Rob Huff</strong> recently chatted with <strong>Corin Tucker</strong> of  <strong>Sleater-Kinney</strong> and <strong>Peter Buck</strong> of <strong>R.E.M.</strong>, about their collaborative supergroup <strong>Filthy Friends</strong>.  If you missed it, you can listen to the interview and songs from their new album <em>Emerald Valley</em>, any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\"><b>On Demand</b></a>!','https://i.imgur.com/zkavb42.jpg?1','ondemand.php',2,'y'),(570,'2019-06-24','2019-07-06','Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever<br>Aussie Unlocked Takeover','Every other week, <b>Shana</b> takes you down under for an hour of music from Australia.   Last week she was joined by <b>Tom</b> and <b>Fran</b> from <b>Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever</b> for a special <em>Aussie Unlocked Radio Takeover</em>!  If you missed it, listen any time at <a href=\"OnDemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/8INbEtt.jpg?1','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(571,'2019-06-24','2019-07-01','The Black Keys: <i>Let\'s Rock</i> Radio Special','This Friday <strong>The Black Keys</strong> release their 9th album <em>Let\'s Rock</em> and Y-Not\'s founding father <strong>Jim McGuinn</strong> got to chat with <strong>Dan Auerbach</strong> and <strong>Patrick Carney</strong> about making the record at their <strong>Easy Eye Sound Studio</strong> in Nashville.  Tune in to hear this special presentation on Friday at 3pm or Sunday at noon.','https://i.imgur.com/D6iRLZJ.jpg?1','https://www.theblackkeys.com/',3,'n'),(572,'2019-07-01','2019-07-05','Britspotting 4th of July Marathon','Here at Y-Not Radio we celebrate Independence Day by listening to music from the empire whose tyrannical rule we escaped in 1776.  Tune in July 4th starting at 10am for our annual <em>Britspotting</em> Marathon and enjoy music exclusively from across the pond with <strong>Matt McGrath</strong> all day long.  Catch new episodes of <em>Britspotting</em> on Monday nights at 8 with encores on Saturdays at 2pm and episodes are <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/discover/british+britpop+ynotradio/?order=latest\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand here</a>.','https://thumbnailer.mixcloud.com/unsafe/300x300/extaudio/e/4/7/e/fe3a-35c0-4888-945e-32150534c31a','https://www.mixcloud.com/discover/british+britpop+ynotradio/?order=latest',2,'n'),(573,'2019-07-15','2019-07-31','Cayucas Y-Not Session On Demand','California indie pop band <strong>Cayucas</strong> recently played in Philly and stopped by the Y-Not Bunker to chat with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> and perform acoustic versions of songs from their latest album <em>Real Life</em> (plus a fun cover tune)!  If you missed their session last week, you can listen any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','http://i.imgur.com/QxVdsAZ.jpg?1','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(574,'2019-08-05','2019-08-12','Sacred Paws Y-Not Session','Scottish band <strong>Sacred Paws</strong> recently played in Philly and took some time to record a <em>Y-Not Session</em> live at PhilaMOCA, performing songs from their new album <em>Run Around The Sun</em>, and chatting with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>!  Hear their session, premiering this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em>, with replays that night at 10pm and Sunday morning at 11 during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>. ','https://d3c1jucybpy4ua.cloudfront.net/data/62109/main_article/Sacred_Paws_-_2019_06_-_please_credit_Katherine_Rose.jpg','https://www.mergerecords.com/sacred-paws',2,'n'),(575,'2019-08-12','2019-08-31','Summer Cannibals Y-Not Session','Portland band <strong>Summer Cannibals</strong> recently played in Philly and visited us for a <em>Y-Not Session</em> at Big Mama\'s Recording, performing songs from their new album <em>Can\'t Tell Me No</em>, and chatting with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>!  If you missed their session last week, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. ','http://f4.bcbits.com/img/0016300349_23.jpg','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(576,'2019-08-19','2019-09-21','Queen of Jeans Y-Not Session','Philly favorites <b>Queen of Jeans</b> just released their 2nd album <em>if you\'re not afraid, i\'m not afraid</em>.  <b>Miri</b> & <b>Mattie</b> from the band celebrated with Y-Not by performing session for <i>Y-Not Philly</i> and guest-hosting <em>Women Crush Wednesday</em>.  If you missed either, hear them <a href=\"ondemand.php?id=419\">On Demand</a>! \r\n Get the new album <a href=\"https://queenofjeans.bandcamp.com/album/if-youre-not-afraid-im-not-afraid\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and see them this Friday, Sept. 6th at <a href=\"https://bootandsaddlephilly.com/event/queen-of-jeans/\" target=\"_blank\">Boot & Saddle</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/1VoVdPG.jpg?1','https://www.queenofjeans.net',7,'y'),(577,'2019-08-29','2019-09-03','Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day Weekend','This Labor Day Weekend, the Y-Not DJs are off, but the music will be live! From Friday through Monday we\'ll be playing tracks from <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, old <strong>Y100</strong> and <strong>WDRE</strong> <em>Sonic Sessions</em>, and plenty of other live album tracks as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"mobile.php\">iRadioPhilly app</a> for <a href=\"http://itunes.apple.com/us/app/iradiophilly/id428128166?mt=8\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone</a> or <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.internetradiopartners.iradiophilly2\" target=\"_blank\">Android</a> and make <em>Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day</em> the soundtrack for your end of summer festivities!','https://dev.opendrive.com/api/v1/download/file.json/106736924_Xh08f?inline=1','mobile.php',1,'y'),(578,'2019-09-02','2019-09-30','Spoon Interview On Demand','When <b>Spoon</b> came to the BB&T Pavilion in Camden on tour with <b>Beck</b> last month, Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> had the chance to sit down with frontman <b>Britt Daniel</b> for a wide-ranging chat about Spoon\'s long career and new greatest hits album, <em>Everything Hits At Once: The Best of Spoon</em>. Hear the interview <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/p3V6yLx.jpg?1','http://www.spoontheband.com/spoon/',9,'y'),(579,'2019-09-09','2019-09-30','Alex Lahey Y-Not Session','When she played Philly last month, Australian artist <strong>Alex Lahey</strong> also brought her band over to <a href=\"https://www.cambridgesoundstudios.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Cambridge Sound Studios</a> to record a <em>Y-Not Session</em>!  Hear them performing songs from the new album <em>The Best of Luck Club</em> and Alex\'s chat with Y-Not\'s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> this Friday at 3:30pm during <em>Future Friday</em>, with replays that night at 11pm, Saturday at 9pm, and Sunday morning at 11 during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>.','https://i.imgur.com/8zrPira.png?1','https://thebestofluckclub.com/',1,'n'),(580,'2019-09-16','2019-09-23','Win Philly Music Fest Passes','<em>Philly Music Fest</em> returns next week with over 20 bands, over 4 nights, across 3 venues.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> for a chance to win a pair of passes for Friday and Saturday\'s shows at World Café Live featuring <b>Vacationer</b>, <b>Restorations</b>, <b>RFA</b>, and <b>Ali Awan</b> on Friday, and <b>Man Man</b>, <b>Petal</b>, <b>Thin Lips</b>, and <b>The Spirit of The Beehive</b> on Saturday.  \r\nFind the full lineup and purchase tickets <a href=\"https://phlmusicfest.com\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. ','https://i.imgur.com/nPFM0Gb.png?1','contests.php',1,'n'),(581,'2019-09-23','2019-09-30','Win Electric Six Tickets','<b>Electric Six</b> return for their annual visit to the Philadelphia area, this time heading out to the burbs, next Friday, October 4th at 118 North in Wayne, PA.    <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"http://www.118northwayne.com/e/electric-six-66239274453/\" target=\"_blank\">118NorthWayne.com</a>. ','https://image-ticketfly.imgix.net/00/03/24/34/37-og.jpg?w=500&h=334&fit=crop&crop=top','contests.php',4,'n'),(582,'2019-09-30','2019-10-31','Alex Lahey Y-Not Session On Demand','When she played Philly recently, Australian artist <strong>Alex Lahey</strong> also brought her band over to <a href=\"https://www.cambridgesoundstudios.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Cambridge Sound Studios</a> to record a <em>Y-Not Session</em>!  Hear them performing songs from the new album <em>The Best of Luck Club</em> and see video of the session <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. ','https://i.imgur.com/e8oBwBC.jpg?1','ondemand.php',7,'n'),(583,'2019-09-30','2019-10-05','Metronomy Radio Takeover','English electro-band <strong>Metronomy</strong> were in Philly last week to shoot a music video, but also stopped by The Bunker for the next <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>! Hear <b>Joe</b>, <b>Anna</b>, and <b>Oscar</b> from the band guest DJ and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> about their new album <em>Metronomy Forever</em> this Friday at 2pm with replays on Saturday at 9pm and Sunday at noon.','https://i.imgur.com/ZuDLzyl.jpg?1','http://www.metronomy.co.uk/',1,'n'),(584,'2019-09-30','2019-10-04','Win Regrettes Tickets','<b>The Regrettes</b> return to Philly in support of their new album <i>How Do You Love?</i> this Saturday night at The Foundry.  The show is SOLD OUT, but you can <a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER HERE</a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets. ','https://media.ticketmaster.co.uk/tm/en-gb/dam/a/0d7/c1642592-aaa5-415f-97da-60c17c5ec0d7_1040591_CUSTOM.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(585,'2019-09-30','2019-10-19','Metronomy Radio Takeover','English electro-band <strong>Metronomy</strong> were in Philly last month to shoot a music video, but also stopped by The Bunker to host a <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>! Hear <strong>Joe</strong>, <strong>Anna</strong>, and <strong>Oscar</strong> from the band guest DJ and chat with<strong> Josh T. Landow</strong> about their new album <em>Metronomy Forever</em> any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/ZuDLzyl.jpg?1','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(586,'2019-10-07','2019-10-31','Ali Barter Y-Not Session','Australian artist <b>Ali Barter</b> recently visited Y-Not Radio to promote her upcoming album <em>Hello, I\'m Doing My Best</em>, which will be released this Friday, October 18th.  Hear Ali perform songs from the album and chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> <a href=\"ondemand.php\"><b>On Demand</b></a>.','https://i.imgur.com/48kMkeW.jpg?1','ondemand.php',10,'n'),(587,'2019-10-11','2019-10-17','Win !!! Tickets','<b>!!! (Chk Chk Chk)</b> recently released their 8th album <em>Wallop</em>, and will be coming to Philly in support of it this Friday, October 18th at Underground Arts.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a  chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"https://www.undergroundarts.org/event/1871846-chk-chk-chk-philadelphia/\" target=\"_blank\">UndergroundArts.org</a>.','https://image-ticketfly.imgix.net/00/03/22/17/59-og.jpg?w=200&h=133&fit=crop&crop=top','contests.php',3,'n'),(588,'2019-10-28','2019-11-09','Hatchie Radio Takeover','Y-Not Radio\'s <em>Aussie Unlocked</em> host <b>Shana</b> recently caught up with Australian artist <b>Hatchie</b>, on tour in support of her debut album <em>Keepsake</em>, for another <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>!  If you missed it, you can hear Hatchie chatting about the album and her DJ set any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/CI1WBSD.jpg?1','ondemand.php',10,'y'),(589,'2019-10-21','2019-10-28','Win Jay Som Tickets','<b>Jay Som</b> comes to Philly to play The Foundry next Tuesday, October 29th in support of her new album <em>Anak Ko</em>.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a  chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"http://www.thefillmorephilly.com/EventDetail?tmeventid=020056BCCDF183B5&offerid=105453\" target=\"_blank\">TheFillmorePhilly[dot]com</a>.','http://image-ticketfly.imgix.net/00/03/20/95/56-og.jpg?w=300&h=200','contests.php',2,'n'),(590,'2019-10-28','2019-11-01','Win White Reaper Tickets','<b>White Reaper</b> return to Philly to play Underground Arts this Friday, November 1st.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets and a download of their new album <em>You Deserve Love</em>, or buy tickets at <a href=\"https://www.undergroundarts.org/e/radio-presents-white-reaper-67614088559/\" target=\"_blank\">UndergroundArts.org</a>.','https://stitchedsound.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/image011-432x400.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(591,'2019-11-04','2019-11-30','Win Ra Ra Riot Tickets','<b>Ra Ra Riot</b> comes to town this Thursday night at The TLA in support of their new album <em>Superbloom</em>, and Y-Not Radio has one last chance for you to win tickets for the show!  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair or buy tickets at <a href=\"https://livemu.sc/31vpZmY\" target=\"_blank\">TLAPhilly.com</a>.','http://www.ticketweb.uk//i/00/08/94/80/79_Listings.jpg?v=6','contests.php',3,'y'),(592,'2019-11-11','2019-11-30','Miss June Y-Not Session','New Zealand band <strong>Miss June</strong> recently visited Y-Not Radio for an acoustic performance of  songs from their debut album <em>Bad Luck Party</em> and a chat with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>.  Hear their session any time <a href=\"onedemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','http://www.thevpme.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/Miss-June-252x167.jpg','ondemand.php',4,'y'),(593,'2019-11-18','2019-11-30','Charly Bliss Radio Takeover','Y-Not favorites <b>Charly Bliss</b> were in Philly last week and sat down before their show with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and <b>Joey O.</b> to host a <em>Radio Takeover</em>.   If you missed it, you can listen any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> to hear Charly Bliss sharing a playlist of their favorite songs, plus tracks from their album <em>Young Enough</em> and brand new EP, <em>Supermoon</em>.','https://i.imgur.com/IWRsPJu.jpg?1','http://charlybliss.com/',5,'n'),(594,'2019-11-25','2019-12-14','New Pornographers Interview','<b>The New Pornographers</b> returned to Philadelphia earlier this month and Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Josh T. Landow</b> had the opportunity to catch up with founder and frontman <b>A.C. Newman</b>.  Hear their interview about the new album <em>In The Morse Code of Brake Lights</em> and tracks from the record, now <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/IHEjYR5.jpg?1','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(595,'2019-11-25','2019-11-29','Y-Not\'s Turkey Day Takeovers','Tune in on Thanksgiving Day starting at 9am as Y-Not Radio continues the tradition of <em>Turkey Day Takeovers</em>, featuring this year\'s guest DJ sets from the likes of <strong>Tacocat</strong>, <strong>Charly Bliss</strong>, <strong>Priests</strong>, <strong>Ex Hex</strong>, <strong>Tokyo Police Club</strong>, <strong>Hatchie</strong>, <strong>Metronomy</strong>, <strong>Queen of Jeans</strong>, and more! <!--Check out the full schedule <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/schedule\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and -->Listen to any of our <i>Y-Not Takeovers</i> <a href=\"http://ynotradio.net/ondemand\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a> anytime.','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',1,'n'),(596,'2019-11-25','2019-12-07','Y-Not\'s Black Friday Shuffle and Sale','Tune in to Y-Not Radio from 6am-8pm on Black Friday for our all-black shuffle! And help Y-Not end the year in the black by making a donation. We still need to raise <b>$100</b> to pay for this month\'s streaming and music royalty fees. Show your support and we\'ll say thanks with a Y-Not t-shirt or a new album from <b>Beck</b>, <b>Foals</b>, <b>The Menzingers</b>, <b>White Reaper</b>, <b>Bat For Lashes</b>, <b>Thom Yorke</b>, or others to choose from.<br>\r\n\r\n  <center><b><a href=\"donate.php\">DONATE HERE</a></b>\r\n  </center>','http://www.ynotradio.net/images/ynotblackfriday.png','donate.php',1,'n'),(597,'2020-12-30','2020-12-31','Y-Not Quarantine Takeovers','Y-Not Radio is still giving you the chance to be a DJ from home!  All you need is the audio recorder on your phone, and you can host a <em>Y-Not Quarantine Takeover</em>!  We\'re looking for DJs for upcoming weeks so <a href=\"mailto:josh@ynotradio.net\">submit</a> an hour-long playlist now.  Tune in Fridays at 2pm and 10pm for new <em>Quarantine Takeovers</em> and you can hear previous episodes <a href=\"http://YNotRadio.net/Quarantine\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/VdhPYGE.jpg','http://www.ynotradio.net/quarantine',10,'y'),(598,'2020-11-22','2020-11-28','<font size=\"2\">Y-Not\'s Turkey Day Quarantine Takeovers</font>','Happy Thanksgiving everybody! This year Y-Not Radio continues the tradition of <em>Turkey Day Takeovers</em>, with a 2020 twist.  Tune in on Thanksgiving Day and Black Friday from 9am-Midnight each day to hear <em>Quarantine Takeovers</em> hosted by Y-Not listeners from home! And hear any of the <em>Quarantine Takeovers</em> <a href=\"quarantine.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','quarantine.php',1,'n'),(599,'2020-11-23','2021-01-31','Y-Not\'s Top 220 of 2020','If you missed any of the <i> Top 220 of 2020</i> countdown, you can listen on demand and see the entire list of songs and poll results <a href=\"yearendpoll.php\"><b>HERE</b></a>.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<i>Y-Not\'s Year End Poll was brought to you by <b>goPuff</b>.  <a href=\"https://gopuff.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Get $5 off your first two orders with the code: <b>YNOT</b>.</a></i>\r\n<br><br>\r\nCongratulations to the <em>Year End Poll</em> contest winner <b>Patrick Pettit</b> of Narberth, who won a $100 goPuff gift card and  counted down his Top 20 of 2020 on Y-Not Radio! If you missed Patrick\'s countdown, listen <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/patrick-pettits-top-20-of-2020/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/In5pEsh.png','yearendpoll.php',6,'n'),(600,'2020-11-30','2020-12-19','Sad13 Quarantine Takeover','Every week, Y-Not Radio has been giving listeners the chance to guest DJ, but for the latest <em>Y-Not Quarantine Takeover</em> <b>Sad13</b> (aka <b>Sadie Dupuis</b> of <b>Speedy Ortiz</b>) took over with her playlist and chatted with Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> about her new album <em>Haunted Painting</em>.  If you missed it, you can listen any time, along with all the previous <i>Quarantine Takeovers</i>, <a href=\"quarantine.php\">On Demand</a>.</em>','https://i.imgur.com/Z5sfKob.jpg?1','https://www.sad13.horse/',5,'n'),(601,'2020-12-14','2020-12-31','Secret American Quarantine Takeover','Last week we wrapped up <em>Y-Not\'s Quarantine Takeovers</em> with our buddies <strong>Derek</strong> and <strong>Todd</strong> from <strong>Secret American</strong>, who spread some holiday cheer with their bandmates in quarantine.  They also chatted with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> about their 2nd album, <em>Heavy Feels</em>.  If you missed it, listen any time <a href=\"quarantine.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://thumbnailer.mixcloud.com/unsafe/300x300/extaudio/0/2/d/e/9e53-7c5d-4843-a6d8-239f6ad8d40a','quarantine.php',2,'n'),(602,'2020-12-14','2021-01-09','Y-Not Best of 2020 Specials','If you missed the Best of 2020 editions of Y-Not Radio\'s specialty shows like <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Transmission</em>, or <em>Y-Not Internacional</em>, you can listen to any of them <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/6NBkitE.jpg','schedule.php',4,'n'),(603,'2020-12-14','2020-12-21','Y-Not Sessions: Best of 2020','This Friday at 3:30pm or Sunday at 10am, tune in to hear 2 hours of the best <em>Y-Not Session</em> tracks from the past year including <b>Mondo Cozmo</b>, <b>The Districts</b>, <b>Cults</b>, <b>Frances Quinlan</b>, <b>Phantom Planet</b>, <b>Worriers</b>, <b>Cheerleader</b>, <b>Tommy Siegel</b>, <b>Honey Cutt</b>, and more... \r\nAnd listen to any of those sessions in their entirety at <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/eSsQOpa.jpg?1','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(604,'2020-12-21','2020-12-26','Christmas @ Y-Not Radio','Tune in for Y-Not Radio\'s unique mix of holiday tunes on Christmas Eve and Christmas Day, including a <em>Noise Complaint</em> Xmas Special on Tuesday at 9pm, <em>T.G.I. 80\'s Xmas Nooner </em>on Thursday, and <b>Josh T. Landow</b> plays an hour of \"Last Christmas\" on Thursday at 1pm.','https://i.imgur.com/jmyUOXK.jpg?1','schedule.php',4,'n'),(605,'2021-01-09','2021-01-31','Y-Not Best of 2020 Specials','If you missed the Best of 2020 editions of Y-Not Radio\'s specialty shows like <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Transmission</em>, or <em>Y-Not Internacional</em>, you can listen to any of them <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/6NBkitE.jpg','shows.php',8,'n'),(606,'2021-01-18','2021-02-14','Eliza & The Delusionals Y-Not Session','Australian band <b>Eliza & The Delusionals</b> recently checked in with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> for the first <em>Y-Not Session</em> of 2021.  If you missed it, you can listen any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> and see video of them performing their new single \"Sentimental\" <a href=\"https://youtu.be/KT8yPnHM12E\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/MRrbqbn.png?1','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(607,'2021-02-08','2021-03-31','Baio Y-Not Session','After a massively busy 2019 supporting <strong>Vampire Weekend</strong>’s <em>Father of The Bride</em>, <b>Chris Baio</b> is back with his third solo album <em>Dead Hand Control</em>!  Last month he checked in with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and <b>Joey O.</b> for a chat and live performance.  If you missed it, you can now listen to Baio’s <em>Y-Not Session</em> <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/UXLVDHQ.png?1','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(608,'2021-02-22','2021-12-31','Y-Not On Demand','If you missed the latest <em>Y-Not Sessions</em> with <b>Colleen Green</b>, <b>The Bots</b>, and <b>Grace Vonderkuhn</b>, interviews with <b>They Might Be Giants</b> and <b>Dave Hause</b>, or <i>Radio Takeovers</i> with <b>Torres</b> and <b>The Joy Formidable</b>, you can hear them any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>, along with many more sessions, <em>Radio Takeovers</em>, and more.  Plus, catch up with Y-Not\'s specialty shows like <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Transmission</em>, or <em>Women CRUSH Wednesday</em> <a href=\"shows.php\">HERE</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/CXZD5GS.jpg?1','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(609,'2021-03-01','2021-04-30','Modern Rock Madness 2021','Congratulations to the <em>Modern Rock Madness 2021</em> champion <b>Jack White</b>!  Thanks for all of your votes along the way!  See how all the matches went down throughout the tournament <a href=\"madness.php\">HERE</a> and listen to the final match <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/modern-rock-madness-2021-the-final-match/\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>. ','https://i.imgur.com/Y46xxwo.png?1','madness.php',8,'n'),(610,'2021-03-22','2021-04-17','Tigers Jaw Y-Not Session ','Scranton PA\'s <b>Tigers Jaw</b> recently released their sixth album <i>I Won\'t Care How You Remember Me</i> and checked in with Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> for an interview and live performance of songs from that new record.  If you missed it, you can now hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i0.wp.com/www.recovery-magazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/tigers-jaw.jpg?resize=640%2C427','https://www.tigersjaw.com/',4,'n'),(611,'2021-04-27','2021-05-15','Ron Gallo Radio Takeover','Philadelphia\'s own <b>Ron Gallo</b> recently released his third solo album <i>PEACEMEAL</i> and checked in last month with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to host his own <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>, which you can hear any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. ','https://i.imgur.com/nQf0KJW.jpg?1','ondemand.php',2,'n'),(612,'2021-05-17','2021-06-05','Remember Sports Y-Not Session','Philly band <b>Remember Sports</b> just released their 4th album <i>Like A Stone</i> last month.  Last week they performed some songs from the album and chatted with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> for the first in-person <i>Y-Not Session</i> in over a year, recorded at <a href=\"https://kellycenter.org/\" target=_blank><b>The Kelly Center</b></a> in Havertown.  If you missed it, you can hear it any time at <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/fIz0wWP.jpg?1','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(613,'2021-05-17','2021-06-05','Ron Gallo Radio Takeover','Philadelphia\'s own <b>Ron Gallo</b> recently released his third solo album <i>PEACEMEAL</i> and checked in with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to host a <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>, which you can hear any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. ','https://thumbnailer.mixcloud.com/unsafe/120x120/extaudio/8/e/2/1/6a1e-178d-4c93-b7e0-b91ed29f3732','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(614,'2021-05-24','2021-06-01','<font size=2>Y-Not\'s Memorial Day Block Party Weekend</font>','Kick off the summer with Y-Not Radio as the soundtrack to your Memorial Day weekend.  We’ll be playing blocks of your favorite indie rock artists from Friday thru Monday!  See the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/EIqxtAl.jpg','schedule.php',1,'n'),(615,'2021-06-07','2021-06-30','<font size=2>Ben Kweller Interview + Live Performance</font>','Y-Not’s old pal <strong>Ben Kweller</strong> has a new record <em>Circuit Boredom</em> that came out earlier this year and chatted about it with Y-Not Radio’s <strong>Joey O.</strong> If you missed Ben\'s interview and live performance last week, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/aBchiGI.png?1','https://benkweller.com/',6,'n'),(616,'2021-06-14','2021-07-10','Mannequin Pussy Y-Not Radio Takeover ','Philadelphia favorites <b>Mannequin Pussy</b> just released a new EP <em>Perfect</em> and frontwoman <b>Missy Dabice</b> joined Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to chat about it and  guest DJ for a <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>! If you missed the Takeover, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/lTlW8rb.jpg?1','https://mannequinpussy.com/',4,'n'),(617,'2021-06-28','2021-07-06','Y-Not Radio\'s Indie-Pendence Day Throwback Weekend ','Tune in this Friday afternoon through Monday  as we celebrate the founders of indie rock from the 70’s, 80’s, 90’s, and early 00’s during Y-Not Radio’s first ever <em>Indie-Pendence Day Throwback Weekend</em>!','https://i.imgur.com/yN2MtcY.jpg?1','http://www.iradiophilly.com/index.php?idStation=42',1,'n'),(618,'2021-07-19','2021-07-31','Y-Not Philly Session with Chewy','Last week Philly trio <b>Chewy</b> joined Hannah on <i>Y-Not Philly</i> to chat and perform tracks from their upcoming album <i>House of Chewy</i>, due August 27th.  If you missed it, you can hear that episode <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/y-not-philly-72121/\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>.  <i>Find music from Chewy <a href=\"https://chewyphl.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</i>','https://i.imgur.com/pT8OkUd.jpg?1','https://chewyphl.bandcamp.com/',3,'n'),(619,'2021-08-02','2021-08-31','Drew Beskin Y-Not Session','Athens, Georgia artist <strong>Drew Beskin </strong>just released his third album <em>Problematic For The People </em> and joined Y-Not\'s <strong>Joey O. </strong>to chat about and play songs from it for the latest <em>Y-Not Session</em>. If you missed it, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/DuSPCx2.jpg?1','ondemand.php',9,'y'),(620,'2021-08-16','2021-08-31','Japanese Breakfast Photo Album','<b>Japanese Breakfast</b> re-opened Philly\'s Union Transfer after a 17 month, pandemic-imposed closure with a run of 5 sold out shows. Check out our photo album from the last of those shows on August 11, 2021 with <b>Spirit of The Beehive</b> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?vanity=ynotradio&set=a.4474308722587988\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/kvSX1Vy.jpg?1','https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?vanity=ynotradio&set=a.4474308722587988',4,'n'),(621,'2021-08-23','2021-09-11','CHVRCHES Interview On Demand','On August 27th, Y-Not favorites <strong>CHVRCHES</strong> released their fourth album <em>Screen Violence</em> and <strong>Lauren</strong>, <strong>Ian</strong>, and <strong>Martin</strong> from the band joined <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> and <strong>Joey O.</strong> to chat about it and share some of the new songs. Listen to the CHVRCHES interview any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/Kc6yvy5.jpg?1','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(622,'2021-08-30','2021-09-11','Grace Vonderkuhn Y-Not Session','Wilmington, DE band <b>Grace Vonderkuhn</b> just released their second album <em>Pleasure Pain</em> and joined us for a <em>Y-Not Session</em> with the band performing songs from the new album and frontwoman <b>Grace</b> chatting with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.  If you missed the session, it\'s now available <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/4HT4lvK.jpg?1','https://gracevonderkuhn.bandcamp.com/',4,'n'),(623,'2021-08-30','2021-09-07','Live Labor Day Weekend','This Labor Day Weekend, the Y-Not DJs are off, but the music will be live! From Friday through Monday we\'ll be playing tracks from <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, old <b>Y100</b> and <b>WDRE</b> <em>Sonic Sessions</em>, and plenty of other live album tracks as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"http://iradiophilly.com/\" target=\"_blank\">iRadioPhilly</a> app and make Y-Not\'s <em>Live Labor Day</em> the soundtrack for your end-of-summer festivities!','https://dev.opendrive.com/api/v1/download/file.json/106736924_Xh08f?inline=1','schedule.php',1,'n'),(624,'2021-09-01','2021-09-30','Japanese Breakfast Photo Album','<b>Japanese Breakfast</b> re-opened Philly\'s Union Transfer after a 17 month, pandemic-imposed closure with a run of 5 sold out shows. Check out our photo album from the last of those shows on August 11, 2021 with <b>Spirit of The Beehive</b> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?vanity=ynotradio&set=a.4474308722587988\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/kvSX1Vy.jpg?1','https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?vanity=ynotradio&set=a.4474308722587988',8,'n'),(625,'2021-09-07','2021-10-09','The Joy Formidable Radio Takeover','Last month, Y-Not favorites <b>The Joy Formidable</b> released their fifth album <em>Into The Blue</em>. Singer <b>Ritzy Bryan</b> checked in with Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> to guest DJ for the next <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>! Tune in to hear all of her picks, plus songs from the new album <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/q89Mmhg.png?1','https://www.thejoyformidable.com/',6,'y'),(626,'2021-09-20','2021-10-09','The Bots Y-Not Session','<b>The Bots</b> just released their first album in seven years, <em>2 Seater</em>, and frontman <strong>Mikaiah Lei</strong> joined Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to chat and perform songs from the album.  Hear The Bots\' <em>Y-Not Session</em> any time <ah href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/BSwARHJ.png?1','ondemand.php',6,'n'),(627,'2021-09-27','2021-10-03','Win IDLES Tickets','<b>IDLES</b> return to Philly next Wednesday, October 13th at The Fillmore in support of their latest album <i>Ultra Mono</i> and their upcoming record <i>Crawler</i>.  <b><a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER HERE</a></b> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"https://concerts.livenation.com/idles-philadelphia-pennsylvania-10-13-2021/event/02005A95A70F1EFD\" target=_blank>TheFillmorePhilly.com</a>. ','https://i.imgur.com/mAqGaWB.jpg','contests.php',4,'n'),(628,'2021-11-08','2021-11-13','Win Tokyo Police Club Tickets','<b>Tokyo Police Club</b> will be in Philly next Wednesday, November 17th at The Foundry, celebrating the 10th anniversary of their album <em>Champ</em>. <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"https://www.thefillmorephilly.com/EventDetail?tmeventid=vvG1FZpikjwwL5&offerid=0\">TheFillmorePhilly.com</a>.','https://i.ticketweb.com//i/00/10/52/03/99_Listings.jpg?v=3','contests.php',2,'n'),(629,'2021-10-11','2021-10-31','Torres Radio Takeover','Over the summer, <strong>Mackenzie Scott</strong> A.K.A. <strong>Torres</strong> released her fifth album, <em>Thirstier</em>.  Before playing in Philly on October 18th at <a href=\"https://johnnybrendas.com/event/torres/\" target=\"_blank\">Johnny Brenda’s</a>, she took over Y-Not Radio last week.  If you missed it, you can hear Torres share her playlist and chat with Y-Not’s <strong>Rob Huff</strong> about the new album <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/N5M7AVu.jpg?1','ondemand.php',7,'n'),(630,'2021-10-18','2021-10-31','Dave Hause Interview','Philly native <strong>Dave Hause</strong> just released his fifth solo album, <em>Blood Harmony</em> and her joined Y-Not\'s <strong>Joey O.</strong> to chat about the record and share some songs from it.  If you missed the interview last week, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.  Order <em>Blood Harmony</em> <a href=\"https://store.davehause.com/\">here</a>.','https://f4.bcbits.com/img/0005563494_23.jpg','http://davehause.com/',2,'n'),(631,'2021-11-08','2021-11-30','They Might Be Giants Interview','<b>They Might Be Giants</b> just released a new album <em>Book</em>, along with an art book of the same name.  If you missed <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Dave L.</b>’s interview with TMBG’s <b>John Flansburgh</b> about those topics and more, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.  <em>Get the album and book at <a href=\"https://www.theymightbegiants.com/Book\" target=\"_blank\">TheyMightBeGiants.com</a>.</em>','https://i.imgur.com/1WCqQPm.jpg?1','ondemand.php',2,'y'),(632,'2021-11-08','2021-12-31','Be A Y-Not DJ','Y-Not Radio is looking for a new voice or two to host on a weekday morning or afternoon.  You must be in the Philly area and able to commit to volunteering for a weekly timeslot in person at the Y-Not Bunker in West Philly.  You must be vaccinated to be considered.  No radio experience is necessary, just a passion for indie music and eagerness to learn.  Please e-mail <a href=\"mailto:josh@yanotradio.net\">Josh T. Landow</a> to apply.','https://djseanray.files.wordpress.com/2011/04/20110429-115736.jpg?w=300','mailto:josh@yanotradio.net',10,'n'),(633,'2021-11-13','2021-11-16','Win Tokyo Police Club Tickets ','<b>Tokyo Police Club</b> will be in Philly this Wednesday, November 17th at The Foundry, celebrating the 10th anniversary of their album <em>Champ</em>. <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or buy them at <a href=\"https://www.thefillmorephilly.com/EventDetail?tmeventid=vvG1FZpikjwwL5&offerid=0\">TheFillmorePhilly.com</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/Q8XgEub.jpg?2','contests.php',4,'n'),(634,'2021-12-13','2021-12-31','<font size=2>Choice Tasters Lounge: The Final Episode</font>','After more than a decade and 100 episodes, <strong>Jersey Dan</strong> has closed down the <em>Choice Tasters Lounge</em> with one last super-sized episode, featuring a guest DJ set from his pal <strong>Ryan Miller</strong> of <strong>Guster</strong>.  If you missed it, you can hear it any time <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/choice-tasters-lounge-the-final-episode-121021/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.','https://thumbnailer.mixcloud.com/unsafe/300x300/extaudio/4/1/6/f/659e-e460-41b8-ac54-c828be9211ec','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/choice-tasters-lounge-the-final-episode-121021/',6,'n'),(635,'2021-11-23','2021-11-26','Y-Not Radio\'s Turkey Day Takeovers','Happy Thanksgiving everybody! Tune in on Thanksgiving Day starting at 10am as Y-Not Radio continues the tradition of <em>Turkey Day Takeovers</em>, featuring artists\' guest DJ sets from the last couple of years, including <b>Mannequin Pussy</b>, <b>The Joy Formidable</b>, <b>Torres</b>, <b>Sad13</b>, <b>Ron Gallo</b>, <b>Sports Team</b>, and <b>Girl Friday</b>!  Check out the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',2,'n'),(636,'2021-11-29','2022-01-15','Y-Not Radio\'s 2021 Year End Poll','Thanks to all of you who voted in <i>Y-Not\'s Year End Poll</i> and tuned in for the <i>Top 221 of 2021</i>. If you missed any of the countdown, you can listen on demand and see the entire list of songs and poll results <a href=\"yearendpoll.php\">here</a>.<br><br>\r\nTune in to hear the <i>Year End Poll</i> contest winner <b>Robert Burnham</b> of Haddon Township, NJ counting down his Top 20 of 2021 this Friday at 2pm (with replays that night at 9pm and Sunday at noon)!','https://i.imgur.com/2J0dh6Q.png','yearendpoll.php',2,'n'),(637,'2023-12-31','2023-12-31','Win Dinosaur Jr. Tickets','<b>Dinosaur Jr.</b> returns to Philly in support of their latest album <i>Sweep It Into Space</i> on Friday, December 2nd at The Fillmore with <b>Guided By Voices</b> and <b>Eugene Mirman</b>.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a></b> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or you can buy them at <a href=\"https://www.thefillmorephilly.com/EventDetail?tmeventid=vvG1FZ98h_K6y_&offerid=0\" target=_blank>TheFillmorePhilly.com</a>.','https://s1.ticketm.net/img/tat/dam/a/b8e/19c2b1b7-ac76-4b4e-bf6a-cca182debb8e_1458781_CUSTOM.jpg','contests.php',50,'y'),(638,'2021-12-13','2022-01-08','Y-Not Best of 2021 Programs','If you missed any of the <em>Best of 2021</em> editions of Y-Not Radio\'s specialty shows including <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <em>Transmission</em>, <em>Y-Not Internacional</em>, and the <em>Y-Not Sessions </em>special, you can hear them any time <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/MXlaZz4.jpg','shows.php',5,'n'),(639,'2021-12-20','2021-12-26','Christmas @ Y-Not Radio','Tune in for Y-Not Radio\'s unique mix of holiday tunes on Christmas Eve and Christmas Day, including replays of this week\'s holiday specials from <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, and of course <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>\'s 6th annual Hour of \"Last Christmas\" covers.  Check our <a href=\"schedule.php\">schedule</a> for replay times or find all those shows <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/playlists/y-not-holiday-specials-2021/\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/jmyUOXK.jpg?1','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/playlists/y-not-holiday-specials-2021/',1,'n'),(640,'2022-01-01','2025-12-31','Y-Not Sessions On Demand','<!--If you missed the recent <em>Y-Not Sessions</em> with <b>The Noisy</b>, <b>Petey USA</b>, and <b>We Are Scientists</b>, you can hear and see video of all those and much more any time-->If you missed any <em>Y-Not Sessions </em> in 2025 with <b>Petey USA</b>, <b>We Are Scientists</b>, <b>The Tisburys</b>, <b>Tim Hause</b>, <b>Polaroid Fade</b>, and more, you can hear and see video of those and much more any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.<!--<br>\r\n  <br>\r\n  Plus, catch up with Y-Not\'s specialty shows like <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Transmission</em>, or <em>Women CRUSH Wednesday</em> <a href=\"shows.php\">HERE</a>.-->','https://i.imgur.com/W6pqnMx.jpeg','ondemand.php',4,'n'),(641,'2025-12-08','2027-01-01','Support Y-Not Radio +<br>Get Y-Not Sessions 2025','Thanks to everyone who supported Y-Not Radio in 2025 we were able to meet our fundraising goals for the year! Help the station get a head start on 2026 expenses like streaming fees and music royalties by making a donation this month. When you donate $15 or more, you can get a download of the new <em>Y-Not Sessions 2025</em> compilation, featuring live recordings from our sessions of last year, including <b>Petey USA</b>, <b>We Are Scientists</b>, <b>The Tisburys</b>, <b>Polaroid Fade</b>, <b>Tim Hause</b>, and more. Thank you!\r\n<br>\r\n<!--If you love Y-Not Radio, please help the station reach its monthly fundraising goal of <b>$1000</b><!--It\'s the last week of November and Y-Not Radio still needs to raise <b>$300</b>-- to pay for streaming, music royalties, and more.  You can support the station by making a donation and we’ll say thanks with a new Y-Not t-shirt or an album download from <b>Snocaps</b>, <b>Tame Impala</b>, <b>Dave Hause</b>, <b>Nation of Language</b>, or others to choose from.  Thank you!-->\r\n<br>\r\n <center><b><a href=\"donate.php\">DONATE HERE</a></b>\r\n  </center>','https://i.imgur.com/lIp8d4K.jpeg','donate.php',6,'n'),(642,'2022-01-15','2022-01-31','Y-Not Radio\'s 2021 Year End Poll','Thanks to all of you who voted in <em>Y-Not\'s Year End Poll</em> and tuned for the <em>Top 221 of 2021</em>. If you missed any of the countdown, you can listen on demand and see the entire list of songs and poll results <a href=\"yearendpoll.php\">HERE</a>.<br><br>\r\nIf you missed <em>Year End Poll</em> contest winner <b>Robert Burnham</b> of Haddon Township, NJ counting down his Top 20 of 2021, you can listen <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/year-end-poll-winner-robert-burnhams-top-20-of-2021/\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>!','https://i.imgur.com/POKgQUx.gif','yearendpoll.php',2,'n'),(643,'2022-01-31','2022-02-28','Marissa Paternoster Interview','<b>Screaming Females</b> frontwoman <b>Marissa Paternoster</b> just released her debut solo album <em>Peace Meter</em>.  You can hear Marissa chat with <b>Joey O.</b> about the new record and more <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.  See Marissa opening for <b>Ted Leo</b> on Sunday, April 3rd at <a href=\"https://wl.seetickets.us/event/Ted-Leo/456814?afflky=WorldCafeLive\" target=\"_blank\">World Café Live</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/RtKseq9.jpg?1','ondemand.php',4,'n'),(644,'2022-03-03','2022-04-30','Modern Rock Madness','After two weeks of fierce competition, your 2022 <i>Modern Rock Madness</i> champions are <b>CHVRCHES</b>, who defeated <b>Metric</b> in the final match on Friday! Congratulations to <b>Iain</b>, <b>Martin</b>, and <b>Lauren</b>, as well as their listener sponsor <b>Dan Rowan</b>! Thanks to all of you for voting for your favorite bands throughout the tournament! If you missed any of the madness, see how it all went down on the completed bracket <a href=\"madness.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/JxEb3r9.png?1','madness.php',8,'n'),(645,'2022-04-04','2022-04-30','Gregor Barnett of The Menzingers<br>Radio Takeover','<b>The Menzingers</b>’ frontman <b>Gregor Barnett</b> recently released his debut solo album <em>Don\'t Go Throwing Roses In My Grave</em>.  He recently joined <b>Joey O.</b> for a <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em> to chat about the album with and guest DJ for an hour of his favorite songs.  If you missed Greg\'s Takeover, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/ySDH12u.jpg?1','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(646,'2022-05-23','2022-05-31','Y-Not\'s Memorial Day Block Party Weekend','Kick off the summer with Y-Not Radio as the soundtrack to your Memorial Day weekend. We’ll be playing three song blocks of your favorite indie rock artists from Friday thru Monday! See the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/EIqxtAl.jpg','schedule.php',1,'n'),(647,'2022-06-06','2022-06-17','Y-Not @ Baltimore Ave. Dollar Stroll','This Thursday, June 16th is the return of the <em>Baltimore Avenue Dollar Stroll</em> after a two year hiatus!  Get dollar deals from local businesses between 40th & 52nd Streets in West Philly from 5:30-8:30pm!  Stop by the Y-Not Radio tent at the corner of 43rd & Baltimore outside The Green Line Café for a chance to win tickets for <b>Courtney Barnett</b> and <b>Lucy Dacus</b> on July 28th at <a href=\"https://www.ticketmaster.com/event/02005C5C0241833B\" target=\"_blank\">The Mann Skyline Stage</a>.  Plus, get $1 stickers, $3 buttons, and $5 Y-Not Sessions downloads. \r\n Find out more <a href=\"https://www.universitycity.org/events/dollarstroll\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/gdSOryM.jpg?1','https://www.universitycity.org/events/dollarstroll',2,'n'),(648,'2022-06-20','2022-07-31','Y-Not\'s 10th (+2) Anniversary Show with Jasmyn','In 2020 Y-Not Radio had its 10th anniversary, but sadly we weren\'t able to celebrate with everybody! Now for our 12th anniversary we\'ll be presenting <strong>Jasmyn</strong> (formerly of <strong>Weaves</strong>) at Kung Fu Necktie tonight for a bash two years in the making! <a href=\"https://kungfunecktie.com/event/jasmyn-air-waves/\" target=\"_blank\">Buy tickets here</a> or get them at the door.','https://f4.bcbits.com/img/0028204164_21.jpg','https://kungfunecktie.com/event/y-not-radios-10th-2-anniversary-show-jasmyn-air-waves/',1,'n'),(649,'2022-06-27','2022-07-05','Y-Not Radio\'s Indie-Pendence Day Throwback Weekend','Tune in this Friday afternoon through Monday as we celebrate the founders of indie rock from the 70’s, 80’s, 90’s, and early 00’s during Y-Not Radio’s second annual <em>Indie-Pendence Day Throwback Weekend</em>!  See the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/kjVJfgy.jpg','schedule.php',1,'n'),(650,'2022-07-05','2022-07-31','We Are Scientists Y-Not Session ','Old friends of Y-Not Radio, <b>Chris Cain</b> and <b>Keith Murray</b> of <b>We Are Scientists</b> recently caught up with <b>Joey O.</b> and <b>Josh T. Landow</b>. Hear them chat about their latest album <em>Huffy</em> and play acoustic versions of songs from it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/JBToMcO.jpg?1','https://wearescientists.com/',6,'y'),(651,'2022-07-11','2022-07-31','Queen of Jeans Y-Not Radio Takeover','Philly band <b>Queen of Jeans</b> recently released a new EP, <em>Hiding In Place</em> and <b>Miri</b> and <b>Mattie</b> from the band just caught up with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to guest DJ for a Y-Not Radio Takeover.  If you missed it, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/sSLuyLM.jpg?1','https://queenofjeans.net/',3,'y'),(652,'2022-07-25','2022-08-31','Metric Interview','Last week <b>Joey O.</b> interviewed <b>Emily Haines</b> of <b>Metric</b> about their new album <em>Formentera</em>.  If you missed it, hear the interview and some songs from the record any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/uZGGtie.jpg','ondemand.php',3,'y'),(653,'2022-08-08','2022-08-31','Jasmyn Y-Not Session','Former<strong> Weaves </strong>frontwoman <strong>Jasmyn Burke</strong> recently played Y-Not Radio’s <em>10th (+2) Anniversary Show</em>.  Before the show she performed some songs from her debut album <em>In The Wild </em>and caught up with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> for the latest <em>Y-Not Session</em>.  If you missed it, you can hear Jasmyn’s session any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/ajdHlr8.jpg?1','ondemand.php',3,'y'),(654,'2022-08-22','2022-09-30','Kayleigh Goldsworthy Y-Not Session','Philly artist <b>Kayleigh Goldsworthy</b> recently paid a visit to the Bunker to chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and perform acoustic versions of songs from her new album  <em>Learning To Be Happy</em>.  If you missed Kayleigh\'s session, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> and you can see her live at this year\'s <em>Philly Music Fest</em> on Wednesday, October 12th at <a href=\"https://wl.seetickets.us/event/Philly-Music-Fest/488416?afflky=WorldCafeLive\" target=\"_blank\">World Cafe Live</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/8v9Yfwh.jpg?1','ondemand.php',3,'y'),(655,'2022-08-29','2022-09-06','Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day Weekend','This Labor Day Weekend, the Y-Not DJs are off, but the music will be live! From Friday through Monday we\'ll be playing tracks from <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, old <strong>Y100</strong> and <strong>WDRE</strong> <em>Sonic Sessions</em>, and plenty of other live album tracks as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"http://iradiophilly.com/\" target=\"_blank\">iRadioPhilly</a> app and make Y-Not\'s <em>Live Labor Day</em> the soundtrack for your end-of-summer festivities!','https://dev.opendrive.com/api/v1/download/file.json/106736924_Xh08f?inline=1','mobile.php',1,'n'),(656,'2022-09-06','2022-09-30','New Y-Not Stream + Alexa Skill','Y-Not Radio\'s livestream has moved to Live 365.  You can access the new stream <a href=\"https://player.live365.com/ynotradio\" target=_blank><b>HERE</b></a> and a new mobile app is coming soon.  For now you can access Y-Not on the go using Live 365\'s <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/live365-radio-music-talk/id1228431134\" target=_blank>iPhone</a> or <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.live365&hl=en_US&gl=US\" target=_blank>Android</a> apps.  You can now listen to Y-Not on Alexa devices by enabling the Y-Not Radio skill on the device and then saying, \"Alexa, play Y-Not Radio.\"','https://i.imgur.com/3gHOBdo.png','index.php',1,'n'),(657,'2022-09-19','2022-10-15','Cheekface Radio Takeover','America\'s local band <b>Cheekface</b> just  surprise-released their third album <em>Too Much To Ask</em>. Last week, frontman <b>Greg Katz</b> joined <b>Joey O.</b> for a <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em> where he be played music from <b>Ween</b>, <b>Beck</b>, <b>The Cars</b>, <b>Lou Reed</b>, and more, plus tracks from their new record. If you missed it, you can hear the <em>Cheekface Radio Takeover</em> any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://atwoodmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/16A8227-Cheekface-credit-Miriam-Brummel-370x247.jpg','ondemand.php',3,'y'),(658,'2022-09-30','2022-10-31','Y-Not\'s New Stream + Apps + Alexa Skill','Y-Not Radio is now streaming through Live 365. You can access the new stream <a href=\"https://player.live365.com/ynotradio\" target=_blank><b>HERE</b></a> and get the new Y-Not mobile app for <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/y-not-radio/id6443588275\" target=_blank><b>iPhone</b></a> or <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.live365.ynotradio\" target=_blank><b>Android</b></a>.  And, you can now also listen to Y-Not on <b>Alexa</b> devices by enabling the Y-Not Radio skill on the device and then saying, \"Alexa, play Y-Not Radio.\"','https://i.imgur.com/guUuVoL.jpg','https://player.live365.com/ynotradio',1,'n'),(659,'2022-10-10','2022-10-31','Alex The Astronaut Y-Not Session','Australian artist <strong>Alex The Astronaut</strong> recently released her sophomore album <em>How To Grow A Sunflower Underwater</em> and joined Y-Not’s <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> to talk about it and play some acoustic versions of songs from the album for the latest <em>Y-Not Session</em>.  You can now hear Alex’s session any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/cw4Srv4.jpg','ondemand.php',6,'y'),(660,'2022-10-17','2022-11-05','Erin Anne Y-Not Session','L.A. artist <b>Erin Anne</b> recently released her sophomore album <em>Do Your Worst </em> and  joined Y-Not’s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to talk about it and perform some songs with her band for latest <em>Y-Not Session</em>.  If you missed Erin’s session last week, you can hear it and see the video any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/xycOuBs.jpg','ondemand.php',7,'n'),(661,'2022-10-31','2022-12-31','New Y-Not Mobile Apps + Alexa Skill','Get the new Y-Not mobile app for <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/y-not-radio/id6443588275\" target=_blank><b>iPhone</b></a> or <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.live365.ynotradio\" target=_blank><b>Android</b></a>. \r\n You can now also listen to Y-Not on <i>Alexa</i> devices by enabling the Y-Not Radio skill on the device and then saying, \"Alexa, play Y-Not Radio.\"','https://i.imgur.com/guUuVoL.jpg','https://apps.apple.com/app/y-not-radio/id6443588275',4,'n'),(662,'2022-11-07','2022-11-25','Y-Not Turkey Day Takeovers','Happy Thanksgiving everybody! Tune in on Thanksgiving Day starting at 11am as Y-Not Radio continues the tradition of <em>Turkey Day Takeovers</em>, featuring artists\' guest DJ sets from the this year, including <b>Gregor Barnett</b> of <b>The Menzingers</b>, <b>Queen of Jeans</b>, <b>Cheekface</b>, and <b>Miya Folick</b>!  Check out the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>.','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',2,'n'),(663,'2022-11-25','2023-01-31','Y-Not\'s Year End Poll','Thanks to all of you who voted in <i>Y-Not\'s Year End Poll</i> and tuned in for the <i>Top 222 of 2022</i>. If you missed any of the countdown, you can listen on demand and see the entire list of songs and poll results <a href=\"yearendpoll.php\"><b>HERE</b></a>.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<i>And if you missed the Year End Poll contest winner <strong>Travis Babcock</strong> of Cherry Hill, NJ counting down his Top 20 of 2022, you can listen On Demand <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/travis-babcocks-top-20-of-2022/\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a>.</i>','https://web.opendrive.com/api/v1/download/file.json/178285449_t7G6d?inline=1&preview=1','yearendpoll.php',7,'n'),(664,'2022-12-12','2023-01-07','Y-Not Best of 2022 Specials','If you missed any of the <em>Best of 2022</em> editions of Y-Not Radio\'s specialty shows including <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <em>Transmission</em>, and <em>Y-Not Internacional</em>, you can hear them any time <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/AAL5yAE.jpg','schedule.php',6,'n'),(665,'2023-01-09','2023-02-28','Y-Not Philly with Cosette Gobat','Former Y-Not DJ <b>Cozy</b> AKA <b>Cosette Gobat</b> is home from the U.K. and recently guest-hosted an episode of <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, featuring a live performance from... herself!  Hear Cosette’s episode any time <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/y-not-philly-2123/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a> and find more of her music on <a href=\"https://cosettegobat.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Bandcamp</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/mImM3oZ.jpg','https://cosettegobat.bandcamp.com/',8,'n'),(666,'2023-01-03','2023-01-22','Foals Photo Album','<strong>Foals</strong> returned to Philly\'s Franklin Music Hall on December 14, 2022 and Y-Not photographer  Carolyn Lederach was there to capture the action.  Check out our photo album from show <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set?vanity=ynotradio&set=a.652526513365816\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/48MMsNl.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/media/set?vanity=ynotradio&set=a.652526513365816',7,'n'),(667,'2023-02-06','2023-02-28','Circa Waves Y-Not Radio Takeover','Brit band <b>Circa Waves</b> just released their fifth album <em>Never Going Under</em> and frontman <b>Kieran Shudall</b> checked in with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to chat about it and pick out a playlist of songs for a <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>, including tunes from <b>The Walkmen</b>, <b>Foo Fighters</b>, <b>Nick Drake</b>, <b>Arctic Monkeys</b>, and more.  Hear the <em>Circa Waves Radio Takeover</em> any time <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/circa-waves-y-not-radio-takeover-21023/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.  And see Circa Waves on March 30th at <a href=\"https://concerts.livenation.com/event/02005D37ADA24EFC\" target=\"_blank\">The Foundry</a>.','https://atwoodmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Circa-Waves-%C2%A9-Lewis-Vorne-2-270x180.jpeg','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/circa-waves-y-not-radio-takeover-21023/',5,'y'),(668,'2023-02-27','2023-04-29','Modern Rock Madness','After two weeks of fierce competition, your 2023 <i>Modern Rock Madness</i> champions are <b>Metric</b>, who defeated <b>CHVRCHES</b> in the final match on Friday! Congratulations to <b>Emily</b>, <b>Jimmy</b>, <b>Joshua</b>, and <b>Joules</b>, as well as their listener sponsor <b>Daniel McGlynn</b>! Thanks to all of you for voting for your favorite bands throughout the tournament! If you missed any of the madness, see how it all went down on the completed bracket <a href=\"madness.php\"><b>HERE</b></a>.','https://i.imgur.com/qrK9wbN.png','madness.php',5,'n'),(669,'2023-04-03','2023-04-30','John Faye Interview','<strong>Dan Fein</strong> was recently joined by musician and now author, <strong>John Faye</strong> of <strong>The Caulfields</strong>, <strong>Ike</strong> & more. They talked about about John\'s best selling new memoir <em>The Yin and the Yang of it All: Rock \'n\' Roll Memories from the Cusp as Told by a Mixed-Up, Mixed-Race Kid</em>, <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Yin-Yang-All-RocknRoll-Mixed-Race/dp/1642257435/ref=tmm_hrd_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&qid&sr&fbclid=IwAR0aXX80PVGHKHw2yGC6flBGVTqbr8X2oneh1T2jJMmNPaTf8zzh4paCkFY\" target=\"_blank\">available now</a>, and played some of the indie rock that has and still does inspire John. Listen to the interview <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.  Get tickets for John\'s book release celebration with The Caulfields on April 25th at Ardmore Music Hall <a href=\"https://bit.ly/JohnFaye_AMH\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/VDVJFuj.jpg','ondemand.php',4,'n'),(670,'2023-05-01','2023-05-31','Placebo Photo Gallery','<b>Placebo</b> played Philly\'s Franklin Music Hall last week in support of their recent album <i>Never Let Me Go</i> with <b>Poppy Jean Crawford</b>. Y-Not photographer <b>Carolyn Lederach</b> was on the scene and you can see the whole photo gallery <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?vanity=ynotradio&set=a.738177361467397\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/2QwSJrL.png','https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?vanity=ynotradio&set=a.738177361467397',8,'n'),(671,'2023-05-15','2023-05-31','Alex Lahey Y-Not Radio Takeover','<b>Alex Lahey</b> just released her third album <em>The Answer Is Always Yes</em> last week and to celebrate she joined <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and <b>Joey O.</b> to chat about the new record.  She was also the guest DJ for the latest <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>, playing songs from <b>Yeah Yeah Yeahs</b>, <b>Alvvays</b>, <b>Holy Holy</b>, and more!  If you missed it, you can listen any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. <i>And see Alex on Friday, June 9th at <a href=\"https://johnnybrendas.com/event/alex-lahey/johnny-brendas/philadelphia-pennsylvania/\" target=\"_blank\">Johnny Brenda\'s</a>.</i>','https://i.imgur.com/s5j5erR.png','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(672,'2023-05-22','2023-05-30','<font size=2>Y-Not\'s Memorial Day Block Party Weekend</font>','Kick off the summer with Y-Not Radio as the soundtrack to your Memorial Day weekend. We’ll be playing blocks of your favorite indie rock artists from Friday thru Monday! <i>Take the block party on the go by listening with the Y-Not Radio app for <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/y-not-radio/id6443588275\">iPhone</a> or <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.live365.ynotradio\">Android</a>.</i>','https://i.imgur.com/EIqxtAl.jpg','schedule.php',2,'n'),(673,'2023-06-26','2023-07-05','Y-Not Radio\'s Indie-Pendence Day Throwback Weekend','Tune in this Friday evening through Tuesday, July 4th as we celebrate the founders of indie rock from the 70’s, 80’s, 90’s, and early 00’s during Y-Not Radio’s third annual <em>Indie-Pendence Day Throwback Weekend</em>! See the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/kjVJfgy.jpg','schedule.php',1,'n'),(674,'2023-06-05','2023-07-08','Jenny Lewis Interview','<strong>Jenny Lewis</strong> just released her fifth solo album <em>Joy\'All</em> last week and  chatted with Y-Not\'s <strong>Joey O.</strong> about the making of the new record and more. If you missed their conversation with some songs from <em>Joy\'All</em>, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/My8d4Pw.jpg','ondemand.php',4,'y'),(675,'2023-07-08','2023-07-31','Grouplove Y-Not Radio Takeover','<b>Grouplove</b> are back with their sixth album <em>I Want It All Right Now</em> and joined Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to talk about it and share some of their new songs.  <b>Christian</b> and <b>Hannah</b> also picked out a playlist for a <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>, including tracks from <b>Dr. Dog</b>, <b>Perfume Genius</b>, <b>David Bowie</b>, <b>Digable Planets</b>,and more! If you missed Grouplove\'s <em>Radio Takeover</em>, it\'s now <a href=\"ondemand.php\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/Q0iuEaA.jpg','https://www.grouplovemusic.com/',4,'n'),(676,'2023-07-24','2023-08-21','Puppy Angst Y-Not Session','One of our favorite Y-Not Philly albums of last year was <strong>Puppy Angst</strong>\'s <em>Scorpio Season</em>. The band recently joined us at <a href=\"https://www.cambridgesoundstudios.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Cambridge Sound Studios</a> to record a <em>Y-Not Session</em> and chat with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.  If you missed it, you can now hear Puppy Angst\'s session <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.  And find more of their music <a href=\"https://puppyangst.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Bandcamp</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/kN5ZBW3.jpg','ondemand.php',6,'y'),(677,'2023-08-05','2023-08-31','The Hives Interview','Sweden\'s greatest rock band <strong>The Hives</strong> are back with their first album in 11 years, <em>The Death of Randy Fitzsimmons</em>. Frontman <em>Howlin\' Pelle Almquist</em> joined Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to talk about it and share some of the new songs. The interview is now available to hear <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/N8SoD2F.jpg','ondemand.php',5,'y'),(678,'2023-08-13','2023-08-31','The Baseball Project Interview','Rock supergroup <strong>The Baseball Project</strong> (featuring members of <strong>R.E.M.</strong>, <strong>The Minus 5</strong>, and <strong>The Dream Syndicate</strong>) is back on the field with their fourth album, <em>Grand Salami Time</em>! Singer/guitarist <strong>Scott McCaughey</strong> joins <strong>Joey O.</strong> this Thursday at 4pm to talk about America\'s national pastime and spin some tunes off the record. Or catch the replay Sunday at noon. <em>See The Baseball Project live on Tuesday, August 22nd at <a href=\"https://worldcafelive.com/event/the-baseball-project-featuring-peter-buck-scott-mccaughey-mike-mills-linda-pitmon-and-steve-wynn/\" target=\"_blank\">World Cafe Live</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/dM5xffu.jpg','http://baseballproject.net/',3,'y'),(679,'2023-08-13','2023-08-31','Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day Weekend','This Labor Day Weekend, the Y-Not DJs are off, but the music will be live! From Friday through Monday we\'ll be playing tracks from <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, old <strong>Y100</strong> and <strong>WDRE</strong> <em>Sonic Sessions</em>, and plenty of other live album tracks as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"mobile.php\">Y-Not Radio app</a> and make <em>Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day</em> the soundtrack for your end-of-summer festivities!','https://i.imgur.com/oP89Tyr.jpg','mobile.php',6,'n'),(680,'2023-08-19','2023-09-16','The Beths Radio Takeover','New Zealand\'s <b>The Beths</b> are currently on tour in North America with <b>The National</b> and earlier this month Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> caught up with singer <b>Liz Stokes</b> to chat about their latest album <em>Expert In A Dying Field</em> and more! Liz also picked out a playlist of favorites including <b>Ratboys</b>, <b>Palehound</b>, and <b>2nd Grade</b> for a <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>!  Hear it now <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/cjRZhkc.jpg','https://thebeths.com/',5,'y'),(681,'2023-08-29','2023-09-30','Y-Not Radio + WCHE in West Chester','Y-Not Radio is back on the FM radio!  Tune in to <b><a href=\"https://953wche.com/\">95.3 WCHE</a></b> in West Chester, PA on Tuesdays at 3pm or Saturdays at 7pm for <em>Y-Not Radio</em>, a one-hour show hosted by <b>Josh T. Landow</b>, featuring the newest indie rock releases each week. And stay tuned for more of Y-Not coming to WCHE soon.','https://i.imgur.com/44HWva4.jpg','https://953wche.com/',10,'n'),(682,'2023-08-31','2023-09-05','Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day Weekend','This Labor Day Weekend, the Y-Not DJs are off, but the music will be live! From Friday through Monday we\'ll be playing tracks from <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, old <b>Y100</b> and <b>WDRE</b> <em>Sonic Sessions</em>, and plenty of other live album tracks as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"https://www.ynotradio.net/mobile.php\" target=\"_blank\">Y-Not Radio app</a> and make <em>Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day</em> the soundtrack for your end-of-summer festivities!','https://i.imgur.com/oP89Tyr.jpg','mobile.php',1,'n'),(683,'2023-09-02','2023-09-30','Speedy Ortiz Y-Not Session','Longtime Y-Not friends and faves <b>Speedy Ortiz</b> just released their fourth album <i>Rabbit Rabbit</i> and joined us at <b>Cambridge Sound Studios</b> for their third <i>Y-Not Session</i> to celebrate!  If you missed it, you can hear the interview and performance any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> and now see video of the session <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q8ngNQJCFMI\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/DredvKD.jpg','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(684,'2024-12-31','2025-01-01','Be A Y-Not DJ','Y-Not Radio is looking for a new voice to host on Wednesday afternoons (2-5pm). You must be in the Philly area and able to commit to volunteering for a weekly timeslot in person at the Y-Not Bunker in West Philly. No radio experience is necessary, just a passion for indie music and eagerness to learn. Please e-mail <a href=\"mailto:josh@ynotradio.net\" target=\"_blank\">Josh T. Landow</a> to apply.','https://djseanray.files.wordpress.com/2011/04/20110429-115736.jpg?w=300','mailto:josh@ynotradio.net',99,'n'),(685,'2023-09-25','2023-10-19','Win Be Your Own Pet Tickets','<b>Be Your Own Pet</b> recently released their first album in fifteen years, <em>MOMMY</em>, and will be bringing their tour to Underground Arts this Sunday, October 22nd.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>Enter to win tickets</b></a> by Friday at noon or purchase tickets at <a href=\"https://wl.seetickets.us/event/Be-YourOwnPet/548710?afflky=UndergroundArts\" target=\"_blank\">UndergroundArts.org</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/yEtw7Vy.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(686,'2023-10-23','2023-10-31','Win Yard Act Tickets','UK post-punk band <b>Yard Act</b> will be coming to Philly to play songs from last year\'s debut album <em>The Overload</em> and their upcoming record <em>Where\'s My Utopia? </em> on Sunday, November 5th at Underground Arts.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>Enter to win tickets</b></a> by Wednesday, November 1st at noon or purchase tickets at <a href=\"https://wl.seetickets.us/event/Yard-Act/548746?afflky=UndergroundArts\" target=\"_blank\">UndergroundArts.org</a>.','https://shorturl.at/fmrB6','contests.php',2,'n'),(687,'2024-01-31','2024-02-01','Win Yard Act Tickets','UK post-punk band <b>Yard Act</b> will be coming to Philly to play songs from last year\'s debut album <i>The Overload</i> and their upcoming new record <i>Where\'s My Utopia?</i> this Sunday, November 5th at Underground Arts.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>Enter to win tickets</b></a> by Wednesday, November 1st at noon or purchase tickets at <a href=\"https://wl.seetickets.us/event/Yard-Act/548746?afflky=UndergroundArts\" target=\"_blank\">UndergroundArts.org</a>.','https://shorturl.at/jrDF4','contests.php',99,'n'),(688,'2023-11-11','2023-12-16','Sydney Sprague Y-Not Session','Phoenix, AZ musician <b>Sydney Sprague</b> was just Philly in support of her sophomore album <i>Somebody In Hell Loves You</i>.  Before her show, she stopped by the Y-Not Bunker for an acoustic performance and chat with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.  If you missed it, you can listen to her session and see video of it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/4T4oUFT.jpg','ondemand.php',2,'n'),(689,'2023-11-18','2023-11-24','Y-Not Turkey Day Takeovers','Tune in on Thanksgiving Day starting at 10am as Y-Not Radio continues the tradition of <i>Turkey Day Takeovers</i>, featuring artists\' guest DJ sets from this year, including <b>Grouplove</b>, <b>The Beths</b>, <b>Alex Lahey</b>, <b>Circa Waves</b>, <b>Dream Wife</b>, and more! Check out the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>.','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',2,'n'),(690,'2023-11-19','2024-01-31','Y-Not Radio\'s Top 223 of 2023','If you missed any of <em>Y-Not\'s Top 223 of 2023</em> countdown, you can listen on demand and see the entire list of songs and <i>Year End Poll</i> results <a href=\"yearendpoll.php\"><b>HERE</b></a>.\r\n<br><br>\r\nIf you missed <em>Year End Poll</em> contest winner <strong>Julie MacKinnon</strong> of Delran, NJ counting down her Top 20 of 2023, you can hear that <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/julie-mackinnons-top-20-of-2023/\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/JLypYHW.png','yearendpoll.php',5,'n'),(691,'2023-11-19','2023-12-31','Yeah Yeah Yeahs Photo Album','<b>Yeah Yeah Yeahs</b> returned to Philly last month for a fantastic show at The Met in support of last year\'s album <em>Cool It Down</em>, with support from <b>Sasami</b>. Y-Not photographer <b>Carolyn Lederach</b> was on the scene and you can see the whole photo gallery <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.874374011181064&type=3\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/slxaFwx.jpg','https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.874374011181064&type=3',7,'n'),(692,'2023-12-19','2023-12-26','Christmas @ Y-Not Radio','Tune in for Y-Not Radio\'s unique mix of holiday tunes on Christmas Eve and Christmas Day, including a replay of <b>Josh T. Landow</b>\'s annual <i>An Hour of \"Last Christmas\" Covers</i> show at noon on Christmas. Holiday episodes of <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, and <em>The T.G.I. 80\'s Nooner</em> are all available <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/playlists/y-not-holiday-specials-2021/\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/jmyUOXK.jpg?1','schedule.php',2,'n'),(693,'2023-12-26','2024-01-02','Y-Not Radio Holiday Specials','If you\'re still feeling the Christmas spirit, you can listen to holiday episodes of <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>The T.G.I. 80\'s Nooner</em>, and of course <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>\'s annual <em>An Hour of \"Last Christmas\" Covers</em>\" show any time <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/playlists/y-not-holiday-specials-2021/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/VoGVmym.png','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/playlists/y-not-holiday-specials-2021/',3,'n'),(694,'2023-12-25','2024-01-31','Y-Not Best of 2023 Specials','If you missed any of the <em>Best of 2023</em> editions of Y-Not Radio\'s specialty shows including <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <em>Transmission</em>, and <em>Y-Not Internacional</em>, you can hear them any time <a href=\"https://www.ynotradio.net/shows.php\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>. And listen to all the Y-Not DJs\' Top 20 countdowns <a href=\"yearendstaffpicks.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/F73qVG8.jpg','yearendstaffpicks.php',7,'n'),(695,'2024-02-12','2024-03-31','Shalom Y-Not Session','One of our favorite new artists last year, <b>Shalom</b>, stopped by the Y-Not Bunker for a stripped-down performance of some songs from her debut album <em>Sublimation</em> and her upcoming second record<em></em>, plus a chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.  If you missed Shalom\'s <em>Y-Not Session</em>, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/iIzc9aX.jpeg','ondemand.php',4,'n'),(696,'2024-04-01','2024-05-01','Bombay Bicycle Club Photo Gallery','Y-Not and <em>Britspotting</em> faves <strong>Bombay Bicycle Club</strong> returned to Philly last month to celebrate their latest album <em>My Big Day</em> at Union  Transfer. Y-Not photographer <strong>Carolyn Lederach</strong> was on the scene and you can see the whole photo gallery <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.964247425527055&type=3\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/pgFGpxX.jpeg','https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.964247425527055&type=3',10,'n'),(697,'2024-03-03','2024-04-06','Modern Rock Madness','After two weeks of fierce competition, your 2024 <em>Modern Rock Madness</em> champions are <b>Japanese Breakfast</b>, who defeated <b>Death Cab For Cutie</b> in the final match on Friday! Congratulations to Philly\'s own <b>Michelle Zauner</b> & co., as well as their listener sponsor <b>Jenifer Wrighte</b>! Thanks to all of you for voting for your favorite bands throughout the tournament! If you missed any of the madness, see how it all went down on the completed bracket <a href=\"madness.php\"><b>HERE</b></a>.','https://i.imgur.com/JYsnDlJ.png','madness.php',2,'n'),(698,'2024-05-31','2024-05-31','Win BODEGA Tickets','Brooklyn\'s <b>BODEGA</b> will be in Philly in support of their new album <i>Our Brand Could Be Yr Life</i> on Friday, April 26th at The Baltic Hall.  You can <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER TO WIN</b></a> a pair of tickets for the show through Wednesday, April 24th at noon.  Tickets are available to purchase <a href=\"https://www.handstamp.com/e/bodega-disaster-artist-the-lunar-years-p7atyhwm\" target=_blank>here</a>. ','https://i.imgur.com/Ltd5127.jpeg','contests.php',20,'n'),(699,'2024-04-01','2024-04-30','Modern Rock Madness','After two weeks of fierce competition, your 2024 <em>Modern Rock Madness</em> champions are <b>Japanese Breakfast</b>, who defeated <b>Death Cab For Cutie</b> in the final match! Congratulations to Philly\'s own <b>Michelle Zauner</b> & co., as well as their listener sponsor <b>Jenifer Wrighte</b>! Thanks to all of you who voted for your favorite bands throughout the tournament! If you missed any of the madness, see how it all went down on the completed bracket <a href=\"madness.php\"><b>HERE</b></a>.','https://i.imgur.com/JYsnDlJ.png','madness.php',9,'n'),(700,'2024-04-08','2024-04-30','The Blackburns Y-Not Session','<b>The Blackburns</b> are a new Philly band featuring members of <b>Wax Wav</b> and <b>Plow United</b>.  They just released their self-titled debut and joined us to play some songs from it at <a href=\"https://www.cambridgesoundstudios.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Cambridge Sound Studios</b></a>. You can see video of that live performance and hear an interview with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.  Get The Blackburns\' album <a href=\"https://theblackburns.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/4O4017d.jpeg','https://theblackburns.bandcamp.com',6,'n'),(701,'2024-04-22','2024-05-31','Bodega Y-Not Radio Takeover','Brooklyn indie rockers <b>Bodega</b> recently released a new album <em>Our Brand Could Be Yr Life</em> and joined Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> to chat about it for the next <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>! <b>Ben</b> and <b>Nikki</b> from the band also picked out a playlist of favorites including <b>Spoon</b>, <b>Pavement</b>, <b>The Beatles</b>, and more.  If you missed Bodega\'s <i>Radio Takeover</i>, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/NTWHWrH.png','ondemand.php',6,'y'),(702,'2024-05-13','2024-06-07','<font size=2>Y-Not Radio\'s 14th Anniversary Celebration</font>','Join Y-Not Radio to celebrate our 14th anniversary on with British up-and-comer <b>Lauran Hibberd</b> on Thursday, June 6th at Kung Fu Necktie.  Tickets are available to <a href=\"https://www.etix.com/ticket/p/83264613\">purchase</a> or enter to win tickets <a href=\"https://www.ynotradio.net/contests\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/pyph0sW.jpeg','contests.php',1,'n'),(703,'2024-05-20','2024-05-28','<font size=2>Y-Not\'s Memorial Day Block Party Weekend</font>','Kick off the summer with Y-Not Radio as the soundtrack to your Memorial Day weekend. We’ll be playing blocks of your favorite indie rock artists from Friday thru Monday! See the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/EIqxtAl.jpg','schedule.php',1,'n'),(704,'2024-05-27','2024-06-15','Eliza Hardy Jones Radio Takeover','Philly musical mainstay <b>Eliza Hardy Jones</b> (of <b>Buried Beds</b>, <b>The War on Drugs</b>, and more) recently released her second solo album <em>Pickpocket</em> and joined Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to chat about it and play tracks from <b>Iron & Wine</b>, <b>The Innocence Mission</b>, <b>The Philly Specials</b>, and more for the latest <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>!  If you missed it, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.  <i>And find Eliza\'s album <b><a href=\"https://elizahardyjones.bandcamp.com/album/pickpocket\" target=_blank>here</a></b>.</i>','https://i.imgur.com/FVIpQJU.jpeg','ondemand.php',9,'y'),(705,'2024-06-10','2024-06-15','Win White Reaper Tickets','<b>White Reaper</b> return to Philly this Thursday, June 20th at Underground Arts in support of last year\'s album  <em>Asking For A Ride</em> with <b>Spiritual Cramp</b>.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>Enter to win tickets</strong></a> by Wednesday at 2pm or purchase tickets at <a href=\"https://link.dice.fm/UA_WR24\" target=\"_blank\">UndergroundArts.org</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/wakY48B.jpeg','contests.php',2,'n'),(706,'2024-06-10','2024-07-01','Lauran Hibberd Radio Takeover','We recently welcomed UK up-and-comer <b>Lauran Hibberd</b> for her first Philly headlining show at Y-Not\'s 14th Anniversary celebration.  Before the show Lauran sat down with <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and <b>Joey O.</b> to talk about her new album <em>Girlfriend Material</em> and pick out some favorite songs for a <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>.  If you missed it, you can now hear Lauran Hibberd\'s Takeover any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/oP0jLK3.jpeg','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(707,'2024-06-17','2024-06-20','Win White Reaper Tickets','Louisville punks  <strong>White Reaper  </strong> return to Philly this  Thursday, June 20th at Underground Arts with <strong>Spiritual Cramp</strong>, in support of their latest album <em>Asking For A Ride</em>.   <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>Enter to win tickets</strong></a> by Wednesday at noon or purchase tickets at <a href=\"https://link.dice.fm/UA_WR24\" target=\"_blank\">UndergroundArts.org</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/wakY48B.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(708,'2024-06-24','2024-07-20','Pouty Y-Not Session','Earlier this year <b>Rachel Gagliardi</b> (formerly of Philly band <b>Slutever</b>) released her debut album as <b>Pouty</b>.  She recently returned home for an album release show and recorded a <em>Y-Not Session</em> at <a href=\"https://jamtownjams.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Jamtown Recording Studio</a>.  If you missed it, you can hear Rachel chat with Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> and perform songs from the record live with her band (featuring members of <b>The Superweaks</b> and <b>Amanda X</b>) any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. Get Pouty\'s album <i>Forgot About Me</i> <a href=\"https://poutyofficial.bandcamp.com/album/forgot-about-me\" target=_blank>here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/cbJgi4s.jpeg','ondemand.php',2,'n'),(709,'2024-06-28','2024-07-08','<font size=2>Indie-Pendence Day Throwback Weekend</font>','Tune in all 4th of July weekend as we celebrate the founders of indie rock from the 70’s, 80’s, 90’s, and early 00’s during Y-Not Radio’s fourth annual <i>Indie-Pendence Day Throwback Weekend</i>! See the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a> and request your favorite retro tunes.','https://i.imgur.com/kjVJfgy.jpg','schedule.php',1,'n'),(710,'2024-06-28','2024-07-06','Win Mates of State Tickets','Husband and wife indie pop duo <b>Mates of State</b> return with the <I>Still The One Tour</i>, coming to Philly on Friday, July 12th at The Foundry.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win a pair of tickets or purchase tickets <a href=\"https://concerts.livenation.com/event/02006055C3813FC7\" target=_blank>here</a>.','https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/7c7/348902c8-f2e1-4ffe-831f-659158ee87c7_CUSTOM.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(711,'2024-07-22','2024-07-28','Get Jack White\'s New Album','On Friday <b>Third Man Records</b> shoppers were surprised by a new <b>Jack White</b> album slipped into their bags, only marked \"No Name\".  Later Jack took to Instagram telling fans to \"RIP IT\" with an official download link.  You can get Jack\'s new album <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GXsie3t8630p-UIN2qedlLiVKWJGAys1\" target=\"_blank\"><b>here</b></a>.  We\'ll play tracks from it all week on Y-Not Radio, including a full album playback tonight at 7pm, and we\'ll keep you updated on any further details (like a name).','https://i.imgur.com/C6xm4i3.jpeg','https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GXsie3t8630p-UIN2qedlLiVKWJGAys1',2,'n'),(712,'2024-08-02','2024-08-31','Bad Bad Hats Y-Not Session','Minnesota\'s <b>Bad Bad Hats</b> recently released their self-titled 4th album and singer <b>Kerry Alexander</b> joined Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> to chat about and play solo acoustic versions of some of the songs from it for the latest <i>Y-Not Session</i>!  If you missed it, you can listen any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>','https://i.imgur.com/iP8T2n1.jpeg','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(713,'2024-08-12','2024-08-31','Lindsay Reamer Y-Not Philly Interview','Last week on <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, <strong>Han</strong> interviewed Philly artist <b>Lindsay Reamer</b> and featured songs from her debut record <em>Natural Science</em>. If you missed it, you can listen to the episode <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/y-not-philly-81424/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a> and you can find Lindsay Reamer online <a href=\"https://www.lindsayreamer.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/vOpkjGM.jpeg','https://www.mixcloud.com/discover/philadelphia+philly+ynotradio/?order=latest',4,'y'),(714,'2024-08-26','2024-09-03','Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day Weekend ','This Labor Day Weekend, the Y-Not DJs are off, but the music will be live! From Friday through Monday we\'ll be playing tracks from <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, old <strong>Y100</strong> and <strong>WDRE</strong> <em>Sonic Sessions</em>, and plenty of other live album tracks as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"mobile.php\">Y-Not Radio app</a> and make <em>Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day</em> the soundtrack for your end-of-summer festivities!','https://i.imgur.com/oP89Tyr.jpg','mobile.php',1,'n'),(715,'2024-09-08','2024-09-16','<font size=2>Win Robert DeLong + Atlas Genius Tickets</font>','One-man dance pop band <b>Robert DeLong</b> releases his new album <em>Playlist of Doom</em> this Friday and then makes his way to The Foundry with Australian brothers <b>Atlas Genius</b> on Wednesday, September 18th.  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>Enter to win tickets</b></a> by Sunday, September 15th or purchase tickets at <a href=\"https://concerts.livenation.com/robert-delong-atlas-genius-philadelphia-pennsylvania-09-18-2024/event/020060E3C8AC7D78\" target=\"_blank\">TheFillmorePhilly.com</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/tY4YgSq.jpeg','contests.php',4,'n'),(716,'2024-09-08','2024-09-30','Nada Surf Radio Takeover','Indie veterans <b>Nada Surf</b> just released their tenth album <em>Moon Mirror</em> and to celebrate, frontman <b>Matthew Caws</b> joined Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to host a <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>! If you missed it, you can tune in <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> to hear his playlist of favorites including <b>Hoodoo Gurus</b>, <b>Pom Pom Squad</b>, and <b>Cate Le Bon</b>, as well as tracks from the new album.','https://www.amoeba.com/sized-images/max/250/365/uploads/live-shows-upcoming/NadaSurfWEB.jpg','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(717,'2024-09-16','2024-09-23','Win Sprints Tickets','Irish band <b>Sprints</b> will be in Philly on Friday, September 27th at The Foundry, \r\nin support of their debut album <em>Letter To Self</em>. <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>Enter to win tickets</strong></a> by Sunday, September 22nd  or purchase tickets at <a href=\"https://concerts.livenation.com/event/02006099D274763F\" target=\"_blank\">TheFillmorePhilly.com</a>.','https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/1de/c6ee3669-f82e-4a4e-ae36-23400efeb1de_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(718,'2024-09-23','0000-00-00','Kate Nash Interview','Longtime favorite and friend of Y-Not Radio, <strong>Kate Nash</strong> recently released her fifth album <em>9 Sad Symphonies</em> and will be back in Philly on October 10th at <a href=\"https://worldcafelive.org/event/kate-nash-9-sad-symphonies/\" target=\"_blank\">World Cafe Live</a>.  Before that, Kate checks in with Y-Not\'s <strong>Joey O.</strong> to chat about the record, her upcoming North American tour, and more. Hear the interview this Thursday at 4pm or catch one of the replays on Friday at 10pm and Sunday at 7pm.','https://i.imgur.com/ja979Rd.png','https://www.katenash.com/',2,'n'),(719,'2024-09-24','2024-10-31','Kate Nash Interview','Longtime favorite and friend of Y-Not Radio, <strong>Kate Nash</strong> recently released her fifth album <em>9 Sad Symphonies</em> and will be back in Philly this Thursday,  October 10th at <a href=\"https://worldcafelive.org/event/kate-nash-9-sad-symphonies/\" target=\"_blank\">World Cafe Live</a>.  Before that, Kate checked in with Y-Not\'s <strong>Joey O.</strong> to chat about the record, her North American tour, and more. If you missed the interview, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/ja979Rd.png','https://www.katenash.com/',2,'y'),(720,'2024-10-28','2024-11-16','2nd Grade Y-Not Session','Philly power pop band <b>2nd Grade</b> just released a new album called <em>Scheduled Explosions </em>and frontman <b>Peter Gill</b> joined Y-Not Radio\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to chat about it and play stripped down versions of some of the songs. If you missed 2nd Grade\'s <i>Y-Not Session</i> you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. Get <em>Scheduled Explosions</em> now on <a href=\"https://2ndgrade.bandcamp.com/album/scheduled-explosions\" target=\"_blank\">Bandcamp</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/REGtMde.jpeg','https://2ndgrade.bandcamp.com/',3,'n'),(721,'2024-11-04','2024-11-30','Sløtface Y-Not Radio Takeover','Norwegian  band <b>Sløtface</b> recently released their third album <em>Film Buff</em> and frontwoman <b>Haley Shea</b> joined Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to chat about it on the latest <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>. Hear Haley guest DJ with a playlist of some of her favorites artists like <b>Pom Poko</b>, <b>MJ Lenderman</b>, <b>The Beths</b>, and more, plus songs from the new album.  The Sløtface <em>Radio Takeover</em> is now <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/JYC60lQ.png','ondemand.php',2,'y'),(722,'2024-11-25','2024-11-29','Y-Not Turkey Day Takeovers','Tune in on Thanksgiving Day starting at 9am as Y-Not Radio continues the tradition of <i>Turkey Day Takeovers</i>, featuring artists\' guest DJ sets from this year, including <b>Nada Surf</b>, <b>Eric Slick</b>, <b>Lauran Hibberd</b>, <b>Bodega</b>, <b>Sløtface</b>, and <b>Eliza Hardy Jones</b>! Check out the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>.','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',1,'n'),(723,'2024-11-25','2024-12-14','Y-Not Cyber Week Sale','Help Y-Not end the year in the black by making a donation this week. We still need to raise <b>$1000</b> in December. As a special <em>Cyber Week</em> sale we’ll send you two album downloads for the price of one this week, including the latest from <b>Japandroids</b>, <b>The Linda Lindas</b>, <b>Bright Eyes</b>, <b>Brigitte Calls Me Baby</b>, and others to choose from. Or get an album download as a bonus item when you select a Y-Not t-shirt.\r\n<br><br>\r\n <center><b><a href=\"donate.php\">DONATE HERE</a></b>\r\n  </center>','https://i.imgur.com/3wFOP2y.jpg','donate.php',4,'y'),(724,'2024-11-25','2024-12-31','Y-Not Radio\'s Top 224 of 2024','It\'s time to finish the year with Y-Not\'s <em>Top 224 of 2024</em> all this week (Monday, Tuesday, Thursday, and Friday)! Tune in as <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> and <strong>Joey O.</strong> count down the songs you voted for and reveal all the <em>Year End Poll</em> results starting at 10am each day (with replays at 5pm & Midnight and over the weekend). Find out if you\'re the winner of an <strong>Apple Watch</strong> and the chance to play your top 20 songs of the year on Y-Not Radio! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nEach day\'s songs and poll results will be posted <a href=\"pages.php?page=top224of2024\">here</a> after the first airing, and each part of the countdown will be posted on demand by the following day.\r\n','https://i.imgur.com/oFi73TC.gif','pages.php?page=top224of2024',1,'n'),(725,'2024-12-09','2024-12-31','Friedberg Y-Not Session','Austrian / British band <b>Friedberg</b> recently released their debut full-length album <em>Hardcore Workout Queen</em> and recorded a <em>Y-Not Session</em> performance at Clouds Hill Studio in Hamburg, Germany.  Hear the session and Josh T. Landow\'s interview with frontwoman <b>Anna F.</b> <a href=\"ondemand\">On Demand</a> or see the video <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZoirNwp-0UU\" target=_blank>here</a>.','https://www.totalntertainment.com/wp-content/uploads/Friedberg-3.jpg','ondemand.php',4,'n'),(726,'2024-12-16','2025-01-11','Y-Not Best of 2024 Specials','If you missed any of the Best of 2024 editions of Y-Not specialty shows including <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, and <em>Transmission</em>, you can find those all <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a>. And if you missed any of the Y-Not DJs counting down their top songs of the year, you can listen to those shows <a href=\"yearendstaffpicks.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/BPKEKxT.jpeg','shows.php',3,'n'),(727,'2024-12-23','2025-01-01','Christmas @ Y-Not Radio','If you missed any of the Y-Not Radio holiday specials from <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>The Nooner</em>, or <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>\'s <i>An Hour of \"Last Christmas\" Covers IX</i>, you can listen to them any time <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/playlists/y-not-holiday-specials-2021/\">on demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/jmyUOXK.jpg?1','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/playlists/y-not-holiday-specials-2021/',3,'n'),(728,'2024-12-31','2025-01-31','Y-Not\'s Top 224 of 2024 + Year End Poll','If you missed any of <em>Y-Not\'s Top 224 of 2024</em> countdown, you can listen on demand and see the entire list of songs and Year End Poll results <a href=\"yearendpoll.php\"><b>HERE</b></a>.<br><br>\r\n<i>Listen to Year End Poll contest winner <strong>Ian Long</strong> of Lancaster, PA counting down his Top 20 of 2024 on Y-Not Radio <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/ian-longs-top-20-of-2024/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</i>','https://i.imgur.com/WPyTO0G.gif','yearendpoll.php',7,'n'),(729,'2025-01-23','2025-02-08','CROONeR Interview','Longtime friend of Y-Not Radio, <b>Christopher Guanlao</b>, drummer of <b>Silversun Pickups</b>, just released a new EP called <i>Catarina</i> from his solo project <b>CROONeR</b>. If you missed Christopher checking in with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong> to chat about it and share some of the songs, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. Follow <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/christophercrooner/\" target=_blank>CROONeR on Instagram</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/v5GBKr2.jpeg','ondemand.php',7,'n'),(730,'2025-01-27','2025-02-18','Pom Pom Squad Radio Takeover','<b>Pom Pom Squad</b> frontwoman <b>Mia Berrin</b> joined us last month for the latest <i>Y-Not Radio Takeover</i>, chatting about their new album <i>Mirror Starts Moving Without Me</i> and playing tracks from <b>Pet Shop Boys</b>, <b>The Cardigans</b>, <b>Prince</b>, and more. If you missed the <i>Pom Pom Squad Radio Takeover</i>, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. <i>Catch Pom Pom Squad in Philly on Feb. 26th at <a href=\"https://link.dice.fm/cdc337494771\" target=\"_blank\">The Ukie Club</a>.</i>','https://i.imgur.com/6AIFmZK.jpeg','https://www.pompomsquadband.com/',6,'y'),(731,'2025-02-10','2025-02-15','Win Travis Tickets','Longtime Y-Not faves <b>Travis</b> return to the area next week in support of their latest album <em>L.A. Times</em> on Tuesday, February 18th at The Keswick Theatre in Glenside.  <a href=\"contests.php\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Enter to win tickets</strong></a> by Friday, February 14th or you can buy them at <a href=\"https://www.keswicktheatre.com/events/detail/588580\" target=\"_blank\">KeswickTheatre.com</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/Nfu1NUW.jpeg','contests.php',2,'n'),(732,'2025-02-10','2025-02-28','Tim Hause Y-Not Session','Philly singer/songwriter <b>Tim Hause</b>, younger brother of <b>Dave Hause</b>, just released his second solo album <em>Pre-Existing Conditions</em> and he joined Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> to talk about it and perform some songs. If you missed Tim\'s <em>Y-Not Session</em>, you can listen and see video <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.  And catch Tim at this year\'s <a href=\"https://singushomefestival.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Sing Us Home Festival</em></a>, May 2-4.','https://i.imgur.com/c6xOhcq.jpeg','ondemand.php',3,'n'),(733,'2025-02-22','2025-03-15','Y100: 20 Years Gone','In honor of the 20th anniversary of <b>Y100</b> being taken off the air last month, <b>Y-Not Radio</b> celebrated the history of Philadelphia\'s beloved modern rock station with check-ins from former Y100 DJs and staff, plus lots of music from back in the day.  If you missed any of the Y100 memories from the people who were there, you can find them <a href=\"y100.php\" target=\"_blank\"><b>HERE</b></a>, along with some old video footage.','https://i.imgur.com/xo1bTSP.jpeg','y100.php',3,'n'),(734,'2025-03-03','2025-03-31','Lauren Mayberry Photo Gallery','A few weeks ago on February 17th, <strong>Lauren Mayberry</strong> of <strong>CHVRCHES</strong> brought her solo <em>Vicious Creature Tour</em> to Philly at Union Transfer with <strong>Cult of Venus</strong>.  Y-Not photographer <strong>Carolyn Lederach</strong> was there to document the occasion! Check out the photo gallery <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/media/set?vanity=ynotradio&set=a.1215082317110230\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/bCLj8Wj.jpeg','https://www.facebook.com/media/set?vanity=ynotradio&set=a.1215082317110230',7,'n'),(735,'2025-03-10','2025-04-26','Modern Rock Madness 2025','After two weeks of fierce competition, your 2025 <i>Modern Rock Madness</i> champions are <b>R.E.M.</b>, who defeated <b>Yeah Yeah Yeahs</b> by one vote in the final match! Congratulations to them and their listener sponsor <b>David Friedenberg</b>! Thanks to all of you who voted for your favorite bands throughout the tournament! If you missed any of the madness, see how it all went down on the completed bracket <a href=\"madness.php\">HERE</a>.\r\n','https://i.imgur.com/WP2zSyB.jpeg','madness.php',6,'n'),(736,'2025-03-17','2025-03-31','Housewife Radio Takeover','The latest <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em> with <b>Housewife</b> is now available <a href=\"ondemand.php\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>!  Hear <b>Brighid Fry</b> chatting with Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> about her new EP <em>Girl of The Hour</em> and playing tracks from <b>Rilo Kiley</b>, <b>Blondshell</b>, <b>boygenius</b>, and more. ','https://i.imgur.com/e1aalqu.jpeg','https://housewifeband.com',2,'n'),(737,'2025-03-17','2025-03-24','William H. Travis Y-Not Philly Interview','Bethlehem, PA musician <strong>William H. Travis</strong> joins Y-Not\'s <strong>Han</strong> on this week\'s episode of <em>Y-Not Philly</em> to talk about and share tracks from his new album <em>Ruby</em>.  Hear it this Wednesday at 11am and 10pm, or Saturday at 5pm.  Catch William H. Travis\' album release shows this Sunday at <a href=\"https://events.humanitix.com/william-h-travis-fellowship-of-love-album-release-march-23-2025\" target=\"_blank\">Godfrey Daniels in Bethlehem</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/6p9u2d9.jpeg','https://williamhtravis.bandcamp.com/',5,'n'),(738,'2025-04-12','2025-04-19','Win Circa Waves Tickets','UK faves <b>Circa Waves</b> will be back in Philly in support of their latest album <em>Death & Love, Part 1</em> on Sunday, April 20th at Union Transfer with <b>Friday Pilots Club</b>. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>Enter to win tickets</b></a> by Friday at noon or purchase tickets at <a href=\"https://www.utphilly.com/events/detail/?event_id=826962\" target=\"_blank\">UTphilly.com</a>.','https://www.scottishmusicnetwork.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/circa.png','https://circawaves.com/',1,'n'),(739,'2025-04-21','2025-04-21','Text To Win Japanese Breakfast Tickets','<b>Japanese Breakfast</b> is coming home to Philly on May 15th and 16th at The Met in support of their latest album <em>For Melancholy Brunettes (& sad women)</em>. We\'re giving you a chance to win tickets for the show on Thursday the 15th by texting in to <b>707-800-YNOT</b> every time you hear us play a Japanese Breakfast song all this week. Just tell us what song was played every time you hear one. The more you listen, the better your chances of winning. Tickets are still available to purchase tickets <a href=\"https://concerts.livenation.com/event/02006190EEC945F2\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/YRxbZcx.jpeg','http://japanesebreakfast.rocks',1,'n'),(740,'2025-04-21','2025-04-28','Text To Win Japanese Breakfast Tickets','<b>Japanese Breakfast</b> is coming home to Philly on May 15th and 16th at The Met in support of their latest album <em>For Melancholy Brunettes (& sad women)</em>. We\'re giving you a chance to win tickets for the show on Thursday the 15th by texting in to <b>707-800-YNOT</b> every time you hear us play a Japanese Breakfast song all this week. Just tell us what song was played every time you hear one. The more you listen, the better your chances of winning. Tickets are still available to purchase tickets <a href=\"https://concerts.livenation.com/event/02006190EEC945F2\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/YRxbZcx.jpeg','http://japanesebreakfast.rocks',1,'n'),(741,'2025-04-28','2025-05-05','Win Clap Your Hands Say Yeah Tickets','Philly\'s own <strong>Clap Your Hands Say Yeah</strong> are celebrating the 20th anniversary of their self-titled debut with a full album performance on Saturday, May 10th at Union Transfer.  Enter to win tickets <a href=\"https://www.ynotradio.net/contests\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a> or purchase tickets at <a href=\"https://www.utphilly.com/events/detail/?event_id=754621\" target=\"_blank\">UTphilly.com</a>. ','https://images.discovery-prod.axs.com/2024/11/uploadedimage_673ca508ca931.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(742,'2025-05-05','2025-05-31','Marilyn Russell Returns To Y-Not Radio!','O.G. member of the <b>Y100</b> and <b>WDRE</b> airstaff, <b>Marilyn Russell</b> has returned to the airwaves of Y-Not Radio with a special monthly three hour edition of the <i>90\'s Nooner</i>.  If you missed Marilyn\'s debut, you can hear it any time <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/marilyn-russells-90s-nooner-51225/\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/ByEJZ0t.jpeg','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/marilyn-russells-90s-nooner-51225/',5,'n'),(743,'2025-05-16','2025-05-27','<font size=2>Y-Not\'s Memorial Day Block Party Weekend</font>','Kick off the summer with Y-Not Radio as the soundtrack to your Memorial Day weekend. We’ll be playing blocks of your favorite indie rock artists from Friday thru Monday! Check out the full DJ schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/EIqxtAl.jpg','schedule.php',1,'n'),(744,'2025-06-16','2025-07-31','Win The Bug Club Tickets','Welsh band <strong>The Bug Club</strong> just released their fourth album <em>Very Human Features </em>and will be back in  Philly this Friday night, June 27th at Johnny Brenda\'s. Enter to win tickets <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>HERE</strong></a> by Wednesday or you can buy them at <a href=\"https://johnnybrendas.com/event/the-bug-club/johnny-brendas/philadelphia-pennsylvania/\" target=\"_blank\">JohnnyBrendas.com</a>.</span> <em>*This is a 21+ show.</em>','https://i.imgur.com/izKS7lJ.jpeg','contests.php',3,'y'),(745,'2025-05-27','2025-06-30','The Tisburys Y-Not Session','Philly band <b>The Tisburys</b> celebrated the release of their new album <em>A Still Life Revisited</em> by joining us for a <em>Y-Not Session</em>, performing songs and chatting with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b>! If you missed the session, it\'s now available <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> with <a href=\"https://youtu.be/fLKY01HytlQ\" target=\"_blank\">video</a>! <em>Find out more about The Tisburys\' upcoming shows <a href=\"https://thetisburys.com\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</em>','https://i.imgur.com/vh94B0i.jpeg','ondemand.php',6,'y'),(746,'2025-10-31','2025-11-01','Be A Y-Not DJ','Y-Not Radio is looking for a couple new voices to host on weekdays during the day. You must be in the Philly area and able to commit to volunteering for a weekly timeslot in person at the Y-Not Bunker in West Philly. No radio experience is necessary, just a passion for indie music and eagerness to learn. Please <a href=\"mailto:josh@ynotradio.net\" target=\"_blank\">e-mail Josh T. Landow</a> to apply.','https://djseanray.files.wordpress.com/2011/04/20110429-115736.jpg?w=300','mailto:josh@ynotradio.net',10,'n'),(747,'2025-06-09','2025-06-30','OK Go Interview','<b>OK Go</b> recently released <em>And The Adjacent Possible</em>, their first album in over a decade, and played a fantastic show in Philly at Union Transfer. Before the show Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and <b>Joey O.</b> caught up with frontman <b>Damian Kulash</b> about the new record, the latest of their ambitious music videos, and more.  If you missed the interview you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/6IsZeW5.jpeg','ondemand.php',2,'y'),(748,'2025-06-09','2025-06-22','Marilyn Russell\'s 90\'s Nooner','O.G. member of the <b>Y100</b> and <strong>WDRE</strong> airstaff, <b>Marilyn Russell</b> has returned to the airwaves of Y-Not Radio with a special monthly three hour edition of the 90\'s Nooner. Marilyn will be back on Monday, June 16th from 12-3pm.  If you missed her debut last month, you can hear it any time <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/marilyn-russells-90s-nooner-51225/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/ByEJZ0t.jpeg','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/marilyn-russells-90s-nooner-51225/',6,'n'),(749,'2025-06-23','2025-07-19','Polaroid Fade Y-Not Session','New Jersey band <b>Polaroid Fade</b> recently joined Y-Not Radio\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> and <b>Joey O.</b> at Cambridge Sound Studios to perform songs from their debut album <em>Chaos Into Poetry</em>. If you missed the session, it\'s now available <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> with video on the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WGoKxaaQ_2g\" target=\"_blank\">Y-Not YouTube channel</a>. <em>Get Polaroid Fade\'s album and find out about upcoming shows <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/polaroidfade\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</em>','https://i.imgur.com/tPPLAta.jpeg','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(750,'2025-06-23','2025-06-30','Y-Not Philly Session with Deerking','Philly artist <strong>Deerking </strong>joined <b>Han</b> for a live performance and interview on last week\'s episode of <em>Y-Not Philly</em>.  If you missed the session, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. Find out more about Deerking <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/deerking\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/8OC8jqN.jpeg','ondemand.php',4,'n'),(751,'2025-08-04','2025-07-31','Marilyn Russell\'s 90\'s Nooner','O.G. member of the <strong>Y100</strong> and <strong>WDRE</strong> airstaff, <strong>Marilyn Russell</strong> has returned to the airwaves of Y-Not Radio with a special monthly three hour edition of the <em>90\'s Nooner</em>. Marilyn\'s next show is coming up on Monday, August 11th from 12-3pm and if you missed her June show, you can find it <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/marilyn-russells-90s-nooner-61625/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.<!--If you missed Marilyn last week, you can hear her show any time <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/marilyn-russells-90s-nooner-61625/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a> and she\'ll be back on Monday, July 14th.-->','https://i.imgur.com/ByEJZ0t.jpeg','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/marilyn-russells-90s-nooner-61625/',9,'n'),(752,'2025-06-30','2025-07-07','<font size=2>Indie-Pendence Day Throwback Weekend</font>','Tune in from Thursday July 3rd at Noon through Sunday, July 6th as we celebrate the founders of indie rock from the 70’s, 80’s, 90’s, and early 00’s during Y-Not Radio’s fifth annual <em>Indie-Pendence Day Throwback Weekend</em>! See the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and request your favorite retro tunes.','https://i.imgur.com/kjVJfgy.jpg','schedule.php',1,'n'),(753,'2025-06-30','2025-07-07','Y-Not Philly Session with Deerking','Philly artist <strong>Deerking </strong>joined <strong>Han </strong>for a live performance and interview on last week\'s episode of <em>Y-Not Philly</em>. If you missed the session, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. Find out more about Deerking <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/deerking\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/8OC8jqN.jpeg','ondemand.php',6,'n'),(754,'2025-07-07','2025-07-14','<font size=2>Win Make The World Better Concert Tickets</font>','The <i>Make The World Better</i> Concert is back and bigger than ever this year with a whole weekend of music, featuring <b>Lucy Dacus</b>, <b>Hop Along</b>, and <b>Jay Som</b> on Friday, July 25th and <b>Remi Wolf</b>, <b>Magdalena Bay</b>, and <b>Annie DiRusso</b> on Sunday, July 27th in FDR Park. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER TO WIN</b></a> weekend passes or you can buy them and get more info <a href=\"https://mtwbconcert.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/Rpd84I5.jpeg','contests.php',1,'n'),(755,'2025-07-14','2025-07-31','Deep Sea Diver Radio Takeover','Seattle\'s <b>Deep Sea Diver</b> recently released their fourth album <em>Billboard Heart</em> and frontwoman <b>Jessica Dobson</b> joined Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> to chat about the album and play some of her favorite songs from <b>Yeah Yeah Yeahs</b>, <b>Fontaines D.C.</b>, <b>Amyl and The Sniffers</b>, <b>Idles</b>, and more!  If you missed the Deep Sea Diver <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://northerntransmissions.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/unnamed-20.jpg','ondemand.php',6,'n'),(756,'2025-07-30','2025-08-09','Y-Not Philly Interviews Chico Romano','If you missed last week\'s episode of <i>Y-Not Philly</i>, featuring <b>Han</b>\'s interview with local artist <b>Chico Romano</b> about his new EP <a href=\"https://chicoromano.bandcamp.com/album/making-a-racket\" target=_blank><i>Making A Racket</i></a>, you can hear it now <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/y-not-philly-73025/\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/0bbZRnf.jpeg','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/y-not-philly-73025/',2,'n'),(757,'2025-10-31','2025-12-31','Marilyn Russell\'s 90\'s Nooner','O.G. member of the <b>Y100</b> and <b>WDRE</b> airstaff, <b>Marilyn Russell</b> has returned to the airwaves of Y-Not Radio with a special monthly edition of the <em>90\'s Nooner</em>. Marilyn\'s next show is coming up on Monday, September 15th from 12-2pm and if you missed her last month, you can listen <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/marilyn-russells-90s-nooner-81125/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/ByEJZ0t.jpeg','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/marilyn-russells-90s-nooner-81125/',7,'y'),(758,'2025-08-11','2025-08-18','Philthy Radio','Tune in this Friday night from 9-11pm or Sunday from 7-9pm for a new episode of <em>Philthy Radio</em> with <a href=\"https://www.philthymag.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Philthy Mag</a> editor-in-chief <b>Izzy Cihak</b> celebrating the 1st anniversary of the show.</span> Find previous episodes of <em>Philthy Radio </em><a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/genres/philthy%2Bynotradio/?order=latest\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.','https://thumbnailer.mixcloud.com/unsafe/290x290/extaudio/a/8/d/6/4b54-718b-4b5c-8e56-3b980a156c9b','https://www.mixcloud.com/genres/philthy%2Bynotradio/?order=latest',2,'n'),(759,'2025-08-18','2025-08-25','Win We Are Scientists Tickets','Longtime friends of Y-Not Radio <b>We Are Scientists</b> return to Philly on Thursday, September 4th at Johnny Brenda\'s in support of their ninth album <em>Qualifying Miles</em>.  Enter to win tickets <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>HERE</strong></a> by Sunday or you can buy them at <a href=\"https://johnnybrendas.com/event/we-are-scientists-3/johnny-brendas/philadelphia-pennsylvania/\" target=\"_blank\">JohnnyBrendas.com</a>.</span> <em>*This is a 21+ show.</em>','https://i.imgur.com/TNQNl8U.jpeg','contests.php',2,'n'),(760,'2025-08-18','2025-08-25','Philthy Radio','If you missed the August episode of <em>Philthy Radio</em> with <b><a href=\"https://www.philthymag.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Philthy Mag</a></b> editor-in-chief <b>Izzy Cihak</b>, you can listen any time <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/philthy-radio-81525/\" target=\"_blank\">On Demand</a> to hear the show\'s 1st anniversary celebration. ','https://thumbnailer.mixcloud.com/unsafe/290x290/extaudio/a/8/d/6/4b54-718b-4b5c-8e56-3b980a156c9b','https://www.mixcloud.com/genres/philthy%2Bynotradio/?order=latest',6,'n'),(761,'2025-08-25','2025-09-02','Win HAIM Tickets','<b>HAIM</b> return to The Mann Center on Thursday, September 4th  in support of their new album <em>i quit</em>.  Enter to win tickets <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>HERE</b></a> through Labor Day or you can buy them at <a href=\"https://manncenter.org/events/2025-09-04/haim\" target=\"_blank\">MannCenter.org</a>.','https://i0.wp.com/www.notreble.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Haim-I-Quit-Tour-600x400.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(762,'2025-08-25','2025-09-02','Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day Weekend','This Labor Day Weekend, the Y-Not DJs are off, but the music will be live! From Friday through Monday we\'ll be playing tracks from <em>Y-Not Sessions</em>, old <b>Y100</b> and <b>WDRE</b> <em>Sonic Sessions</em>, and plenty of other live album tracks as well. Tune in wherever you are with the <a href=\"mobile.php\">Y-Not Radio app</a> and make <em>Y-Not\'s Live Labor Day</em> the soundtrack for your end-of-summer festivities!','https://i.imgur.com/oP89Tyr.jpg','mobile.php',1,'n'),(763,'2025-09-06','2025-09-12','Win Garbage Tickets','The legendary <b>Garbage</b> return to Philly for their last headlining tour on Tuesday, September 16th at The Franklin Music Hall with <b>Starcrawler</b>. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win tickets by Friday! Or you can buy them at <a href=\"https://franklinmusichall.com/events/detail/?event_id=902102\" target=\"_blank\">FranklinMusicHall.com</a>.','https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/191/825c00d9-f592-4c7e-a486-be7413ba4191_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg','contests.php',3,'n'),(764,'2025-09-07','2025-09-30','We Are Scientists Y-Not Session','Y-Not Radio\'s old pals <b>Keith Murray</b> and <b>Chris Cain</b> of <b>We Are Scientists</b> dropped by for a special acoustic performance of songs from their brand new album <em>Qualifying Miles</em> and another (mostly) silly chat with <b>Josh T. Landow</b>.  If you missed We Are Scientists\' <em>Y-Not Session</em>, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/mLlhtxs.jpeg','https://wearescientists.com/',5,'n'),(765,'2025-09-12','2025-09-13','Win Garbage Tickets','The legendary <b>Garbage</b> return to Philly for their last headlining tour on Tuesday, September 16th at The Franklin Music Hall with <b>Starcrawler</b>. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a> for a chance to win tickets by Friday! Or you can buy them at <a href=\"https://franklinmusichall.com/events/detail/?event_id=902102\" target=\"_blank\">FranklinMusicHall.com</a>.','https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/191/825c00d9-f592-4c7e-a486-be7413ba4191_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg','contests.php',2,'n'),(766,'2025-10-06','2025-10-13','Win Jay Som Tickets','<b>Jay Som</b> is back with her first solo album in six years <em>Belong</em> out this Friday, and will be returning to Philly on Tuesday, December 9th at The Foundry with <b>Sea Lemon</b>. <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER TO WIN</b></a> tickets and a copy of the album on vinyl by Sunday or you can buy tickets <a href=\"https://www.ticketmaster.com/event/020062E7DB4D3257\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/e4mZlUB.jpeg','contests.php',3,'n'),(767,'2025-10-06','2025-10-31','Petey USA Y-Not Session','<b>Petey USA</b> came to Philadelphia, USA last week in support of his third album <em>The Yips</em> and he stopped by the Y-Not Bunker for an acoustic performance and chat with <strong>Josh T. Landow</strong>. If you missed the Petey USA <em>Y-Not Session</em>, it\'s now available <a href=\"onademand.php\">On Demand</a> with <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=prG6un7tDks\" target=\"_blank\">video</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/D8aejVw.jpeg','ondemand.php',5,'n'),(768,'2025-10-06','2025-10-20','We Are Scientists Y-Not Session Video','<b>We Are Scientists</b> recently dropped by for an acoustic performance of songs from their latest album <em>Qualifying Miles</em>, which you can hear  <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>. Now you can see video of their <em>Y-Not Session</em> on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I_mhnUKWu1c\" target=\"_blank\">Y-Not\'s YouTube channel</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/mLlhtxs.jpeg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I_mhnUKWu1c',5,'y'),(769,'2025-10-27','2025-11-03','Win Rocket Tickets','L.A. up-and-comers <b>Rocket</b> will make their Philadelphia headlining debut in support of their album <em>R Is For Rocket</em> on Friday, November 7th at Warehouse on Watts. <a href=\"contests.php\"><strong>ENTER HERE</strong></a> for a chance to win tickets by Sunday! Or you can buy them at <a href=\"https://wowphilly.com/event/rocket-with-cashier/cambridge-hall/\" target=\"_blank\">WOWphilly.com</a>','https://femmusic.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Rocket-by-Holly-Whitaker.jpg','https://wowphilly.com/event/rocket-with-cashier/cambridge-hall/',4,'n'),(770,'2025-10-27','2025-12-01','The Noisy Y-Not Philly Session','Tune in to hear Philly band <b>The Noisy</b> joining <b>Han</b> on this week\'s episode of <em>Y-Not Philly</em> for an acoustic performance and to talk about their new release <em>The Secret Ingredient Is Even More Meat</em>.  <em>Y-Not Philly</em> airs on Wednesday at 11am and 10pm, with a replay on Saturday at 5pm. Find music by The Noisy on <a href=\"https://thenoisy.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Bandcamp</a>.','https://f4.bcbits.com/img/0041454192_21.jpg','https://thenoisy.bandcamp.com/',2,'y'),(771,'2025-11-10','2025-11-30','Ida Maria Y-Not Radio Takeover','Norway\'s <b>Ida Maria</b> recently released a new album called <em>Seven Deadly Sins + 3</em> and joined Y-Not\'s <b>Joey O.</b> to chat about it and play some of her favorite songs from <b>The White Stripes</b>, <b>Cage The Elephant</b>, <b>Jimi Hendrix</b>, <b>Refused</b>, and more.  If you missed the Ida Maria <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover</em>, you can hear it any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/1PvoIOs.jpeg','ondemand.php',20,'y'),(772,'2025-11-10','2025-11-17','Win Psychedelic Porn Crumpets Tickets','Australia\'s <b>Psychedelic Porn Crumpets</b> will be back in Philly in support of this year\'s albums <em>Carpe Diem, Moonman</em> and <em>Pogo Rodeo</em> on Wednesday, November 19th at Union Transfer. <b><a href=\"contests.php\">ENTER HERE</a></b> for a chance to win tickets or you can buy them at <a href=\"https://www.utphilly.com/events/detail/?event_id=1032156\" target=\"_blank\">UTphilly.com</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/X1BFE8s.jpeg','contests.php',4,'n'),(773,'2025-11-21','2025-11-29','Win Portugal. The Man Tickets','There\'s no <i>Top 11 @ 11</i> this week due to Thanksgiving, but we\'re still giving away some concert tickets!  <a href=\"contests.php><b>Enter to win</b></a> a pair of tickets to see <b>Portugal. The Man</b> on Thursday, December 4th at Union Transfer in support of their new album <i>SHISH</i>!','https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/595/b429bbe3-82ed-46ac-b29d-8c7de892c595_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg','contests.php',1,'y'),(774,'2025-11-21','2025-11-29','Win Portugal. The Man Tickets','There\'s no <i>Top 11 @ 11</i> this week due to Thanksgiving, but we\'re still giving away some concert tickets!  <a href=\"contests.php\"><b>Enter to win</b></a> a pair of tickets to see <b>Portugal. The Man</b> on Thursday, December 4th at Union Transfer in support of their new album <i>SHISH</i>!  <em><a href=\"https://www.axs.com/au/events/1024654/portugal-the-man-the-denali-tour-tickets\" target=\"_blank\">Tickets are available here.</a></em>','https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/595/b429bbe3-82ed-46ac-b29d-8c7de892c595_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2.jpg','contests.php',1,'n'),(775,'2025-11-24','2025-11-28','Y-Not Turkey Day Takeovers ','Tune in on Thanksgiving Day starting at 10am as Y-Not Radio continues the tradition of <em>Turkey Day Takeovers</em>, featuring artists\' guest DJ sets from this year, including <b>Pom Pom Squad</b>, <b>Deep Sea Diver</b>, <b>Housewife</b>, and <b>Ida Maria</b>! Check out the full schedule <a href=\"schedule.php\">here</a>.','https://2.bp.blogspot.com/_uGIZVil8l2U/TOhNM5VPHFI/AAAAAAAAAKU/FiZg4cLUtr4/s200/YNotTurkey.gif','schedule.php',2,'n'),(776,'2025-11-24','2026-01-31','Y-Not\'s Top 225 of 2025 + Year End Poll','Thanks to all of you who voted in <em>Y-Not\'s Year End Poll</em> and tuned in for the <em>Top 225 of 2025</em>! If you missed any of the countdown, you can listen on demand and see the entire list of songs and poll results. <br><br>\r\n	<center><b><a href=\"yearendpoll.php\">LISTEN HERE</a></b></center><br>\r\nListen to Year End Poll contest winner <b>Rick Goode</b> of Des Plaines, IL counting down his Top 20 of 2025 on Y-Not Radio <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/rick-goodes-top-20-of-2025/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>HERE</strong></a>.','https://i.imgur.com/aUQ4tUa.png','yearendpoll.php',5,'n'),(777,'2025-11-24','2025-12-13','<font size=2>Y-Not\'s Cyber Monday/Giving Tuesday Sale</font>','Help Y-Not end the year in the black by making a donation this week. We still need to raise about <b>$1000</b> for December\'s streaming and music royalty fees. As a special Cyber Monday / Giving Tuesday sale, we’ll send you two album downloads for the price of one, including the latest from <b>Snocaps</b>, <b>Tame Impala</b>, <b>Dave Hause</b>, <b>Nation of Language</b>, <b>The Beths</b>, and more to choose from. <br><br>\r\n <center><b><a href=\"https://www.ynotradio.net/donate.php\" target=\"_blank\">DONATE HERE</a></b>\r\n  </center>','https://i.imgur.com/3wFOP2y.jpg','donate.php',5,'y'),(778,'2025-12-05','2025-12-13','Win Amyl and The Sniffers Tickets','<b>Amyl and The Sniffers</b> are coming back to Philadelphia on June 8th, 2026 at The Mann Skyline Stage and Y-Not Radio has your chance to win tickets before you can buy them on Friday, December 12th at 10am!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<center><a href=\"contests.php><b>ENTER HERE</b></a></center>','https://i.imgur.com/p6DLW6s.jpeg','contests.php',3,'y'),(779,'2025-12-05','2025-12-13','Win Amyl and The Sniffers Tickets','<b>Amyl and The Sniffers</b> are coming back to Philadelphia on June 8th, 2026 at The Mann Skyline Stage and Y-Not Radio has your chance to win tickets before you can buy them on Friday, December 12th at 10am!\r\n<br><br>\r\n<center><a href=\"contests.php\"><b>ENTER HERE</b></a></center>','https://i.imgur.com/p6DLW6s.jpeg','contests.php',2,'y'),(780,'2025-12-08','2025-12-31','Teen Jesus and The Jean Teasers<br>Y-Not Radio Takeover','If you missed the latest <em>Y-Not Radio Takeover </em>with <b>Scarlett McKahey</b> of Australian band <b>Teen Jesus and The Jean Teasers</b>, you can listen any time <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a> to hear her chat with Y-Not\'s <b>Josh T. Landow</b> about their new album <em>Glory</em> and pick some favorite songs from <b>Amyl and The Sniffers</b>, <b>Fontaines D.C.</b>, <b>Lily Allen</b>, <b>Genesis Owusu</b>, and more.','https://i.imgur.com/jP3A5A2.jpeg','ondemand.php',6,'n'),(781,'2025-12-15','2026-01-10','Y-Not Best of 2025 Specials','If you missed any of the <em>Best of 2025</em> editions of Y-Not specialty shows including <em>Britspotting</em>, <em>Sounds Canadian</em>, <em>Aussie Unlocked</em>, <em>Noise Complaint</em>, <em>Y-Not Philly</em>, and <em>Transmission</em>, you can find those all <a href=\"shows.php\">On Demand</a>. And if you missed any of the Y-Not DJs\' Top 20 countdowns, you can listen to those shows <a href=\"yearendstaffpicks.php\">here</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/Bazraew.png','shows.php',3,'n'),(782,'2025-12-22','2026-01-03','Christmas @ Y-Not Radio','If you\'re still feeling the Christmas spirit, you can listen to <b>Josh T. Landow</b>\'s annual <i>An Hour of \"Last Christmas\" Covers</i> and the <i>Noise Complaint</i> Christmas special, any time <a href=\"https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/playlists/y-not-holiday-specials-2021/\" target=_blank>On Demand</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/VoGVmym.png','https://www.mixcloud.com/ynotradio/playlists/y-not-holiday-specials-2021/',5,'n'),(783,'2026-01-12','2026-01-31','Flatwaves Y-Not Session','Philly shoegaze band <b>Flatwaves</b> joined us for the first <i>Y-Not Session</i> of 2026, performing songs from their 2025 album <em>Tell Me Secrets</em> and chatting with Y-Not Philly host <b>Hannah</b>.  If you missed Flatwaves\' <em>Y-Not Session</em>, you can listen to it any time and see the video <a href=\"ondemand.php\">On Demand</a>.  Get Flatwaves\' record on <a href=\"https://flatwaves.bandcamp.com/album/tell-me-secrets\" target=\"_blank\">Bandcamp</a>.','https://i.imgur.com/jtsY4PC.jpeg','https://flatwavesband.com/',3,'n'),(784,'2026-01-19','2026-02-21','Trainwreck Boyfriend Y-Not Session','Philly newcomers <b>Trainwreck Boyfriend</b> just released their self-titled debut album and will be joining Y-Not\'s <strong>Josh T. Landow </strong>to chat about it and perform an acoustic set this Friday before taking the stage for their record release show that night at <a href=\"https://kungfunecktie.com/event/trainwreck-boyfriend-panic-sets-in/kung-fu-necktie/philadelphia-pennsylvania/\" target=\"_blank\">Kung Fu Necktie</a>.  Tune in for their <em>Y-Not Session</em> this Friday at 4pm during <em>Future Friday</em> or catch replays on Saturday at 9pm and Sunday at 11am during the <em>Y-Not Session Shuffle</em>. <em>Get Trainwreck Boyfriend\'s album on <a href=\"https://trainwreckboyfriend.bandcamp.com\" target=\"_blank\">Bandcamp</a>.</em>','https://i.imgur.com/TH7qD6Y.jpeg','https://www.trainwreckboyfriend.com/',2,'n'),(785,'2026-01-19','2026-01-25','Y-Not Philly Takeover with Knotfall','<strong>Sami</strong> of <strong>Knotfall</strong> premieres the first single “Shoreline” from their upcoming album [out April 17th via candlepin records] alongside other Philly favorites on this week’s episodes of <em>Y-Not Philly</em>.  Hear it on Wednesday at 11am and 10pm with a replay on Saturday at 5pm.','https://i.imgur.com/ZbNpToS.jpeg','https://knotfall.bandcamp.com/',9,'n');
